

translate chinese begin_refuse_a9494688:


    "我把毯子掀到一边，大口喘着粗气。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_4f59f291:


    "屏气凝神后定睛一看，才认出来面前是那面挂满了画的墙，还有木头边框的纱窗，窗外还是那片熟悉的森林。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_6dc5e35e:


    "冷冰冰的液体顺着我的胸口缓缓流下。我想头顶上一定有只巨兽张开了血盆大口，唾液顺着口腔滴在我胸口……想到这里，我不由得打了个寒颤。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_10b9b2de:


    "可我身上的是冷汗。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_3979e42d:


    "一切都只是场梦而已。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_3f7a3b23:


    "我条件反射式地用毯子擦了擦汗。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_904ff583:


    "我是怎么回到家的？又是什么时候睡着的？"


translate chinese begin_refuse_0a08fcc6:


    "无数念头相互碰撞，只能拄着我那脆弱的意识，踉踉跄跄地前行。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_7c95169a:


    "我挂在墙上的画现在看来像是随意涂抹出来的东西，毫无意义又乏味无趣。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_0683f561:


    "黑暗肚子贴地，在我的房间里四处蠕动，墙壁咕咕哝哝，嘎吱作响。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_10b65c9d:


    "风猛烈撞击着屋子前门，想要冲进来用弯曲的利爪把屋里的人都撕成碎片。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_4962f2d2:


    "我小心翼翼地偷瞄了一眼窗外。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_026ae380:


    "太阳躲在一层厚厚的白雾后面，暴风雪朝着天空扬起白旗，但那不是投降的标志。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_e78a2542:


    "森林和田野在迷雾中不见了踪影。若隐若现的街道上，路旁那盏鱼眼般的路灯是附近唯一的光亮。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_1ace06b7:


    "白天变成了黑夜，极地一般的怪诞之物无边无际……"


translate chinese begin_refuse_e43e0618:


    "……它绕着屋子，低语着、咆哮着。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_f9051ee3:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/018.Myaso.ogg"
    "{b}“肉。”{/b}——这个字在我颅骨内回响。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_ab83080a:


    "我扇了自己一巴掌。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_9760d0bd:


    "随后冲进了走廊，想去确认一下奥利娅没事，也是确认一下我的噩梦——那个{b}属于我的{/b}噩梦，没有真的对她造成什么伤害。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_b4ae3ec9:


    "妹妹躺在床上，爸爸妈妈正忙着照顾她。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_2ba4dd84:


    "奥利娅脸上泛起一层浅灰，嘴唇蓝得吓人。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_fec8932f:


    "她的腿上裹着一条毛毯，我看了看那条毯子，以为会看到布料渗出殷红。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_c09f8903:


    "紧张过后，短暂的喘息终于降临——奥利娅的腿没事。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_f8a25399:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/001.Chto.ogg"
    Ant "怎么了？"


translate chinese begin_refuse_b27e3341:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/137 Tem.ogg"
    Mam "她忽然发高烧了。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_3913c3a7:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/138 Gov.ogg"
    Mam "啧，叫你们别开窗……"


translate chinese begin_refuse_e3572fd5:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/139 Be.ogg"
    Mam "算了，现在吵这个也没意义，治病才是要紧事。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_413d2bde:


    "奥利娅咳嗽起来。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_3dc19a24:


    "她连眼睛都睁不开，眼睫毛黏在了一起。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_1821c82d:


    "急促的呼吸引得她胸膛剧烈起伏。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_738402c3:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/Tvoi.ogg"
    Oly_glitch "{sc=3}轮到你来喂饱我们了。{/sc}"


translate chinese begin_refuse_fcfb8022:


    "我摇了摇头，努力赶跑脑子里侵入性想法的低语，还有早已死去、身上爬满蛆虫的怪物在车库起舞的画面。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_6f5db475:



    voice "voice/father/day5/1a.ogg"
    Pap "万一是传染病怎么办？"


translate chinese begin_refuse_d4474b98:


    "爸爸焦虑地咬着手指甲。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_5339c9e9:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/140 Pr.ogg"
    Mam "拿止咳糖浆来。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_fdbb5cda:



    voice "voice/father/day5/2uz.ogg"
    Pap "早拿来了，喏，没剩多少了。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_bc66fef1:


    "他递给妈妈一个小瓶子。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_d978aa34:


    "我发觉妈妈把手放在了爸爸的手上，几秒钟后，她轻轻捏了捏爸爸的手便松开了。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_7acbd4e9:


    "屋外的暴风雪越刮越大，但爸爸妈妈之间终年肆虐的怒气暴风雪，此刻有所减弱。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_79fc7067:


    "奥利娅这一病好像让他们放下了争执，转而反思自己的行为。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_b738f2e2:



    voice "voice/father/day5/3gre.ogg"
    Pap "来，热水袋。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_b1e0e54d:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/03 Ne.ogg"
    Oly "我不要，你是坏蛋。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_b9a00d8f:


    "奥利娅烧糊涂了。她翻着白眼，满口胡话。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_809e2052:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/04 Ya.ogg"
    Oly "我知道的！你面具底下的脸很恐怖！"


translate chinese begin_refuse_85c0c2c5:


    "她的话如同一道闪电。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_f268abef:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/141 Tishe.ogg"
    Mam "奥利娅，乖乖的，听话。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_048810a9:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/142 Gos.ogg"
    Mam "天呐……这下怎么办？"


translate chinese begin_refuse_21f5b4cf:


    "爸爸把手搭在了妈妈肩膀上。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_a339ce80:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/143 Pros.ogg"
    Mam "真的很对不起，宝贝。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_18c30e1e:


    "一滴眼泪从妈妈的脸颊滑落。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_53dd4839:


    "她抽噎着，将目光转向了没精打采地站在门口的我身上。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_954168c1:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/145 Eti.ogg"
    Mam "安东，真的很对不起，我们最近跟变了个人似的。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_6af6e9fe:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/146 so.ogg"
    Mam "忽视了你们两个。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_515396f3:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/147 A.ogg"
    Mam "你……你是我们最珍贵的宝物。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_186b47ec:



    voice "voice/father/day5/4me.ogg"
    Pap "安东，我们这段时间脑子糊涂了。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_6da17000:



    voice "voice/father/day5/5ne.ogg"
    Pap "我们不该对你不闻不问。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_615f491b:


    "我不知道该说什么。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_2b475ad8:


    "我都不记得爸爸妈妈上次跟我用这样的态度说话是什么时候的事了。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_f6e4d695:


    "也不记得他们上次握着对方的手是什么时候的事了。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_feb1d6b5:


    "恐惧让他们站在了一起。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_6ad82521:


    "但代价是什么呢？"


translate chinese begin_refuse_7873e3d4:


    "我想起森林里饥饿的野兽，想起笛声和它永不停歇的召唤，想起死去的动物高高跃过松树。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_87c2996c:


    "也想起了巨大绞肉机里的卡嘉。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_ec244c0f:


    "也想起了罗姆卡手脚并用，在雪地上爬行的样子。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_c332321f:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/002.vi.ogg"
    Ant "打……打电话叫医生了吗？"


translate chinese begin_refuse_21e746a2:



    voice "voice/father/day5/6po.ogg"
    Pap "打了。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_d5a4f989:



    voice "voice/father/day5/7un.ogg"
    Pap "天太冷了，他的车发动不起来。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_225c2dd9:



    voice "voice/father/day5/8ya.ogg"
    Pap "我得去接他一下。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_62713271:


    "妈妈摇了摇空空的止咳糖浆瓶。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_2caeb0b1:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/149Aya.ogg"
    Mam "我去村里买点药。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_ee91e888:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/148 Ap.ogg"
    Mam "学校旁边有个药房。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_5ae7d3c9:



    voice "voice/father/day5/9so.ogg"
    Pap "行。卡琳娜，准备一下，我开车送你过去。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_0a1ded1d:



    voice "voice/father/day5/10sei.ogg"
    Pap "我们得像个团队一样，劲往一处使。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_31d4ae12:


    "我想象着爸爸妈妈开车穿过森林，树丛中亮起一双双血红的小眼睛，就像发电机的灯泡一样。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_5b03c5f0:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/003.Ne.ogg"
    Ant "别走！"


translate chinese begin_refuse_4c7e9965:


    "我喉咙深处窜出一声尖叫。奥利娅毛毯下的身体不住地颤抖，她低声说道："


translate chinese begin_refuse_819bc645:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/05 To.ogg"
    Oly "救救我，托沙。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_85c47713:


    "爸爸皱了皱眉。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_1ade5be6:



    voice "voice/father/day5/12Anton.ogg"
    Pap "安东，我们去去就回。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_43e25644:



    voice "voice/father/day5/13och.ogg"
    Pap "现在真的很需要你帮忙。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_8c092990:



    voice "voice/father/day5/14v.ogg"
    Pap "你帮我们……"


translate chinese begin_refuse_461c6588:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/06 Che.ogg"
    Oly "面具底下有好多蛆虫。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_14420cf4:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/150 Chto.ogg"
    Mam "她到底看了什么动画片？"


translate chinese begin_refuse_58b34e6c:



    voice "voice/father/day5/15vt.ogg"
    Pap "……照顾好你妹妹，等我们回来。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_65ab233a:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/004.no.ogg"
    Ant "但是，爸爸……"


translate chinese begin_refuse_084dfe34:



    voice "voice/father/day5/16sl.ogg"
    Pap "别让她冻着了。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_91f01384:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/007.Av.ogg"
    Ant "你们走了以后，她醒了怎么办？"


translate chinese begin_refuse_41a08f61:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/009.vd.ogg"
    Ant "她要是需要什么东西怎么办？！"


translate chinese begin_refuse_517c7722:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/151Tishe.ogg"
    Mam "冷静点，宝贝。没事的。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_be9223d6:


    "她朝我露出了疲惫的微笑，这个笑容拿什么糖我都不换。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_73e804d8:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/017.obe.ogg"
    Ant "保证会回来吗？"


translate chinese begin_refuse_8b5cea1e:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/152 Ya.ogg"
    Mam "保证。我一定会回来的。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_48aa965a:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/153 Atep.ogg"
    Mam "但是安东，你现在得待在家里。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_b9b6d67f:



    voice "voice/father/day5/17sc.ogg"
    Pap "快点，卡琳娜，别拖了。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_3c88a5a8:


    "大概五分钟后，楼下的门咔哒一声关上了。暴风雪的呼啸声中，响起了爸爸汽车的引擎声。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_45562fd5:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/07 Pod.ogg"
    Oly "面具下的是黑暗。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_b72d7466:


    "奥利娅烧得脑子不清醒了，嘴里念叨着的却是我梦里出现的东西，她怎么会知道我梦到了什么？"


translate chinese begin_refuse_21a8551f:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/016.Ehne.ogg"
    Ant "那都是假的。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_f9c6a06d:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/1 mi.ogg"
    "\"{sc=2}{b}我们可不是假的，{/b}{/sc}\"我脑中响起的声音如此说到，与此同时，这个声音从屋子里所有的角落和缝隙涌了出来。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_7139e5fd:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/2 mi.ogg"
    Noname "{b}夜幕降临，我们会来找你。{/b}"


translate chinese begin_refuse_4084531c:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/3 za.ogg"
    Noname "{b}兔子，让我们美餐一顿……{/b}"


translate chinese begin_refuse_168a661f:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/4 eli.ogg"
    Noname "{b}……不然，你就是我们的盘中餐。{/b}"


translate chinese begin_refuse_11893cb7:


    "幻觉像蛛网一样将我罩住。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_0d90bfb2:


    "我挣脱束缚，冲出房间，差点摔在楼梯上。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_95e2919f:


    "我想冲出门外，扑进爸爸妈妈怀里，紧紧抱着他们的脖子，告诉他们我和奥利娅有多爱他们。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_9cd56edf:


    "说我们再也不会吵架或者动手了……"


translate chinese begin_refuse_43736a56:


    "只要能让爸爸妈妈留下来，陪我们度过这段恐怖的时刻，我什么都愿意说。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_6ffbc080:


    "我猛地打开门，屋外暴风雪肆虐，白雪早已覆盖了爸爸留下的车轮印。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_5791522f:


    "整个宇宙汇聚成了门廊前的小小光点。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_6e9ba8d5:


    "屋子立马变得更暗更冷了。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_5873108a:


    "阁楼传来窸窸窣窣的声音。那上面有什么东西，是老鼠，还是狐狸的尾巴？"


translate chinese begin_refuse_3b01cf6e:


    "阴影爬上墙壁。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_4c22804c:


    "空无一人的房间里，地板嘎吱嘎吱响。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_43c8784a:


    "指针毫不留情地走着，时间一分一秒过去，白昼的倒计时快要结束，夜幕即将降临……"


translate chinese begin_refuse_4e2f730a:


    "我还记得爸爸妈妈走之前吩咐了什么。得照顾好奥利娅。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_28734e52:


    "只要能照顾好奥利娅，我什么都愿意做。"


translate chinese begin_refuse_6c183af1:


    "奥利娅要是饿着肚子醒了怎么办？"


translate chinese begin_accept_19f320b8:


    "暴风雪刮了好一会儿，整座屋子包裹在飞扬的白雪之中。"


translate chinese begin_accept_0fca7023:


    "我走进铺满暮色的走廊，门在我身后猛地一下关上了。"


translate chinese begin_accept_5ee41898:


    "一缕微弱的光线从窗外渗进来，还没待多久便消退了。"


translate chinese begin_accept_026ae380:


    "太阳躲在一层厚厚的白雾后面，暴风雪朝着天空扬起白旗，但那不是投降的标志。"


translate chinese begin_accept_e78a2542:


    "森林和田野在迷雾中不见了踪影。若隐若现的街道上，路旁那盏鱼眼般的路灯是附近唯一的光亮。"


translate chinese begin_accept_fddd84ab:


    "白天变成了黑夜，极地一般的怪诞之物无边无际……"


translate chinese begin_accept_e43e0618:


    "……它绕着屋子，低语着、咆哮着。"


translate chinese begin_accept_c43c3b5a:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/018.Myaso.ogg"
    "{b}“肉。”{/b}——这个字在我颅骨内回响。"


translate chinese begin_accept_ab83080a:


    "我扇了自己一巴掌。"


translate chinese begin_accept_44203a8d:


    voice "voice/anton/5day/010.Mama.ogg"


translate chinese begin_accept_18b2ca59:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/00 Mam.ogg"
    Ant "妈妈？爸爸？"


translate chinese begin_accept_32f3e86f:


    "厨房没人，厕所没人，阁楼也没人。"


translate chinese begin_accept_5545448f:


    "空荡荡的屋子发出讥笑。"


translate chinese begin_accept_9e161bb8:


    "我跑上楼梯，后悔自己当初怎么不好好看看那些在风中摇曳的寻人启事。"


translate chinese begin_accept_f024bb58:


    "万一有几张印着爸爸妈妈的脸呢？"


translate chinese begin_accept_f82a22f1:


    "我看了眼妈妈的房间。"


translate chinese begin_accept_3e5f806b:


    "铅灰色的云悄悄爬过天空。"


translate chinese begin_accept_63560745:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/011.Mama.ogg"
    Ant "上哪去了？"


translate chinese begin_accept_a7beb501:


    "我没指望能在儿童房里看见奥利娅，可到那一看，她好好地躺在床上。"


translate chinese begin_accept_452db753:


    "就好像昨天晚上发生的一切都只是场梦而已。"


translate chinese begin_accept_3881f72d:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/012.Slava.ogg"
    Ant "谢天谢地，你人在屋里！"


translate chinese begin_accept_bc03ff86:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/013.Slava.ogg"
    Ant "爸爸妈妈上哪去了？"


translate chinese begin_accept_93b845bb:


    "奥利娅可能睡着了，没答话。"


translate chinese begin_accept_5ed3960c:


    "她枕边有张折好的纸条，看样子是随手一扔，好像故意不想让人看见一样。"


translate chinese begin_accept_c95c173b:


    "“我们出去买药了。奥利娅交给你了，照顾好你妹妹。”"


translate chinese begin_accept_7b6c26e3:


    "“妈妈和爸爸留”"


translate chinese begin_accept_00ef2ae3:


    "奥利娅眼睛还闭着。"


translate chinese begin_accept_e72522dd:


    "她额头上放着块湿布，高烧烧的那块布热乎乎的。我猜爸爸妈妈出门之前一直在照顾奥利娅。"


translate chinese begin_accept_be48cb78:


    "奥利娅的脑袋陷在枕头里，拼命挣扎，眼珠子在眼皮底下转来转去。"


translate chinese begin_accept_054f75b8:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/83 Aya.ogg"
    Oly "我能不能像你一样，跳到星星上去？"


translate chinese begin_accept_7012ee07:


    "我大吃一惊。"


translate chinese begin_accept_295924bc:


    "她梦到了新年那天晚上跟戴面具的人一起跳舞的事。"


translate chinese begin_accept_64668cab:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/014.net.ogg"
    Ant "不行！别去，那都是骗人的！"


translate chinese begin_accept_cf8d2996:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/84 Zai.ogg"
    Oly "轮到你来招待我们了，兔子！"


translate chinese begin_accept_64f055dc:


    "奥利娅笑了，她小小的牙齿沾满了巧克力。"


translate chinese begin_accept_3e223cfe:


    Oly_glitch "{sc=3}肉……{/sc}"


translate chinese begin_accept_9ea4c7fc:


    "我摇了摇头，努力赶跑脑子里侵入性想法的低语，还有早已死去、身上爬满蛆虫的巨大怪物出现的画面。"


translate chinese begin_accept_d8e30cb8:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/85 Gos.ogg"
    Oly "客人很快就要来了。"


translate chinese begin_accept_713b80f6:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/86 Emi.ogg"
    Oly "我们可以跟他们玩上一整晚！"


translate chinese begin_accept_47df8713:


    "我想起森林里饥饿的野兽，想起笛声和它永不停歇的召唤，想起死去的动物高高跃过松树。"


translate chinese begin_accept_6e9ba8d5:


    "屋子立马变得更暗更冷了。"


translate chinese begin_accept_5873108a:


    "阁楼传来窸窸窣窣的声音。那上面有什么东西，是老鼠，还是狐狸的尾巴？"


translate chinese begin_accept_3b01cf6e:


    "阴影爬上墙壁。"


translate chinese begin_accept_4c22804c:


    "空无一人的房间里，地板嘎吱嘎吱响。"


translate chinese begin_accept_e84e11d8:


    "奥利娅烧得脑子不清醒了，嘴里念叨着的却是我梦里出现的东西，她怎么会知道我梦到了什么？"


translate chinese begin_accept_ecbb9a86:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/87 Ya.ogg"
    Oly "所有的糖我都要尝一尝！"


translate chinese begin_accept_459a3cb0:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/016.Yane.ogg"
    Ant "不行！我不让！"


translate chinese begin_accept_f48edb00:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/40 Po.ogg"
    "“{sc=2}{b}你会让她尝的，{/b}{/sc}”我脑中响起的声音如此说到，与此同时，这个声音从屋子里所有的角落和缝隙涌了出来。"


translate chinese begin_accept_7139e5fd:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/2 mi.ogg"
    Noname "{b}夜幕降临，我们会来找你。{/b}"


translate chinese begin_accept_4084531c:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/3 za.ogg"
    Noname "{b}兔子，让我们美餐一顿……{/b}"


translate chinese begin_accept_168a661f:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/4 eli.ogg"
    Noname "{b}……不然，你就是我们的盘中餐。{/b}"


translate chinese begin_accept_11893cb7:


    "幻觉像蛛网一样将我罩住。"


translate chinese begin_accept_0d90bfb2:


    "我挣脱束缚，冲出房间，差点摔在楼梯上。"


translate chinese begin_accept_43c8784a:


    "指针毫不留情地走着，时间一分一秒过去，白昼的倒计时快要结束，夜幕即将降临……"


translate chinese begin_accept_4f0a4f73:


    "不能只顾着自己，想想奥利娅。她要是饿着肚子醒了怎么办？"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_ebe73051:


    "吃剩下的炼乳蔫巴巴地躺在冰箱里。我把面包按照奥利娅喜欢的样子，切成一小块一小块的，涂上炼乳。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_3ffce3a1:


    "就在这时，寒风的吟啸声中掺杂了一声刺耳的嚎叫。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_0fbd2f00:


    "暴风雪的怀抱中蛰伏着什么黑暗的东西。有活物在冰壳上窜来窜去。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_400f5c37:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/019.net.ogg"
    Ant "不对，天还没那么快黑！"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_1bf74b73:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/019.Vi.ogg"
    Ant "你们保证了会给我个机会的！"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_961ad777:


    "一阵可怜兮兮的吠叫声传入耳中。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_7d646efc:


    "暴风雪停歇了片刻，大片大片的雪絮原本如同虫蝇般聚在一起飞舞，如今散开了，现出了一个小毛球。我认出了面前这个瑟瑟发抖的小家伙，它正是我熟悉的那只小狗。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_23ef5f03:


    "或许这就是我一直在等的机会。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_52c50f22:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/019.Zul.ogg"
    Ant "如利卡！"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_2c52ac7e:


    "流浪狗仿佛听见了我在叫它，摇着尾巴一路冲到了屋子前门。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_b04b4a5b:


    "它用小小的爪子抓挠着门板，呜咽个不停，求我放它进去。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_a5923897:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/019P.ogg"
    Ant "你好啊。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_2b55ac27:


    "我弯下腰揉了揉它的耳朵，它尾巴摇得更欢了。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_e98d68c1:


    "{b}小狗……狗肉……吃的……{/b}"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_d597d289:


    "我给黑暗森林里那些怪物送上狗肉会怎么样？"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_df9fab77:


    "能让它们填饱肚子么？"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_02d65fc1:


    "我甚至没来得及细想怎么杀掉这个可怜的小家伙，吹着口哨就往屋子里走。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_af74c1d5:


    "暴风雪跟着我的节奏，一同吹起口哨来，仿佛在给我邪恶的计划助威。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_182d022b:


    "瑟瑟发抖的流浪狗冲进了走廊。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_e520b3bf:


    "我立马关上了门，生怕小狗嗅出危险的味道，想逃出屋去。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_9409ba01:


    "屋子里回荡着欢快的犬吠声。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_1dbf0c2e:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/020.ti.ogg"
    Ant "别叫了，小傻狗，会吵醒奥利娅的。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_80d4067d:


    "不行，走廊不方便动手，要杀最好去厨房。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_13cd5d1a:


    "我抱起如利卡，它想舔舔我的脸，但我躲开了。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_3954762c:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/020Tina.ogg"
    Ant "你饿了吧？"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_a6360303:


    "我在冰箱里翻找了一阵。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_7ef0830e:


    "找出个装了肉块的袋子，撕开口子，把肉扔给如利卡。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_fbdfe3c9:


    "它小心地闻了闻冷冻的肉骨头，朝我投来怀疑的目光。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_ef5cc566:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/021esh.ogg"
    Ant "吃吧。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_9c3cd7b1:


    "我怕弄脏地板，在地上垫了张印有妈妈喜欢的填字游戏的报纸，把肉块倒在了上面。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_ea067aa4:


    "爸爸好像太忙了，忘了磨刀。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_6e9cc073:


    "我一想到自己要像宰猪一样宰了如利卡，就觉得一阵眩晕。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_11db1bf5:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/022.ch.ogg"
    Ant "我该怎么做才能让你少受点苦……"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_05359f7b:


    "我心底有什么人幸灾乐祸地笑了笑。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_3e1698bc:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/023Tieto.ogg"
    Ant "如利卡……你先在这好好待着。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_76aa69e8:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/023po.ogg"
    Ant "我去拿斧子来杀你，好吗？"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_4f9c4ab0:


    "如利卡顺从地看了我一眼，低头吃起了它最后的晚餐。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_a011756c:


    "我双腿像灌了铅，拖着脚一步步走向阁楼。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_b451e4af:


    "我朝黑暗的阁楼瞥了一眼，害怕山羊的血盆大口会出现在我眼前，害怕会闻到他脏兮兮的绒毛散发的恶臭，害怕它冰冷的手指会掐住我的脖子。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_d10866c5:


    "可阁楼里空荡荡的。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_6bd95844:


    "斧头的刀刃正对着我，投下不详的影子。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_d43b38eb:


    "我牢牢握住了斧柄。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_5e81563e:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/023.pom.ogg"
    Ant "记住……要么交出狗肉，要么交出妹妹。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_3a17c4f7:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/023.so.ogg"
    Ant "要么把自己交出去。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_3d8c89fb:


    "我心中涌起一阵无尽的憎恶，恨那只愚蠢又无辜的小狗，恨我爸爸妈妈抛下我们，开车出门，恨那些让我别无选择的野兽……"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_ecfa8b48:


    "我恨这个世界。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_3fe29fef:


    "我带着满腔怒火，扛着斧子，走进厨房，准备完成计划的最后一步。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_d3f930ec:


    "如利卡用两条后腿站了起来，奥利娅正摸着它的后颈。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_75ff9d28:


    "她靠着桌子，免得自己摔在地上。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_a779352c:


    "我扔下斧头，冲向精疲力尽的奥利娅。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_bb751df3:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/026.ti.ogg"
    Ant "你怎么起来了？"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_9d5cd8e5:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/08 Us.ogg"
    Oly "我听见……狗在叫。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_64d06d04:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/09 Mne.ogg"
    Oly "我感觉好多了。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_a8ab68d3:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/027.ne.ogg"
    Ant "别撒谎了！来，我带你回床上躺着！"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_22936750:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/10 Pr.ogg"
    Oly "我真的觉得好多了。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_5d1f3ca1:


    "奥利娅挪开了靠着桌子边缘的半边身子，证明自己不会忽然倒在我身上。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_0240b449:


    "她脸颊红彤彤的。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_7c2cbc4d:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/028.Ya.ogg"
    "我叹了口气，摸了摸她冷冰冰的额头。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_c1a77f11:


    "只要她没事，让我杀谁都行。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_f9ff7081:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/11 Aot.ogg"
    Oly "哪里来的狗？可以养吗？"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_c71ae78d:


    "斧头哐当一下掉在了地上。我站在斧头面前，羞愧难当。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_3d73a987:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/029.Za.ogg"
    Ant "外面冷，我就让它进来了，等暖和了就送它出去。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_4be77b97:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/030.un.ogg"
    Ant "还有好几只小狗等着它回去照顾。我们养了它，小狗就没人养了。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_486afaa5:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/12 Mi.ogg"
    Oly "我们可以把小狗一起带回来养，肯定很好玩！"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_4bc66adf:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/030.ne.ogg"
    Ant "妈妈不会同意的。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_d2fe6edc:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/13 Am.ogg"
    Oly "我们好好跟她求求情就好了！"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_09ddd1b6:


    "流浪狗蹭了蹭奥利娅的腿。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_4ee2fd40:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/031.da.ogg"
    Ant "如利卡，别蹭了，你身上搞不好有虱子。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_bd4b49e8:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/14 Ee.ogg"
    Oly "它是女孩子吗？是不是叫如利卡？"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_a3612b8e:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/15 Zu.ogg"
    Oly "如利卡！你是我们家的一份子了！"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_20e6d0a7:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/16 Ne.ogg"
    Oly "别担心，小姑娘，没人会伤害你的。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_704f6290:


    "奥利娅从冰箱里拿出根香肠，扔给如利卡。{nw}"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_f5fb0317:


    extend "我刚刚才喂了一整块牛骨头，可它还是特别热情，大口大口地啃了起来。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_1a38b88a:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/032.ya.ogg"
    Ant "换我我就再去睡会儿。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_d3235530:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/032.ma.ogg"
    Ant "爸爸去接医生了，很快就回来，妈妈去买药了。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_1ff4dbfe:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/17 Ya.ogg"
    Oly "不想睡了。刚才做噩梦了。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_958c039c:


    "她垂下眸子，慢吞吞地说。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_7176bf8c:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/033.da.ogg"
    Ant "我知道。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_103a3348:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/18 Av.ogg"
    Oly "你才不知道！"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_6d52db11:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/19 Ti.ogg"
    Oly "我梦里确实有你，但是你怎么会知道呢？"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_425ae92c:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/20 Aya.ogg"
    Oly "我才不告诉你我梦到了什么。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_b13ed5e4:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/21 Po.ogg"
    Oly "因为那个梦特别特别恐怖。但是现在……"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_bd84fa16:


    "奥利娅突然面露喜色，嘴角扬起。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_0dce5dd3:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/22 Tep.ogg"
    Oly "我有如利卡啦，一切都会好的。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_a7f2d217:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/23 Ona.ogg"
    Oly "可怕的猫头鹰来了，如利卡就会叫，它一叫，我们就醒了，赶紧找地方躲起来。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_a36051ef:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/24 E.ogg"
    Oly "这样它就找不到我们啦。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_52ad5b71:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/034.ol.ogg"
    Ant "奥利娅，这癞皮狗可保护不了我们。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_f98de6cd:


    "但妹妹下定了决心。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_c3cd3c89:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/25 Es.ogg"
    Oly "肯定能！"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_bd41e5ea:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/26 Ti.ogg"
    Oly "你会保护我们的对吧？对不对，小狗狗！？"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_50aa8006:


    "流浪狗叫了几声，表示肯定。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_c4815def:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/28 Um.ogg"
    Oly "我有东西给你。等着哦！"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_75d5bca4:


    "奥利娅跑向楼梯，木板吱呀作响。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_76f88768:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/035.ost.ogg"
    Ant "小心！"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_372ec0bc:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/29 Ya.ogg"
    Oly "我马上回来！照顾好如利卡！"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_a08bc342:


    "我盯着狗，内心震惊不已：几分钟前还发着高烧，满嘴胡话的奥利娅，现在竟然活蹦乱跳的。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_2f111f60:


    "如利卡吃完香肠，舔起了地板。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_dfc8a6f3:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/036.vdr.ogg"
    Ant "想讨好我是吧？"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_37034086:


    "我是奥利娅唯一的朋友。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_ebd22219:


    "我能救她，起码该试试救她一命。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_60ed276e:


    "但要救她……"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_8923f3f3:


    "我捡起地上的斧子。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_399449b6:


    "如利卡似乎察觉到了什么，猛地冲过去，想跟着奥利娅上楼。但我站在楼梯口，挡住了它的去路。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_7ac512f7:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/037.Un.ogg"
    Ant "我们时间不多了。奥利娅很快就会回来。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_d3f80f23:


    "我握紧了斧子，它如今拎着像有千斤重。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_daf7f0d3:


    "小狗紧盯着我的一举一动，眼珠子始终跟着我的动作走。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_f3f68e1f:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/038.ne.ogg"
    Ant "别害怕……"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_6b429c3c:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/038.Ya.ogg"
    Ant "狗狗死了都会上天堂。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_26c422af:


    "它的尾巴来回摆动。"


translate chinese phase1_zhulka_devend_0b5ab561:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/039.Da.ogg"
    Ant "别这么可爱啊，靠！"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_12e586a9:


    "我在干什么？"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_e1d9b438:


    "我伤害一只无辜的小狗，跟学校里那群爱伤害别人的人有什么区别？更别说这条小狗还用这么通人性的眼神看着我……"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_c29b5b3f:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/040.Ne.ogg"
    Ant "我做不到！"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_b4f0c4e2:


    "我精疲力竭地丢下斧头。"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_4127f68e:


    "一颗颗汗珠顺着我的身体往下滑。我呼吸急促，好像刚跑完百米冲刺。"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_a4aa3b06:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/043.Yane.ogg"
    Ant "我不是屠夫。"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_b7200c39:


    "如利卡汪汪叫，仿佛表示赞同。"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_bca7ab6f:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/30 Y.ogg"
    Oly "我给狗狗拿了玩具来！"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_c9f4542f:


    "奥利娅跳下了楼梯。她一手抓着亮色丝带，另一只手拿着橡胶球。"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_4b7e1f01:


    "我用脚把斧子踢到电话桌底下，一脸苦笑，看着妹妹带着满腔怜爱，冲小狗舒出一口气。"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_31db493e:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/31 Ti.ogg"
    Oly "你没事啦！"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_4e612dc2:


    "但我们呢？"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_d6bd749d:


    "窗户是那么脆弱，窗外的阴影仿佛蠢蠢欲动。"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_a109a9d0:


    "奥利娅把丝带系在小狗脖子上，当作临时项圈。"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_1f36344e:


    "接着，她让如利卡追球玩。如利卡玩得可开心了，牙都露了出来，那模样把奥利娅给逗乐了。"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_cf1673e8:


    "就算是在这种时候，妹妹的笑声也是那么珍贵，不可替代。"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_d80f1dc5:


    "听着她的笑声，我觉得所有不好的事仿佛从来没有发生过，爸爸妈妈很快就会回来，她的高烧马上会退……"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_8b663e0e:


    "……黑色车库也仿佛从没存在过。"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_c315e2f6:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/33 Poc.ogg"
    Oly "我们为什么不能变成狗？"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_dbfbc337:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/34 El.ogg"
    Oly "变成其他动物也可以。当动物，就可以整天跑跑跳跳，玩玩乐乐了！"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_56e3ce73:


    "不祥的预感攥住了我的心脏。"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_b4a5fcee:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/044.Po.ogg"
    Ant "因为我们是人。"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_d0567841:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/36 Scu.ogg"
    Oly "真没意思！"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_f69c0773:


    "奥利娅拍拍地板。"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_aa36408a:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/37 Sid.ogg"
    Oly "坐下！"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_221a317f:


    "如利卡困惑地叫了几声。"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_3a63f5dd:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/045.Ne.ogg"
    Ant "你好像没有在马戏团表演的天分啊，小狗狗？"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_4be75f5b:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/38 Ya.ogg"
    Oly "我会教它听懂很多命令的，等着瞧吧！"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_4151b1bc:


    "奥利娅说完打了个哈欠，就地侧躺下来，皮球从她手中滚远，吸引了那只傻狗的注意。"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_16c41143:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/39 Kak.ogg"
    Oly "好……困。"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_eb2b9cae:


    "她耷拉着眼皮，打起呼噜来。"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_807a2ad6:


    "我弯腰摸了摸她的额头：又烧起来了。"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_6679f1a9:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/046.St.ogg"
    Ant "保护好你的主人。你的命是她给的。"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_f16cebfa:


    "我对如利卡如此命令道。"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_04827643:


    "小狗却只顾嗅我的裤腿，浑然不知自己刚与死神擦肩而过。"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_3c117547:


    "我冲上二楼，取来毯子和枕头。"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_fe271b9e:


    "奥利娅得睡在这里，我来守着她。"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_6f1bd1c5:


    "让她回楼上睡，谁知道会有什么东西去敲她卧室门……"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_4451b171:


    "奥利娅在睡梦中咂着嘴。"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_155e9f54:


    "我给妹妹盖好被子，摸了摸她纤细脆弱的小臂。"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_be4bf7d0:


    "如利卡蜷成毛球贴着她，发出响亮的鼾声。"


translate chinese zhulka_mercy_551f6806:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/45 no.ogg"
    "我心底有个声音在低语：{b}今晚会是个漫长的夜晚。{/b}"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_6473e209:


    "我举起斧子。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_ad73f050:


    "我在脑子里想象出一架天平，一边放着流浪狗，另一边放着我家里人的性命。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_ab0415f0:


    "想象力在脑海中绘制出栩栩如生的画面：暴风雪将我们与文明隔绝，我们像荒岛上的鲁滨逊，只能靠自己活下去。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_ff66ffc9:


    "鲁滨逊会毫不犹豫杀死动物填饱肚子。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_519c454d:


    "如利卡……只不过是食物。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_54e4e715:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/048.Myaso.ogg"
    Ant "肉！"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_b4ad1ff2:


    "斧刃在空中划出弧线。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_aff2c614:


    "随后传来碎裂声。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_f3196286:


    "温热液滴飞溅在我脸上，如利卡都没来得及发出哀嚎就断气了。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_b5deed44:


    "奥利娅替它发出了尖叫。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_675d8394:


    "她用吓人的尖细嗓音哭喊着，双手攥拳，紧紧贴着脸颊。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_3edb3575:


    "其中一只手里还攥着那条亮色丝带，那是她给狗狗准备的临时项圈。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_808ed111:


    "这份礼物送不出去了。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_295e6b5c:


    "我心中涌起一阵愧疚。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_00229394:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/049.Ol.ogg"
    Ant "奥利娅！"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_30604f9e:


    "我走向妹妹。她刚刚就在我身后，目睹了我杀害小狗的全过程。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_191db680:


    "她看见我毫无意义地杀害了人类最好的朋友。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_76a515f6:


    "丝带从她指间滑落。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_266d065b:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/44 Tie.ogg"
    Oly "你……用斧头……杀了它。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_5c9edf3e:


    "奥利娅抽搐着，泪水模糊了双眼。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_b25120bb:


    "她吓坏了，直直盯着我，眼神中有惊讶也有恐惧。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_5e7a7cd0:


    "我在奥利娅眼里仿佛是刽子手，是杀小动物取乐的疯子。她很怕我。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_3954d529:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/45 Za.ogg"
    Oly "为什么？！"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_d0d9bb87:


    "我抹了把黏糊糊的脸。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_1bc34948:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/050.Da.ogg"
    Ant "你不会明白的。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_37574d5d:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/46 Ne.ogg"
    Oly "别过来！"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_dffb685a:


    "奥利娅哽咽得差点说不出话来。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_05518e7b:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/051Ol.ogg"
    Ant "奥利娅，求你了。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_2d410520:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/47 T.ogg"
    Oly "你和那些晚上会跑出来的怪物一样！"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_241da6b2:


    "我朝妹妹伸出手去，可她看到我手上沾着血，叫得更厉害了。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_a2ef6abc:


    "我扯下挂在旁边挂钩上的毛巾，疯狂擦拭猩红的污渍。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_19b278f0:


    "奥利娅忽然冲向走廊中间那滩黏糊糊、脏兮兮的东西，尖叫起来："


translate chinese zhulka_kill_ced9b0de:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/49 Ziv.ogg"
    Oly "它还活着！"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_47c5fd13:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/49 Dok.ogg"
    Oly "医生来了，它就有救了！"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_f8a20e6a:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/052.ne.ogg"
    Ant "不可能！"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_601e4fb0:


    "我死死盯着小狗的尸体。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_83ef0dd3:


    "它血红的残躯正在颤动鼓胀，血肉中渗出了一种灰色的东西。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_fa7dd0c1:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/054.Na.ogg"
    Ant "往后退！"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_7f20acfb:


    "我把奥利娅推向楼梯。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_350085ff:


    "狗的尸体像腐烂的果实一样，中间是空的。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_c1d5433f:


    "难怪我一斧子劈下去毫不费力就劈开了。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_06484baa:


    "有什么令人不快的东西在狗的身体里越长越大。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_25b58f6e:


    "可能就是这东西操纵着狗，让它找到我们家来。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_4b91d8f2:


    "黏腻的畸形生物从狗的尸体里钻了出来。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_6e94283e:


    "转瞬之间，一只巨大的虫子出现在了地板上，它扭动着身子，弯曲的蛛腿在地板上摸索、蠕动。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_d3f632ad:


    "透明的翅膀在它身后伸展、颤动，殷红的血滴甩得到处都是。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_877f091c:


    "这只融合了蜈蚣、蜘蛛与蝴蝶的变异生物，正拖着浑身长毛的躯体朝我爬过来。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_969766a5:


    "它腿上长着钳子，走在地板上咔哒咔哒响，细长的口器中，糖浆一般的黏液一滴接一滴滴在地板上。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_1c6ba7cf:


    "我大叫一声，抡起斧子将寄生虫劈成两半。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_d2e8229e:


    "变异生物的身体爆开，喷出黄色脓液，虫腿抽搐着掉在了地板上。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_455c8bfa:


    "下一秒，奥利娅倒在了我脚边。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_ba8bea3a:


    "我的斧子还插在那滩黏糊糊的东西里。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_48863e5e:


    "那只虫子就像套娃里比较小的{u}玛特廖什卡{/u}，藏在狗的身体里。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_50efdbe4:


    "我突然想起第一次见到阿狸萨那天，她喂这只狗吃过什么东西。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_ddbb4cdc:


    "我靠着墙滑坐在地，双手捂着脸。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_637e406e:


    "一阵恶心涌上喉头，深呼吸了好几次才压下去。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_a129a511:


    "窗外的积雪咯吱作响，仿佛有人靠近窗边，窥视着我们。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_54d79312:


    "我全神贯注，不放过任何一点细小的动静，好像我整个人都变成了一只耳朵。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_7ac8a6f4:


    "什么都没听到。大概是幻觉吧。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_63ea7de2:


    "就跟爸爸平时经常说的一样，我“神经紧张”了。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_c6bdc362:


    "妈妈每次都会跟着补充一句，说神经细胞可是不可再生的。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_39b2f64d:


    "我必须挺住，挺到他们回来。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_0f78f613:


    "快了，他们随时都有可能回来。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_22914c27:


    "我扫了一眼走廊。这儿一片狼藉，仿佛屠宰场，正中央躺着浑身发白的奥利娅。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_3b79a616:


    "绝对不能用这种“惊喜”迎接爸爸妈妈。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_2d8539fd:


    "寄生在流浪狗体内的邪恶生物让我一斧子劈死了，静静躺在地上一动不动。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_a74a676c:


    "我从卧室抱来毯子和枕头，给她盖好毯子，抱到楼梯间旁边，让她离那具寄生虫尸体远远的。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_8f52f764:


    "奥利娅得待在这儿，让我守着。放她回卧室里睡，谁知道会有什么东西去敲她卧室的门……"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_f409970d:


    "奥利娅脸颊上的红色已经褪去，皮肤变成了灰白色。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_dbcc7cd3:


    "我用嘴唇碰了碰她的额头。不用体温计量也知道，她又发高烧了。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_362ce968:


    "我用床单把那具恶心的虫子尸体，还有如利卡的皮毛一菓，一股脑儿塞进了冰箱。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_983ba487:


    "虽然不觉得等大人回来，这具尸体还会在冰箱里，但总得试试。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_d197ee47:


    "希望他们这回至少能相信我说的话……"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_99bd531e:


    "狗血用毛巾能勉强擦干净，可那种黏糊糊的液体就难擦得多了。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_539fe5d3:


    "最后我只能改用一开始打算拿来杀如利卡的刀子，一点点把黏液刮掉。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_c0cb2830:


    "屋外的天空垂下了厚重的雪幕。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_79a15a3e:


    "屋子颤抖起来，飓风似乎想将这座小屋连根拔起。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_acdb55a3:


    "整座屋子就像即将飞到奥兹国的桃乐丝的小屋——只不过奥兹国有善良巫师，而我们的终点是疯狂与死亡统治之地。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_af95b872:


    "雪花如同幽灵，手拉手在窗外嬉笑起舞。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_ef8d6126:


    "随后，黑暗降临。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_33652477:


    "夜色和暴风雪用墨汁涂满了房子的每一扇窗户。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_caf7f1f5:


    "现在就算有人贴在窗台上紧盯着我们，我也根本看不见。"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_2cdc7a50:


    "门闩究竟有多牢？"


translate chinese zhulka_kill_5d454b6c:


    "蔓延的黑暗又有多么饥饿？"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_839d3504:


    "四周的黑暗中传来震耳欲聋的尖叫声，我一听就蜷缩了起来。"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_a92498ab:


    "那是风声，亦或是饥饿的哀嚎。"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_b63b1bd4:


    "尖啸、呜咽，还有我越跳越快的心跳声交织在一起，构成了一组骇人的乐章。"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_d85074e1:


    "飓风将乐章的音符灌进了我耳朵里。"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_b0937d75:


    "狂风撞击着窗户。"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_4216a0e9:


    "楼上有扇窗户没关，风吹得窗户撞在窗框上，哐当作响。"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_a2bd0922:


    "就像发狂的野兽的血盆大口在一张一合。"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_8599d439:


    "客人已经来了吗？它们现在是不是在二楼游荡？是不是在走廊各个角落窜来窜去，发出咯咯的笑声……"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_49e89c9b:


    "我本来应该喂如利卡给它们吃的。"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_ee1fa077:


    "它们发怒了，怒火无边无际！"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_70120310:


    "我缩进冰箱角落，总觉得门框旁的黑暗中会忽然伸出一只利爪，紧紧抓住我。"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_525fc63c:


    "总觉得那些野兽的脸会随时出现在厨房里，它们面露獠牙，口水滴落在地板上。"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_d42dd0f9:


    "我得冷静下来。"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_a752d5de:


    "该吃药了……"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_adaa5196:


    "我从冰箱的架子上拿出一盒药，舌头顶出一片药，就着自来水吞了下去。"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_aa75c76b:


    "随后，接了点水洗了把脸。"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_104c13fb:


    "暴风雪似乎对我的选择很失望。"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_df610b66:


    "它嚎叫着，朝屋子的外墙发起了更猛烈的进攻。"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_0b74f5b6:


    "它能感觉到这座不堪一击的屋子里，那两个孩子的恐惧。"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_3be709a2:


    "我发觉只要一移开视线，阴影就会悄悄向奥利娅靠近。"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_cdea5153:


    "屋子角落里那些蠕动的黑色团块，只要让人直直盯着，就会融化消失，变成桌下模糊的轮廓。"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_86472306:


    "我发疯一般转着脑袋，想用目光逼退它们。"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_7c4d51e5:


    "这时，我发现地板上又出现一滩血迹，跟我刚擦掉的一模一样。"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_04dbfb83:


    "令人牙酸的刮擦声响起，仿佛有双爪子在刮擦着窗玻璃。"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_9ae29b57:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/04 net.ogg"
    Ant "假的……"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_84ed49a9:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/05 V.ogg"    
    Ant "你们都是假的！"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_94a8f14c:


    "但如果影子是假的……"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_13193d55:


    "如果暴风雪里压根没人……"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_3166d33f:


    "那是不是说明，发疯的人是我……？"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_25fc782d:


    "我是个杀小动物取乐的虐待狂……连环杀手不都是从杀小动物开始的么？"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_a75b9353:


    "我看向手中的药盒。"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_b5b7ce31:


    "我刚刚吃了什么？小孩一般不用认真看药品说明，这是妈妈该干的事。"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_00590d59:


    "我眯起眼，仔细辨认上面印的小字："


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_7c3567e0:


    "“用于控制突发性暴怒、焦虑”"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_f51dfdb4:


    "“治疗行为异常、躁狂、破坏性行为……”"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_9bfd8282:


    "“可能成瘾！”"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_382bb2e4:


    "“副作用包括头晕、多动……”"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_bd12a271:


    "“……体温调节紊乱、失眠”"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_3087e3de:


    "“过量服用可能导致严重伤害或死亡”"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_9326c866:


    "我犹豫了起来。"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_07392d50:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/Tabll.ogg"
    "记忆中阿狸萨那谄媚的声音，此刻浮现在脑海中……这些药约束着我……让我在积雪的小路上走着走着，就走到了别的地方去……"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_7c5d708a:


    "但或许我压根不需要那条积雪的小路？"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_5e8cb775:


    "该停下了……"


translate chinese event_medication_afterdev_2040e9c3:


    "真相到底是什么？我该怎么做，才能分辨真相和恶毒的谎言？"


translate chinese event_medicated_8352f16b:


    "我冒了个险。可我要是不保持清醒，事情只会变得更糟。"


translate chinese event_medicated_d39027df:


    "我等了一会儿，但药物没有起效。"


translate chinese event_medicated_a1d2d918:


    "窗外不祥的世界丝毫未变，敌意分毫不减。"


translate chinese event_medicated_76cfa358:


    "恰恰相反，树木的剪影仿佛化作了潜伏在黑暗中的食人野兽，静候猎物。"


translate chinese event_medicated_fc6731ff:


    "扭曲的枝桠时而俯身探向雪径搜寻猎物，时而猛地刺向天空试图攫取不设防的飞鸟。"


translate chinese event_medicated_35a03dc4:


    "然而一旦目光投向它们，这些伪装者便会瞬间凝固。"


translate chinese event_medicated_6a74fd6b:


    "重新变回被诅咒的针叶林中无数死树中的一员。"


translate chinese event_medicated_282248c2:


    "但或许这全是风的恶作剧……不对，绝对不可能！"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_d7691eee:


    "我灌下一大口水关上水龙头时，发现那滩血迹已无影无踪。"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_994efaf8:


    "周围的阴影也不再像有生命般躁动。刮擦声消失了。"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_e2749a7d:


    "周围的阴影渐渐不再像有生命般活动，那些吱吱作响的声音也停止了。"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_29ed593d:


    "人在屋子里，外面的暴风雪再大，也构不成威胁。"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_ec3e19f1:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/01 Vi.ogg" 
    Mam "安东？奥利娅？"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_7a745af0:



    voice "voice/father/day5/01 Na.ogg"
    Pap "这鬼天气。"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_cc392a1e:



    voice "voice/father/day5/02 Ant.ogg"
    Pap "安东，去烧壶水。"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_0a0fee4b:


    "两双鞋在玄关跺着雪，父母出现在门框里。"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_0369fb4e:


    "爸爸妈妈出现在了门口。"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_a7f20a01:


    "奥利娅微微颤抖着，睁开了眼睛。"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_1b1fc6a2:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/04 Ma.ogg"
    Oly "妈妈……爸爸……"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_6d33499f:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/02 Ti.ogg"
    Mam "发着烧怎么还躺在地上？"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_b8a091a9:


    "父亲扫视着狼藉的厨房，脸色越来越阴沉。"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_01a3c5ad:


    "母亲抱起奥莉亚。"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_65fbbcc0:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/03 Go.ogg"
    Mam "天哪，额头这么烫。"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_c5a76af1:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/04 Ni.ogg" 
    Mam "别怕，我们带药回来了。很快就不难受了。"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_19803a28:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/05 Mne.ogg"
    Oly "我做了噩梦。狗狗被杀了。"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_e0985cb2:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/06 Mnes.ogg"
    Oly "梦里安东变成了怪物。"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_268f9ae9:


    "母亲用责备的眼神烫伤了我。"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_18f05953:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/05 Na.ogg"
    Mam "五分钟都离不开人。"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_6456395a:


    "我感到脸颊发烫。"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_d3b4d645:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/06 Vs.ogg"
    Mam "乖宝贝，妈妈抱你回床上。"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_1acbd116:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/07 Ant.ogg"
    Oly "安东……"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_c0544272:


    "我们目光相遇。她眼里盛满哀求。"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_af1df198:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/08 Ant.ogg"
    Oly "安东，陪着我……"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_3e1d592b:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/07 Tv.ogg"
    Mam "你哥哥得收拾残局。"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_f3bb5529:


    "收拾残局？怎么收拾？去黑暗里吗？"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_aa422153:


    "不对，你个傻子，妈妈是说让你去收拾收拾厨房……"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_d227f2e1:


    "被抱走前，奥莉亚困惑地回望我。"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_089a1d48:


    "我想抓住她紧紧搂住。但母亲已抱着她走进走廊。"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_f12bd1d9:


    "厨房在她离开后变得更加污浊，风声也愈发凄厉。"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_a3a7a680:



    voice "voice/father/day5/03 Da.ogg"
    Pap "很不好……你这样很不好，安东。"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_ce5e9a37:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/06 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "我可以解释——"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_463b7639:


    "父亲抬手打断。"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_226873c9:



    voice "voice/father/day5/04 Ne.ogg"
    Pap "现在别说。"


translate chinese event_medicated_intro_483dfc83:



    voice "voice/father/day5/05 Ya.ogg"
    Pap "我饿得像头狼……"


translate chinese event_medicated_meat_268f91bc:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/07 pod.ogg"
    Ant "等等！"


translate chinese event_medicated_meat_be5baa92:


    "但为时已晚。"


translate chinese event_medicated_meat_d9794f5a:


    "父亲拉开冰柜。惨白的灯光照亮他逐渐僵硬的脸。"


translate chinese event_medicated_meat_65ab057e:


    "我屏息看着他取出裹尸布般的床单，世界开始倾斜。"


translate chinese event_medicated_meat_13b0374a:



    voice "voice/father/day5/06 Vot.ogg"
    Pap "明白了。"


translate chinese event_medicated_meat_b7abe5dc:



    voice "voice/father/day5/07 Mne.ogg"
    Pap "他们说过可能会这样。"


translate chinese event_medicated_meat_d97ad776:


    "父亲没有吼我。我宁愿他吼出来！"


translate chinese event_medicated_meat_d3f86028:


    "他看起来精疲力竭又沮丧。"


translate chinese event_medicated_meat_9416f376:


    Ant "我只是想保护奥莉亚。"


translate chinese event_medicated_meat_75af61e6:



    voice "voice/father/day5/08 hor.ogg"
    Pap "好。现在别说话，听我说。"


translate chinese event_medicated_meat_2258ef4f:


    "他瞥了眼床单里的残骸，厌恶地皱起脸。"


translate chinese event_medicated_meat_232bfdd1:



    voice "voice/father/day5/10 Tv.ogg"
    Pap "绝不能让妈妈知道。懂吗？"


translate chinese event_medicated_meat_71e470a7:


    "我咽了口唾沫。"


translate chinese event_medicated_meat_37d56fae:



    voice "voice/father/day5/11 Po.ogg"
    Pap "听懂没有？"


translate chinese event_medicated_meat_b0f41e99:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/11 Da.ogg"
    Ant "明、明白。"


translate chinese event_medicated_meat_587f0d4e:



    voice "voice/father/day5/12 Un.ogg"
    Pap "她操心的东西够多的了……"


translate chinese event_medicated_meat_3d19fa73:



    voice "voice/father/day5/13 Ya.ogg"
    Pap "赶紧处理掉这脏东西。"


translate chinese event_medicated_meat_c535ed0a:



    voice "voice/father/day5/14 Tak.ogg"
    Pap "别让奥莉亚看见。"


translate chinese event_medicated_meat_1d740679:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/12 No.ogg"
    Ant "可是……"


translate chinese event_medicated_meat_6154a2cb:



    voice "voice/father/day5/15 Se.ogg"
    Pap "立刻。"


translate chinese event_medicated_meat_9b8ad5ec:



    voice "voice/father/day5/16 Ya.ogg"
    Pap "我来清理现场。"


translate chinese event_medicated_meat_36094adb:


    "我木然点头，接过床单走向走廊。"


translate chinese event_medicated_meat_5fda604d:


    "扔掉？但这不是垃圾。是因我而死的生命……"


translate chinese event_medicated_meat_d631353b:


    "强忍呜咽，我从墙角抄起铁锹。"


translate chinese event_medicated_zhulka_40d237b9:


    "父亲弯腰拾起斧头。如利卡在桌下发出呜咽。"


translate chinese event_medicated_zhulka_12330c08:



    voice "voice/father/day5/20 Cha.ogg"
    Pap "这又是什么？你从哪弄来的？"


translate chinese event_medicated_zhulka_e7a50994:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/14 Eto.ogg"
    Ant "是个女孩。她叫……"


translate chinese event_medicated_zhulka_c697269e:


    "父亲抬手打断我。"


translate chinese event_medicated_zhulka_cb1981bf:



    voice "voice/father/day5/21 Tak.ogg"
    Pap "所以这摊乱子是它搞的？"


translate chinese event_medicated_zhulka_552f3f8c:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/15 Ne.ogg"
    Ant "不完全是，但……"


translate chinese event_medicated_zhulka_4b835b90:



    voice "voice/father/day5/22 Ya.ogg"
    Pap "我不想争论。把它赶出去。"


translate chinese event_medicated_zhulka_4dc924b5:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/16 Pa.ogg"
    Ant "可是爸爸……！"


translate chinese event_medicated_zhulka_010e8c1c:



    voice "voice/father/day5/23 To.ogg"
    Pap "托沙，你妈妈现在快崩溃了。"


translate chinese event_medicated_zhulka_e66ceb65:



    voice "voice/father/day5/24 Um.ogg"
    Pap "趁她发现前，赶紧把狗弄走。"


translate chinese event_medicated_zhulka_3f07fb69:



    voice "voice/father/day5/25 Ti.ogg"
    Pap "你知道她的脾气。绝不会同意养狗。"


translate chinese event_medicated_zhulka_5509c9bc:



    voice "voice/father/day5/26 Po.ogg"
    Pap "至少等奥莉亚病好。到时候......"


translate chinese event_medicated_zhulka_4b43e606:



    voice "voice/father/day5/27 Ch.ogg"
    Pap "……我们再想办法。"


translate chinese event_medicated_zhulka_0b4ccb3b:


    "我认命地叹了口气。"


translate chinese event_medicated_zhulka_f00338f0:


    "父亲露出苦笑，从冰箱取出几根香肠递给我。"


translate chinese event_medicated_zhulka_dbd481dd:



    voice "voice/father/day5/28 Na.ogg"
    Pap "拿去。到外面喂它。"


translate chinese event_medicated_zhulka_8f3cfbaf:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/18 poi.ogg"
    Ant "走吧，如利卡。"


translate chinese event_medicated_zhulka_3b0c8a8c:


    "我和正啃着冷香肠的小狗一起走进门厅。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_d465e3b8:


    "我竖起耳朵想听奥莉亚房里的对话，但肆虐的风雪吞没了所有声音。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_9314fa0f:


    "我匆匆套上外套，蹬上靴子，抱着如利卡冲进了暴风雪中。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_f657e523:


    "我胡乱套上外套，朝那狗吹了声口哨，我们便一头扎进了暴风雪中。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_c31751cf:


    "唯一的安慰是如利卡本来就是流浪狗，说不定知道该怎么在这么冷的冬天活下去。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_5322b1e0:


    "我将最后几块肉干喂给它，它兴奋地舔着我的手掌。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_54f64e78:


    "寒风推搡着我的后背，仿佛在押送我去那片刑场般的树林。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_ea75aac1:


    "那些树在暴雪中佝偻着身子，活像丑陋的刽子手，正等着处决我这个罪人。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_30ddde9a:


    "成片的榆树如同峭壁，岩缝间游荡着寒风与灰白的幽灵——"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_e140d865:


    "定是这片森林从前的牺牲品。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_bb9ce639:


    "不，只是积雪……"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_6133023d:


    "可连林间空地都如此可怖，密林深处又会怎样？"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_0802e13e:


    "别想了……"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_3d334354:


    "速战速决，逃回去便是。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_2b3a59fe:


    "我在齐膝的雪堆里艰难前行。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_1ac71267:


    "离松林越近，周遭便愈发昏暗。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_5d2eb265:


    "我回望家的方向。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_7f22d560:


    "顶灯如风中之烛般明灭不定，"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_4fc22d77:


    "不知为何，我觉得再不会有人去重新点燃它们了。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_6312dd79:


    "我将染血的床单铺在雪地上，铁锹狠狠凿向冰封的地面。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_36205ea7:


    "冻土比石头还硬。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_127783db:


    "这该用挖掘机而不是铁锹——看来是没法正经下葬了。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_8a232369:


    "我疑神疑鬼地环顾四周，活像被困在百鬼夜行墓地的蹩脚殓尸人。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_d0fa3900:


    "那些树木刽子手与雪堆怪物正凝视着我。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_1cf85662:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/19 Be.ogg"
    Ant "跑吧，如利卡。这里不欢迎你。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_a8e42407:


    "小狗竖起了耳朵。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_bad91c65:


    "灌木丛在严寒中沙沙作响，发出脆裂的声响。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_1eacac72:


    "黑暗深处传来呜咽。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_9c3ce84c:


    "树枝断裂的脆响。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_8e43205e:


    "有人正沿着森林边缘游走。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_6f5da817:


    "如利卡短促地吠叫了一声。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_594ee1bc:


    "我惊慌转身，却发现家的踪影已然消失。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_8b115302:


    "暴风雪用密不透风的混沌将我包围。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_c0fab469:


    "树干间回荡着尖啸，雪片抽打着我的脸庞。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_660991a4:


    "咔嚓。咔嚓。咔嚓。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_760b5d1a:


    "犹如巨型绞肉机碾碎骨头的声响——那正是黑暗中向我逼近的脚步声。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_4648938a:


    "我踉跄后退，有什么东西绊了我一下——是如利卡的尸体。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_379d1d9e:


    "父亲终究还是心软了，悄悄跟来想帮我安葬它吧。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_16462eb1:


    "我踉跄后退。如利卡突然狂吠起来。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_e65e0eb5:


    "父亲终究不忍心看狗冻死，决定把它带回温暖的房子吧。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_c220626e:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/20 Pap.ogg"
    Ant "爸？"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_b37b48be:


    "咔嚓。咔嚓。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_9e5d42ef:


    "脚步声在距我数米处戛然而止。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_01228812:


    "我拼命睁大眼睛——"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_d781929e:


    "空无一人。不过是狂风压弯的灌木丛。"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_ce6a29c9:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/21 Vid.ogg"
    "刚松口气，"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_c0cd9ea4:


    "突然有双手从背后钳住我……"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_a68b46bf:


    "……把我提了起来，带离地面……"


translate chinese event_medicated_story_fb47d848:


    "……狠狠抛进黑暗！"


translate chinese event_m_story_b88b1bd0:


    "昏迷如同坠入粘稠糖浆的深井，我在其中缓缓下沉。"


translate chinese event_m_story_e95af77c:


    "这感觉竟有些惬意——既然无力改变，不如在胶状黑暗里放松四肢。"


translate chinese event_m_story_29e4b2e4:


    "像潜水者放任洋流裹挟。"


translate chinese event_m_story_f6233667:


    "但即便那时我也知道，这口井终有尽头。"


translate chinese event_m_story_bf02c759:


    "不可能再醒来看见父母焦虑的脸。"


translate chinese event_m_story_cb4af3e9:


    "最先复苏的是痛觉。"


translate chinese event_m_story_12a50854:


    "双手像是被车轮碾过般剧痛。"


translate chinese event_m_story_f9391824:


    "接着，微光渗入颤动的眼帘。"


translate chinese event_m_story_0f1f63c4:


    "当我睁眼，噩梦才真正开始。"


translate chinese event_m_story_542b8bd0:


    "现实的碎片像一群发了疯的狗一般朝我扑来。"


translate chinese event_m_story_7f9a1c31:


    "现实的碎片如疯狗群扑来："


translate chinese event_m_story_2251945c:


    "生锈的金属墙。摇晃的灯泡。铆钉地板。成排货架。"


translate chinese event_m_story_c794fd27:


    "我在车库里醒来。"


translate chinese event_m_story_0561133f:


    "恐惧比捆住手腕的麻绳更令人窒息。"


translate chinese event_m_story_7891b130:


    "胶带封住嘴巴，所有挣扎都化作呜咽。"


translate chinese event_m_story_5fce9896:


    "我悬在离地两尺的空中，天花板挂钩下的绳索将人吊成十字。"


translate chinese event_m_story_57ef63ee:


    "脚尖徒劳划着空气，"


translate chinese event_m_story_40104ed3:


    "麻绳勒进渗血的手腕。"


translate chinese event_m_story_6a9909ef:


    "喉咙干得像是粘在了一起。"


translate chinese event_m_story_d900e741:


    "这就是终点。"


translate chinese event_m_story_bcefa486:


    "确切地说，是漫长折磨的起点。"


translate chinese event_m_story_1e6a2870:


    "恐怖拼图正在成型："


translate chinese event_m_story_a39116ad:


    "我强迫自己冷静，避免手臂伤得更重。"


translate chinese event_m_story_cb40bd65:


    "至少绑架者暂时离开了。这个铁皮箱里只剩我一人。"


translate chinese event_m_story_2228dd16:


    "或许我能挣脱？"


translate chinese event_m_story_9b13d3eb:


    "但稍一动弹，我又像蛛网中的飞虫般悬空摇晃起来。"


translate chinese event_m_story_874b901a:


    "本该放着扳手和绞盘的地方，陈列着锈迹斑斑的钳子、手术刀和骨锯。"


translate chinese event_m_story_2d088057:


    "全都脏兮兮的，还布满灰尘。"


translate chinese event_m_story_c1f4a103:


    "地板上凝结着暗红斑块。"


translate chinese event_m_story_46047a8d:


    "角落那堆破布……当意识到那是什么时，我浑身力气瞬间抽离。"


translate chinese event_m_story_14e7b7cc:


    "全是孩童的衣物和鞋子。"


translate chinese event_m_story_d82a799d:


    "那些在我之前被诱入魔窟的孩子们，最终留下的只有这些遗物。"


translate chinese event_m_story_fb37fe66:


    "我眨掉灼热的泪水。"


translate chinese event_m_story_eeec4065:


    "在我右侧，一块防水布覆盖着某种庞然大物。"


translate chinese event_m_story_d7488b32:


    "而在更左侧的阴影里，蜷缩着一个孩子。"


translate chinese event_m_story_9fe6809e:


    "他弓着背蹲在那台——大概是给灯泡供电的发电机旁。"


translate chinese event_m_story_1e224625:


    "我止住抽泣，发出呜咽试图引起他的注意。"


translate chinese event_m_story_1ae80075:


    "那孩子始终背对着我，兜帽遮住了头部。"


translate chinese event_m_story_81b703b9:


    "分不清是男是女。"


translate chinese event_m_story_60a52934:


    "只见他抱着膝盖前后摇晃，仿佛陷入某种恍惚状态。"


translate chinese event_m_story_08172496:


    "他的影子在金属墙上滑动，唯有窗外呼啸的风声打破沉寂。"


translate chinese event_m_story_a10629ab:


    "万一是奥莉亚呢？"


translate chinese event_m_story_7a7dc20f:


    "难道妹妹也被抓进了黑色车库？这个念头如沸水般灼伤我的大脑。"


translate chinese event_m_story_bf3c5a18:


    "我猛地后仰头颈，扭动手腕试图够到绳结，"


translate chinese event_m_story_f745764c:


    "当然只是徒劳无功。"


translate chinese event_m_story_eaf1e89c:


    "当我再次看向发电机时，"


translate chinese event_m_story_17e37fb1:


    "那个孩子已经消失。或许他从未真实存在过。"


translate chinese event_m_story_f3a2bc55:


    "我转动僵硬的脖颈四处搜寻，"


translate chinese event_m_story_020d8ce4:


    "却听见防水布下传来压抑的喘息声——"


translate chinese event_m_story_81dd3e45:


    "又是幻觉吗？"


translate chinese event_m_story_2dec2bac:


    "我死死盯着那微弱的声响来源。"


translate chinese event_m_story_99baef2b:


    "突然整个金属牢房剧烈震颤，我的身体像钟摆般甩向货架。"


translate chinese event_m_story_2277fae8:


    "刑具叮当作响，灯泡疯狂摇晃，刺眼的光斑在地板上扭曲爬行。"


translate chinese event_m_story_a049e7b4:


    "黑色车库瞬间变成了一座皮影戏台。"


translate chinese event_m_story_3117acff:


    "地震？"


translate chinese event_m_story_ba8b5433:


    "不，更像是{u}芭芭雅嘎{/u}的鸡腿小屋正在拔足狂奔。"


translate chinese event_m_story_4c814574:


    "车库在移动。没错，我正在被运往某处。"


translate chinese event_m_story_32f94101:


    "狂风咆哮中，隐约能听见外头引擎的轰鸣。"


translate chinese event_m_story_97825cc7:


    "灯泡明灭不定，忽而熄灭，忽而又挣扎着亮起。"


translate chinese event_m_story_378a92fd:


    "那是……狗叫声？"


translate chinese event_m_story_cdb20576:


    "一阵剧烈颠簸将我甩向发电机。"


translate chinese event_m_story_9f22070d:


    "绳索从挂钩滑脱，我重重仰摔在地，痛得眼球几乎暴凸。"


translate chinese event_m_story_627408c6:


    "就在这时，车库门猛地洞开——"


translate chinese event_m_story_416e3a5d:


    "暴风雪中，无数树干正飞速后退。我们确实在移动，很可能被拖车牵引着。"


translate chinese event_m_story_b4cd0c3f:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/01 est.ogg"
    Rom "还有人活着吗？拜沙！"


translate chinese event_m_story_4cc8e322:


    "罗姆卡！难道这次不是幻觉？"


translate chinese event_m_story_932c0fb1:


    "我拼命蹬动双腿。"


translate chinese event_m_story_560066a5:


    "罗姆卡像赶火车的乘客般冲进车库，"


translate chinese event_m_story_ac35b4c1:


    "只愣了一秒就扑过来扯掉我嘴里的布条。"


translate chinese event_m_story_6db0662d:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/03 bra.ogg"
    Rom "没事吧兄弟？！"


translate chinese event_m_story_e6bd3c62:


    "这个问题我实在难以回答。"


translate chinese event_m_story_7d929641:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/04 Sha.ogg"
    Rom "等会儿……"


translate chinese event_m_story_43783d6e:


    "罗姆卡掏出蝴蝶刀割断了绳索。"


translate chinese event_m_story_165ecc75:


    "僵硬手腕传来的剧痛让我闷哼出声，被他一把拽起。"


translate chinese event_m_story_f0d67c4d:


    "脚下地面疯狂震颤，我们必须保持平衡才不会被甩到墙上。"


translate chinese event_m_story_3aa27fe4:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/06 Ya.ogg"
    Rom "你小子命可真硬。"


translate chinese event_m_story_a9fc512d:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/20 Petrov.ogg"
    Rom "彼得罗夫？你他妈在这儿干嘛？"


translate chinese event_m_story_c33e6734:


    "我无法回答这个问题。"


translate chinese event_m_story_a1213ce8:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/21 Os.ogg"
    Rom "我巴不得留你在这儿等死，废物。"


translate chinese event_m_story_7d9a2184:


    "他的话让我全身如坠冰窟。"


translate chinese event_m_story_737ec566:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/22 Da.ogg"
    Rom "放松点，开玩笑的。我看起来像怪物吗？给我一分钟。"


translate chinese event_m_story_43783d6e_1:


    "罗姆卡掏出蝴蝶刀割断了绳索。"


translate chinese event_m_story_f2179d11:


    "我因手腕僵硬的疼痛呻吟起来。站起身时看见Roma正咧嘴盯着我。"


translate chinese event_m_story_e022346f:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/24 bu.ogg"
    Rom "你欠我一次，蠢货。"


translate chinese event_m_story_f0d67c4d_1:


    "脚下地面疯狂震颤，我们必须保持平衡才不会被甩到墙上。"


translate chinese event_m_story_67e8dfed:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/25 Poz.ogg"
    Rom "恭喜啊彼得罗夫，你不是凶手。"


translate chinese event_m_story_e0ad1769:


    "呵，那可真是多谢了。"


translate chinese event_m_story_85744e7f:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/28 Kak.ogg"
    Ant "你怎么会在这里？"


translate chinese event_m_story_556876db:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/07 Ka.ogg"
    Rom "简直像他妈的动作片情节！"


translate chinese event_m_story_752cb646:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/08 By.ogg"
    Rom "拜沙失踪了，条子就找上我这个老相识。"


translate chinese event_m_story_d500ac4a:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/09 Ti.ogg"
    Rom "结果吉洪诺夫直接说：“你跟我们一起走。”"


translate chinese event_m_story_eeb25562:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/10 On.ogg"
    Rom "他们把我塞进警车，在附近兜了好几圈。"


translate chinese event_m_story_84ada17e:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/11 Sch.ogg"
    Rom "运气不错，凶手转移车库时被我们盯上了。"


translate chinese event_m_story_3b9c18c4:


    "外面传来枪声和犬吠。"


translate chinese event_m_story_1e8e4025:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/29 A.ogg"
    Ant "到底……凶手是谁？"


translate chinese event_m_story_2534ae1e:


    "罗曼刚要开口，帆布下又传来窒息的声响。"


translate chinese event_m_story_05da2de7:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/12 B.ogg"
    Rom "拜沙！"


translate chinese event_m_story_6ebf4524:


    "我们冲向声源，四只手同时掀开帆布。"


translate chinese event_m_story_3b0a46f1:


    "眼前的景象让我大脑几乎宕机。"


translate chinese event_m_story_7fc3c147:


    "帆布下是台工业绞肉机。"


translate chinese event_m_story_89c7a0e4:


    "机油槽里捆着卡嘉。"


translate chinese event_m_story_f0c8b8a3:


    "她盈满绝望泪水的眼睛正望着我们。"


translate chinese event_m_story_3b4d47bd:


    "卡嘉嘴里塞着东西，发出呜咽。"


translate chinese event_m_story_832faf49:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/30 mi.ogg"
    Ant "我们这就救你出来！"


translate chinese event_m_story_74c2cd6e:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/31 ost.ogg"
    Ant "小心，罗曼！"


translate chinese event_m_story_bf219383:


    "罗姆卡听到我的警告却为时已晚。"


translate chinese event_m_story_b032e9d6:


    "车库再次震动，这个混混撞上绞肉机侧壁，压断了槽底操纵杆。"


translate chinese event_m_story_f14fc841:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/14 Bl.ogg"
    Rom "操！"


translate chinese event_m_story_04b7e316:


    "巨型机器发出空腹般的轰鸣。"


translate chinese event_m_story_1441b08d:


    "铸铁口内的刀片开始运转。"


translate chinese event_m_story_9795596d:


    "卡嘉的眼球惊恐暴突。"


translate chinese event_m_story_32f7665d:


    "我意识到她正滑向绞肉机的咽喉。再过几秒，刀刃就会切断她的双脚。"


translate chinese event_m_story_d5f4ba67:


    "罗姆卡忍痛试图徒扳动残余的操纵杆，但已经完全损毁。"


translate chinese event_m_story_5d90d149:


    "我把手伸进油槽抓住卡嘉肩膀。"


translate chinese event_m_story_bf873c1f:


    "手指不断打滑。"


translate chinese event_m_story_0764ed5d:


    "女孩的脚已触及刀片。"


translate chinese event_m_story_7b1bb830:


    "地狱螺旋染上猩红，Katay的面容血色尽失。"


translate chinese event_m_story_d0722128:


    "她快要失去意识了。"


translate chinese event_m_story_f449faa6:


    "我死死揪住卡嘉大衣领口拼命后拽。"


translate chinese event_m_story_1e08bcc6:


    "罗姆卡冲来协助，阻止同学坠入槽中。"


translate chinese event_m_story_2697e7c4:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/10 k.ogg"
    Tikhonov "什么人？"


translate chinese event_m_story_28ef3c4f:


    "吉洪诺夫踉跄冲进车库，气喘如牛。我这才发现车库已停止移动。"


translate chinese event_m_story_6a787180:


    "外面枪声未歇。"


translate chinese event_m_story_df0252ca:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/32 Let.ogg"
    Ant "警督！快帮忙！"


translate chinese event_m_story_b8761ce1:


    "幽灵方才所在的位置突然引起我注意。"


translate chinese event_m_story_c445ccaa:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/33 Ge.ogg"
    Ant "发电机！"


translate chinese event_m_story_96f92253:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/06 m.ogg"
    "吉洪诺夫立即行动。"


translate chinese event_m_story_00f0e230:


    "在我们固定卡嘉时冲向发电机。"


translate chinese event_m_story_99b2966f:


    "警察瞬间关闭了引擎。"


translate chinese event_m_story_78deb5bf:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/07 m.ogg"
    "巨型机器发出最后一阵铸铁脏腑的轰鸣，归于沉寂。"


translate chinese event_m_story_a413cf34:


    "刀片空转数秒后停驻，鲜血顺刃滴落。"


translate chinese event_m_story_047398a1:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/15 Toh .ogg"
    Rom "托沙，好兄弟，别告诉他们是我碰了操纵杆。"


translate chinese event_m_story_7e822078:


    "我生硬地点了点头，他明显松了口气，像是信了我的保证。"


translate chinese event_m_story_d63d2e3a:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/16 Sp.ogg"
    Rom "谢了，真够意思。"


translate chinese event_m_story_9b1d4449:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/26 Pe.ogg"
    Rom "彼得罗夫，咱俩算不上朋友，但好歹是我救了你。"


translate chinese event_m_story_8513f8ae:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/27 A.ogg"
    Rom "所以你现在这是欠我的……"


translate chinese event_m_story_8e796f7f:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/28 Ne.ogg"
    Rom "别跟任何人提操纵杆的事。"


translate chinese event_m_story_7e822078_1:


    "我生硬地点了点头，他明显松了口气，像是信了我的保证。"


translate chinese event_m_story_cddff1c6:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/29 Kv.ogg"
    Rom "这下两清了。"


translate chinese event_m_story_3caa5848:


    "我们把卡嘉从绞肉机里拖出来时，她直接瘫在了吉洪诺夫臂弯里。"


translate chinese event_m_story_1fe75970:


    "昏迷或许是她此刻最好的结局。"


translate chinese event_m_story_27f9a84f:


    "敞开的门洞灌进尖啸的寒风。"


translate chinese event_m_story_9d1eeabc:


    "同学那只血肉模糊的脚看得人胃部痉挛——"


translate chinese event_m_story_a44a20c6:


    "大脚趾齐根消失，相邻的趾头仅靠一绺皮肉悬吊着晃荡。"


translate chinese event_m_story_5eefb965:


    "体育课上再也不会出现卡嘉冲刺最快的矫健身影了。"


translate chinese event_m_story_52324cc8:


    "这个念头让我眼眶发烫，但我咬牙忍住了。"


translate chinese event_m_story_e70881c7:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/17 Ne.ogg"
    Rom "不可能……靠……不可能的……"


translate chinese event_m_story_ce0e923b:


    "转头看见罗曼正从鞋堆里刨出一只运动鞋，手指发抖。"


translate chinese event_m_story_0133ea37:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/32 By.ogg"
    Rom "拜沙……兄弟……"


translate chinese event_m_story_720fbf61:


    "我按住罗姆卡颤抖的肩膀。"


translate chinese event_m_story_f548f298:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/34 Ti.ogg"
    Ant "是他的？你确定？"


translate chinese event_m_story_685ca273:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/18 Eg.ogg"
    Rom "是他的……这鞋子本来是我的……我总把旧鞋子给他穿……"


translate chinese event_m_story_29299eca:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/35 Mne.ogg"
    Ant "节哀。"


translate chinese event_m_story_0e46a17f:


    "我们不算朋友，说是死对头也不为过。"


translate chinese event_m_story_5ef76643:


    "但此刻看着罗姆卡崩溃无助的样子，胸腔竟泛起陌生的酸胀。"


translate chinese event_m_story_27257ac7:


    "失去朋友是什么滋味——光是想象就让人窒息。"


translate chinese event_m_story_6595a624:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/12 Uho.ogg"
    Tikhonov "撤！"


translate chinese event_m_story_d7cb8c72:


    "罗姆卡松开了那只运动鞋。"


translate chinese event_m_story_7b3ff4d8:


    "我们一个接一个冲进肆虐的暴风雪中。"


translate chinese event_m_story_409f4a87:


    "松树高耸，如森森白骨矗立，风啸如同葬歌在树干空洞中回荡。"


translate chinese event_m_story_54127452:


    "翻倒的拖拉机驾驶室已被积雪掩埋，车库深陷雪堆。"


translate chinese event_m_story_cf82f2e3:


    "一辆警车歪斜地停在附近。"


translate chinese event_m_story_d577f05c:


    "闪烁的警灯、鬼魅般的树影、苍白的荒原……这幅画面将永远烙在我脑海中。"


translate chinese event_m_story_d1abd1fd:


    "远处又传来几声枪响。"


translate chinese event_m_story_cedf20ac:


    "突然，我恍然大悟——"


translate chinese event_m_story_ecd0641e:


    "拖拉机司机！"


translate chinese event_m_story_fecbd5da:


    "就是他来回转移车库，他就是那个连环杀手！"


translate chinese event_m_story_ca82bac7:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/13 Dor.ogg"
    Tikhonov "托洛尼他们去追捕绑匪了。"


translate chinese event_m_story_6051a29a:


    "如利卡摇着尾巴扑到我腿边。"


translate chinese event_m_story_8d5caa87:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/14 Agero.ogg"
    Tikhonov "原来你在这儿，我们的小英雄。"


translate chinese event_m_story_f8af5641:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/36 Ger.ogg"
    Ant "英雄？"


translate chinese event_m_story_177df244:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/15 Eto.ogg"
    Tikhonov "是它带我们找到车库的，八成是闻到了你的气味。"


translate chinese event_m_story_98ccb25e:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/16 Po.ogg"
    Tikhonov "想不想来警队当嗅探员啊，机灵鬼？"


translate chinese event_m_story_8bb946af:


    "如利卡赞同地叫了一声。"


translate chinese event_m_story_956588dc:


    "我揉了揉狗狗的后背。"


translate chinese event_m_story_d0da99e0:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/37 Kak.ogg"
    Ant "你们怎么找到我的？"


translate chinese event_m_story_8fddf710:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/17 Slu.ogg"
    Tikhonov "警犬勉强嗅到点线索。"


translate chinese event_m_story_28ec03ea:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/18 Sch.ogg"
    Tikhonov "纯属走运。"


translate chinese event_m_story_863ba5fc:


    "远处传来此起彼伏的犬吠声。"


translate chinese event_m_story_1ce6d117:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/19 pog.ogg"
    Tikhonov "它们去追那个畜生了，最好能撕下他几块肉。"


translate chinese event_m_story_1d1f82c8:


    "森林冷得让人受不了。"


translate chinese event_m_story_5596f627:


    "吉洪诺夫用兄弟般的温柔目光看了看卡嘉，随后转向我们。"


translate chinese event_m_story_7d6f68a6:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/20 A.ogg"
    Tikhonov "手套箱下面有急救包。你……安东……你去拿些绷带过来。"


translate chinese event_m_story_7c9a41d2:


    "我立刻照做了。"


translate chinese event_m_story_ac9e914a:


    "吉洪诺夫托着卡嘉的脚。鲜红的血珠滴落在雪地上。"


translate chinese event_m_story_c63fe806:


    "我一边给卡嘉包扎脚伤，一边偷瞄警督的表情，用眼神询问自己操作是否正确。"


translate chinese event_m_story_dabaa60b:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/22 tep.ogg"
    Tikhonov "现在在这里打个结……很好。"


translate chinese event_m_story_9df7e50d:


    "白纱布上渗出一小块冰霜状的暗红痕迹——毕竟霜晶本不会泛红。"


translate chinese event_m_story_29d094ae:


    "我的目光几乎无法从那里移开。"


translate chinese event_m_story_592fe227:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/23 Mu.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你们留在车里陪她。"


translate chinese event_m_story_2360b642:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/24 Ya.ogg"
    Tikhonov "我去找多罗宁。"


translate chinese event_m_story_7c9d47f9:


    "吉洪诺夫把卡嘉抱进车里。"


translate chinese event_m_story_85a3b1a1:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/25 Sl.ogg"
    Tikhonov "务必让她的腿始终保持抬高。"


translate chinese event_m_story_0964bed2:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/26 A.ogg"
    Tikhonov "否则可能会失血过多而死……"


translate chinese event_m_story_2cf6c772:


    "警官说完就离开了。"


translate chinese event_m_story_39bcd3a1:


    "罗曼沉浸在自己的思绪里，坐在前排，太阳穴抵着车窗玻璃。"


translate chinese event_m_story_c6db0554:


    "他已经没心情和我说话了。"


translate chinese event_m_story_decc5576:


    "我坐在后排，挨着卡嘉。"


translate chinese event_m_story_9d622f45:


    "她看起来很虚弱，面色如石膏般苍白，却依然美得惊心动魄。"


translate chinese event_m_story_5b67de37:


    "她不再像条狡黠的毒蛇，而是垂死在我手中的天鹅。"


translate chinese event_m_story_dd3c9c31:


    "当身体回暖时，我才渐渐意识到自己活下来了。"


translate chinese event_m_story_cfbdcff5:


    "那段充满纯粹恐怖的人生篇章，终于结束了。"


translate chinese event_m_story_af26bc0a:


    "我把视线从窗外肆虐的暴风雪移开，惊讶地低下头。"


translate chinese event_m_story_9afb16e1:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/09 dih.ogg"
    "卡嘉的手指正紧紧攥着我的手。"


translate chinese event_m_story_396c0539:


    "她从半垂的眼睑下望着我。"


translate chinese event_m_story_08fafa8e:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/010 eto.ogg"
    Kate "你……是你救了我……"


translate chinese event_m_story_6c93cdcf:


    "我本想说明罗曼也参与了救援，吉洪诺夫带领的警察也在附近。"


translate chinese event_m_story_5eb55148:


    "但不知为何，我保持了沉默。"


translate chinese event_m_story_3b62d865:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/011 spa.ogg"
    Kate "谢谢你。"


translate chinese event_m_story_0b97dece:


    "我回以一个疲惫的微笑。"


translate chinese event_m_story_a9f102f9:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/38 Otd.ogg"
    Ant "休息吧。我们都需要休息。"


translate chinese event_m_story_1f1d83bd:


    "我转头望向车窗，继续感受卡嘉手指留在我手背的触感。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_8f4ce4ee:


    "下课铃响起。学生们成群涌出教室。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_f13a0cf2:


    "风雪覆盖着校园，积雪在靴底融化，把室内地板弄得泥泞不堪。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_54c2358c:


    "从杀手巢穴逃出来已经两周了。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_22a29f9d:


    "罗曼几乎不来学校，我始终没机会和他说话。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_842ca1ca:


    "最后一次见到卡嘉还是在那辆警车里。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_362bc2cb:


    "莉莉娅·帕夫洛夫娜请假照顾女儿，现在由代课老师上课。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_54e273bd:


    "要不是爸爸劝住妈妈把我关在家里的想法，我现在也不会在这里。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_7072f026:


    "那件事之后，父母时刻紧盯着我。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_b560681e:


    "同学们看我的眼神也变了，就像在打量来自遥远星球的外星人。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_2b0faab7:


    "我分不清那到底是哪种外星人——"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_6d8d7587:


    "是史蒂文·斯皮尔伯格电影里友善的那种，还是{b}异形{/b}？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_212b7c3f:


    "我站在窗边，凝视着银装素裹的校园。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_a94e04e8:


    "世界缩小到学校及其周边，被翻涌的黑暗所隔绝。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_f72f1862:


    "杀手成功逃脱了……"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_9c74f4c5:


    "他依然逍遥法外……"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_ea96bdd0:


    "恐怕正在打造新的车库，比之前更黑暗、更骇人。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_8ee64e0f:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/23 Pr.ogg" 
    Pol "嘿，我的英雄。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_3a5cf7a7:


    "波琳娜双手背在身后，对我微笑着。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_08452c95:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/24 kak.ogg" 
    Pol "我们好久没聊天了！"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_a6d0b0b0:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/39 Po.ogg"
    Ant "昨天才通过电话。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_8be1c2fa:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/25 Te.ogg" 
    Pol "那不算数。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_981277cb:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/26 Av.ogg" 
    Pol "真正重要的是现实世界的交流！"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_c20532e3:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/27 kak.ogg" 
    Pol "你最近怎么样？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_b70014a2:


    "我最近怎么样，说真的？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_00e7d791:


    "我可是亲眼目睹卡嘉的两个脚趾被巨型刀片切掉的人。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_ad5a6a80:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/40 Vse.ogg"
    Ant "我还好……大概吧。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_cafb2ce6:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/28 Ti.ogg" 
    Pol "你变了，看起来成熟多了。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_5d021d0b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/29 Do.ogg" 
    Pol "还是不敢相信，这个安东·彼得罗夫居然从绞肉机手里救了人。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_5ae6061d:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/41 Mi.ogg"
    Ant "是和罗姆卡一起……"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_71341171:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/30 Ro.ogg" 
    Pol "罗姆卡……"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_cb5ae6d4:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/31 St.ogg" 
    Pol "他竟然没误伤别人，运气真够好的……"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_c825317a:


    "波琳娜蹙起眉头。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_3c014ca5:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/32 A.ogg" 
    Pol "你不一样。在你身边让我觉得很安心。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_fbfc7cc0:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/33 De.ogg" 
    Pol "女孩子对这种事有第六感。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_f108d335:


    "我完全不知所措。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_9f22d5df:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/43 Nu.ogg"
    Ant "我不知道……"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_0561646a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/34 ne.ogg" 
    Pol "不用谦虚！不过你脸红的样子还挺可爱的！"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_a03dbc06:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/10 Vot.ogg"
    Pol "真希望世界上能多些像你这样的骑士。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_1f072daf:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/11 Eto.ogg" 
    Pol "这样很多问题就能迎刃而解了，你不觉得吗？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_bcfe65b2:


    "她刚才说我是骑士？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_a6de9f2a:


    "我含糊地嘟囔了几句，脸红得像甜菜根，在心里痛恨自己的腼腆。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_46c1bfc3:


    "波琳娜悄悄瞥向窗外，望着外面飘飞的白雪。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_37a32b82:


    "花坛后方是浓得化不开的黑暗。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_e06e297f:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/12 Du.ogg" 
    Pol "你觉得那个疯子还在村里吗？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_2f1f8d97:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/45 Na.ogg"
    Ant "希望不在了。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_ad2cbac8:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/46 Mi.ogg"
    Ant "警方搜遍了这附近每个角落。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_7e9581be:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/13 U.ogg" 
    Pol "安东，我想请你帮个忙。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_8cb6c5fe:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/14 De.ogg" 
    Pol "爷爷现在住院了。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_3df6cb72:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/47 Ch.ogg"
    Ant "严重吗？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_1c0513d3:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/39 V.ogg" 
    Pol "他年纪那么大了，得什么病都很严重……"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_64b33a0b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/40 Zn.ogg" 
    Pol "你看……就算关着门我也觉得害怕……"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_dfd0567d:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/41 A.ogg" 
    Pol "外面……暴风雪里……我放学路上忍不住哭了出来。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_319aa4ac:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/42 G.ogg" 
    Pol "很傻吧？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_68957e96:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/48 Vo.ogg"
    Ant "一点也不傻。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_42b4acfd:


    "感觉她从未对我如此坦诚过。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_78bb9c1a:


    "这种直率的态度很适合波琳娜，让她本就美丽的脸庞更添光彩。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_11c996a7:


    "还有她那双眼睛，好像有魔力似的……带着疑虑，却又充满信任。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_62e31fe0:


    "在这样的目光注视下，任何人都会想成为真正的骑士。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_1698ceb1:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/19 Ti.ogg" 
    Pol "放学后你能送我回家吗？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_fb799476:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/20 Dr.ogg" 
    Pol "其他男生也主动提出要送，但万一杀手出现他们能做什么？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_60782d60:


    "我受宠若惊，却仍不禁自问：“{b}我{/b}又能做什么？”"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_8e8d43e1:


    "像查克·诺里斯那样掏出一把乌兹冲锋枪？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_924aea35:


    "波琳娜看着我的眼神，仿佛确信我书包里就装着那样的枪，说不定还不止一把。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_b4685d32:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/21 Mi.ogg" 
    Pol "所以，你意下如何？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_80a2ac91:


    "我正要回答，却看见楼梯口有两个人。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_550ee75d:


    "莉莉娅·帕夫洛夫娜和拄着拐杖的卡嘉。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_f196be23:


    "缺席数周后，她消瘦了不少，看起来弱不禁风。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_136b3986:


    "我想起在警车里她投来的温柔目光。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_1e2f28b7:


    "正是那两个死里逃生的人之间的温情时刻，让那个可怕的日子透进了一丝光亮。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_973cebd9:


    "上课铃响了。我浑身一颤。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_3ddd0c9a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/22 Vs.ogg"
    Pol "放学后见。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_2c8c7034:


    "我们走进教室。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_5ee8214d:


    "莉莉娅·帕夫洛夫娜返校的消息传得比她的脚步还快。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_0957ca5f:


    "她进来时，同学们已经全体起立。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_ed9e335b:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/02 sa.ogg"
    Lilia_P "请坐。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_b132c251:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/03 ka.ogg"
    Lilia_P "自己能走过去吗，卡嘉？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_fbf66b84:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/08 smog.ogg"
    Kate "可以的，妈妈。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_7cfa946f:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/013 hod.ogg"
    "卡嘉一瘸一拐地走过课桌间，同学们的目光像要把她盯穿。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_b6ce582c:


    "他们大概在想象自己身处她的境地，被困在那个疯子的车库里。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_0cc519c8:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/014 hod.ogg"
    "或者在想少了两根脚趾走路是什么感觉？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_6a0b8e02:


    "卡嘉经过自己常坐的座位时没有停留，仿佛病假期间忘了座位在哪，最终停在我的课桌旁。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_f8419676:


    "她垂着眼站在那里。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_8f0584ec:


    "我愣住了。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_7208f390:


    "更让我不安的是，波琳娜正半侧着身子紧张地注视着我们。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_6e6b94e4:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/015 pod.ogg"
    Kate "能让一下吗？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_4543926f:


    "我不知该如何是好。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_d69934d9:


    "就像爸爸常说的'进退两难'。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_483c3113:


    "波琳娜攥紧了手中的铅笔，铅笔仿佛下一秒就要折断。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_58bf02e5:


    "那股压力也传到了我的脊梁上。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_c32e634f:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/015 mne.ogg"
    Kate "嗯？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_610d45cf:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/49 Ch2.ogg"
    Ant "什么？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_45fad262:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/011 ti.ogg"
    Kate "你反应迟钝吗？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_cdc1a2b3:


    "她终于看向我。我可一点都不想念她这种带刺的目光。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_306e60d6:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/016 k.ogg"
    Kate "让开，四眼仔。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_a82f4a02:


    "我气得一时间喘不上气来。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_e9be34a6:


    "四眼仔？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_8179914a:


    "经历了这么多事，还叫我四眼仔？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_cb11dc04:


    "我涨红着脸，顺从地让开了。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_697dcc81:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/017 na.ogg"
    Kate "地上。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_80164e43:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/49 Ch.ogg"
    Ant "什么？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_ce1aa1ec:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/018 na.ogg"
    Kate "地上有脏东西。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_ae021562:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/50 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "今天不是我值日。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_9187fde8:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/019 eto.ogg"
    Kate "那是你靴子带进来的泥。擦掉！"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_d1ff0359:


    "我咽了口唾沫，不敢看同学们，希望此刻没人注意我们。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_c0e179e7:


    "但愿没人在这羞辱性场面中获得乐趣。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_d700fa59:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/52 Hor.ogg"
    Ant "好吧。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_66e693d0:


    "我直视着卡嘉，用鞋底抹掉了课桌下的一小片污渍。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_246464d4:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/04 ti.ogg"
    Lilia_P "你怎么还站着，卡嘉？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_34472f65:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/020 Lil.ogg"
    Kate "莉莉娅·帕夫洛夫娜，彼得罗夫把这儿弄脏了！"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_d5f8911c:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/021 da.ogg"
    Kate "没错没错！"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_a772766d:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/022 vot.ogg"
    Kate "我在等他清理干净。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_325398e2:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/05 pe.ogg"
    Lilia_P "彼得罗夫，动作快点。我们要开始上课了。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_b9f37c04:


    "我感觉整个脑袋都在发烫。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_73a3cada:


    "脱口而出的话语化作了小火球。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_83113041:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/53 Ser.ogg"
    Ant "当真要这样？'擦干净'？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_ee6d168a:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/54 Eto.ogg"
    Ant "这就是你的感谢方式？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_2fa398fa:


    "卡嘉脸红了，但依然傲慢地与我对视。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_c22959f7:


    "我再也刹不住车，仿佛冲下了隐喻的山坡。情绪爆发了。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_79d6bb50:


    "或者说，是压抑了一个月的恐惧终于决堤？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_44472747:


    "我推开旁边的椅子，蹲下身，用衬衫袖子擦拭地板。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_99e32ae8:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/55 Chis.ogg"
    Ant "这样够好了吗？女王陛下终于可以坐下了吗？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_012d5afb:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/023 pf.ogg"
    "卡嘉无礼地哼了一声。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_95dd6adc:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/023 cto.ogg"
    Kate "不错，干得好。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_5f8ab9a4:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/56 Ks.ogg"
    Ant "对了……"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_cd3ee2e5:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/57 Sama.ogg"
    Ant "下次我绝不会救你！白痴！"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_acce1f81:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/06 pet.ogg"
    Lilia_P "彼得罗夫！"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_9fa69d80:


    "莉莉娅·帕夫洛夫娜瞪大眼睛，气得满脸通红。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_5472a0d0:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/07 Cht.ogg"
    Lilia_P "你竟敢这么说话！去校长办公室！现在！"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_3b9dbc13:


    "我叛逆地跳起来。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_7abbfaaa:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/43 Ta.ogg" 
    Pol "但他说的没错。她至少该道个谢。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_b0bdb47c:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/44 on.ogg" 
    Pol "他救了她的命。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_5ad68ce4:


    "教室里响起一片附和声。他们显然都站在我这边。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_6468c2c9:


    "还没等我细想，命运又给了我新的'惊喜'。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_d7f5bf99:


    voice "voice/kate/5day/023pad.ogg"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_e9a0a7dc:


    "卡嘉身子一晃，我下意识扶住她防止摔倒，让她坐到了我的椅子上。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_4be644d8:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/06 pr.ogg"
    Kate "对不起，安东。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_d3d3aaa1:


    "她的面具脱落了。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_25f4013a:


    "我又看到了那个在警车后座紧紧抓着我的手的卡嘉。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_9ee51ad9:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/024 Ya.ogg"
    Kate "我不是生你的气，我是在生我脚的气。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_5ca63b63:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/025 Pr.ogg"
    Kate "对不起……我是个白痴。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_0e741821:


    "我被这突如其来的坦白震撼，含糊地嘟囔了几句作为回应。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_918f6c42:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/026 m.ogg"
    Kate "你要坐下吗？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_e58d406d:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/58 No.ogg"
    Ant "可是莉莉娅·帕夫洛夫娜……"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_cab62222:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/08 Lad.ogg"
    Lilia_P "好了，彼得罗夫，你坐下吧。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_9c44c71a:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/09 Da.ogg"
    Lilia_P "我们开始上课。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_d40067e5:


    "我坐回座位。卡嘉的目光锁定着我，让人有些发痒。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_90b3cad9:


    "我回过头，撞上了波琳娜的视线。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_1e396f10:


    "她正竭力想弄明白我和卡嘉之间发生了什么。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_3fd02895:


    "但这连我自己也无法理解。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_862859e9:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/027 z.ogg"
    Kate "你知道吗，住院的时候我一直在想……"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_59cf963d:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/028 Ya.ogg"
    Kate "我以前对别人太不公平了。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_85d1b6ec:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/029 a.ogg"
    Kate "尤其是对你。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_a4b16879:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/59 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "我已经忘了……"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_610bd101:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/030 A.ogg"
    Kate "得了吧。骗子。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_3d91507e:


    "她的手肘不小心把我的黑色铅笔盒（上面有赛车图案）碰下了桌子。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_dca664bd:


    "我弯腰去捡。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_7c112525:


    "一瞬间，我的目光凝固在卡嘉缠着绷带的脚上。随后我直起身。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_89300093:


    "卡嘉推给我一张纸条。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_148a518f:


    "\"保证不再说谎。\""


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_423e20e0:


    "我对她笑了笑，拿起铅笔在纸上又加了一行。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_660aad47:


    "\"我尽力。\""


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_8e9a116b:


    "卡嘉从笔袋里拿出一支红笔。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_4ff5d37d:


    "她仔细检查了所有字母，然后狡黠地眯起眼，在我的字下面打了个“B+”。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_ef303ae1:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/031 da.ogg"
    Kate "没错没错！你的草书有点太乱了，所以不能得A。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_b5a30c93:


    "我哼了一声作为回应。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_cc23e3c0:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/032 o.ogg"
    Kate "但你可以提高成绩。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_8dd095e6:


    "我感觉到波琳娜的目光刺在我的后脑勺上。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_baa84bbd:


    "这感觉尴尬、焦虑，却又带着一丝愉悦，仿佛一场情感风暴。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_90213b43:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/61 Dop.ogg"
    Ant "假设我想得A呢。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_c5bafeed:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/033 t.ogg"
    Kate "那你放学后就送我回家。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_b7d93f90:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/034 to.ogg"
    Kate "不是，我是说……"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_05d70552:


    "她对我露出一个带着歉意的微笑，驱散了先前那个她的阴影。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_4ff794e5:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/034 Ya .ogg"
    Kate "你能送我回家吗？求求你啦。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_da950bf4:


    "这个……我得考虑一下。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_98d65761:


    "班里最漂亮的兩個女孩都让我送她们回家？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_181f0891:


    "我是不是出现幻觉了？该吃药了？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_3d64a051:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/62 Vd.ogg"
    "我张开嘴，但随即注意到一个明显比我们小的孩子坐在罗姆卡和拜沙的课桌旁。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_8ca85787:


    "遮住整张脸的连帽衫……"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_ed7e4aa5:


    "恐惧淹没了我灵魂的空洞。喉咙发紧，让我无法呼吸。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_cfa55fc2:


    "我以前见过那个轮廓。在连环杀手的车库里，发电机旁边！"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_4c5509f9:


    "我的下巴掉得更厉害了。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_8bc43730:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/63 Ka.ogg"
    Ant "卡嘉……"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_5cb9cb7e:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/35 da.ogg"
    Kate "嗯？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_0bd3f6c9:


    "我把目光从那奇怪的轮廓上移开，手伸进口袋，从药板里按出一粒药。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_45f33762:


    "然后立刻嚼碎咽下。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_46ab39ba:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/65 K.ogg"
    Ant "看，罗曼的桌子……"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_a2c8c894:


    "我再次看向那个孩子，但他已经不见了。只剩下两把空椅子和一张被小刀刻划得乱七八糟的课桌。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_2503f0bc:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/36 E.ogg"
    Kate "有什么问题吗？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_f58212c7:


    "是我有什么问题吗？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_3e9ca716:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/66 Nich.ogg"
    Ant "没什么，忘了吧。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_87ac732d:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/27 Pro.ogg"
    Tikhonov "抱歉打扰您上课……"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_a7c2a81e:


    "吉洪诺夫警督走进教室，摘下了帽子。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_c0ce8c47:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/10 Nu.ogg"
    Lilia_P "噢，不用道歉。我们随时欢迎您。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_cedda014:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/28 M.ogg"
    Tikhonov "我想和您的两位学生谈谈，彼得罗夫和皮亚季凡诺夫。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_6ce7709d:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/11 Pya.ogg"
    Lilia_P "据我所知，皮亚季凡诺夫现在生病在家。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_b5fbd12c:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/12 A.ogg"
    Lilia_P "彼得罗夫在这儿。正碍眼呢。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_9c6c2553:


    "吉洪诺夫目光找到我，清了清嗓子，然后从文件夹里取出一张奖状开始宣读。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_3c43fc1a:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/30 Za.ogg"
    Tikhonov "为其在拯救他人生命过程中表现的勇敢、杰出态度和勇气……"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_2da06d83:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/37 Nu.ogg"
    Kate "快，站起来。是给你的。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_0207ef18:


    "我仿佛被奖状的官方措辞催眠了，依言起身。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_512eb2f3:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/31 Ad.ogg"
    Tikhonov "……村政府和地区儿童事务专员特此感谢安东·彼得罗夫！"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_e20beb3d:


    "教室里爆发出热烈的掌声。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_63446c93:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/38 Hi.ogg"
    "卡嘉喜笑颜开。波琳娜眼睛闪闪发亮地看着我，微笑着。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_14b5c249:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/39 Nash.ogg"
    Childs "为我们彼得罗夫！"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_ba9599c4:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/40 Ura.ogg"
    Childs "乌拉！"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_7a5b89da:


    "莉莉娅·帕夫洛夫娜推了推眼镜，用手帕擦了擦眼角。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_01d35ef1:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/13 St.ogg"
    Lilia_P "我真惭愧，大家。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_673f7483:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/14 Sv.ogg"
    Lilia_P "我原以为那都是卡嘉的幻觉……但现在看来是真的……"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_6cd2e490:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/15 Pet.ogg"
    Lilia_P "彼得罗夫救了我的孩子，而我却想让他去校长办公室……"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_b28063c7:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/32 Ot.ogg"
    Tikhonov "他不用去校长办公室！进光荣榜还差不多。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_0f7868f4:


    "那一刻，我想象着自己的照片，但它不是挂在光荣榜上，而是贴在布告栏里，挨着所有其他失踪孩子的照片。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_504538b3:


    "这个念头玷污了我本应完美的胜利。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_5f096b94:


    "下课后我扶着卡嘉下楼梯。我拿着她的拐杖，搀着她的胳膊肘。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_6e734674:


    "我们一起走到学校院子里。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_fcc82b01:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/41 Zna.ogg"
    Kate "你知道最奇怪的是什么吗？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_fe99f1b4:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/42 Ya.ogg"
    Kate "我还能感觉到我的脚趾。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_a80fb6db:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/42 Eh.ogg"
    Kate "它们已经不在了，但我还能感觉到……"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_f5089fdf:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/67 Bil.ogg"
    Ant "要是我当时动作再快一点……"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_640decaf:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/43 B.ogg"
    Kate "哦，别说了。就算是超人也做不到更好了。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_b3537bdf:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/44 T.ogg"
    Kate "吉洪诺夫说我已经非常幸运了，他说得对……"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_41de0bee:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/45 s.ogg" 
    Pol "很高兴你康复了，卡嘉。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_42a5ef55:


    "波琳娜从拐角处走出来，目光直视卡嘉。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_27735082:


    "卡嘉骄傲地承受着同学灼人的注视。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_fb54b666:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/45 S.ogg"
    Kate "谢谢你，波琳娜。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_5560eaf7:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/46 E.ogg"
    Kate "也谢谢你的男朋友。他也做得很好。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_5840f8da:


    "感觉卡嘉又想提醒我罗姆卡和波琳娜是什么关系。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_2e34c55d:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/46 Es.ogg"
    Pol "如果你指的是皮亚季凡诺夫，他不是我男朋友。他是个好人，但是……"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_308adca2:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/47 Vi.ogg" 
    Pol "你们俩……这是要去哪儿？"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_fd5a34fb:


    "卡嘉没让我回答。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_16e9240a:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/47 Ya.ogg"
    Kate "我还是个瘸子。所以我说服我们的英雄送我回家。"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_37a65f7a:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/48 Da.ogg"
    Kate "没错没错！"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_53009b32:


    "这太尴尬了……"


translate chinese event_m_story2_afterdev_e3823326:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/68 polin.ogg"
    Ant "波琳娜，你看……"


translate chinese d5_polkatya_dev_205e6eb6:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/48 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "我不是白痴。我明白。"


translate chinese d5_polkatya_dev_faceff7b:


    "波琳娜眼中闪过一丝悲伤，但她笑了笑，仿佛接受了命运。"


translate chinese d5_polkatya_dev_dc82d5d8:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/49 Ti.ogg" 
    Pol "你是位真正的绅士。像我爷爷说的，快绝种了。"


translate chinese d5_polkatya_dev_4807d004:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/50 Ne.ogg" 
    Pol "不是每个女孩都这么幸运……"


translate chinese d5_polkatya_dev_0abfeff8:


    "暴风雪用积雪覆盖着校园。"


translate chinese d5_polkatya_dev_9256156a:


    "波琳娜转过身，焦虑地望着黑暗，完全迷失了方向。"


translate chinese d5_polkatya_dev_6173c80e:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/49 Za.ogg"
    Kate "别摆出一副受害者的样子，让我恶心。"


translate chinese d5_polkatya_dev_49e6aa3a:


    "这最后一句低语，只有我能听见。"


translate chinese d5_polkatya_dev_aba416d3:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/51 T.ogg"
    Kate "看来只要大家都同情她，她巴不得跟我交换处境呢。"


translate chinese d5_polkatya_dev_2d4333e6:


    "黑暗中有什么东西沙沙作响，如利卡跑进了学校后院。"


translate chinese d5_polkatya_dev_606dafe2:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/52 oi.ogg"
    Kate "噢，小狗！"


translate chinese d5_polkatya_dev_7d018b82:


    "如利卡注意到波琳娜，发出了微弱的低吼。"


translate chinese d5_polkatya_dev_6b5a6fa7:


    "波琳娜眨了眨眼。两行泪水滑落脸颊，在严寒中凝结成冰，闪烁着微光。"


translate chinese d5_polkatya_dev_ae039e0f:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/51 Ti.ogg" 
    Pol "所以你也不想送我回家，是吗？"


translate chinese d5_polkatya_dev_0dc46ef8:


    "如利卡叫了几声作为回应。"


translate chinese d5_polkatya_dev_c24368ed:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/53 nu.ogg"
    Kate "怎么样？我们走吗？"


translate chinese d5_polkatya_dev_a5513a74:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/54 Pu.ogg"
    Kate "这个扫兴的家伙可以自己回家，天还没那么黑呢。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_16fe57e4:


    "我注视了波琳娜片刻，然后转向卡嘉。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_7fa5d009:


    "我处境艰难。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_d5215e28:


    "虽不像逃离刑讯室时那样紧迫，但仍然让我不适。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_88cea688:


    "我不想让卡嘉难过。但痛苦地承认，她失去脚趾后并未改变。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_ff2dd467:


    "她仍然是那个熟练的操纵者。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_f3bbd593:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/69 Kat.ogg"
    Ant "卡嘉，你看，我已经答应波琳娜了……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_914bc47e:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/54 no.ogg"
    Kate "但是……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_222c53a5:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/70 mi.ogg"
    Ant "别担心，我知道该怎么做。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_533c08c3:


    "我抬起头。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_9f9d94d6:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/71 Liliya.ogg"
    Ant "莉莉娅·帕夫洛夫娜！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_9e2fdf12:


    "老师的脸出现在窗口。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_559231b0:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/72 ya.ogg"
    Ant "我扶卡嘉下来了。您能从这里接她一下吗？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_26ceccaa:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/16 Kon.ogg"
    Lilia_P "没问题！等着我，卡嘉，我马上就来。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_44cb4472:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/17 Sp.ogg"
    Lilia_P "谢谢你帮忙，安东。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_f4cb8d92:


    "卡嘉只是站在那里，脸色苍白，一言不发。我担心她不舒服。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_c6f73762:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/73 Ti.ogg"
    Ant "你没事吧？头晕吗？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_7e691b8e:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/55 k.ogg"
    Kate "嗯。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_b2f5541f:


    "她的声音里此刻带着愤怒。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_042c15d5:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/56 te.ogg"
    Kate "你在乎吗？你不是保证不说谎了吗？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_62790fbc:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/57 L.ogg"
    Kate "骗子。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_f0cc53a7:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/58 K.ogg"
    Kate "E减，彼得罗夫。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_8f58cb20:


    "波琳娜的脸冻得通红，我几乎能想象到她眼中射出的闪电。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_eb47e86b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/52 Pr.ogg" 
    Pol "别发神经了，卡嘉。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_4ff784bd:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/53 Mi.ogg" 
    Pol "安东和我可以先送你回家，然后再去我那儿。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_b93a17ca:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/59 kon.ogg"
    Kate "对，当然！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_79213504:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/60 Lu.ogg"
    Kate "你们怎么不下地狱呢？你们两个！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_07b02fa5:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/61 S.ogg"
    Kate "滚远点！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_91206902:


    "她被这突如其来的爆发惊住了，决定避免进一步冲突。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_c0da4da0:


    "好吧，我们走开。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_a97a5703:


    "我领着波琳娜穿过校园。卡嘉站在楼梯旁，用憎恨的目光灼烧着我们。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_7957799a:


    "我注意到波琳娜回头对她露出了胜利的冷笑。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_fa0793e3:


    "所有女孩都这样吗？她们都把男孩看得比朋友重？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_d4ce4020:


    "再说，卡嘉和波琳娜也算不上亲密……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_c34bf287:


    "我也回过头，但白色的阴霾已经笼罩了那个倚着拐杖的孤独身影。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_a603945a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/54 Da.ogg"
    Pol "那个戏精只是在博取同情。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_5e6f1899:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/74 Ei.ogg"
    Ant "不，她现在的状态很糟。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_10a37993:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/55 Vs.ogg" 
    Pol "你忘了她以前是怎么排挤你的吗？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_4c2e57da:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/56 Ta.ogg" 
    Pol "她那样的人永远不会变。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_8d57fc4a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/57 Ho.ogg" 
    Pol "尽管她的遭遇罪不至此。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_acbbf943:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/75 N.ogg"
    Ant "没人该遭受那种事。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_08d4f21b:


    "我拿过波琳娜的书包，我们开始走过一片结冰的路面。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_75ab219e:


    "波琳娜咯咯笑着，躲闪着脸庞攻击的雪花。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_21d95bfa:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/59 na.ogg" 
    Pol "你会滑冰吗？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_fe6bbddf:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/76 Ne.ogg"
    Ant "会一点。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_b799303f:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/60 sho.ogg" 
    Pol "那我们改天去溜冰场怎么样？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_3e172822:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/77 La.ogg"
    Ant "好吧……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_c52bdf1a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/62 da.ogg"
    Pol "我们像乌龟一样走过去吧。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_178842e7:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/61 hah.ogg" 
    "我们转过身，背对着风，开始倒着走。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_86e1d397:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/78 Pod.ogg"
    Ant "多看看脚下，别摔着了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_c5571182:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/63 ku.ogg" 
    Pol "我爱看哪儿看哪儿，谢谢。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_a957b887:


    "结果她是想看着我。天气这么冷，她的目光却那么温暖。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_22c0dbd0:


    "波琳娜脚下一滑，大笑着跌进雪堆里。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_f6992674:


    "我赶过去帮忙，扶她起来，拍掉她外套上的雪，她不停地笑啊笑。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_53ac929e:


    "就在那时，罗姆卡从拐角窜了出来。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_d03367be:


    "我心里一紧。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_b836722e:


    "他现在会怎么想？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_abcc14a6:


    "他在车库里给我松了绑，我们共同经历了那么多，而我现在却跟他喜欢的女生调情！我这算什么朋友！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_16496c67:


    "我僵住了，预料接下来会发生我人生中最难堪的一次冲突，还会传出流言蜚语。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_92098648:


    "波琳娜像只真乌龟一样把头缩进外套里。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_0b962542:


    "我一动不动地站着，眨着眼睛。我还没做好打架的准备，但看起来这架是非打不可了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_4d3298f8:


    "光看到我们两个在一起，就够他发疯的了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_a43e738a:


    "看波琳娜那紧张的样子，她也害怕，怕的东西跟我一样。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_1242559f:


    "罗姆卡所有的威胁都浮现在我的记忆里。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_58d08279:


    "想到罗姆卡从车库回来后的糟糕状态，这些威胁显得更有分量。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_262b4f23:


    "他脸色苍白，佝偻着，像梦游一样走来走去……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_270d2160:


    "我深吸一口气，但罗姆卡打断了我。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_08ddb9c4:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/30 B.ogg"
    Rom "刚放学？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_0c6d7506:


    "他的问题毫无威胁。他的声音毫无感情，几乎像机器人。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_7452d74b:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/79 Aga.ogg"
    Ant "报了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_878ae9e8:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/31 B.ogg"
    Rom "见过拜沙吗？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_ba2f83fb:


    "我惊讶地摇头。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_3b02b3bb:


    "我们都见过那只运动鞋。罗姆卡亲口确认那是他朋友的。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_10ef62ad:


    "拜沙不可能自愿把鞋送给连环杀手，现在光着脚在村里游荡。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_070cce4d:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/80 Rom.ogg"
    Ant "罗曼，拜沙在车库里待过。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_99491493:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/33 Bil.ogg"
    Rom "那又怎样？我们也在那儿。而我们安然无恙。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_9230fad2:


    "可他看起来根本不像好好的。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_34c002fe:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/34 Ya.ogg"
    Rom "不查清拜沙的下落我绝不罢休。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_3af65eee:


    "罗姆卡的下巴绷紧，尽管天寒地冻，他的脸颊却像雪一样白。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_4f56c0a6:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/35 B.ogg"
    Rom "拜沙经常离家出走。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_6a36c310:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/36 Bi.ogg"
    Rom "他过去总是往我窗户扔小石子，我就开窗让他进来……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_5eed3294:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/37 Na.ogg"
    Rom "我会在地板上给他铺个地方睡，他会整夜翻来覆去，弄得我睡不着。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_575e1846:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/38 Za.ogg"
    Rom "但至少我知道，如果我出了什么事，他一定会支持我。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_8cf4bd47:


    "罗姆卡出神地望着飘落的雪花。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_d79741ed:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/39 Vs.ogg"
    Rom "我还在等他扔石子呢。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_646cb257:


    "罗姆卡最后那句话说得太轻，我几乎听不见。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_f3f6299b:


    "那句告白化作一团蒸汽，从他苍白的嘴唇中呼出。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_f6b026f9:


    "消散在短暂冬日的严寒空气中。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_32398a2b:


    "罗姆卡从外套里掏出一叠海报，数出几张递给我。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_9cd46182:


    "那是伊戈尔·布达耶夫的寻人启事。上面有拜沙的照片和识别特征。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_a5ee074a:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/40 Ra.ogg"
    Rom "沿路贴上。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_60e7109d:


    "他没等我的回答，沉思着，像陷入流沙一般，从我们身边走过。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_94211521:


    "也许他甚至没注意到波琳娜，又或者他已经不在乎了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_26110a40:


    "他的面部轮廓更加锐利，仿佛长期与疾病抗争，玻璃般的眼睛凝视着虚空。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_fab3093b:


    "下一刻，他消失在暴风雪中，我们继续前行。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_186a4f64:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/66 on.ogg"
    Pol "他现在总是那样。我试着跟他说话，但他连假装在听都不肯。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_7694c59a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/67 zn.ogg" 
    Pol "他像一把断了弦的小提琴。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_b50b7a04:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/68 e.ogg" 
    Pol "他的旋律正在消逝。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_6613ea4b:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/81 on.ogg"
    Ant "他失去了一个朋友。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_c62a7de3:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/69 d.ogg" 
    Pol "即使这样，也不是变成行尸走肉的理由。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_9704f512:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/70 on.ogg" 
    Pol "他都不来上学了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_bebbcaf5:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/71 bo.ogg" 
    Pol "我怕他会做傻事……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_78967cef:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/82 ka.ogg"
    Ant "每个人处理创伤的方式不同。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_ac06c4ea:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/72 a.ogg" 
    Pol "那你是怎么处理的？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_f1bcb81e:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/83 A.ogg"
    Ant "我没有失去过那么亲近的人。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_87f0932a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/73 an.ogg"
    Pol "你差点丢了命，安东。我经常和女孩们聊起这个。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_40b3c881:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/84 O.ogg"
    Ant "聊什么？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_5df7e2dd:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/74 on.ogg" 
    Pol "她们觉得你的神经是钢铁做的，而我……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_8a8fec37:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/75 ta.ogg" 
    Pol "……我也这么觉得。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_8f0ef77b:


    "一种奇怪的感觉攫住了我。羞耻感让我浑身发烫，却又想放声大笑。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_ec9ce04d:


    "波琳娜小心翼翼地瞥了一眼肆虐的暴风雪，望向我们视野之外的某处。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_1888f2c2:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/76 tebe.ogg"
    Pol "你当时一点都不害怕吗？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_37a09f09:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/85 Sh.ogg"
    Ant "开什么玩笑？我以为我的头发都要吓白了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_f7440a1b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/77  ti.ogg" 
    Pol "你本来就有白头发呀。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_625e63b9:


    "波琳娜咯咯笑起来，但下一秒就变得严肃。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_22b5dae3:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/79 mi.ogg" 
    Pol "我们以前每天都见到那个拖拉机手……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_4f919412:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/80 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "我一直在想这件事。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_0699568b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/81 on.ogg" 
    Pol "他看起来那么正常。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_devend_4675f77f:



