    "通话戛然而止。我盯着电话机，心脏几乎要跳出胸腔。太荒谬了…简直疯了…"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_matuhin_3e4af103:


    "我怎么可能把电话打到森林里…"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_matuhin_2dd16482:


    "我要精神失常了…"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_matuhin_861da228:


    "这都是幻听，是我臆想出来的幻觉……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_ce9cdd8d:


    "窗外呼啸的风声让我想起了拜沙。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_fadf31fa:


    "我能清晰地想象出他独自在黑暗中徘徊的模样……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_2bb5762d:


    "说不定我送波琳娜回家时，他已经回来了？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_19658455:


    "得确认一下。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_193903a6:



    voice "voice/episod/Dulgar/00 al.ogg"
    Dul "喂，找谁？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_7410243c:


    "是拜沙的父亲。我迟疑着，努力回想他的名字。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_5d326b33:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/115 D.ogg"
    Ant "晚上好，叔叔……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_d3a57a2c:


    "我瞥见寻人启事上写着：\"如有线索请联系杜尔加\"。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_6a04c96d:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/116 D.ogg"
    Ant "……杜尔加叔叔。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_81574820:



    voice "voice/episod/Dulgar/01 t.ogg"
    Dul "你小子从哪儿打的电话？全村人都在找你知不知道？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_88c77272:



    voice "voice/episod/Dulgar/02 po.ogg"
    Dul "真不嫌害臊！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_71e70253:



    voice "voice/episod/Dulgar/03 e.ogg"
    Dul "就为你这兔崽子，老子跟条子耗了一整天。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_3148d0da:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/117 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "我不是……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_b6ba5d75:



    voice "voice/episod/Dulgar/04 ne.ogg"
    Dul "{u}真晦气{/u}！赶紧滚回家，看老子不收拾你。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_d209a371:



    voice "voice/episod/Dulgar/05 s.ogg"
    Dul "皮痒了是吧？忘了老子的皮带什么滋味？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_8a23d0d1:



    voice "voice/episod/Dulgar/06 b.ogg"
    Dul "看我怎么收拾你，听见没？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_c0d827f9:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/118 S.ogg"
    Ant "听见了……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_0959c96e:


    "我咬紧牙关，此刻仿佛成了拜沙——那个被全世界抛弃的孩子。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_49171e04:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/119 T.ogg"
    Ant "但我不是……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_a6cdc83e:



    voice "voice/episod/Dulgar/07 a.ogg"
    Dul "要是你不回来……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_d1a2d2a6:



    voice "voice/episod/Dulgar/08 h.ogg"
    Dul "混蛋……让老子往后怎么活？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_3a33fb15:



    voice "voice/episod/Dulgar/09 s.ogg"
    Dul "小子，我昨晚还梦见亲手埋了你……用这双手。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_91637480:



    voice "voice/episod/Dulgar/10 y.ogg"
    Dul "我已经失去过家人了。当年你妈被……送进医院。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_0986d575:



    voice "voice/episod/Dulgar/11 ya.ogg"
    Dul "老子没抛下你，回来把你拉扯大……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_8b74e5e4:



    voice "voice/episod/Dulgar/12 t.ogg"
    Dul "别丢下你老爹……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_893cfd92:



    voice "voice/episod/Dulgar/13 s.ogg"
    Dul "别这样，行不行……？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_38a029b6:


    "杜尔加叔叔醉醺醺的嘟囔变得含糊不清。我缓缓挂断电话。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_bae116a1:


    "可怜的拜沙……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_0198b6a6:


    "父亲酗酒成性，母亲显然在精神病院，这些事恐怕全村人皆知。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_a7917f37:


    "难怪他以前总离家出走。但这次不一样了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_4b1d2f77:


    "刚才怎么没问问他搜寻进展？拜沙的父亲去过警局，说不定掌握了新线索？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_ba2acd41:


    "我又拨通了那个五位数的号码。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_c697f6c9:


    "短促的忙音。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_aa80ac6d:


    "杜尔加叔叔大概没把电话听筒搁好。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_c53c533c:


    "我盯着松下电话机看了半晌，第三次尝试拨号。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_3a291ce3:



    voice "voice/Owl/24 Uh.ogg" 
    Owl "咕咕！有人来电话啦。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_d4791fce:



    voice "voice/Owl/25 Ya.ogg" 
    Owl "洗耳恭听，咕咕。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_d95113c7:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/120 K.ogg"
    Ant "你是谁？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_7cd8134b:


    "又是一阵沉默。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_9a9052ac:


    "正要挂断时，听筒深处传来令人毛骨悚然的声音。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_083c107a:



    voice "voice/Owl/26 Raz.ogg" 
    Owl "第一，莫慌张。血肉早已腐坏。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_4e68f141:



    voice "voice/Owl/27 Ti.ogg" 
    Owl "你是我的猎物，你是我的美餐。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_e216dd3f:



    voice "voice/Owl/28 Vi.ogg" 
    Owl "找到你，抓住你，把你的身躯带回来。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_9597e8af:



    voice "voice/Owl/29 Tr.ogg" 
    Owl "三、四、五！休想活着被找到。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_b23e46a8:


    "我吓得跳起来，猛地把听筒砸回话机，切断了那邪恶鸟类的笑声。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_byash_899d0922:


    "这不是真的。我的脑子已经错乱了……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_c40fa729:


    "卡嘉在校门口垂头丧气的模样始终在我脑海里挥之不去。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_b45e4c78:


    "犹豫片刻后，我拨通了她的号码。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_49ee3d0b:


    "她接得太快，仿佛一直在等我的电话。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_6e6f6982:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/07 nu.ogg"
    Kate "有事？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_dad60a7d:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/121 P.ogg"
    Ant "嗨。你感觉怎么样？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_4e0e856e:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/08 te.ogg"
    Kate "你管得着吗？真当自己是特蕾莎修女了？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_4165763c:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/122 M.ogg"
    Ant "我和波琳娜都很担心你……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_0de41701:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/09 ah.ogg"
    Kate "啊，你和波琳娜！可不是嘛！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_99f2e017:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/10 ot.ogg"
    Kate "你现在是在她家打电话？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_82616d43:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/11 A.ogg"
    Kate "她是不是正站在旁边捂着嘴偷笑？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_5b8a2242:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/123 O.ogg"
    Ant "你说话非得这么刻薄吗？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_ff79f8ed:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/12 ya.ogg"
    Kate "这还没开始呢，小家伙。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_13fb4049:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/13 no.ogg"
    Kate "不过啊，你往后的日子可精彩了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_85015c33:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/14 ya.ogg"
    Kate "我会把你这点破事全都告诉妈妈……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_c1271265:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/15 d.ogg"
    Kate "没错没错！够你难受一辈子。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_ed3f1873:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/16 ch.ogg"
    Kate "再见不送！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_65b39b78:


    "电话里只剩下短促的忙音。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_67009136:


    "这通电话告诉我，卡嘉丝毫未变。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_b5f9794c:


    "她还是那个让人头疼的麻烦精。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_2f18160f:


    "忙音。不知道她在跟谁通话……又会编排我什么荒唐事？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_36a3f552:


    "三声忙音后，听筒里传来卡嘉带着哭腔的沙哑声音。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_32963254:


    "我攥紧了塑料听筒。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_3b4a469c:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/17 Ant.ogg"
    Kate "是你吗，安托沙？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_816e870b:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/18 sk.ogg"
    Kate "快来救我。快点！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_4cb97242:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/124 Pro.ogg"
    Ant "怎么了？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_40c680c5:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/19 ya.ogg"
    Kate "我不知道…我不知道这是哪里…"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_660e3724:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/125 Ka.ogg"
    Ant "什么叫不知道？我打的是你家电话，你当然在家。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_f5672ce4:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/20 et.ogg"
    Kate "这里不是我家…四周是金属墙壁…还有些盖着黑布的东西。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_af790144:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/21 ya.ogg"
    Kate "我扯掉一面镜子上的布，却照不出人影。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_3f200aad:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/22 v.ogg"
    Kate "镜子里有东西在窥视…"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_48d83064:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/23 m.ogg"
    Kate "我好害怕，安托沙！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_efddc1bd:


    "我震惊得张大了嘴。卡嘉疯了吗？是创伤后遗症发作？还是她又想出了新的恶作剧？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_9a2b866f:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/24 oni.ogg"
    Kate "他们绑架了我。折磨我，安东！好疼啊！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_bc27f513:


    "听筒突然发出刺耳噪音，仿佛另一端有生锈的机械开始运转。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_18b15e70:


    "卡嘉的声音戛然而止。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_fef5b500:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/126 A.ogg"
    Ant "喂？听不清了！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_9431c27e:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/25 gd.ogg"
    Kate "我的腿去哪儿了？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_d85b3a28:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/26 ne.ogg"
    Kate "不！我不想消失！求…"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_45b013c3:


    "我听着刺耳杂音与呼啸风声良久，直到忙音再度响起。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_f0c30f12:


    "饱受折磨的卡嘉被自己的心智开了个残忍的玩笑。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_katya_a727f985:


    "看来，我也未能幸免。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_polina_46bc5052:


    "忙音。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_polina_059f3771:


    "不是忙音还能是什么呢？打自己家的电话怎么可能打得通。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_polina_adfdc3c8:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/01 K.ogg" 
    Alis "谁在深夜呼唤我？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_polina_aff742fc:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/02 Che.ogg" 
    Alis "是我那可爱闪亮的骑士吗？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_polina_dda75c92:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/08 eto.ogg"
    Ant "是我……我在打给自己……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_polina_ae0acb89:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/03 Chto.ogg"
    Alis "多可悲呀！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_polina_4e5a760c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/04 Tebe.ogg" 
    Alis "你肯定是寂寞了，才会自己给自己打电话。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_polina_47ddf35f:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/05 Ko.ogg" 
    Alis "循环啊循环，双脚陷进泥潭！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_polina_9d838c17:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/06 Ha.ogg" 
    Alis "啊哈哈哈！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_polina_629c8984:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/07 El.ogg"
    Alis "再来听听这个。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_polina_dd19bed0:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/08 To.ogg"
    Alis "一首可爱的小诗。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_polina_694f75a7:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/09 Ra.ogg"
    Alis "一、二，魔法降临你身！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_polina_019f8a52:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/10 Go.ogg" 
    Alis "欢迎做客，让心神得以安歇。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_polina_1c945f43:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/11 Tr.ogg"
    Alis "三、四、五，忘却今生所有。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_polina_9b19910e:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/12 Sta.ogg" 
    Alis "你将成我的巢穴，死亡完成其余一切。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_polina_6e7699a9:


    "刺耳的笑声如同冰锥，狠狠凿击着我的颅骨。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_polina_4b0caba3:


    "我猛砸电话叉簧，倚着墙大口喘息。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_polina_a9bd8ecc:


    "我到底怎么了？为何总会听见这些绝无可能存在的声响？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_5248d4d5:


    "电话本上森娅号码的末尾数字被咖啡渍晕染了。我随便选了个数字拨过去。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_9bd7d99d:



    voice "voice/episod/02 Na.ogg"
    Noname "请讲。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_66e71195:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/127 z.ogg"
    Ant "您好。我想打听克谢尼娅的事……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_c044ea5a:



    voice "voice/episod/03 Ne.ogg"
    Noname "这里没有克谢尼娅。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_bee003a7:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/128 P.ogg"
    Ant "抱歉，我可能打错了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_2481c4c6:



    voice "voice/episod/04 S.ogg"
    Noname "确实打错了。房东家根本就没孩子。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_0efc0620:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/129 t.ogg"
    Ant "是塔拉莱耶夫家吗？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_1c085188:



    voice "voice/episod/05 Nu.ogg" 
    Noname "对。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_0685c50a:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/130 A.ogg"
    Ant "他们现在在家吗？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_fb49c48c:



    voice "voice/episod/06 n.ogg" 
    Noname "不在。他们把房子租给我就搬走了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_e4c1249e:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/131 E.ogg"
    Ant "打扰您了，再见。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_4f9da0d1:



    voice "voice/episod/07 b.ogg" 
    Noname "Yeah, bye."


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_97c48f84:


    "我挂断电话，思索着那个女儿失踪后绝望的一家人究竟会搬去哪里。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_e274ebbe:


    "既然那人租着他们家的房子，应该知道怎么联系塔拉莱耶夫一家。毕竟总要付房租的。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_01ea1729:


    "我又拨了相同的号码。忙音。那位租客正在和别人通话。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_bc171fbb:



    voice "voice/episod/12 Al.ogg"
    Ksenia "喂！妈妈，是你吗？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_6c798ae3:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/132 Se.ogg"
    Ant "森娅？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_4f59664f:



    voice "voice/episod/13 D.ogg" 
    Ksenia "快带我离开这里，先生！您是警察吗？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_d2e78f77:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/133 Ne.ogg"
    Ant "不是的……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_37c8bf80:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/134 P.ogg"
    Ant "等等，你在哪里？全村人都在找你，森娅。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_ca095975:



    voice "voice/episod/14 E.ogg" 
    Ksenia "他们在找……在找我……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_40a92ceb:



    voice "voice/episod/15 t.ogg" 
    Ksenia "那些黑影……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_bf09e385:



    voice "voice/episod/16 ch.ogg" 
    Ksenia "黑色的野兽……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_a5210b0b:



    voice "voice/episod/17 v.ogg" 
    Ksenia "您不会让它们吃掉我的，对吗？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_4cbad751:



    voice "voice/episod/18 Z.ogg"
    Ksenia "这里太可怕了。到处都黏糊糊的，破旧不堪。我分不清天花板和地板。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_8a3d5ff5:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/135 A.ogg"
    Ant "喂……信号断了……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_2a7c701e:



    voice "voice/episod/19 ne.ogg" 
    Ksenia "别让那些冰冷的野兽吃掉我！！！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_4c9f5425:



    voice "voice/episod/20 on.ogg" 
    Ksenia "它们想和我玩耍……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_5bab290b:



    voice "voice/episod/21 on.ogg" 
    Ksenia "它们喂我吃东西……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_f302b29c:



    voice "voice/episod/22 za.ogg" 
    Ksenia "逼我吃恶心的东西！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_fa2acfe3:



    voice "voice/episod/23 gde.ogg" 
    Ksenia "出口在哪里？？？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_027b7971:


    "通话突然中断了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_864f33ed:


    "太荒谬了……如果森娅真的回家了，那个租房客早就该报警了……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_aa3327e2:


    "这一切都是我的臆想。根本没有什么求救的女孩……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_ksenia_12681e5c:


    "也没有什么穿越古老森林的电话线传来的呼喊……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_f3a468b8:


    "我漫不经心地翻着电话旁那本电话簿。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_9c058b2b:


    "这是1993年印制的。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_3351eba1:


    "不知这上面还有多少用户活着，又有多少人再也接不到任何来电？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_b752bd70:


    "他们是死了……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_4cca76fd:


    "……还是失踪了……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_1492649d:


    "……就像谢苗一样。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_300ce4f8:


    "我凝视着同学巴布林这个姓氏。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_b3d12538:


    "一只手不由自主地伸向按键，另一只手早已将听筒贴在耳边。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_445433e4:


    "谢苗根本不可能接电话，对吧？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_64003262:



    voice "voice/episod/01 n.ogg"
    Gran "你好，哪位？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_f92bfe7c:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/136 A.ogg"
    Ant "我是安东……彼得罗夫，谢苗的同学。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_33961477:



    voice "voice/episod/02 pe.ogg"
    Gran "彼得罗夫？哦……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_b138ffa3:



    voice "voice/episod/03 ti.ogg"
    Gran "你见过我的谢苗吗，彼得罗夫？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_bd6139d2:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/137 N.ogg"
    Ant "没有。但有警察来我们学校……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_0ce974e4:



    voice "voice/episod/04 v.ogg"
    Gran "没用的……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_584bc0e2:



    voice "voice/episod/05 y.ogg"
    Gran "我还在家里等他……眼泪都快流干了……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_780b210a:



    voice "voice/episod/06 b.ogg"
    Gran "老天爷啊，为什么要这样对我？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_86aa1b61:


    "老妇人的哭诉撕扯着我的心。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_75de9e51:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/138 Ne.ogg"
    Ant "请您冷静，这不是您的错。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_3d096dce:



    voice "voice/episod/07 V.ogg"
    Gran "我进棺材前怕是见不到他喽……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_510cd882:



    voice "voice/episod/08 ne.ogg"
    Gran "我没能保护好他……都是我的错，都是我的错啊！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_264d602f:


    "她几乎是在尖叫。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_2b515efe:


    "我下意识按下电话叉簧，用如同死人脉搏般平稳的忙音切断了老妇人的哀泣。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_6b2a84be:


    "我这是怎么了？我本该安抚谢苗奶奶的，我本该说出得体的话。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_65d24e1d:


    "短促的忙音像是被压抑的绝望呜咽。线路忙。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_d86ba3bf:


    "我第三次拨通了电话簿上的号码。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_46d8bb26:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/01Kt.ogg"
    Bear "谁敢打扰我的冬眠？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_7ec5f9c6:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/02 ne.ogg"
    Bear "不知羞耻吗？现在可是深冬……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_dc174bc3:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/03 na.ogg"
    Bear "我正该睡觉，你却把我从床上拽起来。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_10d92b6f:


    "我吓得僵住了，无法相信自己的耳朵。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_b0992e9a:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/04 zvo.ogg"
    Bear "既然打电话……为何又不说话……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_2bee2bfa:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/139 K.ogg"
    Ant "我在和谁通话？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_1fbf06ee:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/05 Raz.ogg"
    Bear "一、二、三、四、五。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_7b3a23b3:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/06 mir.ogg"
    Bear "我要把这个世界生吞活剥。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_3cb8db7b:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/07 sk.ogg"
    Bear "穿过洞穴回到巢居处，"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_2235b76f:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/08 bu.ogg"
    Bear "在地狱里等候你光顾！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_e200c7c4:


    "我扔下听筒。眼前的电话机开始重影，地板在脚下晃动。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_2cff97e7:


    "我到底怎么了？为什么能听见这些根本不存在的声音？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_semen_85f2ed9e:


    "我一定是疯了……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_36602668:


    "对奥利娅的担忧让我突然冒出个出乎意料的务实念头。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_2c13710a:


    "抓住连环杀手是有赏金的。钱能解决我们家的所有问题……妈妈和爸爸或许就能重展笑颜。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_65860a7c:


    "我集中精神，试图从零碎记忆里拼凑出吉洪诺夫留给我的号码。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_b14f1834:


    "应该是这个。五，八，六……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_80979d6a:


    "听筒里传来犬吠般的杂音。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_1696dbac:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/33 Le.ogg"
    Tikhonov "我是吉洪诺夫警督。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_b29f31f3:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/34 Ti.ogg"
    Tikhonov "安静点，你这家伙。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_9d36d748:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/140 D.ogg"
    Ant "晚上好，警官。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_90462d1a:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/35 A.ogg"
    Tikhonov "啊，是你！彼得罗夫对吧？很高兴接到你的电话，孩子。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_9211c229:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/36 Da.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你能不能消停会儿？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_992822b0:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/37 Ch.ogg"
    Tikhonov "出什么事了吗？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_b6dbae8c:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/141 ne.ogg"
    Ant "没什么……我只是在想……协助抓捕连环杀手的人应该能拿到丰厚赏金吧？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_9ee3081a:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/38 Nu.ogg"
    Tikhonov "这我就不清楚了，孩子……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_4b7af91b:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/39 T.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你知道我们村的预算多紧张吗？连给派出所添置新车、给窗户安新栏杆的钱都凑不齐……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_303e9e92:


    "刺耳的狂吠声冲击着我的耳膜。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_1b5aa492:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/40 Da.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你怎么回事？安静！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_062d413c:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/41 Alo.ogg"
    Tikhonov "喂。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_9cea0e54:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/42 A.ogg"
    Tikhonov "要我说啊……人生不能只看重金钱。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_baae762b:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/43 Ya.ogg"
    Tikhonov "我能让你上电视。没错，我是认真的。地区电视台。想想看！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_73dd0460:


    "我肩膀垮了下来。上电视固然好，但这能拯救我的家庭吗？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_2d15eadc:


    "仿佛看穿我的心思般，吉洪诺夫用更热烈的语气继续说。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_750222f1:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/44 A.ogg"
    Tikhonov "或者我给你买张彩票怎么样，彼得罗夫？{u}体育彩票{/u}！保证能中一百万……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_b562bea0:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/142 p.ogg"
    Ant "明白了……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_9c9be800:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/143 Ne.ogg"
    Ant "我不需要彩票……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_f43c4fa0:


    "我连失望的情绪都懒得掩饰。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_677b4932:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/45 S.ogg"
    Tikhonov "坐下！你这野狗安分点！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_86924fdb:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/46 Nu.ogg"
    Tikhonov "振作点，彼得罗夫！别垂头丧气的！你很好，明白吗？我得挂了，还有工作要处理。有事随时打我电话，好吗？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_7e8ad837:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/144 D.ogg"
    Ant "再见。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_728eb85b:


    "我挂断电话，但犬吠声仍在脑中回响了好几秒。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_af2cd08b:


    "我得再试试。比起一无所获，上电视露脸或是彩票总归强些。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_f0bcd46f:


    "短促的忙音。吉洪诺夫正在和谁通话？村里又出事了吗？我惶恐地瞥向窗外，但外面的黑暗与狂风没有给我任何答案。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_c4c26fe9:


    "我得再试试。说不定警官已经通完电话了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_a8310c71:


    Dots "Woof! Woof! Grrrr!"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_d777c1fa:


    "犬吠声直接冲进耳膜。那畜生恐怕体型惊人且面目狰狞。它该不会是用牙咬着听筒吧？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_77b1aba7:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/145 A.ogg"
    Ant "喂！警官，您在吗？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_21d58add:


    Dots "Grrrrrrr!"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_a538fee7:


    "正要挂断时……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_628e24c1:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/48 Chu.ogg"
    Tikhonov "我闻到了！我嗅到了！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_58ef1325:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/49 Sv.ogg"
    Tikhonov "新鲜血液！年轻甜美的血液！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_89dee088:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/50 Ti.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你散发着猎物的气息！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_72c1dd50:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/51 Gd.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你在哪里，小子？别挂电话，我们好追踪你的位置！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_3d2ce402:


    "我狠狠捶向松下电话的塑料外壳。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_d50ba1c1:


    "等等，我刚才真的听见吉洪诺夫在狂吠低吼，重复那些可怕的呓语吗？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_tikhonov_99a3bad8:


    "不，多半是线路杂音在作祟。或者更糟——出问题的不是电话线，而是我的大脑……"


