    voice "voice/episod/po.ogg"
    FDep "消防队。请说明紧急情况。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_fire_dep_f25ac71f:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/146 Oi.ogg"
    Ant "抱歉，我想找燃气安全部门。打错了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_fire_dep_aa610650:


    "我们的消防队都是由志愿者组成的。要是总打扰他们，我可能会惹上麻烦。"


