    voice "voice/episod/milisia.ogg"
    Militia "这里是警察局。请说明紧急情况。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_militia_1ce245a8:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/147 Ni.ogg"
    Ant "没事，抱歉。拨错号码了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_phone_militia_3ad87d47:


    "这类恶作剧电话是法律明令禁止的，可能会面临高额罚款。"


