translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_b22299ea:


    "我鼓起勇气拨通了家里的号码。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_f3ff86f4:


    "忙音。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_fac71b88:


    "接着是一阵窸窣声，随后陷入彻底的寂静。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_692d0a4f:


    "如果是爸爸接电话，他会说'请讲'。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_f058719a:


    "但妈妈总是拿起电话后保持沉默，等着对方先开口。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_bd5799f8:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/150 M.ogg"
    Ant "妈妈，是我。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_47b0f501:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/08 Vas.ogg"
    Mam "在学校留堂了？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_1f42348d:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/151 Net.ogg"
    Ant "不是……听着妈妈……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_70dedb53:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/152 T.ogg"
    Ant "别担心，我得了这张奖状……因为见义勇为……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_802b6ff8:


    "我亮出了底牌。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_5dc72b97:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/09 Me.ogg" 
    Mam "我宁愿你拿到好成绩。不需要什么奖状。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_39fe5c24:


    "又变回那个冰雪女王了！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_3c70cd9a:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/153 Pr.ogg"
    Ant "但同学们都为我高兴。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_2c1e5a87:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/154  E.ogg"
    Ant "所以我们决定一起吃蛋糕喝汽水庆祝……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_6e36358e:


    "说谎让我作呕。但我还能怎么说？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_c94e5a90:


    "难道说我不是自愿走进那个车库的？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_f6752b4a:


    "还是说，那天我出门只是为了甩掉如利卡？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_500b0313:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/10 Ka.ogg" 
    Mam "蛋糕？安东，家里还给你留着晚饭呢！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_9d1524ca:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/11 T.ogg" 
    Mam "又想惹麻烦是不是？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_527fc259:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/155 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "我想着……结伴总比独自穿过村子安全。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_e106539e:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/156 k.ogg"
    Ant "而且外面暴风雪越来越大了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_5226ae3e:


    "妈妈迟疑了片刻。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_4f9493a3:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/12 U.ogg" 
    Mam "爸爸的车又发动不了。不然他能去接你……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_f7f69684:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/13 Ho.ogg"
    Mam "好吧，你可以留下。但明天放学必须立刻回家。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_47a417cb:


    "太好了！成功了！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_9b9e44c1:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/14 T.ogg"
    Mam "你现在在谁家？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_83533a65:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/15 Ch.ogg" 
    Mam "万一有事我好联系。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_8dfe377e:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/U.ogg"
    Ant "我在……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_d7c60c86:


    "我从口袋里掏出寻人启事，目光与尼亚沙那张颗粒粗糙的照片相遇。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_b9b82b63:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/157 U.ogg"
    Ant "我在比亚……伊戈尔·布达耶夫家。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_41d7f9da:


    "接着我本能地报出波琳娜的号码。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_020c0d95:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/158 T.ogg"
    Ant "3-24-92"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_225f3d34:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/16 Pe.ogg" 
    Mam "代我向伊戈尔问好。别忘了吃药。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_c887457f:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/159 S.ogg"
    Ant "谢谢！我会记得的！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_bd6dd6be:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/160 Ma.ogg"
    Ant "妈妈，奥利娅怎么样了？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_253adcc6:


    "妈妈挂断了电话。她大概没听见我最后的问题。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_7e69ecd3:


    "我放下电话，望向波琳娜刚才走进的门口。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_13a56fd7:


    "女孩正把东西塞进衣柜。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_b008ddab:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/83 Mo.ogg"
    Pol "可以进来了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_b5dca808:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/84 D.ogg" 
    Pol "乔安娜躲进衣柜了，你现在安全啦。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_4047a253:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/85 Eto.ogg" 
    Pol "乔安娜是我的猫。她怕生，可能会抓伤你。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_8eb215f2:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/86 Ch.ogg"
    Pol "你妈妈怎么说？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_ed0914b5:


    "我叹了口气作为回答。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_68fe26af:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/162 Che.ogg"
    Ant "说实话，比想象中好。她只说等我回家再算账。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_d330dda7:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/87 ne.ogg"
    Pol "你太小看你妈妈了，彼得罗夫！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_82927640:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/88 Z.ogg" 
    Pol "所以她同意你留宿了？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_5f803bf4:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/89 Ur.ogg"
    Pol "太好啦！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_ce88997c:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/90  Sl.ogg"
    Pol "听到了吗？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_9d1963c6:


    "波琳娜竖起手指。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_8dfaf3f6:


    "窗外暴风雪正肆虐。明天所有街道都会变成溜冰场。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_ef64f202:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/91 ho.ogg" 
    Pol "有你在真好。我真是个胆小鬼。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_aae8e91e:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/92 Da.ogg" 
    Pol "我们趁停电前看会儿电视……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_279c876f:


    "房间陷入黑暗。外面狂风怒号。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_560ebd0d:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/94 pro.ogg" 
    Pol "……果然停了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_a7d0139a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/95 S.ogg" 
    Pol "真被我说中了。老是这样。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_6c1166a1:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/96 Po.ogg"
    Pol "等等，我应该有……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_c899c4ce:


    "窸窣声后火柴划亮，映出波琳娜的脸庞，随后火苗被引到蜡烛上。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_e503a4a2:


    "尽管狂风大作，卧室却透着奇异的温馨。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_8093bde6:


    "就像外面风暴肆虐时，待在室内享受安全感带来的惬意。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_fe15db26:


    "你甚至可以幻想幽灵来找刺激。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_9170fe16:


    "但我不想思考这些。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_d6ec42fe:


    "波琳娜又点燃几根蜡烛。看来她家经常停电。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_4bc6a68f:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/97 Te.ogg" 
    Pol "看不成电视了。给我弹吉他吧？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_c5e98ee4:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/163 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "我？我五音不全。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_bd5fabae:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/98 Go.ogg" 
    Pol "肯定夸张了。你这么有艺术细胞的人怎么可能音准差。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_afterphone_15c709c3:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/99 Eto.ogg" 
    Pol "而且这个很简单。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_57ac6a5b:


    "她取来吉他站到我身后。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_3c362fa0:


    "我拨动尼龙弦，乐器发出不和谐的抗议声。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_369a0e9d:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/164 G.ogg"
    Ant "早说过不行。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_cae61caa:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/100 Te.ogg" 
    Pol "只是需要老师指导。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_bfdb2571:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/101 be.ogg"
    Pol "我收费很贵，但物超所值。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_363b77c1:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/102 Po.ogg" 
    Pol "要这样转。别压太死。手指放这里。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_aa465def:


    "波琳娜像雕塑家捏陶土般'塑造'着我的手势，温热呼吸拂过耳际。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_66cb66d9:


    "我闻到她洗发水的香气。暖意流遍全身，让我不再在意窗外的暴风雪。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_c091aa90:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/103 p.ogg" 
    Pol "然后这里……还有这里……Ем、Ам、D……G……C……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_ea7dbddd:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/165 K.ogg"
    Ant "是帕格尼尼的曲子？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_4f619b8d:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/104 E.ogg" 
    Pol "想得美。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_8e034f10:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/105 Ya.ogg" 
    Pol "这是我自创的旋律。喜欢吗？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_70fe531a:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/166 P.ogg"
    Ant "真的？听起来像电台热门金曲。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_08f4b053:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/167 Me.ogg"
    Ant "这旋律很抓耳……同时又很耳熟。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_c003e98c:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/106 S.ogg"
    Pol "谢谢。我有点不好意思了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_fc9214aa:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/107 Ya.ogg" 
    Pol "虽然不太喜欢流行歌，但不得不承认确实有点像。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_intro_talk_f534323e:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/108 Da.ogg"
    Pol "来，该你试试了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_r_fail_f1741f6f:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/115 Po.ogg" 
    Pol "想再试试吗？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_r2_polina_before_943a0138:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/168 K.ogg"
    Ant "好！我可以的！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_r2_polina_before_2753e65c:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/121 A.ogg"
    Pol "看吧？我就说你有弹吉他的天赋！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_r3_polina_before_2b8c6b69:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/169 T.ogg"
    Ant "是你教得好！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_r3_polina_before_83d187dd:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/122 Og.ogg" 
    Pol "真的吗？那要不要也试试小提琴？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_abort_bb2a0514:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/126 S.ogg" 
    Pol "这就要放弃啦？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_abort_def070c8:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/170 P.ogg"
    Ant "抱歉，对我来说画音乐比演奏音乐容易多了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_abort_0a54f0d3:


    "我正要把吉他还给波琳娜，她却更用力地环住我。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_abort_ea596a6a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/127 Eh.ogg" 
    Pol "你们搞视觉艺术的总是…这么难搞。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_abort_d74c8d72:


    "我顿时从头到脚红成了甜菜根。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_abort_59ddcfc2:


    "她甚至不用看指板，纤长手指在琴弦上游走，嘴角噙着笑。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_abort_02dfc28d:


    "吉他流淌出婉转旋律。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_abort_dffb4cc4:


    "波琳娜享受着和弦臣服于指尖的快意，我则沉醉在将她带离寒冬的乐章里。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_abort_477a5f04:


    "所有被诅咒的老宅都留在了过往。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_abort_929f7151:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/128 La.ogg"
    Pol "好吧，不必非要当摇滚明星。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_abort_c2a631c7:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/129 Do.ogg" 
    Pol "当个画家和勇士已经很够了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_success_b6ae9952:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/171 S.ogg"
    Ant "听见没？我弹出来了！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_success_1fbfd4e0:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/124 Ok.ogg"
    Pol "看来你不只是天才画家，还是摇滚明星呢。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_success_43cd3332:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/125 U.ogg" 
    Pol "你的经历已经比大多数人都精彩了，勇敢的家伙。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_fail_01_40d02bf0:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/114 Ch.ogg"
    Pol "不过或许该从简单的开始，比如{u}《国王与小丑》{/u}。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_fail_01_74748bb3:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/172 T.ogg"
    Ant "除非他们有什么单和弦曲子。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_fail_02_7d4f1db3:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/173 A.ogg"
    Ant "这吉他调准音了吗？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_fail_02_bf4e754b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/116 Ne.ogg" 
    Pol "别把失败怪到乐器头上！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_fail_03_0f4338a5:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/117 La.ogg" 
    Pol "反正达利也不是什么吉他大师。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_fail_03_92b1683a:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/174 T.ogg"
    Ant "你真会安慰人，但我压根不该尝试的。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_fail_04_3205ad7b:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/175 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "我彻底没救了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_fail_04_e627364b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/118 Ne.ogg" 
    Pol "别这么苛责自己。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_fail_05_1f6a20b7:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/119 T.ogg" 
    Pol "等等，你该不会在弹{u}《娜-娜》{/u}的歌吧？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_fail_06_099fe814:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/176 Y.ogg"
    Ant "只是按错和弦了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_fail_07_d69831f9:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/120 Ti.ogg" 
    Pol "你太紧张了。手腕放松。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_guitar_fail_08_daae8376:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/177 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "我简直在丢人现眼。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_3d84d27b:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/178 K.ogg"
    Ant "我根本不勇敢…那时候居然像个傻瓜一样躲着你。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_8e37c93c:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/179 D.ogg"
    Ant "现在想起来还是很难为情…"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_3f93529d:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/130 Y.ogg" 
    Pol "我早就忘了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_620a01f2:


    "她直视我的眼睛，那目光让我忽冷忽热。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_59eec5ac:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/131 Mo.ogg" 
    Pol "我们到沙发上去吧？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_4e3cc0f3:


    "这个提议让我喉咙发紧，但我还是毫不犹豫地挪了过去。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_f2631682:


    "波琳娜放好吉他，紧挨着我坐下。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_af6603e3:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/132 Zn.ogg" 
    Pol "有句话想对你说很久了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_5b682665:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/133 Ti.ogg" 
    Pol "我一直很喜欢你。从初次见面就开始了。或许更早…"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_0d30c173:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/180 k.ogg"
    Ant "比那还早？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_e8123553:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/134 Nu.ogg" 
    Pol "嗯，你知道的。我们女孩子总会幻想属于自己的王子。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_baae4259:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/135 mne.ogg" 
    Pol "我觉得是我创造了你。然后你就真的出现了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_3eb7d050:


    "一阵眩晕袭来，仿佛坐上摩天轮直抵云端。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_74405af4:


    "原来不需要魔法或科技也能飞翔。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_8a4bd25c:


    "不，此刻这间屋里正在发生的就是魔法本身。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_eb98600a:


    "唯有这种魔法能对抗侵蚀我们村庄的黑暗病灶。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_192e313c:


    "波琳娜在等待着什么。而等待的不止她一个。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_3de324e8:


    "房间里还有某个存在渴求着我的关注。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_4013e313:


    "我望向波琳娜肩后，惊恐地僵住了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_98dcbcf2:


    "一个孩子像被罚站般背对我们立在墙角。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_c9f5ddbc:


    "连帽衫完全遮住了头部，娇小轮廓几乎隐没在黑暗里。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_561688da:


    "我见过她。在车库里，在莉莉娅·帕夫洛夫娜的课堂上。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_a7fce58e:


    "奥利娅？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_c7148695:


    "但这个总会神秘消失的孩子如同幽灵，而我的奥利娅明明活得好好的…"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_485ffd1c:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/136 ti.ogg" 
    Pol "怎么了？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_47d4c133:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/181 T.ogg"
    Ant "那儿有人。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_bd1543a5:


    "波琳娜甚至没瞥向烛光未及的阴影，只是平静地挪到沙发边。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_7e1cf89b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/137 Eto.ogg" 
    Pol "大概是乔安娜吧。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_2dc5ae0d:


    "我举高蜡烛想驱散幻象…"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_01ba9288:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/138 Vi.ogg" 
    Pol "看吧？我就说。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_89714e34:


    "一只暹罗猫在跃动的烛光中凝视着我。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_bd970f4d:


    "但刚移开烛火，我又瞥见孩童轮廓在黑暗中扭动。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_3d87d885:


    "我强迫自己不再注意墙角恼人的影子，小心地在波琳娜身旁坐下。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_44308bef:


    "明知有不速之客在场，与她对话都令人心惊。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_610feae7:


    "是时候坦白了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_af1c0394:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/182 P.ogg"
    Ant "波琳娜，我出现幻觉了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_beb60e86:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/139 S.ogg" 
    Pol "现在吗？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_65ed6ba1:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/183 E.ogg"
    Ant "现在，而且一直…"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_056ce4b9:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/184 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "总会看到奇怪的东西。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_b3122984:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/140 Ho.ogg"
    Pol "所以你觉得自己疯了？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_6324424e:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/185 D.ogg"
    Ant "医生说这是青春期症状会自然消退，只要按时吃药。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_b2f0566d:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/141 oni.ogg"
    Pol "药带了吗？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_a7f3e202:


    "我点点头，取出药板。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_1cc2e8ab:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/142 Tak.ogg" 
    Pol "那还等什么？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_809f5e1a:


    "我到底在{b}等{/b}什么呢？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_3dd9223c:


    "我又望向墙角。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_7659a008:


    "那道剪影依旧维持姿势，但现在我确信…"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_19e7e1e3:


    "那就是奥利娅。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_2716498a:


    "一缕低语穿透呼啸狂风。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_f35acfc9:


    "它突破厚重积雪，从冻土之下传来，仿佛妹妹正从墓穴深处呼唤我。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_20df7807:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/09 Ant.ogg"
    Oly "安东！回来，安东！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_c136fba1:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/10 Ver.ogg"
    Oly "回到我身边，求你了！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_1ed4e7a2:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/143 T.ogg" 
    Pol "你吓到我了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_c7e48941:


    "在另一个世界，奥利娅不停地哭泣，反复呼唤着我的名字。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_followup_afterdev_1ec41d1d:


    "我的目光再次黏在药板上。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_accept_e4ddbfd2:


    "我宁愿相信幽灵存在，但奥利娅明明没有死。半小时前我才和妈妈通过电话。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_accept_89ceda25:


    "这根本不合逻辑。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_accept_5e846205:


    "我将药片抛进舌根。一只端着水杯的手适时出现在眼前。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_accept_3072fed9:


    "波琳娜投来理解的目光，让我心中充满感激。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_accept_e44aa4b7:


    "我接过水吞下药片。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_accept_cf5ff89c:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/144 Nu.ogg"
    Pol "感觉如何？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_accept_7e6e0055:


    "我迅速瞥向墙角。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_accept_20b21db0:


    "哭声渐渐平息。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_accept_87c7e74d:


    "幻觉终于放过了我。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_accept_e6990908:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/186 Y.ogg"
    Ant "看来我确实疯了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_accept_e467a3f0:


    "波琳娜回以轻松的微笑。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_accept_09c40bdb:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/145 Sl.ogg" 
    Pol "这点我不反驳。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_accept_7a22cd95:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/146 No.ogg" 
    Pol "但你绝对是我见过最酷的疯子。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_accept_57c7ead2:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/147 ps.ogg"
    Pol "是个英俊的神经病。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_accept_f24ac718:


    "波琳娜突然坐到我腿上，投来成熟的目光。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_accept_a8a52eb8:


    "我的心跳几乎停滞，节奏乱得像不知该如何搏动。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_accept_4ba459db:


    "随即滚烫的血液又涌向全身脉络。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_accept_b6e1b023:


    "我想起父亲。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_accept_a98baca0:


    "他年轻时是否也经历过这些，在遇见妈妈之前？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_accept_ad544772:


    "他生命里是否也有个像波琳娜这样的女孩，曾用这样的眼神注视过他？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_accept_e5cd3772:


    "若有，他当年是如何不被这般汹涌情感灼伤的？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_accept_714a6986:


    "波琳娜轻抚我的肩膀，掸去不存在的线头，悄声问道："


translate chinese event_m_polina_accept_e5d583fb:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/148 Ne.ogg" 
    Pol "这次你不会逃走了吧？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_accept_ad78aa99:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/187 N.ogg"
    Ant "当然。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_accept_8e9f45af:


    "一个吻。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_accept_31b53116:


    "烛火熄灭了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_638c1245:


    "但万一那不是幻觉呢？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_3e17de76:


    "我攥紧手中的药板。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_a513747f:


    "万一奥利娅需要我的帮助，或是想警告我什么？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_60746dd4:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/149 A.ogg" 
    Pol "别这样，安东。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_7f3d000c:


    "看到波琳娜眼中闪过的恐惧——不，那是不断扩散的恐慌，我不禁皱眉。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_41ecbc33:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/188 Ch.ogg"
    Ant "怎么了？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_6d9632d8:


    "哭声陡然增强，充斥整个房间。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_823805aa:


    "波琳娜是不是瑟缩了一下？她刚才是不是看了眼墙角？难道她也听见了？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_cf59fa5d:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/189 T.ogg"
    Ant "所以那不是幻觉……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_b0a1f12b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/13 krik.ogg" 
    "当拳头重重砸响房门时，波琳娜失声尖叫。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_e6c3c442:


    "猫咪蹿上天花板，扯落窗帘消失在黑暗里。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_ae31da7a:


    "我们同时蜷缩起来。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_9845a920:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/150 net.ogg" 
    Pol "不，不要……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_0e234806:


    "她浑身颤抖着摇头。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_ef7d68f6:


    "奥利娅的哭嚎与暴风雪的哀歌交织成合唱。拳脚不断撞击着门板。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_fadfa638:


    "烛火摇曳，周遭黑暗愈发浓重。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_ddd716c5:



    voice "voice/Hariton/02 Po.ogg"
    Noname "波琳娜！波琳娜你在家吗？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_9b4dc826:


    "是她爷爷……只是出院回家的爷爷……但为什么在深夜？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_e0453c58:


    "为什么他的声音像含着满口獠牙？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_2daf902a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/151 Ch.ogg" 
    Pol "你做了什么，安东？为什么不吃药？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_ad94395a:


    "泪水从她圆睁的眼中夺眶而出。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_ec243db8:



    voice "voice/Hariton/03 Vi.ogg"
    Noname "出来吧，我死去的孩子！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_70e39d26:



    voice "voice/Hariton/42.C2.ogg"
    Noname "你要是不能完完整整地出来，至少分我一块儿肉！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_a97740e1:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/13 Vs.ogg"
    "波琳娜歇斯底里地哭泣，泪水从圆睁的眼中奔涌而出。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_a58a1c32:


    "门廊传来吱呀声。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_aa05296e:


    "哈里东……他学会走路了？在暴风雪中行走，在黑暗里行走……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_d7fa5639:


    "窗外掠过狰狞黑影。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_d2851100:


    "炽热呼吸融化了冰霜，澄净的玻璃上浮现凸起的眼球。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_95577ecf:


    "有个庞然大物正窥探着屋子里的情况，想确认屋里有新鲜的血肉。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_a0fc178d:


    "利爪破开冰层，刮擦玻璃。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_d9df5bbf:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/13 krik.ogg"
    "窗框迸裂，严寒灌入室内。玻璃碎片四溅，骨镰扣住窗沿。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_fe55777d:


    "狂风卷入房间扑灭大半烛火，唯有一支倒下的仍在燃烧。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_0a1f832d:


    "或许是为了让我们看清夜行生物如何造访尖叫的波琳娜。它们有首领。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_69c180a3:


    "我惊恐地捂住脸，从指缝间窥视窗外出现的巨物。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_7b41d586:


    "它饥渴的双眸在昏暗中如银月般发光。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_80ab17aa:


    "怪物伸出手，匕首般的指尖直指我们。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_b5785174:


    "疯狼群如洪流冲进房间，席卷沿途一切。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_fa216c52:


    "巨怪随之踏入。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_a92b98a7:


    "它骇人的身躯直抵天花板。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_0e9bd6c8:


    "硕大头颅上竖着颤抖的长耳。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_c49ab2fc:


    "怪物的阴影在墙上狂舞。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_e7b9ebc1:


    "火苗窜上桌布噼啪作响。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_2099557c:


    "浓烟灼烧我的鼻腔。饥渴的恶魔在炽热地狱里狞笑。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_af68d1d4:


    "我恐惧地僵坐着，看波琳娜从沙发惊起试图逃窜。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_30966af4:


    "跑到房间中央时她突然战栗着跪倒在不可名状的恐怖面前。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_5a48efd3:


    "这来自森林与寒坟的怪物。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_bfebd071:


    "兔形怪物左爪攥住波琳娜的头发。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_98e873cd:


    "右爪如折扇般展开，陶醉于猎物的无助。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_61cd7538:


    "利爪缓缓划过女孩的脸庞，描摹发际线。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_fdc682a8:


    "途经颌骨，贯穿下颚又向上游移。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_2704620a:


    "波琳娜发出尖叫。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_45218330:


    "皮肤在爪压下褶皱，泪水滑过失血的脸颊。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_a706a7f1:


    "燃烧的布片飘落椅面点燃填充物。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_dd89c83d:


    "接着，怪物一挥手完整剥下波琳娜的脸皮，像丢弃破布般扔开。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_539b61d6:


    "原本脸庞的位置只剩湿漉漉闪光的红色肉糜，夹杂肌腱与脂肪粒。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_71f6805c:


    "被剥皮的波琳娜发出刺耳尖嚎。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_efea7482:


    "火焰映照在她面骨间的红色沼泽里。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_300b256d:


    "尖叫渐变成尖锐嘶鸣，最终化为某种咯咯怪响。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_60e70491:


    "她是在……笑吗？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_74979806:


    "波琳娜将残缺的脸转向我。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_282cd1fe:


    "光滑肉块上的孔洞传出恶毒笑声。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_204260cc:


    "失去眼睑的浑圆眼球在眼眶里疯狂转动。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_6a7a5e5c:


    "我宁愿死去也不愿再看。恐惧使我全身麻痹。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_e8747031:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/156 ti.ogg" 
    Pol "你什么都做不了，懦夫！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_376bbebd:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/157 ni.ogg" 
    Pol "废物！连保护我都做不到！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_f49c5cfa:


    "我捂住耳朵却依然能听见。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_d4c740ee:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/158 ro.ogg" 
    Pol "罗姆卡比你强一千倍。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_4d6f84c1:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/159 zn.ogg" 
    Pol "记住，失败者……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_11abd073:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/160 ni.ogg"
    Pol "没有任何世界线你能拯救我，安东！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_f2eda78b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/161ni.ogg" 
    Pol "不存在我会属于你的宇宙！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_e61ef0f4:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/162 ti.ogg" 
    Pol "你注定失败！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_576113a2:


    "身后火焰肆虐。当浓烟笼罩波琳娜时，她再次尖叫。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_7f327d70:


    "或许终于意识到即将发生什么。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_fdaf63a4:


    "利爪带着布料撕裂般的恶心声响剖开她的腹部。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_7356e36d:


    "兽爪探入腹腔扯出肠脏。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_aab86555:


    "女学生紫红色的肠管。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_bec05b1a:


    "怪物舔舐嘴唇，将发臭的肠管像绳索般绕回波琳娜脖颈，随后扬爪一甩。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_f0ce1530:


    "波琳娜腾空而起，用自己的肠子吊在枝形吊灯上如钟摆般摇晃。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_2872334b:


    "双腿单调地撞击墙壁，无力的手指抓挠着可怖的绞索。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_433e946b:


    "怪物转向我，黏浊唾液从口器滴落。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_8f00ee4e:


    "波琳娜双臂垂落，但尸体仍在风中摇摆。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_ff603f56:


    "狼群蓄势待发，等待进攻信号。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_e042c9ec:


    "污浊毛发下肌肉贲张。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_c4f707ec:


    "结痂的尾巴因期待盛宴而颤抖。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_38273307:


    "怪物缓缓抬手，用爪尖轻触我。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_0fa3eb2c:



    voice "voice/bunny/13 Ez.ogg"
    Bunny "因为你们这种家伙，我们才成为异类！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_11f6ad30:



    voice "voice/bunny/14 Vs.ogg"
    Bunny "整个狼群早已对月长嚎……"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_7f3458cb:



    voice "voice/bunny/15 As.ogg"
    Bunny "唯独你要特立独行！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_1837a01b:



    voice "voice/bunny/16Tv .ogg"
    Bunny "你的血肉将消融在胃酸里。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_dc3e1303:



    voice "voice/bunny/17Tv.ogg"
    Bunny "你的灵魂将归于森林。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_f23bc9d5:



    voice "voice/bunny/18 Tv.ogg"
    Bunny "你的名字将被永远遗忘。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_51430495:


    "狼群齐声嗥叫。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_73b38b0b:


    "离我最近的野兽猛扑过来，利齿咬穿我的喉咙，深深楔入喉骨。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_9c7745b6:


    "波琳娜的影子在墙上摇曳。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_5b641b60:


    "我手指死死抠进狼首黏湿的皮毛，用尽最后力气想推开掠食者。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_4312a689:


    "它继续啃咬着，撕碎我的喉管。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_bc729829:



    voice "voice/bunny/19 Nu.ogg"
    Bunny "如何？死亡很可怕吧？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_2e6f3731:


    Oly "啊啊啊啊啊啊——！"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_c119b180:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/sluni.ogg"
    "我被自己的唾液呛住，误以为是鲜血，猛地睁开了眼睛。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_4e72f538:


    "奥利娅的尖叫已停歇，余音仍在颅腔内震荡。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_8b7ec864:


    "痛楚消失了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_41e3163d:


    "狼群、怪物、死去的波琳娜……全都消失了。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_fe6567f3:


    "我从哈里东家燃烧的卧室瞬间转移到了自家门厅。难道一切都是梦？"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_29fb91a9:


    "我摸索着完好无损的脖颈。"


translate chinese event_m_polina_refuse_95a875db:


    "不仅在波琳娜家度过的夜晚，连同整个上月、受伤的卡嘉、我们从车库的逃亡……"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_c6fc05a3:


    "我望向波琳娜。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_596994e6:


    "她纯真的笑容并未打消我的疑虑。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_915f9f40:


    "尽管雪幕将校园笼罩得愈来愈密，我的视线却愈发清晰。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_3b9f0535:


    "我依然无法信任波琳娜。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_786f9a45:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/192 P.ogg"
    Ant "抱歉，波琳娜，但卡嘉更需要帮助。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_d67c4943:


    "波琳娜如同挨了一记耳光。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_ebc07830:


    "她双眼微眯，颤抖唇瓣上的笑意渐渐枯萎。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_4b944c3c:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/62 Es.ogg"
    Kate "当然，如果你不介意的话。你不介意对吧，波琳娜？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_4e190ed8:


    "罗姆卡的出现打破了尴尬的沉默。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_4d66e3df:


    "他从拐角处走来，低垂着头。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_bd9f4fde:


    "失去朋友的痛苦仿佛化作了实质的重量压在他肩上。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_3536de2b:


    "卡嘉抓住我的胳膊，但我没有在意。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_0fdf0024:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/165 R.ogg" 
    Pol "罗曼！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_6a3a5cdd:


    "波琳娜冲向罗姆卡紧紧抱住他。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_46d51701:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/166 ro.ogg" 
    Pol "罗莫奇卡，没有你我真的好难过。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_4ebc8af6:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/167 nu.ogg" 
    Pol "这些天你去哪了？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_3c699788:


    "短暂的停顿后，罗姆卡的手臂环住波琳娜颤抖的脊背。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_58f5d7fb:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/63 b.ogg"
    Kate "呵，转变得真快。你不觉得难受吗，安东？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_b1549d79:


    "我摇了摇头。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_68f91cbb:


    "罗姆卡抬起头。惯常的得意冷笑在他脸上一闪而过，但转瞬即逝。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_bf673c64:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/41 Nu.ogg"
    Rom "别哭了，我不喜欢这样。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_cdeca368:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/42 Na.ogg"
    Rom "你去上学了？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_1f849953:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/168 bi.ogg" 
    Pol "嗯……"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_10c91e3c:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/43 B.ogg"
    Rom "见过拜沙吗？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_b5e4dda1:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/168 ne.ogg" 
    Pol "没有。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_d452472c:


    "罗曼朝雪地啐了一口，这才将目光转向我和卡嘉。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_b656f847:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/45 A.ogg"
    Rom "你们俩见过拜沙吗？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_ba2f83fb:


    "我惊讶地摇头。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_3b02b3bb:


    "我们都见过那只运动鞋。罗姆卡亲口确认那是他朋友的。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_10ef62ad:


    "拜沙不可能自愿把鞋送给连环杀手，现在光着脚在村里游荡。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_a704b0c7:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/193 R.ogg"
    Ant "罗曼，拜沙在车库里待过。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_19455efe:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/46 B.ogg"
    Rom "那又怎样？我们也在那儿。现在不都好好的。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_9230fad2:


    "可他看起来根本不像好好的。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_e24f277f:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/47 Ya.ogg"
    Rom "不查清拜沙的下落我绝不罢休。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_ad483a0a:


    "罗姆卡从外套掏出一叠海报，数出几张递给我。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_3726f5da:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/48 Ra.ogg"
    Rom "沿路贴上。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_8908565d:


    "没来得及细看，卡嘉已把我拽到一旁。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_d22d448e:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/64 K.ogg"
    Kate "没错没错！有钱能使鬼推磨。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_d35347c2:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/65 A.ogg"
    Kate "要是没钱——那就认命吧，老兄。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_58bc9ee2:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/66 Ch.ogg"
    Kate "再见咯！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_57eff479:


    "罗姆卡对卡嘉的讥讽充耳不闻，只是轻抚波琳娜的肩头。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_7ca5f718:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/49 Ed.ogg"
    Rom "走吧，宝贝。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_d9ba62e6:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/49 od.ogg"
    Rom "这年头不能独自走动。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_3a3f6b24:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/169 ed.ogg" 
    Pol "走吧罗莫奇卡，我有好多话想对你说。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_310a8da4:


    "离去时，罗姆卡最后与我对视一眼，点了点头，仿佛我们共享着某个秘密。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_a5366a6a:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/67 E.ogg"
    Kate "从此他们过上了幸福的生活……"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_3d518b5d:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/18 Kat.ogg"
    Lilia_P "卡嘉，亲爱的！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_c0d5b245:


    "我们抬头望向二楼窗口。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_a2c9071b:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/19 Ver.ogg"
    Lilia_P "回教室来。你得等我一会儿。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_7d0fbb93:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/20 Ra.ogg"
    Lilia_P "工作实在太多了！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_2ce8c1a3:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/194 L.ogg"
    Ant "莉莉娅·帕夫洛夫娜，我可以送卡嘉回家。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_acd18702:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/21 Pr.ogg"
    Lilia_P "真的吗？那太好了！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_4866d949:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/22 No.ogg"
    Lilia_P "只是……家里连吃的都没有了。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_a416bb45:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/68 Ya.ogg"
    Kate "别担心妈妈，我自己能做点吃的。我们会没事的。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_d89e6860:



    voice "voice/lydia/5day/23 Mo.ogg"
    Lilia_P "啊，你们真是我的天使！路上千万小心。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_7be81fba:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/195 K.ogg"
    Ant "当然！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_16386849:


    "我们踏上归途。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_720b1696:


    "灰暗云层遮蔽天空，吞没阳光，将周遭世界染上霉灰色调。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_22ab6680:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/69 Esh.ogg"
    Kate "再次道歉。为今天，也为从前。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_139891da:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/70 T.ogg"
    Kate "你大概觉得我是个很糟糕的人吧？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_54c08a09:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/196 Che.ogg"
    Ant "说实话？确实有过类似想法。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_78bdab93:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/71 Nu.ogg"
    Kate "白痴！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_ae4cefd3:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/197 H.ogg"
    Ant "是你要我说真话的。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_e501a76f:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/72 Ya.ogg"
    Kate "那我也告诉你实话。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_5e6e4613:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/73 Dum.ogg"
    Kate "以为我欺负你是出于施虐狂之类的心理？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_603a8991:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/74 Da.ogg"
    Kate "是啊是啊！才怪呢！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_c5c12d67:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/75 Ya.ogg"
    Kate "我只是不知道该怎么引起你注意。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_ffde1c1c:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/77 kh.ogg"
    "我惊讶地看向她。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_be255b32:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/76 V.ogg"
    Kate "你们男生根本读不懂暗示。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_48e236b9:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/79 ai.ogg"
    "卡嘉皱起眉头，我们停下脚步。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_161cf97d:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/78V.ogg"
    Kate "我没事，继续走吧。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_0b4a88e1:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/198 Na.ogg"
    Ant "拄着拐杖走路一定很不方便……"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_f1350c3d:


    "这样平常的对话将我从严酷坦率带来的窘迫中解救出来。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_dadf120d:


    "警车后座上我们十指相扣的画面仍烙印在脑海。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_5aee8c65:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/79 p.ogg"
    Kate "慢慢就习惯了。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_e6047c70:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/80 m.ogg"
    Kate "而且妈妈帮了很多忙。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_b8e87d2b:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/81 E.ogg"
    Kate "她本来就不容易，现在我又成了残废。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_b1b2fa2f:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/199 Y.ogg"
    Ant "能问你件事吗？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_16c422c3:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/82 ri.ogg"
    Kate "尽管问。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_526ad992:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/200 T.ogg"
    Ant "你父亲……"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_5ebd1e6a:


    "卡嘉抿紧嘴唇。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_0d790fb1:


    "我踏入了危险领域。但她片刻后放松下来，轻声回答。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_1ab7f2ff:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/83 Pa.ogg"
    Kate "爸爸以前在精神病院工作。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_2e32a0de:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/84 Ya.ogg"
    Kate "从他那儿我听说了不少关于邻居们的'趣闻'。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_4ea5f39a:


    "她在回避话题。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_457169c9:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/85 V.ogg"
    Kate "比如波琳娜。她家可是精彩得很……"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_3436eb98:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/86 E.ogg"
    Kate "她爷爷就是把拜沙妈妈送进精神病院的元凶。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_7ab20c78:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/201 Ha.ogg"
    Ant "哈里东？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_c63ad7c1:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/87 on.ogg"
    Kate "大名鼎鼎的传奇人物。不过他有他的理由。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_a2f7d389:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/88 Ma.ogg"
    Kate "拜沙的妈妈散布那些谣言……甚至不算谣言，根本是妄想。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_84b6253b:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/89 G.ogg"
    Kate "她说村民都被附身了，说老哈里东是恶魔。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_9809f959:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/90 Na.ogg"
    Kate "她总是一大清早就喝醉，大概这样才能看见恶魔吧。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_b1036640:


    "我想起轮椅上的老人和他那些不祥的故事。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_d0db524c:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/91 Ko.ogg"
    Kate "她被关起来后，哈里东就开始照顾拜沙。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_246bd159:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/92 E.ogg"
    Kate "爸爸还跟我说过罗姆卡那个混蛋父亲的事。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_70c9a703:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/93 Z.ogg"
    Kate "你知道她参加过戒毒康复计划吗？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_8a039476:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/94 da.ogg"
    Kate "没错没错！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_cebc3120:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/95  Ez.ogg"
    Kate "所以他总是打儿子。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_8d284522:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/96 N.ogg"
    Kate "要是罗姆卡走上老路我也不会惊讶。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_2b8751e8:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/97 S.ogg"
    Kate "看他现在过的什么日子。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_66e2d353:


    "听这些阴暗秘密让我不适。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_24507e87:


    "吸毒者，精神失常的女人……"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_ecf834b9:


    "这提醒我黑暗不仅存在于森林或蛛网密布的老屋角落。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_8186442f:


    "它也常蛰伏在人们脑海里。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_a043b7c5:


    "唤醒某些危险事物……比如恶魔……或是沉睡的怪物……"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_f5231065:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/202 Chto.ogg"
    Ant "我们聊别人够久了。说说你自己吧？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_36ed3a5a:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/98a.ogg"
    Kate "有什么可说的？你早就都知道了。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_b7da548f:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/203 Ne.ogg"
    Ant "我觉得我一无所知。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_a605cbc8:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/204 T.ogg"
    Ant "你说你父亲'以前'工作过。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_468652cf:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/205 On.ogg"
    Ant "他辞职了？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_8c204392:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/99t.ogg"
    Kate "这个嘛……发生了一些事……"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_9cb28513:


    "卡嘉的目光投向眼前浮动的雾气。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_e70c74df:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/100e.ogg"
    Kate "和疯子打交道太久，自己也会疯掉。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_975e6023:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/101p.ogg"
    Kate "我爸找了个年轻护士私奔了，那个老色鬼。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_f1c0bbc4:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/102ma.ogg"
    Kate "妈妈不得不拼命工作，才能让我有个像样的童年。既当老师又当家长。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_cc76e077:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/103z.ogg"
    Kate "你知道她有多爱我吗？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_f48ed394:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/104e.ogg"
    Kate "要是我没了，她肯定会自杀的。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_25e10570:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/105t.ogg"
    Kate "所以你其实救了两条命。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_46ced24c:


    "我脑海中浮现出清晰的场景："


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_71219415:


    "学生们等着上课，但走进教室的不是老师而是校长。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_160664ba:


    "他说文学课取消了。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_540576c0:


    "莉莉娅·帕夫洛夫娜死了。上吊自尽的。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_e1ac50ef:


    "这想象灼痛我的心，将我拽回那个悲惨的日子。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_953e3684:


    "绞肉机槽里的卡嘉……和她残缺的脚趾。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_cdb45ff6:


    "我眨眨眼驱散幻象，小心翼翼地问："


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_6411ec2d:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/206 Ti.ogg"
    Ant "你还记得怎么被绑架的吗？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_908568cd:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/106 gl.ogg"
    "卡嘉吞咽了一下。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_82d23636:


    "我懊恼自己多嘴。这简直是最糟的问题！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_c1e02ba9:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/107 V.ogg"
    Kate "大概记得。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_74200eb0:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/108on.ogg"
    Kate "他……从背后捂住我，然后……我……可能昏过去了。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_09fb756f:


    "这说辞如此耳熟……"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_f845bc7f:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/01 p.ogg"
    Kate "不然还能怎样呢？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_8b68d84b:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/02 u.ogg"
    Kate "他长着你的脸，安东！然后直接飞上天了。对对对。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_9ec37373:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/03 e.ogg"
    Kate "接着发生特别诡异的事……呃！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_da2167d0:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/04 y.ogg"
    Kate "我意识到全是噩梦……等醒来时……"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_40080c9a:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/05 s.ogg"
    Kate "看见他正拖着我在雪地里走。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_6f04faa8:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/110 Ya.ogg"
    Kate "我抓住手提包……扔到路上。希望有人发现……"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_87f86ddd:


    "卡嘉在村里仅有的两栋公寓楼前停步，背对着我。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_b1e515ba:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/207 K.ogg"
    Ant "卡嘉？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_af10dc2b:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/111 hn.ogg"
    "她在哭。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_c0e94151:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/112 ch.ogg"
    Kate "什么？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_df8db7f7:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/113 Ya.ogg"
    Kate "我当卡嘉已经十二年了！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_6b69349d:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/208 Nu.ogg"
    Ant "别这样。都过去了。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_bf334cda:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/114 At.ogg"
    Kate "知道绞肉机最可怕的是什么吗？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_bddbd490:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/115ch.ogg"
    Kate "是怕到死都没能向你告白。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_81cfdf00:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/209 V.ogg"
    Ant "告白什么？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_7180703a:


    "卡嘉突然转身，我看到她通红的脸。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_6568b2ca:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/116 k.ogg"
    Kate "你这个笨蛋，安东·彼得罗夫！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_a47ce4f2:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/117v.ogg"
    Kate "告白我喜欢你啊！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_8f0584ec:


    "我愣住了。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_92fe9c12:


    "但随后听见自己的话语仿佛从遥远之处传来："


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_3e66440d:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/210 T.ogg"
    Ant "我也喜欢你。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_0bb3fc39:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/118 Ch.ogg"
    Kate "真的？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_14b7ed21:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/211 Ch.ogg"
    Ant "真的。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_3c4b67d0:


    "我擦去她焕发光彩的脸颊上的泪珠。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_dabc5dab:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/212 K.ogg"
    Ant "当然喜欢。我以为这很明显。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_29f555ce:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/119 V.ogg"
    Kate "你们男生总觉得什么事都明显。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_82482566:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/120 a.ogg"
    Kate "但女孩子想亲耳听到。我们用耳朵恋爱，你不知道吗？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_13168ae4:


    "我不知道的事情还有很多。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_c39d3b68:


    "卡嘉的泪珠闪烁，雪花洒落在赋予我重大抉择的十字路口，洒向不同的人生轨迹。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_7e203eac:


    "我感到此刻弥足珍贵，需要将它铭刻在记忆里。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_098c264f:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/213 r.ogg"
    Ant "能画你吗？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_a26beed4:


    "卡嘉破涕为笑。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_40ba10ac:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/121 t.ogg"
    Kate "别画现在这副狼狈相。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_907de230:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/214 po.ogg"
    Ant "成交！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_a9072e72:


    "她望向混凝土建筑。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_bc4a9a7d:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/122 z.ogg"
    Kate "我住这儿。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_687e5aa4:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/215 Kr.ogg"
    Ant "真好。连这方面你都与众不同。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_7d8f4033:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/123 r.ogg"
    Kate "我父母分到了公寓。老师和医生——村里最重要的人。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_7875aa0e:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/124 k.ogg"
    Kate "能看见垃圾堆的舒适生活。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_d757fab0:


    "我宁愿看垃圾堆也不愿看我家周围的森林。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_a83a3d9d:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/125 za.ogg"
    Kate "可惜没电梯。拐杖太麻烦了。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_8b2b9213:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/126ne.ogg"
    Kate "上三楼简直是挑战。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_92e1171c:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/216 T.ogg"
    Ant "要我帮忙吗？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_50053941:


    "妈妈讲过她和我爸爸约会时扭伤脚踝的故事。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_03e3e7e7:


    "爸爸抱着她走了两个街区。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_e314e09f:


    "那一刻她决定和这个男人共度一生。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_782d61f0:


    voice "voice/kate/5day/127ah.ogg"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_9a1d3dd5:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/128 ok.ogg"
    Kate "你疯了？！我很重的，白痴。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_c9b3523c:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/218 K.ogg"
    Ant "轻如羽毛。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_b3aa199e:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/129 oi.ogg"
    Kate "喂！手放哪儿呢。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_d6487ce5:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/130 at.ogg"
    Kate "小心我告诉妈妈。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_ac5f4ec9:


    "我将她横抱起来走向公寓。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_336acf64:


    "一个嚼着{u}芝麻糖{/u}的女管理员迎面走来，沾满面粉的脸上绽开笑容。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_e68d48ac:



    voice "voice/episod/06 Vot.ogg"
    Janitor "哎哟哟！这场景！跟巴西连续剧似的！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_5b57f254:



    voice "voice/episod/07 N.ogg" 
    Janitor "好小子！抱得真稳！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_6da57047:



    voice "voice/episod/08 L.ogg" 
    Janitor "瞧瞧这画面！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_9e56044f:



    voice "voice/episod/09 A.ogg" 
    Janitor "还都说美国电影带坏年轻人！这不还有靠谱的小伙子嘛！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_45985722:


    "我尴尬地嘟囔着。卡嘉脸红得像甜菜根。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_61dbd069:


    "她虽轻，但上楼时我开始左右摇晃。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_6f720360:


    "她握着的拐杖不时撞到栏杆哐当作响。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_48c1b9bd:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/131 hi.ogg"
    "卡嘉不好意思地轻笑。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_49ab9134:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/131 hihi.ogg"
    "她仿佛正努力将登楼的每个瞬间刻进记忆。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_0fdb4d27:


    "而我竭力避免弓背，努力挺直腰板。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_bfad3207:


    "鼓励的喊声从背后传来："


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_9e1844b9:



    voice "voice/episod/10 Na.ogg" 
    Janitor "真正的绅士！长大了就嫁给他吧卡嘉！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_85e77347:


    "卡嘉笑出声来。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_99c6a83a:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/132 ob.ogg"
    Kate "当然！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_94ac0a7f:


    "我小心地将卡嘉放在公寓门前的混凝土地面上。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_7c20d642:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/131 hihihi.ogg"
    "她开门时回头瞥我，轻咬下唇。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_8dd138e6:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/133 s.ogg"
    Kate "谢谢你，大力士先生！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_a9fc7484:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/134 pr.ogg"
    Kate "进来坐坐，我正好换个绷带。现在都得自己动手了。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_14544133:


    "她消失在浴室门后，我走进整洁的房间。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_cf193516:


    "窗外呼啸的暴风雪让温暖的卧室更显舒适。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_ada0e2d1:


    "我想起城里住过的公寓，那里总有烘焙点心的香气和父母的笑声。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_devend_1a4e38af:


    "但在这里，我同样感到安心。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_lookaround_aqua_1c2eb46a:


    "大鱼缸。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_lookaround_draw_aqua_8cbe77ec:


    "养鱼很省事，适合不常在家的人。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_lookaround_draw_aqua_b5bed4cd:


    "卡嘉确实常缺课，有时好几天没人见到她。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_lookaround_draw_aqua_5cb1a491:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/220 M.ogg"
    Ant "我能不能喂喂鱼？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_lookaround_draw_aqua_30584a6b:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/135 T.ogg"
    Kate "可以，但是别喂多了。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_lookaround_draw_aqua_239c9ea7:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/136 E.ogg"
    Kate "鱼饲料不新鲜，鱼吃了会死的。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_lookaround_certif_a85e78f2:


    "摆满奖牌的架子。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_lookaround_certif_6e531818:


    "全是少儿艺术体操比赛的参与奖牌。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_lookaround_certif_ac7e81a6:


    "我从来不知道她还练体操。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_lookaround_certif_844b831b:


    "在落入黑色车库前，卡嘉已有不少成就。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_lookaround_dollh_1887a83a:


    "芭比娃娃屋。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_lookaround_dollh_30de6a4e:


    "我不懂娃娃，但这肯定很贵。莉莉娅·帕夫洛夫娜很宠独生女。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_lookaround_dollh_3830cf03:


    "不过为什么塑料淑女们在喝茶，而肯的头被拧掉了？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_lookaround_mirror_3d8c065a:


    "梳妆台。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_lookaround_mirror_2a5fd420:


    "卡嘉大概常在这里化妆欣赏自己。她的化妆品比我妈妈还多。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_lookaround_musicb_754856f5:


    "磁带播放器。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_lookaround_musicb_43265b63:


    "正宗日本产的播放器。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_lookaround_musicb_ce125c3b:


    "旁边还有些运动器材。可以想象她随着音乐练习的样子。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_cc0ce762:


    "卡嘉踮脚站立，一手优雅后扬，彩带在空中飘舞。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_9091769b:


    "她的动作如此优美流畅！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_99c021f3:


    "为什么看着这张照片我会感到悲伤？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_d98f11da:


    "我陷入沉思，没听见橡胶拐杖头敲击地面的声音。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_f6973a12:


    "从相框玻璃的倒影看见卡嘉，我转过身。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_e3e9e2c1:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/137 vz.ogg"
    "她环顾房间，轻叹一声。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_c119a55c:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/138 do.ogg"
    Kate "还是不敢相信这些都成了过去。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_5ff89c68:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/139 mam.ogg"
    Kate "妈妈一直梦想成为运动员，所以坚信我必须替她实现。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_0592d942:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/221 M.ogg"
    Ant "真遗憾。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_a6669f6f:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/222 V.ogg"
    Ant "这些奖牌、照片……你不能练体操了怎么办？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_78230607:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/140 Us.ogg"
    Kate "我绝对不要当残奥会的运动员。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_b75313c5:


    "卡嘉忽然笑起来。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_cca7cbb2:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/141 A.ogg"
    Kate "我早就厌烦体操了。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_532cd4cb:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/142 Vs.ogg"
    Kate "要这样站，还要那样站，什么玩意儿嘛！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_ff93fb38:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/143 ed.ogg"
    Kate "所以最近这些事唯一的好处是……"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_2cd64dd8:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/144 Ya.ogg"
    Kate "我再也不用参加比赛了。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_91e8ca92:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/145 Da.ogg"
    Kate "没错没错！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_9a6d10c9:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/146 te.ogg"
    Kate "现在我想做什么就做什么！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_1f4ee2ae:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/147 kto.ogg"
    Kate "谁是世界之王？卡嘉是世界之王！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_35c8631b:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/148 ha.ogg"
    "她大笑起来，仿佛在说这全是玩笑，但玩笑里总藏着几分真实……"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_680e36b9:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/223 Ch.ogg"
    Ant "看你这样，根本想不到你受过什么限制。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_ca6b4de2:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/149 et.ogg"
    Kate "批评我？觉得我被宠坏了？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_7b4bb55b:


    voice "voice/kate/5day/150 h.ogg"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_6eae585f:


    "卡嘉玩笑般地举起拐杖。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_a96c4ac5:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/151p.ogg"
    Kate "认清你的地位，彼得罗夫！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_c7036bc6:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/152 e.ogg"
    Kate "别偷懒。帮不帮我做饭？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_bc7d947c:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/224 P.ogg"
    Ant "我试试！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_eb84bdb7:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/153 oh.ogg"
    "卡嘉带我进厨房，拉开抽屉时僵住了，谨慎地窥视里面。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_deec41a6:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/225 Ch.ogg"
    Ant "有老鼠？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_198d95c9:


    "她焦虑地摇头。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_2f26b7de:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/154 d.ogg"
    Kate "请把它拿出来。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_c33f1a32:


    "我凑近看向抽屉……"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_c9dfa9d8:


    "绞肉机正藏在厨具间。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_c7d6b439:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/226 K.ogg"
    Ant "对……"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_aab01929:


    "我取出它，感觉有冰块堵在心口。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_c2934919:


    "看到固定在滚轴上的刀片时，我一阵恶心。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_30bf7df7:


    "我告诉自己这老式铸铁家伙和车间的工业巨兽毫无共同之处。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_354ef7a9:


    "卡嘉脸色苍白如鬼魂，沉默地看着我。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_06cdbdc1:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/155 ne.ogg"
    Kate "我没法自己绞肉。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_41d262fd:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/156pl.ogg"
    Kate "会立刻想吐。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_970ec169:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/227 P.ogg"        
    Ant "交给我！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_152b25df:


    "我固定绞肉机时，卡嘉摆弄碗碟，冰箱门开合作响。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_1d025f3c:


    "她拿出肉、洋葱和面包糠。恢复活力的她开始切蔬菜做沙拉。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_8e8ea047:


    "我把食材塞进绞肉机开始转动把手。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_bca8271b:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/157b.ogg"
    Kate "小心手指。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_c3993aa9:


    "带纹路的推杆随着手柄旋转，将猪肉推向刀片。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_bd8174b3:


    "肉糜从网孔中挤出。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_a2ceb183:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/158tc.ogg"
    Kate "绞细一点！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_0a9e457b:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/159 ne.ogg"
    Kate "放心，这绞肉机牢靠着呢！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_b22a0b41:


    "想起沾满人血的刀片，想起卡嘉连着一丝皮肉摇晃的脚趾，我不禁瑟缩。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_086d8d39:


    "我悄悄把药片塞进舌下咀嚼。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_b72a52a3:


    "药物让我平静下来，恐惧退回它的黑暗巢穴。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_7c540197:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/160mi.ogg"
    Kate "我们真像对疯夫妻。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_0df4ac4b:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/161do.ogg"
    Kate "亲爱的，晚饭吃什么？"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_8ac8e261:


    "我配合她演戏。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_d2a9ff30:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/228 K.ogg"
    Ant "肉饼，宝贝。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_f63048ac:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/162Ah.ogg"
    Kate "啊，一天吃三顿我都愿意，亲爱的。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_7751245b:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/229 U.ogg"
    Ant "好消息。我们的肉饼够吃到明年冬天！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_c06ffd4d:


    voice "voice/kate/5day/163hah.ogg"


translate chinese event_m_katya_followup_99deeed4:


    "笑闹间，不安随着令人作呕的幻觉渐渐消散。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_stove_lose1_22acb9c9:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/168 ne.ogg"
    Kate "我觉得肉饼不该这么黑。"


