    voice "voice/kate/5day/176dai.ogg"
    Kate "还是我来吧…"


translate chinese event_m_katya_bad_game_part2_22c0adcd:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/177v.ogg"
    "她晃悠悠走向灶台。我连忙扶住她的腰防止摔倒。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_bad_game_part2_7403cf6f:


    "意识到这个动作有多大胆时，我瞬间脸红。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_bad_game_part2_fbd3a385:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/178de.ogg"
    Kate "抱紧点。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_good_game_0db0735e:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/179vd.ogg"
    "卡嘉深吸着诱人的香气。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_good_game_6e4ca434:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/180s.ogg"
    Kate "真让人流口水！"


translate chinese event_m_katya_good_game_849513da:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/181da.ogg"
    Kate "多少人梦寐以求能有你这样的新郎官呢。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_good_game_ec129c3a:


    voice "voice/kate/5day/182oh.ogg"


translate chinese event_m_katya_good_game_b84e566b:


    "卡嘉在灶台前踉跄了一下，我连忙扶住她的腰保持平衡。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_good_game_1b8fc18d:


    "意识到这个举动有多大胆时，我的脸顿时烧了起来。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_good_game_14758b05:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/183 ne.ogg"
    Kate "不过还是别让人家追杀你了。我得让你永远这样抱着我。"


translate chinese event_m_katya_after_game_52656f70:



    voice "voice/kate/5day/184 na.ogg"
    Kate "这才是我在那些折磨人的训练里梦想的生活！"


