translate chinese phase4_guests_devend_70d8666a:


    Ant_m "必须趁还来得及堵死所有入口。"


translate chinese phase4_guests_devend_a934788b:


    "我用斧头劈开橱柜，将它劈成几块木板。"


translate chinese phase4_guests_devend_e3a99855:


    "斧刃上还沾着野狗身体里那怪物的脓液。"


translate chinese phase4_guests_devend_8c68cc73:


