    voice "voice/anton/5day/092.Ve.ogg"
    Ant "风太大，我怕掉，钉了一下……"


translate chinese event_guests_fox_in_815babab:


    "如利卡发出狂吠。"


translate chinese event_guests_fox_in_ee6cc90e:


    "罗姆卡跺了跺脚，流浪狗便窜到楼梯间后面的黑暗中去了。"


translate chinese event_guests_fox_in_6d4e3810:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/19 na.ogg"
    Pol "哇哦。"


translate chinese event_guests_fox_in_cfa04fe7:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/20 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "还以为你们搞艺术的都不擅长体力活。"


translate chinese event_guests_fox_in_995d022a:


    "我尴尬地低下头，罗曼拍了拍我的肩。"


translate chinese event_guests_fox_in_61257796:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/285 Nash.ogg"
    Rom "咱们安东做什么都行！"


translate chinese event_guests_fox_in_9829c9fd:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/21 Sv.ogg"
    Pol "尤其是牵红线这方面。"


translate chinese event_guests_fox_in_1feea151:


    "这时，我才注意到他们背上鼓鼓囊囊的行囊。"


translate chinese event_guests_fox_in_8443dee3:


    "我忽然明白他们说的“从家里逃出来”到底是什么意思。"


translate chinese event_guests_fox_in_21547700:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/093.Tak.ogg"
    Ant "所以……你们不回去了？"


translate chinese event_guests_fox_in_efab56b8:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/286 Aga.ogg" 
    Rom "嗯，再也不回了。"


translate chinese event_guests_fox_in_8891c0e9:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/287 Ya.ogg"
    Rom "我当了些家当，凑够了去城里的路费。"


translate chinese event_guests_fox_in_92afd5d4:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/288 Atam.ogg" 
    Rom "我叔叔在那边开酒吧，能暂时收留我们一会儿。"


translate chinese event_guests_fox_in_b600a8ad:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/289 Ta.ogg" 
    Rom "没问题的。"


translate chinese event_guests_fox_in_e9874705:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/22 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "等到了那儿，我再给爷爷打电话，跟他好好解释解释。"


translate chinese event_guests_fox_in_6016ae33:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/23 o.ogg"
    Pol "我们不能再待在这儿了……"


translate chinese event_guests_fox_in_ff45cacc:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/24 ra.ogg"
    Pol "你明白的，对吧？"


translate chinese event_guests_fox_in_dee3c0cf:


    "我看得出波琳娜对未来的恐惧。"


translate chinese event_guests_fox_in_5631f7bd:


    "但她眼中也闪着真切的光彩。"


translate chinese event_guests_fox_in_f087c666:


    "我想画下此刻的她——凝固在门槛上，站在新旧生活的交界处。"


translate chinese event_guests_fox_in_5060e261:


    "她正纵身跃入未知的海洋，即将消失在其中。"


translate chinese event_guests_fox_in_00001d91:


    "这是我最后一次见到他们。他们将离开这里，共同长大。"


translate chinese event_guests_fox_in_67616b10:


    "而我会留在这座窗棂钉死的房子里，留在世界边缘，留在古老森林的临界点。"


translate chinese event_guests_fox_in_2342a8dc:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/25 mi.ogg"
    Pol "我们是来道别的。"


translate chinese event_guests_fox_in_11f4caf4:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/290 Sli.ogg"
    Rom "喂，你爸妈呢？"


translate chinese event_guests_fox_in_538d145f:


    "他皱起眉头，目光在斧头和黑暗的楼梯间游移。"


translate chinese event_guests_fox_in_ace0bf18:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/291 Chto.ogg"
    Rom "这他妈到底什么情况？"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_ac95cce4:


    "波琳娜冲进门廊，用颤抖的双手紧紧抱住我。"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_b0433156:


    "我惊讶地呼出一口气。"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_bde57ab5:


    "闻到她发丝的香气，想起她突然情绪失控前为我拉小提琴的模样。"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_d020d100:


    "仿佛舒曼的旋律随她一同飘进了这间屋子。"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_5f1149fa:


    "湿润的睫毛扫过我的脸颊。波琳娜在哭泣。"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_9caed6e0:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/094.Chto.ogg"
    Ant "发生什么事了？你怎么会来这而？"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_aef7a4c5:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/170 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "我没地方去了。"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_c8e0c15c:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/171 De.ogg" 
    Pol "爷爷他……去世了。"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_49abd9da:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/095.Chto.ogg"
    Ant "什么？真的吗？"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_08dc77cb:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/172 Ya.ogg" 
    Pol "我不知道。"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_19dc6aab:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/173 y.ogg" 
    Pol "我从没见过人死去的是什么样子。"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_190964e1:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/174 m.ogg" 
    Pol "但我觉得应该就是他那个样子了。"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_e7f3f77c:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/096.tak.ogg"
    Ant "那说不定……"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_e786dd75:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/175 ya.ogg" 
    Pol "我好害怕。"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_126b7914:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/176 on.ogg"
    Pol "他没有任何反应，就那样坐在黑暗的轮椅里。"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_4b528885:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/177 E.ogg" 
    Pol "他的眼睛……像玻璃珠一样凝固了。"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_9edaf5b8:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/178 Po.ogg" 
    Pol "自从你那次离开后，他就一直很消沉，不停喝药水。"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_999d178b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/179 Ya.ogg" 
    Pol "我担心他的心脏会受不了。"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_8c82cc1f:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/180 E.ogg" 
    Pol "然后……"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_ca90f838:


    "我想象着轮椅里死去的老人，毫无血色的嘴唇后露出铁质假牙。"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_fe949f64:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/smile.ogg"
    "这时我注意到波琳娜的嘴角——正扬起幸福的微笑。"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_f4dc1440:


    voice "voice/Polina/5day/Ahh.ogg"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_44c8d8be:


    "她突然战栗，仿佛从幻梦中惊醒，那个笑容瞬间消失。"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_9f6c1beb:


    "是神经紧张吧。"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_e17560f2:


    "这可怜的姑娘失去了唯一的亲人，而这很可能都是我的错……"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_b6e3aae4:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/097.ti.ogg"
    Ant "你叫救护车了吗？"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_a099a1f7:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/181 Da.ogg"
    Pol "叫了！但电话打不通……"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_864e3582:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/182 Po.ogg" 
    Pol "来的路上我看到电线杆都倒了。"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_13c62c21:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/183 mne.ogg" 
    Pol "在森林里的时候我好害怕，托沙！"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_613ab0af:


    "她把脸埋进我的背心抽泣。"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_be10c1bd:


    "如利卡在角落发出低吼。我跺了跺脚，小狗叫了几声，慌忙躲到楼梯间后面。"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_2b0d73e4:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/185 ti.ogg" 
    Pol "你是我最后的希望了！"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_720bbaa7:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/186 v.ogg" 
    Pol "我昨天表现得像个傻瓜！"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_d4b0f5d4:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/187 t.ogg" 
    Pol "一直害怕你会不愿意……"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_95e8ed51:


    "就在这时，她泪眼朦胧的目光定格在斧头上。"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_476d96ff:


    "定格在钉死的窗户和睡在走廊中央的妹妹身上。"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_5a3b2e21:


    "波琳娜的话语戛然而止。"


translate chinese event_guests_polina_in_ee02ace2:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/188 ch.ogg"
    Pol "这……到底是怎么回事？"


translate chinese event_guests_common_e7cebaa1:


    "我倚着楼梯栏杆。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_7b193b82:


    "渴望倾诉那些将我压得喘不过气的重负。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_d4a89333:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/098.Ol.ogg"
    Ant "奥利娅病了。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_147b524c:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/099.Papa.ogg"
    Ant "爸爸去找医生，妈妈去买药。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_21e54291:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/099.dav.ogg"
    Ant "已经去了很久，整整六个小时了。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_9f9c2ff7:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/26 sh.ogg"
    Pol "六个小时？你报警了吗？"


translate chinese event_guests_common_0233f7c2:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/100.Aga.ogg"
    Ant "报了。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_ffc21d48:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/100.skaz.ogg"
    Ant "他们说爸妈很快会回来，只不过是雪太大，大雪封路了。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_f577dd36:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/101.Ya.ogg"
    Ant "我等啊等，后来在楼梯上睡着了，醒了一看，天都黑了。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_05f5705e:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/103.A.ogg"
    Ant "然后你就来了……"


translate chinese event_guests_common_ae6408b0:


    "窗外传来刺耳的断裂声。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_e7f31f0c:


    "大概是路灯杆不堪暴风雪重压倒下了。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_8238faca:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/107.Mne.ogg"
    Ant "我觉得我们处境很危险。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_fa622525:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/102.A.ogg"
    Ant "然后你们就来了……"


translate chinese event_guests_common_a1e0d9d3:


    "短暂的宁静被奥利娅痛苦的呼喊打破。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_e7f76130:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/51 Oni.ogg"
    Oly "它们已经来了！快赶走它们，托沙，求你了！"


translate chinese event_guests_common_fedeb33a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/27 tam.ogg"
    Pol "地上的是你妹妹？"


translate chinese event_guests_common_7e14f338:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/104.Da.ogg"
    Ant "嗯……她不太舒服。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_33ea8299:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/52 Vi.ogg"
    Oly "你们是坏人！走开！"


translate chinese event_guests_common_fd867812:


    "高烧侵蚀着奥利娅的神智，让她看见足以让人血液凝固的可怖幻象。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_e5d65b25:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/292 Tin.ogg"
    Rom "你没说实话。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_7083fceb:


    "罗姆卡用审视的目光打量着我。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_2c67292b:


    "他亲身经历过车库事件，知道不少情况。但也不是什么都知道。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_9b22eb09:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/105.M.ogg"
    Ant "你们来得不是时候……"


translate chinese event_guests_common_22cb6171:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/105.Mei.ogg"
    Ant "我们处境很危险。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_ea4e3b1a:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/106.kt.ogg"
    Ant "有人在附近鬼鬼祟祟地转悠。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_2c7d045e:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/106.Eshet.ogg"
    Ant "想找机会闯进来。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_f8b72b5e:


    "波琳娜惊恐地捂住嘴。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_a5c43742:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/28 ma.ogg"
    Pol "是不是那个连环杀手？"


translate chinese event_guests_common_bb1023a1:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/109.Mo.ogg"
    Ant "很可能。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_2b112242:


    "灯光忽然一下全熄灭了。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_9f55cb13:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/189 a.ogg"
    Pol "啊！"


translate chinese event_guests_common_8fb44cd1:


    "冰箱停止运行的嗡鸣声在寂静中格外刺耳。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_bb30ae6a:


    "阴影从所有角落涌出，吞没了波琳娜。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_81a8e300:


    "暴风雪的哀嚎愈发凄厉。我紧抓栏杆，疯狂眨着眼睛适应黑暗。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_12fd894d:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/190 A.ogg" 
    Pol "安东！你听见了吗？！"


translate chinese event_guests_common_21e50fd0:


    "她眼中翻涌着恐惧的浪潮。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_b2804442:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/108.E.ogg"
    Ant "我倒希望……"


translate chinese event_guests_common_ef8ac76c:


    "门外传来震耳欲聋的撞击声。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_e8809a37:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/29 m.ogg"
    Pol "天啊！"


translate chinese event_guests_common_140ff46f:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/293 Tishe.ogg"
    Rom "安静！只是风声而已。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_12c6439f:


    "也可能是路灯杆不堪暴风雪重压倒下了。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_d6ea77b8:


    "罗姆卡放下背包，波琳娜也跟着把东西放了下来。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_08dccc6c:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/294 Nas.ogg"
    Rom "我们有三个人，还有武器，窗户也都封死了……"


translate chinese event_guests_common_3887d5fe:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/295 Zde.ogg"
    Rom "这里很安全。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_5521dff5:


    "灯光突然熄灭。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_8fb44cd1_1:


    "冰箱停止运行的嗡鸣声在寂静中格外刺耳。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_c44dbc15:


    "黑暗从所有角落涌出，吞没了罗姆卡和波琳娜的身影。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_c918a514:


    "我紧抓栏杆，拼命眨着眼睛适应黑暗。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_b18eacff:


    "暴风雪的哀嚎愈发凄厉。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_95f59a08:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/296 Tvo.ogg" 
    Rom "搞什么……"


translate chinese event_guests_common_5d96943b:


    "他啪地打亮打火机。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_2ad2c019:


    "摇曳的火苗映照出朋友们苍白的脸。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_f032838c:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/30 r.ogg"
    Pol "你们听到了吗？！"


translate chinese event_guests_common_9e9eea49:


    "她瞪大的眼睛里凝着无声的惊惧。"


translate chinese event_guests_common_7709c01b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/31 Z.ogg"
    Pol "笛声……"


translate chinese event_monsters_came_devend_ac24caa0:


    "有人开始猛烈捶打房门。"


translate chinese event_monsters_came_devend_012fa459:


    "我惊得往后一退，撞在了墙上。"


translate chinese event_monsters_came_devend_09839a3b:


    "密集的撞击如冰雹般落在门板上，单薄的木板发出不堪重负的呻吟。"


translate chinese event_monsters_came_devend_9fa8b536:


    "仿佛有数十只拳头和腿脚在同时攻击木门。"


translate chinese event_monsters_came_devend_74872bd1:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/110.Eto.ogg"
    Ant "它们来了！"


translate chinese event_monsters_came_devend_4ddbb501:


    "波琳娜脸色惨白，紧紧抓住我的胳膊，浑身发抖。"


translate chinese event_monsters_came_devend_d47125b8:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/191 On.ogg" 
    Pol "它们？！"


translate chinese event_monsters_came_devend_64a59026:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/297 oni.ogg"
    Rom "它们？"


translate chinese event_monsters_came_devend_2d8e60c2:


    "门板在门框里剧烈震动，窗框上的灰尘簌簌落下。"


translate chinese event_monsters_came_devend_f6564fe9:


    "罗姆卡惊得瞪大了双眼。"


translate chinese event_monsters_came_devend_eb8f149a:


    "波琳娜歇斯底里地尖叫起来，双手紧紧捂住脸庞。"


translate chinese event_monsters_came_devend_e8cd21ea:


    "轰响如同开始时那样戛然而止。"


translate chinese event_monsters_came_devend_7b8d58c3:


    "墙上的黑色十字架从钉子上震落，碎在我脚边。"


translate chinese event_monsters_came_devend_1b4c3765:


    "一连串不安的记忆掠过脑海——"


translate chinese event_monsters_came_devend_25afe502:


    "村边废弃小教堂的钟声，父母卧室柜顶积灰的圣像，祖母临终时的诵经……"


translate chinese event_monsters_came_devend_1dc4f7a1:


    "我多么希望自己能相信这十字架能抵挡来自雾霭森林的恐怖。"


translate chinese event_monsters_came_devend_36fbe9df:


    "在这个食人怪物逡巡的夜晚，总该存在神圣的庇护所，让我们逃离利爪与獠牙。"


translate chinese event_monsters_faith_87d2d3eb:


    "我正要伸手去拾那件古老的圣物，忽然觉得胸口有什么东西扎了一下。"


translate chinese event_monsters_faith_a59ef579:


    "是波琳娜送我的爪形萨满护身符，此刻正隔着衬衫硌在皮肤上。"


translate chinese event_monsters_faith_b4ebb610:


    "原始巫术正与我祖母和父亲笃信的圣力相抗衡。"


translate chinese event_monsters_faith_88655c1f:


    "我僵在原地，犹豫该向哪股力量祈求庇护。这些物件真能救我们性命吗？"


translate chinese event_monsters_faith_e44b634e:


    "整栋房子死寂无声。食人怪物仿佛正躲在门后狞笑，等待我做出选择。"


translate chinese event_monsters_faith_amulet_a4cd83a0:


    "我一脚将十字架踢到房间角落，同时用手掌紧紧按住衣襟下的护身符。"


translate chinese event_monsters_faith_amulet_a6e6f770:


    "唯有与古老针叶林同样原始、摒弃了正义与怜悯的信仰，才能对抗这些原始住民。"


translate chinese event_monsters_faith_cross_roma_23b844ca:


    "我不假思索地抓起十字架。"


translate chinese event_monsters_faith_cross_roma_e319fa54:


    "当那只企图将我们拖入地狱折磨的犄角怪物在窗外逡巡时，我已然准备好向上帝祈求庇佑。"


translate chinese event_monsters_faith_cross_polina_23b844ca:


    "我不假思索地抓起十字架。"


translate chinese event_monsters_faith_cross_polina_e319fa54:


