translate chinese event_dref_common_9cd15f3f:


    "我时不时抱起她，让她的小靴子悬在空中晃荡。"


translate chinese event_dref_common_049e900e:


    "但即便如此，波琳娜仍渐渐落后。"


translate chinese event_dref_common_e8810810:


    "此时户外反而更亮了。"


translate chinese event_dref_common_2348e00c:


    "我不敢回头，却清晰想象着家园化作巨大火葬堆的模样——"


translate chinese event_dref_common_6f0fe923:


    "火焰正吞食我的画作、录像带、家具和衣物。"


translate chinese event_dref_common_fcb2223e:


    "烈火与寒风交织咆哮，火星直冲夜空。"


translate chinese event_dref_common_d2d022d8:


    "某个庞然大物从暴风雪中掠过。"


translate chinese event_dref_common_873a90c5:


    "一阵疾风掀飞奥利娅的帽子，我没敢回头去看。"


translate chinese event_dref_common_c00e503b:


    "我们跃过倒塌的电线杆。"


translate chinese event_dref_common_5565a5e4:


    "冰霜如蜂群刺痛脸颊，"


translate chinese event_dref_common_d65fa917:


    "肺叶几近炸裂。"


translate chinese event_monsters_dog_roma_d291f5aa:


    "我放缓脚步喘息，就在那一刻，奥利娅摔倒在地。"


translate chinese event_monsters_dog_roma_add07e5f:


    "她的小手从我掌心滑脱。"


translate chinese event_monsters_dog_roma_b8a57655:


    "紧接着波琳娜发出尖叫。"


translate chinese event_monsters_dog_roma_bf28beeb:


    "两个女孩在雪地里挣扎，仿佛陷入泥沼。"


translate chinese event_monsters_dog_roma_010e9a21:


    "这片旷野站在怪物那边。"


translate chinese event_monsters_dog_roma_1937b2eb:


    "波琳娜陷至腰际，奥利娅已没到肩膀。"


translate chinese event_monsters_dog_roma_005c161c:


    "每次挣扎都让她们下陷更深。"


translate chinese event_monsters_dog_roma_beca98f8:


    "我僵立原地，恐惧地注视着那些丑恶身影齐刷刷转身。"


translate chinese event_monsters_dog_roma_22cfd1fa:


    "它们立即全力扑来，四肢刨开积雪。"


translate chinese event_monsters_dog_roma_af78b7a1:


    "我看见饥饿的颚骨啃食着扭曲的树桩、田鼠丘和我们留下的足迹。"


translate chinese event_monsters_dog_roma_61ada222:


    "片刻的犹豫就会让无尽长夜将我们永远锁入死亡怀抱。"


translate chinese event_monsters_dog_roma_2bfcc4f6:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/64 Tos.ogg"
    Oly "托沙，救救我——！"


translate chinese event_monsters_dog_roma_c6de30e5:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/37 An.ogg"
    Pol "安东，别丢下我！"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_special_6477ff1c:


    "令人心碎的嗥叫越来越近。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_special_c04fc727:


    "突然，我的腿被树根缠住。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_special_01cd0c73:


    "剧痛从脚底窜上。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_special_449c348e:


    "明知在劫难逃，我却故作镇定。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_special_0e3fb822:


    "一步，又一步。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_special_de030d5a:


    "扭伤的脚踝向大脑发射着疼痛信号。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_special_177a3267:


    "奥利娅终究也回头望去，发出恐惧的呜咽。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_special_f288df8e:


    "我不敢想象她看见了什么。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_special_31a11251:


    "树木从黑暗中显现。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_special_86d92175:


    "林间小径在树桩与根须间蜿蜒。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_special_85e059b0:


    "这里就是我们的葬身之地。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_special_f728d07e:


    "妹妹突然变得沉重无比。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_special_03d39039:


    "肺叶抗拒着这种折磨。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_special_07c36276:


    "我们再也跑不动，只能蹒跚前行。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_special_bc471dce:


    "波琳娜绝望地喃喃自语。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_1f55c296:


    "树木从我们身旁飞掠而过，化作一堆冰刺。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_bd86dec0:


    "枝条扭曲如邪恶猫头鹰的利爪，试图用它们弯曲的獠牙刺瞎我们。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_20dc5149:


    "奥利娅的手像抹了油般从我掌心滑脱。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_c0eca2dc:


    "林间小径很快到了尽头。我们置身于高耸的雪堆之中。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_43fbcc40:


    "我们的鞋底不断踩碎雪壳，陷入雪中。我们不得不把膝盖抬得很高。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_9e555d32:


    "我的肌肉痉挛。我们喘不过气。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_43bd14fd:


    "但追赶我们的东西不知疲倦。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_1050abb3:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/20 ya.ogg"
    Oly "我坚持不住了。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_22708c63:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/261 Mi.ogg"
    Ant "我们必须坚持！"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_9b41e2d0:


    "话刚出口，我自己也因筋疲力尽而脸朝下摔倒。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_20748dee:


    "丛林永恒的寒意灼烧着我的脸。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_1b787926:


    "疼痛和恐惧让泪水从眼中迸出，瞬间在脸颊上冻结。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_a4270a68:


    "波琳娜瘫坐身旁，呼吸凌乱地凝视黑暗。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_2a01394b:


    "我想保护她，但我所能做的只是向她伸出我无力的手。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_8b6a39e6:


    "绝望中抓住脑海里闪现的一个念头，我掏出从家里抢救出来的黑十字架。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_5b11a86c:


    "它很旧，看起来平平无奇，但我强迫自己想象它是对抗邪恶的武器，就像电影《驱魔人》里那样。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_9aa8191f:


    "一直落在后面的波琳娜突然冲过我身边。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_4016fccf:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/200 B.ogg"
    Pol "快停下！它们来了。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_a644cd49:


    "阴影包围了我们，化身为动物的形态，化身为黑暗森林里那场恶心的狂欢。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_8c5b5582:


    "明显喘不过气的波琳娜停住脚步，惊讶地看着我。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_d7ae154a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/201 Et.ogg"
    Pol "这没用…我们会死在这里的……"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_2fa7d829:


    "我想起祖母的葬礼。她的童话。那个守护家宅的十字架。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_ae0ea94c:


    "从没有狼进过我的家。那只是梦。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_d7da1bcf:


    "或者……"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_2_3cedca58:


    "我扔下斧头，将奶奶的十字架推向黑暗。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_2_0cf9a487:


    "波琳娜惊恐而困惑地盯着我。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_2_ecdc8931:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/263 Pr.ogg"
    Ant "退下！"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_2_dee30937:


    "黑暗嘲弄地鸣叫。阴影爬得更近。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_2_56413235:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/264 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "我命令你！"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_2_a480f8b6:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/202 bro.ogg" 
    Pol "算了吧！我们得离开这儿！"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_2_4266a95f:


    "波琳娜的声音充满绝望和恼怒。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_2_16fe1f12:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/203 os.ogg" 
    Pol "你没看见吗？这没用！我不想死……"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_2_1837f05c:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/21 Ya.ogg"
    Oly "我也不想……"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_2_b808d942:


    "奥莉娅碰了碰我，恳求我跟她一起跑。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_b2c13ac2:


    "我们跑不了了……没时间了……"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_d95123e8:


    "我需要帮助，需要某种对抗怪物的超自然力量。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_f13eee66:


    "我紧闭双眼，想象我的奶奶，背对着我站在圣像下的角落里。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_3a39c49f:


    "咒语！她教过孙子如何防备那些潜伏在黑夜里的东西。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_68194437:


    "我干裂的嘴唇张开。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_f98103c1:


    "这很愚蠢，但是……"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_5d923444:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/265 Na.ogg"
    Ant "在布扬岛上，在瑕疵的太阳下，在蔚蓝的海中，立着一座木屋……"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_b957b4af:


    "接下来是什么？"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_621cacdb:


    "波琳娜难以置信地看着我。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_d2db0968:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/266 V.ogg"
    Ant "那里放着猪油和灰白的头发。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_f41e3be4:


    "每念出一个词，我都仿佛从冻土上抬起，头仰得越来越高。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_080bdde5:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/267 V.ogg"
    Ant "让魔鬼巢穴的子孙饱食，并永远放过神忠实的仆人安东。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_155538fa:


    "我没理会惊呆的朋友，几乎尖叫着完成了咒语。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_85c85d52:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/268 B.ogg"
    Ant "邪恶必须离开此屋！"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_4fb9fd81:


    "奥莉娅也在那一刻尖叫起来。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_61454c61:


    "由黑暗本身编织而成的可怖猫头鹰爪子，将我妹妹拖入了雪渊。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_e0f803d9:


    "波琳娜试图抓住她，但奥莉娅就这么消失了。眨眼间便无影无踪。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_71eb7dbd:


    voice "voice/anton/5day/08 Vd.ogg"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_a848ca7a:


    "这不是真的。只是我的头脑在捉弄我。只是我疯了。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_3d7b6f2b:


    "我的奥莉娅活得好好的，她和妈妈爸爸在房间里……绝不可能在这冰封的夜晚中央。死了。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_10b9b3f8:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/204 ant.ogg" 
    Pol "安东！奥莉娅死了。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_6bc3e3d0:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/13 hnik.ogg"
    "一滴眼泪滑过我的脸颊。我什么都不在乎了。不在乎我的精疲力竭，也不在乎逼近的死亡。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_d3acea65:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/269 ne.ogg"
    Ant "不，不，不……这一切都不是真的！"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_6dbee9c3:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/270 Ol.ogg"
    Ant "奥莉娅还活着，他们只是想吓唬我们。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_7fe1d707:


    "我不得不承认这是我的错。我的计划失败了。奥莉娅死了。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_3d2aa244:


    "我得逃跑。救我自己。去叫妈妈。告诉她奥莉娅那迷人的光芒已经熄灭……"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_182bf39a:


    "……或者继续相信奇迹。念完咒语的最后一句。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_c978fd9b:


    "波琳娜在我附近某个地方倒下，因歇斯底里的尖叫而窒息。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_cross_3_e4f9b99e:


    "这黑暗无可救赎。但我必须做出决定。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_3d735a73:


    "我滑下斜坡，随即一个绳套勒住了我的脖子，打断了惊慌失措的逃亡。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_9d1bd76d:


    "由于这突如其来的停顿，奥莉娅撞上我摔进雪里，而我则悬在离地几厘米的半空。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_3eeb9f9b:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/262 kr.ogg"
    "那根扭曲丑陋的树枝用波琳娜护身符的绳子将我吊起，如同绞刑架上的人。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_1642a001:


    "斧头从我手中掉落，陷进雪中。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_32ddf3f2:


    "是这邪恶的护身符自己为我设下的陷阱吗？"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_941e008b:


    "我试图扯掉它，抓挠脖子直到出血。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_d032f338:


    "但感觉树枝却将我越拉越高，直向树顶而去。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_5ee7699f:


    "我在空中挣扎，试图引体向上，将手指挤进脖子和绳索之间……"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_af4af5e2:


    "……但只是徒劳。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_5fa4961e:


    "脚下的雪不断崩塌。一声长长的呻吟从我唇边逸出。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_33b1aef8:


    "身体仍在摆动，我奋力扭动了几下，但那树枝纹丝不动。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_a75fcbd4:


    "灼热的空气即将耗尽。我的视线逐渐变暗……"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_304865e6:


    "但就在这时，波琳娜赶到我身边，用整个身体推了我一把。带子深深勒进皮肤，挤压着我的喉咙。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_a9fabff9:


    "树枝断裂，终于将我们抛下。正好落进嚎啕大哭的奥莉娅怀里。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_7615ecba:


    "护身符松开了它那带刺绳线的抓握，从我身上滑脱，留在了断枝末端。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_11f6748f:


    "这被诅咒的礼物真的想杀我吗？还是它在试图警告我？"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_04a293c7:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/233 Sk.ogg" 
    Pol "快走！它们很近了。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_b87f800e:


    "拉小提琴的女孩冲向密林更深处，而我则拼命试图站起来，哭泣的奥莉娅是我的支撑。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_e27f15fd:


    "兽爪在断枝上继续摇晃，仿佛在请求我使用它。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_6fc28d4e:


    "追猎的声音催生了关于我即将快速死亡的恶心念头。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_676bfe7b:


    "这个护身符能救我吗？"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_2f7a6301:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/26 To.ogg"
    Oly "托沙，我害……害怕……"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_4de3167f:


    "它能拯救我那已死妹妹的生命吗？"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_47eaf14e:


    "我转过身。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_b0cd796a:


    "包围者在几步之外停下，缓缓将我们围住，他们邪恶的笑声在黑暗的森林中回荡。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_8ccd60b1:


    "我知道，只要它们愿意，这些活生生的噩梦随时都能抓住我们。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_77afe596:


    "但它们并不着急，仿佛这只是一场猫鼠游戏。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_0baaae17:


    "我们徒劳的自救尝试、我们不断增长的恐慌和即将到来的绝望，让它们感到有趣。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_10017e9e:


    "如果它们不会触碰护身符的主人呢？"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_85fbb826:


    "要么我们接受游戏规则，继续逃跑，明知最终仍会被抓住……"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_94f1f7db:


    "……我再次瞥了一眼在风中摇晃的邪恶法器……"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_9629c7c5:


    "……或者我们中该有人相信这件萨满教的玩意儿。"


translate chinese event_monsters_polina_amulet_eb513222:


    "而另一个，大概会死。"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_olya_646b0d02:


    "我扔下斧头，跪倒在地，麻木的手指紧紧抓住奥莉娅的衣领。"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_olya_485f3045:


    "一步踏错，我的靴子就会陷入积雪覆盖的坑洞。"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_olya_34369d3c:


    "那就没人能救我妹妹了。"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_olya_ba9ec7eb:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/184.der.ogg"
    Ant "抓紧了，奥莉娅！"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_olya_84d3ffbf:


    "罗姆卡冲向波琳娜，抓住她的腋下，用尽全力试图把她拉出来。"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_olya_492f5292:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/266 ya.ogg" 
    Rom "我在这儿！"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_olya_a8c2173f:


    "野兽们朝我们冲来，身后是狂怒的火焰，它们的影子如同巨大的地毯覆盖着地面。"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_olya_21613bd0:


    "女孩们在雪坑中尖叫、扭动。"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_olya_cf53ab0e:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/33 br.ogg"
    "{b}‘丢下她，快跑，’{/b} 我脑海里的声音低语。{b}‘快跑，长耳朵的，快逃！’{/b}"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_olya_f88a2174:


    "我一边尖叫一边把奥莉娅拉了出来。同时，罗姆卡也扶起了波琳娜。"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_olya_d1744ccb:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/65 Pro.ogg"
    Oly "对不起。我答应过要想着覆盆子的……"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_olya_17244b77:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/186.Niche.ogg"
    Ant "没关系，亲爱的。"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_olya_90d89232:


    "兽群正在逼近。我能看到它们饥饿眼睛里的闪光。"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_olya_ede300f9:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/303 bir.ogg" 
    Rom "快！拿上斧头跑！"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_olya_8cede4a5:


    "狂风愤怒地抽打着我们的脊背。"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_olya_6477ff1c:


    "令人心碎的嗥叫越来越近。"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_polina_7ab37cf0:


    "我扔下斧头，跪倒在地，麻木的手指紧紧抓住波琳娜的衣袖。"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_polina_cc9320b5:


    "一步踏错，我的靴子就会陷入积雪覆盖的坑洞。"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_polina_7ecbfe4e:


    "那就没人能救我朋友了。"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_polina_31750585:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/188.De.ogg"
    Ant "抓紧了，波琳娜！"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_polina_76c70620:


    "我拼命拉扯波琳娜的外套，但感觉她似乎轻了一半。"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_polina_642892f1:


    "直到这时我才注意到，罗姆卡在她身后，正把她往上推。"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_polina_5257b746:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/266 ya2.ogg" 
    Rom "我在这儿！"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_polina_a93a1dcf:


    "可是，那谁来救我妹妹？"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_polina_3719bc86:


    "我听到奥莉娅的尖叫时，这个可怕的念头才追上我。"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_polina_493ef77f:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/35 To.ogg"
    Oly "托————沙————！！！"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_polina_958d449a:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/190.Olya.ogg"
    Ant "奥利娅！"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_polina_c0896c68:


    "饥饿的阴影将她拽出雪坑拖进浓稠黑暗，随后传来咀嚼与碎裂的声响。"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_polina_46c6e3d9:


    "这个选择让我亲手杀死了妹妹，背叛了父母的托付。"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_polina_555c76dd:


    "我亲手掐灭了全家重获幸福的最后希望。"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_polina_581b0f8b:


    "罗姆卡拉出波琳娜，猛拽我的肩膀。"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_polina_f8594fad:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/267 be.ogg" 
    Rom "快跑！不能停下！"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_polina_145681d8:


    "泪水在脸颊凝结成冰。"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_polina_f97bcb7b:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/Vshlip.ogg"
    "双腿拒绝移动，但心底的声音在低语：“不能迟疑，否则她的牺牲就白费了！”"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_polina_949cbea2:


    "我拾起斧头。"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_polina_5b28611e:


    "任由那个声音指引我。"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_polina_8cede4a5:


    "狂风愤怒地抽打着我们的脊背。"


translate chinese event_runaway_girlstrapped_roma_polina_6477ff1c:


    "令人心碎的嗥叫越来越近。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_c04fc727:


    "突然，我的腿被树根缠住。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_01cd0c73:


    "剧痛从脚底窜上。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_449c348e:


    "明知在劫难逃，我却故作镇定。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_0e3fb822:


    "一步，又一步。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_c269f8f8:


    "扭伤的脚踝向大脑发射着疼痛信号。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_df0ed33c:


    "波琳娜回过头，发出惊恐的呻吟。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_177a3267:


    "奥利娅终究也回头望去，发出恐惧的呜咽。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_f288df8e:


    "我不敢想象她看见了什么。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_31a11251:


    "树木从黑暗中显现。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_86d92175:


    "林间小径在树桩与根须间蜿蜒。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_85e059b0:


    "这里就是我们的葬身之地。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_f728d07e:


    "妹妹突然变得沉重无比。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_03d39039:


    "肺叶抗拒着这种折磨。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_07c36276:


    "我们再也跑不动，只能蹒跚前行。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_bc471dce:


    "波琳娜绝望地喃喃自语。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_e959a303:


    "我喘着粗气站起身。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_743bc68a:


    "一排排树木的阴影之间，亮起一对发光的眼睛。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_7025960d:


    "它们正以疯狂的速度逼近。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_e639f974:


    "另外三对眼睛追着我们，越来越近，越来越大。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_25f431a2:


    "另外两对眼睛追着我们，越来越近，越来越大。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_f1867c4a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/43 mi.ogg"
    Pol "我们被包围了！"


translate chinese event_police_devend_9614d495:


    "我双手紧握斧头，准备血战到底。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_af39dca6:


    "罗姆卡迟疑片刻。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_aa9d49e6:


    "他站在一旁，仿佛在衡量是否该为我们冒险。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_09383894:


    "他的目光在我与黑暗中跳跃的眼睛间游移，最终定格在波琳娜身上，低声咒骂着掏出小刀。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_6e494d85:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/269 Nu.ogg"
    Rom "看来到此为止了，是吧？"


translate chinese event_police_devend_ec96a11a:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/270 Po.ogg" 
    Rom "波琳娜，托哈，对不起我没能……"


translate chinese event_police_devend_8f08b63a:


    "他吸了吸鼻子。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_752ebaa9:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/235 Ro.ogg" 
    Pol "罗曼，我好怕！"


translate chinese event_police_devend_c62c5470:


    "他的目光在我和奥利娅之间游移，最终定格在波琳娜身上，低声咒骂着掏出小刀。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_53989bf3:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/269 Nu.ogg"
    Rom "看来到此为止了，是吧？"


translate chinese event_police_devend_2b5ad8ff:


    "这时强光刺得我们睁不开眼。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_6e1fb72e:


    "我举斧遮脸，随即意识到那是辆颠簸驶来的汽车头灯。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_626a476a:


    "是警车。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_d30dad2b:


    "乌阿斯牌越野车猛冲到我面前。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_55cb54d4:


    "司机急刹的同时推开车门——"


translate chinese event_police_devend_22d2eea0:


    "是吉洪诺夫。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_c0abb027:


    "他不敢置信地瞪着我们。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_fc7b8cc3:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/195.Oni.ogg"
    Ant "它们来了！杀手来了！"


translate chinese event_police_devend_00fb92b3:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/63 V.ogg"
    Tikhonov "快上车！立刻！"


translate chinese event_police_devend_716f9e4c:


    "车灯与黑暗洪流激烈搏斗。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_7ef1b34a:


    "我护着波琳娜先上车，让罗姆卡紧随其后。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_bbf266b5:


    "我护着波琳娜先上车，让罗姆卡紧随其后。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_fd4df666:


    "灌木丛后，红灯微微闪烁。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_4f3ff8ca:


    "那些歪斜如巫婆的树木俯视着乌阿斯车。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_81ffe574:


    "我最后爬上车，猛力关紧车门。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_189c0786:


    "与此同时，有东西扑上了侧窗。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_4c709bc2:


