translate chinese event_police_devend_ec97b288:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/196.Gonite.ogg"
    Ant "全速前进！"


translate chinese event_police_devend_52bcf3ae:


    "警督猛踩油门，轮胎溅起漫天雪沫。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_3234e4b1:


    "一旦陷车，我们就会被撕成碎片。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_cf6b8897:


    "污秽的亡兽在灯光光束中爬行。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_38a16a3d:


