translate chinese event_police_devend_932fbfd0:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/199.Tak.ogg"
    Ant "碾过去！干掉它们！"


translate chinese event_police_devend_33fad008:


    "吉洪诺夫二话不说猛打方向盘，沿林线飞驰。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_c79e0530:


    "时速表指针向右甩动。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_18c9e54b:


    "发动机发出健康的轰鸣。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_81c687b0:


