translate chinese event_police_devend_1380f300:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/Yavzdrognuliostanovils.ogg"
    "我回头望去，顿时失语——"


translate chinese event_police_devend_06e28a08:


    "距我仅几英寸处是张蛆虫蠕动的熊脸。"


