translate chinese event_police_devend_c3c8fa9d:


    "斧头从屋顶上弹开，在空中划出一道弧线，深深陷进了我和警察中间的地板里。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_e0891ecd:


    "紧接着一声巨响。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_a0d14511:


    "乌阿斯车戛然而止。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_a15ea720:


