translate chinese event_police_devend_bd7a5ad3:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/67 Cho.ogg"
    Tikhonov "该死！真他妈该死！"


translate chinese event_police_devend_f20a6be9:


    "吉洪诺夫猛拧点火开关。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_c5869d04:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/68 Dol.ogg"
    Tikhonov "这破玩意儿！"


translate chinese event_police_devend_055df6af:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/69 Dvig.ogg"
    Tikhonov "发动机熄火了！"


translate chinese event_police_devend_1988e08a:


    "他懊恼地捶打方向盘。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_cf3117a8:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/70 Vse.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你们没事吧？"


translate chinese event_police_devend_554bb22b:


    "罗姆卡从牙缝里挤出回答："


translate chinese event_police_devend_62cbb74a:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/274 Tse.ogg" 
    Rom "还行。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_97523b1a:


    "波琳娜带着哭腔说："


translate chinese event_police_devend_c65145ff:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/236 da.ogg" 
    Pol "没…没事。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_5de3c75b:


    "我摸索着啜泣的妹妹。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_2ee98ef8:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/203.Bolno.ogg"
    Ant "受伤了吗？"


translate chinese event_police_devend_d5e7d8fe:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/68 Zab.ogg"
    Oly "带我离开这里！"


translate chinese event_police_devend_914340a7:


    "滚烫的泪水滑过她沾满污渍的脸颊。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_3cfb11ae:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/204.Zaberu.ogg"
    Ant "我发誓一定做到。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_e1d68ede:


    "吉洪诺夫放弃点火，抬头望向前方。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_d3132dce:


    "车灯照亮了花岗岩墓碑与扭曲的十字架。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_5f3a3a3f:


    "墓地。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_9252c4b2:


    "我们闯进了村庄墓园。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_56c4512d:


    "我想起曾掠过这些坟茔的摄像机，想起雪地里染血的碎布。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_f964777b:


    "过去一周的事件化作恐怖影像在眼前流转。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_1dc3d9f4:


    "奥利娅不在了。奥利娅死了。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_4e86b8ea:


    "我想起她曾绽放的笑容——那是我发誓用全世界的糖果都不愿交换的珍宝。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_28927815:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/80 Voz.ogg"
    Oly "快回家呀，哥哥！"


translate chinese event_police_devend_31dff78d:


