translate chinese event_police_devend_b8cdc727:


    "我痛苦地紧闭双眼。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_f987cd1c:


    "有人摇晃着我，拍打我的脸颊，仿佛我正昏睡在雪地里。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_947aa6db:


    "我茫然地望着罗姆卡。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_9d2da3bd:


    "他的巴掌让我清醒过来。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_a9253b4b:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/275 Ti.ogg"
    Rom "你怎么了，托什克？"


translate chinese event_police_devend_963a96aa:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/276 Ko.ogg"
