translate chinese event_police_devend_7603a68f:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/205.Poche.ogg"
    Ant "那我们为什么没救下奥利娅？"


translate chinese event_police_devend_b7572341:


    "罗曼愧疚地后仰，随即用力把我拽得额头相抵。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_6b6e49ec:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/277 pro.ogg"
    Rom "对不起，兄弟。只是当时……"


translate chinese event_police_devend_277f1838:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/278 val.ogg" 
    Rom "我们必须离开这里。它们快追上了，托哈。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_6a38256e:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/279 Vs.ogg" 
    Rom "站起来。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_3147e019:


    "长眠于此的祖母可曾知晓，在她那些失效的咒语之外，松林间潜藏着怎样的邪恶？"


translate chinese event_police_devend_1b33929a:


    "冻土之下，祖母得以远离这场疯狂。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_2b9727f1:


