translate chinese event_police_devend_374f2251:


    "我用靴子抵住座椅，紧握把手，像从死去的巨人嘴里拔牙一样，拔出了那把斧头。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_ede13bdd:


    "我们从变形的车厢里爬出来。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_56b0c591:


    "警灯有节奏地扫过墓碑，四周布满蠕动的阴影。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_f2ca1628:


    "我知道有些阴影是活的，饥饿的，带着利齿。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_99a5efe3:


    "比如在歪斜树篱后闪过的那道。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_ea5ea95a:


    "我踉跄着走向警官。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_2cec4906:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/275 Oni.ogg"
    Ant "它们来了。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_65e32dcd:


    "吉洪诺夫没有回答。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_51e5b7f6:


    "我怔怔看着他解下带折叠枪托的步枪——"


translate chinese event_police_devend_0a1ac59b:


    "第一次如此近距离看到传说中的'卡拉什尼科夫'。"


translate chinese event_police_devend_373c55a8:


    "警督流畅地上好膛，机械的咔嗒声令我浑身一颤。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_66816406:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/73 Raz.ogg"
    Tikhonov "小场面。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_27aa0e80:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/74 E.ogg"
    Tikhonov "比这更大的阵仗我都见过。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_1d624310:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/235. Vi.ogg"
    Ant "您不明白。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_648e1d62:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/235.Eto.ogg"
    Ant "这根本不是拿着屠刀的连环杀手。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_2322252c:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/236.Oni.ogg"
    Ant "它们不是人类，是戴面具的怪物！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_a721b27b:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/52 Vm.ogg"
    Tikhonov "戴面具的什么……？"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_7fa5e55c:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/53 Ne.ogg"
    Tikhonov "不可能！那都是梦……"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_ad5e9176:


    "阴影中响起笛声。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_c2e303fe:


    "仿佛有开关在吉洪诺夫脑中啪嗒翻转。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_1239eca2:


    "他僵立原地，嘴巴微张，目光空洞地凝视虚空。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_de8a1fd1:


    "他怎么了？吓傻了吗？"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_54625455:


    "步枪在背带上无力晃动。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_147ac878:


    "这位警官像是突然中风了——我在百科全书里读过相关症状。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_1d3cad8f:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/237.Ko.ogg"
    Ant "康斯坦丁·弗拉基米罗维奇？"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_77e01814:


    "此刻的吉洪诺夫比十字架间的黑暗更令我恐惧。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_a602f918:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/13 krik.ogg"
    "波琳娜尖叫着缩进罗姆卡怀里。留在车里的奥利娅紧紧捂住耳朵。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_760d2a5a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/13 krik.ogg"
    "波琳娜尖叫着缩进罗姆卡怀里。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_91125453:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/45 sl.ogg" 
    Pol "听见了吗？在那边！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_45bfc0e1:


    "暴风雪掀起雪幕，露出林立十字架的荒凉景致。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_2f01b8c0:


    "戴山羊面具的高瘦身影矗立在两座坟墓之间。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_8aadef96:


    "蓬松的猫头鹰立在右侧。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_2487c95e:


    "舞动的熊怪守在左边。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_66d7100c:


    "它们在车灯下宛如恶魔现世。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_e5e88b9b:


    "山羊张开双臂，掌心朝向我和警察，还有我的朋友。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_20699115:


    "可怖怪物的姿态竟透着诡异的优雅。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_9fddd253:


    "他如同古老墓园里的雕像一般，俯视着那一堆十字架。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_470189b4:


    "雪花黏附在破旧的熊形与猫头鹰面具上。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_a1e606c8:


    "他蛊惑的嗓音几乎被风声淹没，却又比狂风更清晰地叩击耳膜："


translate chinese event_battle_devend_e20b77c7:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/04 st.ogg" 
    Master "这片土地埋葬了太多亡魂……"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_1c624635:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/05 be.ogg"
    Master "无尽的死亡。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_39954c4c:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/06 Po.ogg" 
    Master "土壤已冻入骨髓。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_589f3802:



    voice "voice/Owl/01 Igr.ogg" 
    Owl "文字游戏。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_e6887021:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/Vr.ogg"
    Bear "该玩耍取乐了！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_43d82577:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/07 ts.ogg" 
    Master "肃静！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_e7f6f3ab:


    "熊怪用爪子捂住面具下半部。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_b206c242:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/08 De.ogg"
    Master "孩子们…可怜的羔羊们。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_44198ef7:


    "高瘦身影散发着极地寒意。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_698d0d1e:


    "山羊用修长的手指指向我。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_b82bd408:


    "尽管相隔甚远，我却觉得怪物的指甲已刺入我的腹部——不，是刺穿了灵魂。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_327e9dc7:


    "他的手向右滑动。山羊以一个优雅的手势，在空中划出一道弧线，指向波琳娜和罗姆卡。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_83aa1dc6:


    "他的手臂滑向右侧，优雅的弧线将车里的奥利娅也囊括其中。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_ee05170b:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/09 Ot.ogg" 
    Master "异教徒。渺小的叛徒们。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_6c8b3c8e:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/10 Po.ogg" 
    Master "看看你们自己。恐惧让你们颤抖，而你们本可成为散播恐惧之人。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_2b3a9238:


    "张开的手指猛然攥成拳头。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_acbc4421:


    "我瞥向吉洪诺夫，在心底对他呐喊。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_cd36bbbc:


    "别愣着！你是成年人！你有枪！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_89c8a6d7:


    "但吉洪诺夫似乎也变成了恐惧中的孩子。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_b5ed08ab:


    "他苍白的脸上写满沉重思虑，仿佛在努力回忆某件重要的事。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_1e8017d4:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/11 Ya.ogg" 
    Master "你们已无价值。无用的孩子们。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_9c882ed3:


    "首领的声音扭曲，充满嘲弄。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_f3dffc83:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/12 St.ogg"
    Master "狼群即将集结完毕。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_77ebcfa6:


    "骨笛发出鞭子般的呼啸。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_e852cda7:


    "孩童的轮廓瞬间扭曲成畸变的野兽，四周响起骨骼错位与痛苦哀鸣。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_b204fee1:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/13 Mo.ogg" 
    Master "我的小玩偶…饥饿的幼崽们…"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_9c125cbd:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/14 U.ogg" 
    Master "你们本可拥有一切。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_78945712:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/15 Si.ogg" 
    Master "力量，自由，权能……成为黑树梢间的疾风。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_d1624aae:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/17 Te.ogg" 
    Master "降临皑皑白雪的黑暗。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_0e9e0535:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/16 V.ogg" 
    Master "你们本可跃向星辰品尝其滋味……"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_efad035a:


    "我吞咽着，飞快瞥了眼警车里的小小身影。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_1cf49ed0:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/18 A.ogg" 
    Master "安东……"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_97c4e4e4:


    "我本能地踉跄后退。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_7c796acf:


    "当山羊念出我名字时，他口中涎液横流。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_01f211f5:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/19 T.ogg" 
    Master "你本可成为新的兔子，与古老针叶林的其他野兽一同在阴影中潜行。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_be8f1784:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/20 S.ogg" 
    Master "你浪费了机会。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_1e07ec66:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/21 T.ogg"
    Master "现在你们只是祭品，葬礼的甜点。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_033108c6:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/22 S.ogg"
    Master "真正的兔子将在你们的滋养中诞生。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_8cb3d2f2:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/44 ne.ogg"
    "{b}“不！”{/b}——某种异物在我体内搏动，{b}“我才是兔子，我是狡黠饥饿的野兽，主人！”{/b}"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_cb2369e0:


    "我咬破下唇，咸腥的血味弥漫口腔。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_b4b4b77b:


    "这片森林植入我们体内的，犹如智能的肿瘤。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_17edd3d7:


    "我的朋友们，我的奥利娅，是否也感受着同样的悸动？"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_aaa429be:


    "我看见波琳娜颤抖的唇瓣，看见罗姆卡恐惧的扭曲表情下深藏的怨怼。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_d9db9b7b:


    "他们无疑都染上了这恶魔的疫病。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_1bbc8e18:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/23 Es.ogg" 
    Master "真正的兔子将吞噬赝品，跃向月轮。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_acde6a47:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/24 Es.ogg" 
    Master "真正的兔子将吞噬姐弟，跃向月轮。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_56131a23:


    "山羊打了个嗝。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_c08d1c66:


    "尽管相隔甚远，我们却被腐殖土的恶臭笼罩。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_6970981f:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/25 be.ogg" 
    Master "鼓鼓掌吧！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_5faacb37:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/27 Te.ogg" 
    Master "狼群再度拥有了自己的兔子。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_ef02ffbb:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/28 Es.ogg"
    Master "来自上一代的兔子。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_6116f046:



    voice "voice/Owl/02 Na.ogg" 
    Owl "我们崭新的老朋友！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_11c7ce36:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/Na.ogg"
    Bear "希望她还记得怎么玩耍！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_ca24fc84:


    "山羊从袖中抽出一支胫骨制成的细长笛子。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_89e45e96:


    "蹒跚的怪物将乐器凑近唇边。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_b477c296:


    "新的哀嚎声融入狂风呼啸。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_69de2b3e:


    "先是刺骨的尖啸，接着是震齿的低鸣，如同冻原苏醒的嗥叫。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_40d69007:


    "仿佛某个异质的存在——饥饿与死亡之神——在永冬的严寒中发出声音。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_817a9191:


    "山羊、熊怪和猫头鹰齐刷刷转向墓园边缘歪斜的树林。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_dfe91c4a:


    "我不想看。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_be16d90f:


    "我只想抓住吉洪诺夫，质问他为何毫无作为。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_316cadd0:


    "警察望向森林。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_f7830b09:


    "波琳娜和罗姆卡也是。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_9d34710f:


    "我转过身，牙齿因恐惧与寒冷格格作响。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_8e9649b0:


    "一道纤瘦的身影从黑暗树干后走出。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_dc07794d:


    "那是个成年女性。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_7ab8fa12:


    "破碎的兔形面具覆盖全脸。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_502cd38f:


    "我见过她吗？她的步态…肩颈的姿态…"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_3e654ff8:


    "我认识她吗？"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_9285fb0c:


    "我竭力回忆，答案却始终溜走。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_24528ca2:


    "奥利娅将手掌按在结霜的车窗上，扭头追踪兔子的行动。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_0b541636:


    "狂风撕扯着埋在雪中的葬礼花环缎带，剥落墓碑的漆皮。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_c497045c:


    "她甚至没看我们一眼，径自滑行在生锈的铁十字架与焦黑木桩之间。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_f18998a5:


    "仿佛音乐是提线，而这女人是傀儡。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_5e701d9a:


    "猫头鹰与熊怪敬畏地低下头。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_349d15dc:


    "我看不见山羊面具下的嘴，但能感觉到这群首领正对新兔子露出慈父般的微笑。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_42ae6919:


    "她停在怪物面前，那似曾相识的姿态让我苦苦思索。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_9b8f13e5:


    "山羊唇离骨笛，旋律却随风继续奏响。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_85cebc75:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/29 W.ogg" 
    Master "小狼……"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_1d09ee55:


    "山羊面具眼缝里的目光直刺罗曼。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_51666324:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/58 Ya.ogg"
    Rom "我……？"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_2acf7414:


    "波琳娜抱住他，试图阻挡那穿透性的注视。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_d47224c4:


    "但这时我看见吉洪诺夫转向山羊。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_68f8afcd:


    "而山羊以更狂热的姿态吹奏起骨笛。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_2b16bef6:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/56 Ne.ogg"
    Tikhonov "不。是我。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_a323fe5e:


    "警官脸上的皱纹骤然舒展。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_a8ef0d41:


    "我以为音乐侵入了他的颅骨，麻痹了大脑。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_0cb52cee:


    "尽管可怕至极，这旋律对我和朋友们却未见效。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_cf1f69b9:


    "吉洪诺夫无用的枪口垂向雪地。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_66ec8bfd:


    "若非他双眼圆睁，我会以为他站着睡着了。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_98d5caf6:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/276 k.ogg"
    Ant "康斯坦丁·弗拉基米罗维奇……？"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_57a4e5db:


    "吉洪诺夫毫无反应。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_84d33fde:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/30 No.ogg"
    Master "这些雏儿不配承载黑暗。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_f3878770:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/31 Ti.ogg" 
    Master "你才是我的老狼，科斯佳。凶猛的野兽。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_4b374b5b:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/32 Kak.ogg" 
    Master "一如往昔。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_a7f06f07:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/57 Kog.ogg"
    Tikhonov "一如往昔……"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_e1412336:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/34 ka.ogg" 
    Master "一如永恒！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_c44b09a1:


    "山羊手中浮现狼形面具。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_1fb9fbed:


    "食肉动物的颚部张开，我拼命说服自己那只是皮革、纸板和毛皮。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_2ae8948d:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/35 V.ogg" 
    Master "这些年来你一直在寻找它，科斯佳。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_d429a8f2:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/36 Vot.ogg"
    Master "所以你去当了警察，对吧？"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_10c867d7:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/58 Ch.ogg"
    Tikhonov "我想知道童年时究竟发生了什么。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_cfa40883:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/37 Vo.ogg" 
    Master "你的记忆。我会归还。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_d56c9b5e:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/277 on.ogg"
    Ant "康斯坦丁·弗拉基米罗维奇！他在骗你！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_d40c596c:


    "我抓住吉洪诺夫的袖管。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_b174ccd7:


    "他就像被人戏谑地套上警服的稻草人。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_4615f7cb:


    "被音乐与面具催眠的吉洪诺夫听不见我。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_dcde6053:


    "泪水滑过我的脸颊。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_3766ee12:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/277 K.ogg"
    Ant "这是巫术……"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_c662efc4:


    "吉洪诺夫推开我向前走去，积雪在靴下碎裂。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_ddb0cd7d:


    "山羊耐心等待着，手指在笛孔间舞动。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_14637742:


    "枯枝在风中吱呀作响。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_908bb1d8:


    "吉洪诺夫走到新兔子面前，接过面具。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_c1020892:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/38 vs.ogg" 
