translate chinese event_battle_devend_20badb86:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/279 N.ogg"
    Ant "不要！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_8d0053da:


    "警官背对着我，看不见他的动作。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_de47a09b:


    "但当他转身时……"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_6e2087d0:


    "……狼吻取代了他的面容。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_5dce85e7:


    "面具严丝合缝，如同第二层皮肤。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_004d38a0:


    "猫头鹰与熊怪开始按节奏鼓掌。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_a08b1eb1:


    "山羊再度吹奏，这骇人的音调专为戴面具者而鸣。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_e756f392:


    "受笛声蛊惑，他们开始摇摆跺脚。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_21fd6792:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/39 Ah.ogg"
    Master "啊，美妙。恍如昨日。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_3115f3f0:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/60 oi.ogg"
    Tikhonov "哦您好！真是好久不见！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_fed7208a:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/001 Do.ogg" 
    Lady_Bunny "晚上好！您孩子们的面具真有趣！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_3b415379:


    "猫头鹰和熊怪受用地咕噜着。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_cdbe4faf:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/40 vo.ogg" 
    Master "相聚时光多珍贵，朋友们！庆典即将开始。没有点心怎算庆典？"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_a37bccea:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/26 ne.ogg"
    Master "莫要迟延。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_420e99c2:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/61 Y.ogg"
    Tikhonov "我很乐意，但还有事要处理。或许……"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_6e9fa2f0:


    "狼首领用指尖刺破冰壳，从雪中取出一只麻袋。褐色污渍弄脏了粗布。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_7bffefdc:


    "女人和吉洪诺夫摇晃着走向山羊，踮起脚尖因期待而颤抖。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_f291319f:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/42 ugo.ogg" 
    Master "宴席开始！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_28ea449a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/17 Ah.ogg" 
    "波琳娜倒吸凉气。若不是胃已掏空，我定会呕吐。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_ab079588:


    "人骨从袋中倾泻而出。有些陈旧发霉，有些还粘着粉红肌腱与冻结的脂肪块。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_36a98cb4:


    "一具完整的躯干，边缘挂着被啃食的猩红肉糜。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_3e3f22c4:


    "连着白皮肤的下颌骨。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_e83a4ecd:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/Sk.ogg"
    Bear "这么多巧克力！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_ca92cea2:



    voice "voice/Owl/03 N.ogg"
    Owl "希望没人对甜食过敏！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_89401bfc:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/Ut.ogg"
    Bear "受够了！根本没什么过敏！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_ea124b23:


    "成人们跪倒在地，恍惚地用手触碰人类残骸。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_bbcd099d:


    "猫头鹰检视着破碎头骨和脊椎\"尾巴\"，发出惊喜的叫喊。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_1c199145:



    voice "voice/Owl/04 Or.ogg" 
    Owl "坚果！太妃糖！糖霜！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_7a49e235:


    "吉洪诺夫难以从死肉上移开视线。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_6dc941f8:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/62 Mn.ogg"
    Tikhonov "我真的该走了……"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_d09df938:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/43 ui.ogg" 
    Master "你不想知道为何在密林中被发现？不想找回失去的记忆？"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_5897e439:


    "黄色的爪子探入祭品堆。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_c21c2e8f:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/44 vs.ogg"
    Master "全在这里了。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_65f193c6:


    "骸骨吞噬了吉洪诺夫的注意力。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_d8bc7f0e:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/45 ne.ogg" 
    Master "别光啃干粮，馋鬼们。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_e57ab90f:


    "狼首领再次俯身，从雪堆里取出锈迹斑斑的保温壶。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_a1200f7c:


    "女人和警察手中凭空出现茶杯，蒸汽袅袅升起。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_275af721:


    "而我紧盯着熊怪——面具缝隙里燃烧着永不餍足的饥火。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_2479baf2:


    "他四肢扭曲，涎水从嘴角连绵不绝地淌下。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_76f62842:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/46 na.ogg"
    Master "尽情享用！饱餐一顿！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_0a299645:


    "女人发出咯咯轻笑。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_5bd7016e:


    "吉洪诺夫啜饮一口，犹豫片刻后伸手取肉。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_abdbd020:


    "这两人仿佛真不知怪物喂给他们的是什么。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_edaa1163:


    "墓园中的宴席成了令人血液冻结的景象。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_751a79a9:


    "我后退一步，阴影从背后掠过。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_aeb43bfa:


    "罗姆卡？不，他仍抱着波琳娜惊慌四顾。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_448f8c51:


    "我张嘴想再次呼唤吉洪诺夫，阴影在几步外飘忽。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_f49a4cdd:


    "猫头鹰扭动脖颈，喙部开合。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_5e5119d0:


    "我踉跄后退，不祥的轮廓在雾中消散，又出现在罗姆卡身后。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_6e1ef0f3:


    "猫头鹰盘旋着阻断退路。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_6eb71156:


    "每次呼吸间她都闪现眼前，发出咕呜与啄击声，毛茸茸的脸孔左右摇摆。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_675d7745:


    "当我被首领的爪牙分神时，吉洪诺夫将骨头塞进面具下，咀嚼着筋络。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_d0dcc411:


    "女人吸食骨髓，如同吮吸蛋奶冻。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_6ec4c981:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/13 Za.ogg"
    "波琳娜与我同时发出呻吟。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_a1d84df9:


    "吉洪诺夫从口中取出红色金属物。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_a7204ac1:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/239 et.ogg" 
    Pol "是卡嘉的发夹！绝对是！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_dfac5dd1:


    "如同音乐会第三幕开场，山羊仰头吹奏出又一段混沌乐章。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_0bc5972a:


    "身着警服的食人者猛地弯腰，身旁的女人如法炮制。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_3801427b:


    "他们像遭电击般抽搐，旋律将电流注入他们的躯体。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_6c0f464e:


    "异变正在发生……面具扭曲变形，不再仅是狂欢节装饰。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_7f499598:


    "它们化作真实的兽首，粗糙的兽舌舔过黄牙。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_10f9c2cf:


    "兔首女人……狼首男人……"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_55f60c96:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/64 da.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "对…就是这样…我开始想起来了…"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_0a034c97:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/65 mne.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "那时我…十二岁。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_4d2ef59c:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/49 Mne.ogg"
    Lady_Bunny "我……六岁。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_f156985e:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/66 m.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "我们跳舞跳跃。现在记清楚了。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_7d611b4d:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/67 no.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "但仪式失败了。起了大火。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_1809e7e5:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/50 Vse.ogg"
    Lady_Bunny "所有孩子都死了。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_331b8763:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/68 kr.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "除了我们。然后长角爸爸收走了面具。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_09905558:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/69 on.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "他把面具和记忆一起烧了。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_7214b6a2:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/47 nec.ogg" 
    Master "凡燃烧必有痕迹。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_c6855e44:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/48 v.ogg" 
    Master "你们回来了，我的孩子们。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_d00fb453:


    "猫头鹰张开喙部，黏稠唾液垂落。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_43f306b9:


    "熊怪高举双爪，像{u}不倒翁{/u}玩偶般摇晃。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_68bae45a:


    "吉洪诺夫仰头发出短促孤寂的嗥叫，风声与之呼应。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_e1bc2059:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/49 t.ogg" 
    Master "针叶林感知到狼群归来。即将完整。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_500cf748:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/50 ne.ogg"
    Master "只缺狐狸了。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_77e8bf8f:


    "我环顾四周寻找阿狸萨。他是在说那个神秘的狐狸朋友吧？"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_f9fcebe4:


    "阿狸萨会来救我们。只有她能对抗这嘶鸣的恶魔。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_e7aa0c87:


    "墓园积雪渐厚。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_d0540fb3:


    "罗曼护着波琳娜，却毫无英勇之态。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_8dd62f4a:


    "波琳娜从他肩后窥视，泪光闪烁。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_aefa1b41:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/51 bu.ogg" 
    Master "做个狡猾的小野兽吧，女孩。加入胜者一方。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_c059c080:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/52 E.ogg" 
    Master "届时我们将完成仪式。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_2a72431f:


    "我再度环顾，仍找不到阿狸萨的身影。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_c7e2c93d:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/Ri.ogg"
    Bear "仪式，仪式，仪式。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_74987cd4:



    voice "voice/Owl/05 Prig.ogg" 
    Owl "蹦蹦跳，蹦蹦跳。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_65850172:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/71 sz.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "他烧了我们的面具……"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_229dbe22:


    "吉洪诺夫垂下他那骇人地拉长的脸。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_a768d8e1:


    "狼吻中传出牙齿刮擦的声响。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_c11f6d51:


    "随后他转向首领。我震惊地听到被古老面具扭曲的笑声——"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_60d70bb3:


    "是的，吉洪诺夫在直面噩梦般的山羊时发出了笑声。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_31b2e63c:


    "紧接着，这位前警察的声带里迸发出令人血液冻结的低吼："


translate chinese event_battle_devend_e68a96ae:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/74 t.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "你疯-grrr-了，长-grrr-角的！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_b5fd81fe:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/75 ti.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "我学会对月长嚎时你就老朽不堪，现在更是彻底疯了。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_fffb0292:


    "如此不敬让猫头鹰和熊怪目瞪口呆。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_da76e3b5:


    "山羊叩击牙齿，对反叛者无言以对。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_f9d62c4b:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/76 tv.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "你的-grrr-时代结束了。狼群需要新主人。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_85121f08:


    "山羊摇晃犄角发出咩叫，终于找回语言，但声音颤抖："


translate chinese event_battle_devend_f6225e01:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/54 mo.ogg" 
    Master "我最忠实的狗！竟敢如此？"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_43e6e022:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/55 sa.ogg" 
    Master "我最虔诚的幼崽，还不明白吗？"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_e8c91063:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/56 Ya.ogg"
    Master "我不得不除掉你们！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_db667b44:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/77 t.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "你杀了我的兄-grrr-弟姐-grrr-妹。解散了旧狼群。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_bc00a822:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/57 Ver.ogg" 
    Master "没错。我杀了自己的骨肉，但谁帮我动的手？"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_8f353aa9:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/58 Ti.ogg" 
    Master "是你，科斯佳。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_9e89f190:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/59 En.ogg" 
    Master "否则他们早把我吃掉跃向月亮了。你选对了边。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_fee50207:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/60 Za.ogg"
    Master "为此我赐你自由。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_650df1dc:


    "山羊的手划过吉洪诺夫和沉默的女人。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_ed5f842a:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/78 os.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "自-grrr-由？不，你背-grrr-叛了我们。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_3f9553db:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/79 s.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "这些年来我在这肉躯牢笼里受苦……"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_7d770544:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/61 Ko.ogg" 
    Master "科斯佳……"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_030aab55:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/80 za.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "闭嘴，老东西。现在由我发言。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_03db074d:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/86 men.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "我们交换。你拿我的面具，我取你的犄角。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_e91d6108:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/87 Sim.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "权力的象征。我将成为饥兽的角主。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_3dfef865:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/62 Mo.ogg"
    Master "休想！！！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_a8793bf6:


    "首领用修长手指护住山羊面具。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_b5f2c261:


    "猫头鹰与熊怪冲至主人脚边，誓死捍卫。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_416de411:


    "兔女的毛发倒竖，她俯身贴地，对吉洪诺夫发出威胁的嘶声。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_40e45a68:


    "但他毫不在意敌众我寡。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_1309cc35:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/88 Eto.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "走着瞧吧，长角的蠢货。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_406a9770:


    "吉洪诺夫如同被面具操控般走向山羊。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_7576ddec:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/01 Sl.ogg"
    Master "多美味的祭品！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_11a2ca8b:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/82 derz.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "做梦，怪物！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_8bd2df67:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/83 nehoce.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "若你不愿好聚好散……"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_bd0979bb:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/84 naka.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "接着！吃这个！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_f36655a3:


    "AK步枪发出咆哮。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_2998538d:


    "一串子弹将对面三个身影打得千疮百孔。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_ae7f05b4:


    "弹无虚发，但兽群纹丝不动。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_157c61c6:


    "唯有羽毛与皮毛碎片在凛冽空气中与雪花共舞。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_11b7457f:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/02 Za.ogg"
    Master "可悲！还抓着人类玩具不放！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_29539fe6:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/03 M.ogg"
    Master "你始终是块肉，终将如肉块般死去。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_e28185a6:



    voice "voice/Owl/39 Vi.ogg" 
    Owl "我们要啄出你的肠子！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_1d46d938:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/21 Bu.ogg"
    Bear "嚼到地老天荒！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_a5be3341:


    "山羊用獠牙叼住骨笛开始吹奏。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_bd2f2c1b:


    "长指在笛孔间翻飞，奏出悲凉孤寂的曲调。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_d3fd838f:


    "应其召唤，灌木丛开始移动，葬礼花环的缎带簌簌发抖。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_2caeeea0:


    "雪花开始向上飘浮。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_6a410fb9:


    "幽灵般的幻影栖息在阴森墓地的界线上。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_1fd00a57:


    "野兽口中垂落涎液。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_33e85458:


    "它们的皮毛浮现孔洞，布满獠牙的颚部张开。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_cae75937:


    "蛆虫团在面具深处蠕动。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_d5d2602b:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/85 tvo.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "你的狼群凋零了，老东西。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_9356bf95:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/86 chtoz.ogg"
    Wolf_Big "来！看看它们会响应谁的呼唤。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_1bc27e15:


    "他跪倒在地，当警督如野兽般弓起脊背时，我退向汽车。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_0d7578c9:


    "吉洪诺夫朝向灰暗天空仰头长嚎。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_555cb2f6:


    "声浪碾向前方三人。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_48a6f257:


    "雪花加速飞舞，几座十字架倾斜倒下。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_8ce288f6:


    "笛声与模仿它的嚎叫如双矛交击。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_da80b7d0:


    "我毛发倒竖，皮肤刺痛。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_fb55d16e:


    "乌阿斯车的金属车身在恐怖力量下弯曲，引擎盖迸出火花。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_7f8ba105:


    "两道身影从黑暗中跃出。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_1a1af40a:


    "瞬间我以为那是朋友们，随即辨认出面具——"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_94ef0a50:


    "阿狸萨和小狼。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_b2c941b1:


    "她们没有从背后扑杀我，而是直取山羊。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_4101c4b7:


    "我钻进车内关紧车门。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_9f7b9428:


    "奥利娅在哭泣，我紧紧抱住她。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_1682cb92:


    "她湿润的脸颊贴在我锁骨上。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_6c17668b:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/70 Tosh.ogg"
    Oly "托沙，我们会怎样？"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_9b623352:


    "根据外面的巨响，一场屠杀正在上演。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_1c8b16c4:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/240.Nesm.ogg"
    Ant "别看！闭上眼睛。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_e564d2d2:


    "她乖乖照做，仍在我怀中颤抖。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_89e0e8ab:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/72 Nes.ogg"
    Oly "我不看！我不看！我不看！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_1b515965:


    "车窗蒙上雾气。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_813c2e21:


    "我只能看见外面扭动的阴影。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_ed6a435b:


    "黑夜，以及其中发生的屠杀。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_a44416c1:


    "猩红液滴溅上挡风玻璃。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_5016feb2:


    "我攥紧拳头，指甲陷进掌心。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_4158fbc5:


    "重物砸上车头，兽爪一闪而过。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_08fc28b5:


    "我不想看，却也无法闭眼。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_58dec55a:


    "纵然只能窥见战斗的碎片，声响却完整传入耳中——距乌阿斯车几英尺外，皮毛撕裂，肌肉崩解。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_16b07c22:


    "毛茸茸的影子沿车身踉跄而行。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_6ca42400:


    "猫头鹰？"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_a49eebff:


    "狐狸？"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_42bcae0f:


    "不，是两者！"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_2013f390:


    "她们蜷成毛皮球团，化作自相吞噬的双头畸物。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_bf8a2447:


    "狐狸将尖吻楔入猫头鹰胸部的破洞，正吞食其内脏。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_6715a035:


    "羽毛下露出粉白色的皮下脂肪，恶心的层状结构在獠牙压力下破裂，渗出黑色血丝。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_a709d406:


    "在消失在车身右侧前，野兽们互相撕扯脖颈。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_11fdbc4d:


    "猫头鹰颈间钻出青蓝色的气管，如蠕虫般扭动。"


translate chinese event_battle_devend_ab8a4c8e:


    "那是覆满血肉纤维的湿滑管道。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_29bfafa5:


    "奥利娅紧紧贴着我，全身都在发抖。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_bce9a712:


    "车内虽然寒冷，但恐惧才是我们在后座颤抖的真正原因。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_633b3ab9:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/37 Chto.ogg"
    Oly "它们在做什么？"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_0cf9223e:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/38 Gde.ogg"
    Oly "妈妈在哪里？"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_c27c3868:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/282 m.ogg"
    Ant "妈妈很快就回来。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_8af49310:


    "我搂住妹妹，用手遮住她的眼睛。奥利娅颤抖的睫毛轻扫我的掌心。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_046fbc08:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/283 n.ogg"
    Ant "别往外看。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_b62883f2:


    "警车窗玻璃覆满冰霜，只能瞥见暴风雪中跳跃的模糊色块。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_ecfd09c0:


    "有人跃过引擎盖，钻进车底，又窜到右侧。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_89ef4265:


    "色块相互追逐。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_e5450def:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/39 Dya.ogg"
    Oly "警官先生会救我们吗？"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_7b6b14a2:


    "其实我并不确定。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_94cef492:


    "内心某个异常冷静狡黠的部分明白，成年人靠不住。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_15dcbf8b:


    "我必须行动。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_efbab70e:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/05 tih.ogg"
    "{b}“吉洪诺夫会输，”{/b}我心想，{b}“他太弱了。”{/b}"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_db930af9:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/06 kol.ogg"
    "{b}子弹战胜不了魔法，唯有魔法能对抗魔法。{/b}"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_7b4dfd6a:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/07 mm.ogg"
    "{b}自从雪原逃亡那夜，面具就一直在我口袋里。{/b}"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_c4a6dde4:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/08 oni.ogg"
    "{b}它们想让我加入狼群，但现在这已不重要。{/b}"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_efcb1ce2:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/09 t.ogg"
    "{b}只有我能救朋友们。{/b}"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_c0795bed:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/10 na.ogg"
    "{b}必须赶在他们变成祭品袋里的骸骨之前……{/b}"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_70c7ca25:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/11 oni.ogg"
    "{b}他们在呼唤我！{/b}"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_aadd7385:


    "此刻，我仿佛听见罗姆卡和波琳娜被狂风吞没的呼救。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_d5cf867c:


    "驾驶座车窗后浮现暗色椭圆，"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_d53d6042:


    "像有张脸贴在冰霜上转瞬即逝。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_7ffb86d5:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/12 na.ogg"
    "{b}“戴上它，”{/b}我对自己说。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_f1804cb4:


    "但这真是我的念头吗？"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_b1644d1b:


    "这些思绪属于我自己吗？"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_aadd2bb6:


    "奥利娅的泪水温热了我的手掌。时间不多了。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_48d214c7:


    "我可以成为罗姆卡和波琳娜的英雄，也能保护妹妹……"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_e598d741:


    "但需要奇迹才能拯救他们。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_b0ed4c7f:


    "我继续遮着奥利娅的眼睛，取出了面具。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_ab906848:


    "它从何而来？谁将野兽封入其中？那黑暗力量所求为何？"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_532eead6:


    "真要与无法理解之物合为一体吗？"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_bf9487c7:


    "如同把汽油浇满全身，点燃自己冲向敌人……"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_186593b5:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/13 ne.ogg"
    "{b}“别多想，”{/b}内心的声音坚持道，{b}“只管去做。”{/b}"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_400005b0:


    "我小心移开手，妹妹闭着眼睛轻声问："


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_2083e162:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/40 Ku.ogg"
    Oly "你要去哪里？"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_7d4bf2c2:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/284 N.ogg"
    Ant "哪儿也不去。我在这儿，永远都在。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_2e87abc3:


    "面具触感令人愉悦，内里仿佛在召唤我。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_b4983d53:


    "全身泛起鸡皮疙瘩，奇异的期待感在蔓延。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_f8b20af0:


    "就像孩提时代圣诞前夜，当你仍相信魔法与月下慈祥老人的那种悸动。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_d88e8ffb:


    "我将面具贴近脸颊。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_b2d2a2d1:


    "奥利娅的手指突然环住我的手腕。转头对上她哀求的目光。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_0447de36:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/41 Ne.ogg"
    Oly "别戴它。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_69419763:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/285 t.ogg"
    Ant "你不明白，这是唯一的机会。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_967ddefb:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/42 Eto.ogg"
    Oly "是陷阱！邪恶之物不会带来善果。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_3255c306:


    "她努力组织语言想说服我。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_f1a3dfe9:


    "奥利娅看见了我看不见的东西。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_40136ba6:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/43 Os.ogg"
    Oly "快停下。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_8cbd09be:


    "然后呢？就算活到葬礼，也只能亲手埋葬朋友和家人吗？"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_3a1369f7:


    "左侧车门突然传来撞击声，奥利娅失声尖叫。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_e8f7e832:


    "模糊的手掌拍打车窗，指甲刮擦冰霜。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyayes_4fbd0a59:


    "门把手在外力推动下发出呻吟。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_bca022ce:


    "这是为了你，奥利娅。但愿将来你能明白……"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_4d13bd22:


    "面具触上脸颊，如野兽粗糙的舌头，颅腔内有什么东西短路了。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_30decc94:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/Vdoh.ogg"
    "我的肺部扩张。我吸入的空气混合着血腥味和车内肮脏的气息。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_9cc8b15e:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/286 t.ogg"
    Ant "你说得对…总是这么聪明…对不起…"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_1edf7375:


    "我扔掉了面具。再也不需要那片黑暗森林孕育的恐怖魔法了。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_9d09e601:


    "野兽的游戏到此为止。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_32d89158:


    "仿佛在抗议我的决定，副驾驶门猛地弹开，铰链几近崩断。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_9d36bb0f:


    "暴风雪在门外肆虐，苍白的女性轮廓从雪幕中浮现，看不清头颅的位置。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_d3a9df19:


    "惨白的手指如白化蜘蛛般摸索金属部件，正向我和奥利娅的庇护所爬来。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_89eba9d8:


    "妹妹的指甲深深掐进我的肩膀。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_aac81227:


    "那女人缓缓弓身探入，动作像生锈的机械般滞涩。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_1ec976e3:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/001 Rik.ogg"
    "一个长着粗乱毛发的下巴出现了……然后是嘴……眼睛的缝隙。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_3b8f5625:


    "她的面具几乎和曾经盖在我脸上的那个一模一样。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_d774e0a6:


    "她的面具与我曾经戴过的那副几乎一模一样。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_b1c28aac:


    "却扭曲得更加可怖，如同在哈哈镜中的倒影。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_8599beb7:


    "瞳孔在孔洞中闪烁。指甲刮擦着金属。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_933d55dd:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/45 Ne.ogg"
    Oly "求你别过来！"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_1691e452:


    "她是谁？"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_cce3f0b1:


    "为什么这些怪诞的动作如此熟悉？"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_537c25a4:


    "奥利娅哀嚎着更用力地缩进我怀里。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_fd4262db:


    "女人猛地探身入车，利齿在距我脸颊寸许处咔嚓咬合。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_50fa88ff:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/47 H.ogg"
    Oly "住手！"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_d9935397:


    "又一声脆响。怪物鼻孔剧烈抽动，四处嗅闻。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_6c7ef718:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/Ne.ogg"
    Oly "不准碰我哥哥！"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_d3d333a5:


    "奥利娅扑到我身前反手抱住我，阻止未知怪物将我拖进漆黑树丛。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_43e49c45:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/48 Ya.ogg"
    Oly "我好害怕！"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_6f040bf7:


    "女人以野兽的姿态扭动脖颈，发出咕噜声，似乎在努力回忆如何说话。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_62dc5239:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/008 Moe.ogg" 
    Lady_Bunny "我亲爱的孩子……"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_3864b487:


    "我意识到她在对奥利娅说话。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_23c92530:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/09 Poi.ogg" 
    Lady_Bunny "跟我走……现在由我来保护你……"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_ced572c7:


    "奥利娅摇着头躲开伸来的手。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_cb3a2675:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/49 Ui.ogg"
    Oly "走开！我不要！"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_f2544336:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/010 No.ogg" 
    Lady_Bunny "但你是我的！"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_2a559a63:


    "霎时间，古老面具眼缝里闪烁的恶魔般怒意消散了。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_145654a7:


    "我发誓从中看到了绝望。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_6186b2e4:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/50 Ya.ogg"
    Oly "我要回家！找妈妈！"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_9fec48c4:


    "奥利娅歇斯底里地挣扎着。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_a79b89a5:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/51 Ma.ogg"
    Oly "妈妈救命，这里有可怕的怪物！"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_0ddcf5a0:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/011 St.ogg" 
    Lady_Bunny "可怕的怪物……"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_2d83e190:


    "女人的声音变了，浸满痛苦。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_adde7ca2:


    "暗沉眼缝里闪烁的不再是怒火，而是泪光。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_b13a5d43:


    "我难以置信地望着这个片刻前还想将我们撕碎的女人。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_5855d16e:


    "我难以置信地望着这个片刻前还想将我们撕碎的怪物。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_8c76122c:


    "纤长的手指再次伸向奥利娅，却在半途停住。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_f3ab743f:


    "突然，兔首女人滑出车厢，瞬间消失在纷飞大雪中。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_275e9717:


    "我听见她含泪的哀嚎在墓园与冰封树干间回荡。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_5b5ac51e:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/52 kto.ogg"
    Oly "她是谁？"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_6f1e9b54:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/288 y.ogg"
    Ant "不知道。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_965e7c34:


    "突然，兔首女人滑出车厢，冲进战团中央。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_b21e75a6:


    "我看见她将獠牙刺入吉洪诺夫的脖颈，撕下血肉碎片。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_1c42ded7:


    "狼人在猩红雪地上翻滚，痛苦哀鸣着徒劳地想甩开发狂的兔女。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_edc02f34:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/52 kto.ogg"
    Oly "她是谁？"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_6f1e9b54_1:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/288 y.ogg"
    Ant "不知道。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_2ca0fca8:


    "我想把面具扔到车内最远的角落，但它却黏在我的指间。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_3d8c4ce5:


    "我猛甩手腕，终于摆脱了那秽物。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_4770081b:


    "我拉紧车门落锁。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_d03f198e:


    "我们要留在车里，直到一切平息。直到正义战胜邪恶。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_10fe8704:


    "就像妈妈小时候给我读的故事里写的那样。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_0acc3b82:


    "奥利娅将头靠在我肩上。斑斓的光影仍在模糊的车窗外混乱移动。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_yes_mom_92f24e86:


    "我们只是坐在车里，等待结局降临。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_a3de4781:


    "车内寒气刺骨，但恐惧才是我们在后座颤抖的真正原因。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_80f0e17c:


    "我想看清窗外战况，却又渴望失明。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_112c1dc8:


    "最好能昏过去，再醒来时已回到父母身边。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_b62883f2:


    "警车窗玻璃覆满冰霜，只能瞥见暴风雪中跳跃的模糊色块。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_ecfd09c0:


    "有人跃过引擎盖，钻进车底，又窜到右侧。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_89ef4265:


    "色块相互追逐。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_f7b39d15:


    "吉洪诺夫在哪？他一定会来救我的……"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_7b6b14a2:


    "其实我并不确定。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_94cef492:


    "内心某个异常冷静狡黠的部分明白，成年人靠不住。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_15dcbf8b:


    "我必须行动。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_efbab70e:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/05 tih.ogg"
    "{b}“吉洪诺夫会输，”{/b}我心想，{b}“他太弱了。”{/b}"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_db930af9:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/06 kol.ogg"
    "{b}子弹战胜不了魔法，唯有魔法能对抗魔法。{/b}"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_7b4dfd6a:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/07 mm.ogg"
    "{b}自从雪原逃亡那夜，面具就一直在我口袋里。{/b}"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_efcb1ce2:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/09 t.ogg"
    "{b}只有我能救朋友们。{/b}"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_c0795bed:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/10 na.ogg"
    "{b}必须赶在他们变成祭品袋里的骸骨之前……{/b}"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_70c7ca25:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/11 oni.ogg"
    "{b}他们在呼唤我！{/b}"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_aadd7385:


    "此刻，我仿佛听见罗姆卡和波琳娜被狂风吞没的呼救。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_d5cf867c:


    "驾驶座车窗后浮现暗色椭圆，"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_d53d6042:


    "像有张脸贴在冰霜上转瞬即逝。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_7ffb86d5:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/12 na.ogg"
    "{b}“戴上它，”{/b}我对自己说。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_f1804cb4:


    "但这真是我的念头吗？"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_b1644d1b:


    "这些思绪属于我自己吗？"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_dd72788c:


    "风雪中传来孩童的哭喊。时间不多了。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_48587bd0:


    "我可以成为罗姆卡和波琳娜的英雄。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_e598d741:


    "但需要奇迹才能拯救他们。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_2a459f08:


    "强压恐慌，我从口袋取出面具。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_ab906848:


    "它从何而来？谁将野兽封入其中？那黑暗力量所求为何？"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_532eead6:


    "真要与无法理解之物合为一体吗？"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_bf9487c7:


    "如同把汽油浇满全身，点燃自己冲向敌人……"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_186593b5:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/13 ne.ogg"
    "{b}“别多想，”{/b}内心的声音坚持道，{b}“只管去做。”{/b}"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_2e87abc3:


    "面具触感令人愉悦，内里仿佛在召唤我。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_b4983d53:


    "全身泛起鸡皮疙瘩，奇异的期待感在蔓延。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_f8b20af0:


    "就像孩提时代圣诞前夜，当你仍相信魔法与月下慈祥老人的那种悸动。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_d88e8ffb:


    "我将面具贴近脸颊。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_53d0f9ad:


    "如果奥利娅还活着，她会说什么？"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_a826e490:


    "我的妹妹……我愿付出一切再听一次她的声音。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_91366dcf:


    "意识到自己在哭泣。泪水温热了脸颊。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_2a4364da:


    "任泪水流淌，任亡妹的幻影在车内浮现。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_0ad9bb6f:


    "尽管她只是我想象的造物。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_e891bfcf:


    "我知道她会用眼神哀求我重新考虑。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_c7358acd:


    "手指划过虚空，仿佛在梳理奥利娅丝缎般的头发。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_9a440f75:


    "指尖什么也没触到，再也找不到那个鲜活的人。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_dc63cad1:


    "车门突然传来撞击声。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_e8f7e832:


    "模糊的手掌拍打车窗，指甲刮擦冰霜。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_olyano_4fbd0a59:


    "门把手在外力推动下发出呻吟。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_5fb28049:


    "我扔掉了面具。再也不需要那片黑暗森林孕育的恐怖魔法了。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_9d09e601:


    "野兽的游戏到此为止。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_014d31a1:


    "仿佛在抗议我的决定，副驾驶门猛地弹开，铰链几近崩断。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_eaa5cc27:


    "外面暴风雪肆虐，一个纤细的女性轮廓从白茫中凸显。我看不清她的头在哪里。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_73a35181:


    "苍白的手摸索着金属部件，像某种白化蜘蛛，爬进我和奥莉娅的避难所。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_6041bbf0:


    "那女人俯身探入，缓慢地弯下腰，像生锈的机械装置。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_b2abf5bc:


    "一个长着粗乱毛发的下巴出现了……然后是嘴……眼睛的缝隙。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_d774e0a6:


    "她的面具与我曾经戴过的那副几乎一模一样。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_67acf55b:


    "只是更加骇人，更加扭曲，仿佛在哈哈镜中映照过一般。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_8599beb7:


    "瞳孔在孔洞中闪烁。指甲刮擦着金属。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_18113eb5:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/019 Kto.ogg"
    Lady_Bunny "看看我们找到了谁？"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_1223db4b:


    "在陌生女人愤怒的注视下，我彻底僵住，最后一丝力气也流失了。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_e0dd453b:


    "她是谁？为什么这些怪诞的动作如此熟悉？"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_fd4262db:


    "女人猛地探身入车，利齿在距我脸颊寸许处咔嚓咬合。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_1115e258:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/289 n.ogg"
    Ant "不要！"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_d9935397:


    "又一声脆响。怪物鼻孔剧烈抽动，四处嗅闻。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_221832db:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/290 m.ogg"
    Ant "妈妈！救命！"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_66c0668c:


    "我呼喊着母亲，仿佛她能听见并把我从这怪物手中救出。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_ea629fa1:


    "女人以野兽的姿态扭动脖颈，发出咕噜声，似乎在努力回忆如何说话。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_5ddc590d:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/021 Re.ogg" 
    Lady_Bunny "一个孩子……"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_94b3c916:


    "女人的声音变了。她垂下双手，暗沉眼缝里闪烁的不再是怒火，而是泪光。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_1b87f0bb:


    "我难以置信地望着这个片刻前还想将我撕碎的怪物。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_062e08cb:


    Lady_Bunny "可怜的孩子……"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_b3378ebb:


    "纤长的手指伸向我，却在半途停住。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_e79715e3:


    "突然，她滑出车厢，瞬间消失在纷飞大雪中。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_275e9717:


    "我听见她含泪的哀嚎在墓园与冰封树干间回荡。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_2ca0fca8:


    "我想把面具扔到车内最远的角落，但它却黏在我的指间。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_3d8c4ce5:


    "我猛甩手腕，终于摆脱了那秽物。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_aeaab9b7:


    "猛地拉紧车门落锁。我应该留在车内直到一切平息。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_1e253653:


    "直到正义战胜邪恶。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_10fe8704:


    "就像妈妈小时候给我读的故事里写的那样。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_9b25d867:


    "心脏狂跳着撞击胸腔。斑斓的光影仍在模糊的车窗外混乱移动。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_no_face_c8db1a9a:


    "我坐在车里，等待结局降临。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_aftermath_devend_c8373c32:


    "骨骼与翅翼碎裂声不绝于耳。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_aftermath_devend_a37414df:


    "我用手捂住奥利娅的耳朵。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_aftermath_devend_d749b238:


    "犄角的阴影正从车头前掠过。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_aftermath_devend_320747a2:


    "死亡与饥饿的旋律钻入我的脑海。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_aftermath_devend_c285b0a1:


    "我以为变成了狼的吉洪诺夫在操控失去意识的阿狸萨，就像山羊操控它的兽群。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_aftermath_devend_2ab8c5fa:


    "野兽对抗野兽。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_aftermath_devend_c2eaaf07:


    "黑暗吞噬黑暗。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_aftermath_devend_54cc9115:


    "狼崽被击飞撞上十字架，如同父亲信仰的那位受难神祇般悬挂其上。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_aftermath_devend_33acdab1:


    "吉洪诺夫在暴风雪中发出咆哮。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_aftermath_devend_ce0702f9:


    "山羊发出最后的咩叫。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_aftermath_devend_5fd432b7:


    "血柱喷涌着冲向夜空。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_aftermath_devend_55c45656:


    "笛声戛然而止。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_aftermath_devend_d7bccadb:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/74 St.ogg"
    Oly "现在好安静。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_aftermath_devend_91ea2bb6:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/241.da.ogg"
    Ant "是的，亲爱的。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_aftermath_devend_8049d87b:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/241.Ya.ogg"
    Ant "坐着别动，我很快回来。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_aftermath_devend_4b051732:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/75 Net.ogg"
    Oly "不要！别走！"


translate chinese event_final_battle_aftermath_devend_9d41b40a:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/242.Ya.ogg"
    Ant "我会回来的……"


translate chinese event_final_battle_aftermath_devend_6782786a:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/242.Ob.ogg"
    Ant "我保证……"


translate chinese event_final_battle_aftermath_devend_63335904:


    "她勉强松开我的衣领，轻轻抽泣。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_aftermath_devend_6dd28fef:


    "我从后座拿起斧头。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_aftermath_devend_5616f89d:


    "不知从何而来的力量支撑着我。"


translate chinese event_final_battle_aftermath_devend_dbf28c5c:


    "但或许蒙蔽双眼留在车内，比直面外界更令人恐惧。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_e411ac26:


    "我谨慎地踏出车门。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_6601c240:


    "战场已被鲜血染成猩红。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_03abdc2b:


    "伤痕累累的野兽们攀附在十字架上，望着被肢解的山羊。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_691096fa:


    "吉洪诺夫剖开了他的腹腔。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_86884380:


    "肠管如花环般在冰壳上拖行。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_549b758e:


    "留下黏液痕迹，如同蜗牛爬过的涎迹。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_b631adf4:


    "胃酸在雪地嘶嘶作响，褐色脓液从面具下渗出。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_b2aa532e:


    "警灯内部传来咔嗒声，一盏灯熄灭，另一盏投下死寂的蓝光笼罩墓园。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_de3cc07f:


    "吉洪诺夫扯下汗湿的狼形面具。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_3f83aecd:


    "敌人利爪留下的伤痕从眼睑延伸到下颌，"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_9be0fb25:


    "左眼成了血涌的坑洞。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_525282d2:


    "可她却在笑……"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_8b7b067e:


    "他带着狰狞的笑容，注视着残存的兽群如幼犬般瑟缩。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_05f2682c:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/291 l.ogg"
    Ant "警官？"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_b9ab181f:


    "警察大步迈向兽群的老首领。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_155ad5aa:


    "此刻吉洪诺夫的剪影与十字架旁的幼兽同样可怖。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_2b3b20fb:



    voice "voice/Owl/a.ogg"  
    "被撕碎如破旧玩偶的猫头鹰发出咕呜。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_b1a5fadc:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/a.ogg"
    "小熊抱着断爪低沉附和。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_d23ac87e:


    "山羊勉强抬起头，苍老的声音颤抖着："


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_eed50e20:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/10 Pro.ogg"
    Master "你这肮脏的孽种……"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_347d5227:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/11 Proch.ogg"
    Master "别用脏手碰它！那是我的！"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_3f3f912f:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/12 Ra.ogg"
    Master "没听见低语吗？"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_e0992ba7:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/13 Ya.ogg"
    Master "我才是它的主人！"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_27e56eaf:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/94 Shop.ogg"
    Tikhonov "低语拂过耳畔唤醒了我。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_0971cdcc:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/95 tis.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你太老了，跳不上月亮了……"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_23216a51:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/14 Ne.ogg"
    Master "不！"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_67f15dba:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/96 tep.ogg"
    Tikhonov "该由我戴上了！"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_1db605be:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/97 no.ogg"
    Tikhonov "不过别担心……"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_ec22e0f4:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/99 yasohr.ogg"
    Tikhonov "我会让你的崽子活着。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_c0ff0ac7:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/15 Che.ogg"
    Master "还在等什么，我的傀儡们？"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_e4694fc7:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/16 po.ogg"
    Master "为什么不帮帮你们的主人？"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_5c9a0bf0:


    "小狼仅以獠牙作为回应。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_b748b657:


    "熊怪用后爪刨雪假装没听见。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_0799fd97:


    "利爪撕扯散落的肠管，爆裂声中将褐色物质溅满雪地。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_eee5b137:


    "猫头鹰发出恶毒的咯咯声。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_a3dd5c37:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/17 Bu.ogg"
    Master "诅咒你们！"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_2908eae8:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/18 V.ogg"
    Master "愿永恒饥渴折磨你们这些忘恩负义的东西！"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_0540f516:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/19 V.ogg"
    Master "永恒饥——"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_c3af88fd:


    "吉洪诺夫将手指刺入山羊脊背，打断愤怒的咆哮。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_60116fc6:


    "他抓住双侧肩胛骨向上撕扯，"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_1b97c599:


    "碎骨如翅膀般耸立，黄色脂肪块如同羽毛。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_b3f7f55d:


    Master "啊——！"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_f1451982:


    "垂死山羊的哀鸣响彻墓园。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_ce0ee61c:


    "吉洪诺夫猛地抽出整条脊椎。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_21418745:


    "粘稠的条状物如拱桥般弯曲。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_3afd9189:


    "山羊巨大的眼睛失去光彩，在灰烬与积雪间气绝。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_e0c72ca7:


    "结束了。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_0f04d7fd:


    "我们终于得救了吗？"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_e77e0279:


    "与先前经历截然相反，我心中涌起狂喜。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_24cd804f:


    "邪恶被击败了。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_518b9b85:


    "吉洪诺夫抚过敌人血迹斑斑的脸。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_21abc6df:


    "他从尸体上取下山羊面具举向月亮，如同向兽群、森林与黑暗本身献祭。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_9cc589d0:


    "黑暗以嚎叫合唱回应。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_cb3c881f:


    "喜悦的泪水在我睫毛上凝结。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_63b0bf58:


    "吉洪诺夫戴上了面具。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_518c326d:


    "他将面具按在脸上张开双臂，犄角与他浑然一体。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_e5310e55:


    "恐惧如刺刀贯穿了我。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_dddb74a4:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/245.St.ogg"
    Ant "快住手！"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_52f4e824:


    "野兽们蹒跚着聚向新主人。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_39957407:


    "它们围成圈，如同贺卡上环绕圣诞老人的孩童。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_566c003b:


    "狼崽用鼻尖磨蹭首领大腿。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_54267d83:


    "猫头鹰躬身行礼。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_24284a25:


    "熊怪将鼻子埋入猩红积雪。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_15e3f4dc:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/63 Z.ogg"
    Master "兔子。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_9bd1c94b:



    voice "voice/Wolf/23 zrat.ogg"
    Wolf "开-grrr-饭！"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_385acd29:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/12 Uto.ogg"
    Bear "打累了。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_05fda4d8:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/13 Go.ogg"
    Bear "我们饿！"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_198109ba:



    voice "voice/Owl/a.ogg" 
    "我意识到它们全都在盯着我，涎水从嘴角滴落。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_11ad83fd:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/101 bud.ogg"
    Master "盛宴开始！"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_fc8b3fed:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/102 zai.ogg"
    Master "兔子快上前，勇敢些。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_ca879ae0:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/103 myas.ogg"
    Master "给饿兽们献上渴求的鲜肉！"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_e411ac26:


    "我谨慎地踏出车门。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_6601c240:


    "战场已被鲜血染成猩红。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_e2390938:


    "熊怪的尸体头颅碎裂。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_b6aa938b:


    "猫头鹰失去双眼和一侧翅膀。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_c25710f9:


    "只有阿狸萨和兔女不见了踪影。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_e448a253:


    "吉洪诺夫捂着喉咙，徒劳地想止住喷涌的鲜血。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_46da32a6:


    "血液从他指缝间泵出。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_62598ac4:


    "他戴的面具连同底下的皮肤都被撕碎。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_f4b60315:


    "敌人利爪掀翻了他半张脸，从眼睑到下颌，颧骨软组织不翼而飞。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_82591a97:


    "透过窟窿能看见上颌发黄的牙齿。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_d65b29ab:


    "左眼球如生蛋清般垂落。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_d4c196f2:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/89 Chto.ogg"
    Tikhonov "我怎么了……安东？"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_050df889:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/90 Neho.ogg"
    Tikhonov "我不想……"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_cbec3098:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/91 Gor.ogg"
    Tikhonov "好烫……好烫……"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_fe7f3adb:


    "他最后喘息一声，身体瘫软。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_0701bba2:


    "确认奥利娅仍安然待在驾驶座旁，"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_8a3e193a:


    "我拖着脚步走向墓园。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_470875fd:


    "山羊在栅栏间爬行，在雪地里挣扎。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_691096fa:


    "吉洪诺夫剖开了他的腹腔。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_d51b76ed:


    "肠管如花环般在冰壳上拖行。"


translate chinese event_newkozel_born_afterdev_44a1dea8:


    "留下黏液痕迹，如同蜗牛爬过的涎迹。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_b631adf4:


    "胃酸在雪地嘶嘶作响，褐色脓液从面具下渗出。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_cbb2ba2d:


    "蛆虫在他唇间蠕动，仿佛涂了黑色唇膏。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_3cbfb19c:


    "发臭的肉块脱落萎缩。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_39b1598c:


    "山羊散发着湿土、尿液和火药硫磺的气味。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_d8abc740:


    "{b}“他快死了，”{/b}我心想。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_7c7c1ed5:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/04 E.ogg"
    Ant_m "这些面具都将归我所有。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_22ed1f32:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/05 sa.ogg"
    Ant_m "由我决定谁配与我跃向月亮。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_3f53c247:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/06 A.ogg"
    Ant_m "谁该畏惧我。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_8749c960:


    "异质的思绪如热水注满全身……"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_bd9ba470:


    "……带来暖意。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_0bf92b80:


    Ant_m "再次想象在瑰丽奇幻森林的夜路上奔跑。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_c95c26bf:


    Ant_m "多么自在。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_4378b60b:


    "山羊抬起手。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_1c5ca728:


    "兔形面具悬在他扭曲的指间，用孔洞注视着我。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_87295f7f:


    "皮毛泛着银光。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_49332b55:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/08 ko.ogg"
    "当它贴上脸颊，所有烦恼都将消散。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_805efa64:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/09Yaa.ogg"
    "我将饱食奔跑。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_10f5f87b:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/10 bu.ogg"
    "跃上云端，与闪烁星辰嬉戏。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_f56c66cc:


    "一具正在僵硬的尸体侧倒时发出轻微响动。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_c9307e88:


    "他不像其他尸体般面目全非，我轻易认出了他。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_224e8409:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/05 Et.ogg"
    Master "这是给你的！"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_d4e94c02:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/06 Na .ogg"
    Master "戴上它，安东，快戴上……"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_b7443a99:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/07 ho.ogg"
    Master "好孩子！它是你的了！"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_fa9d1544:


    "我没有听。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_c26c964a:


    "我看着挂在十字架上那件撕破了的外套。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_8d94aff0:


    "外套下面，躺着浑身是血、早已死去的孩子。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_76996883:


    "罗曼。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_25167e72:


    "他那张人类的面容平静安详。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_d42c6b68:


    "他曾是我的朋友。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_ae170205:


    "我唯一的朋友，到死都没能走出这座被诅咒的村庄。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_824b43fc:


    "罗姆卡再也无法将心中的良善馈赠世界。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_5a1e90e2:


    "体内沸腾的热意开始消散。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_4dbd7352:


    "痛苦与思念取而代之。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_6439fd6b:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/08 skor.ogg"
    Master "快，安东！"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_63f72c6d:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/14 sk.ogg"
    "{b}“快！”{/b}内心的声音催促着，{b}“戴上面具！在夜色中起舞！忘记一切！”{/b}"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_967b9940:


    "“你究竟是谁？”我在心中质问这纠缠不休的声音。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_89d7463a:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/15 ni.ogg"
    "{b}“无名小卒！”{/b}那声音带着焦虑，{b}“我就是你！”{/b}"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_12bae6fe:


    "撒谎。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_36256d2d:


    "我凝视着面具。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_302d597f:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/16 Mask.ogg"
    "兔子的嘴唇翕动，发出低语。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_1f8bf4be:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/292 u.ogg"
    Ant "滚出去。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_9bead929:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/17 R.ogg"
    "内心的声音沉寂片刻，突然发出低吼。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_0d1dd7db:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/01 O.ogg"
    Ant_m "我会出去的……"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_48ab5275:


    "它不再怯懦可怜，而是公然反抗。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_085d87b6:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/02 No.ogg"
    Ant_m "但别以为我们能分道扬镳，再也不见。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_3515923b:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/03 Ya.ogg"
    Ant_m "我早晚会回来的。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_fd12e965:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/04 Ver.ogg"
    Ant_m "会在你最意想不到的时候回来。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_28838c2c:


    "这威胁令我不安。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_34c69a7e:


    "有某个完全陌生的存在寄居在我体内，操控着我的思想、情感与恐惧。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_92c79517:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/05 Ver.ogg"
    Ant_m "我会回来……"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_8f08353a:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/06 Kog.ogg"
    Ant_m "当你为煮汤切新鲜蔬菜，手指危险地贴近刀刃时。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_f6211f46:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/07 Ver.ogg"
    Ant_m "我会回来……"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_b59269c8:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/08 Kogd.ogg"
    Ant_m "当你高举斧头劈向木柴，而奥利娅笨拙地将白皙脖颈凑近时。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_d46f2381:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/09 El.ogg"
    Ant_m "或者更晚……对，很久以后。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_764334a4:


    "我几乎想拔腿逃跑，逃到天涯海角。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_c9e16874:


    "让高烧想象绘出的恐怖画面模糊消散。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_0a557a48:


    "但我知道，逃到哪儿都躲不过这声音。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_9a7bf498:


    "逃不进藏匿古老怪物的针叶林。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_9bebae1d:


    "逃不进窗棂钉死的林间木屋。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_d0b297ad:


    "逃不上月亮——那条无尽夜路的终点。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_e2f8b9bd:


    "那个伪装成我的声音，同时从兔子面具的孔洞与我的唇间渗出。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_51992a0e:


    "因为它始终在模仿我。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_6c0e7757:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/10 Mo.ogg"
    Ant_m "或许当你长大成人，怀抱如阳光编织的婴儿时……"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_dd82313e:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/11 Sot.ogg"
    Ant_m "……我会突然出现。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_2d822bef:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/12 Kak.ogg"
    Ant_m "掐灭那烛火多么容易。只需一阵风……"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_9d6bc141:


    "我紧闭双眼，泪水飞溅。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_7b3f47d6:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/293 z.ogg"
    Ant "闭嘴！"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_802ebc23:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/13 Ya.ogg"
    Bunny "我会等着。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_58fca553:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/292 u.ogg"
    Ant "滚开！"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_217cf501:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/18 mo.ogg"
    Bunny "你现在可以把我赶走，可以让我说不了话，或者压抑住我。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_beefdb84:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/19 M.ogg"
    Bunny "但我不在乎……"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_cb9bc397:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/294 y.ogg"
    Ant "我不是你。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_cfb90794:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/20 Ya.ogg"
    Bunny "我一直以来都是你的一部分。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_b1a29e02:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/21 ot.ogg"
    Bunny "从今往后，我们永不分离。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_a2f094e5:


    "我再次望向被诅咒的面具，逐渐意识到放弃人性将失去的一切——"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_cf304b54:


    "奥利娅、妈妈、爸爸。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_ef24d025:


    "冰风割裂皮肤，剧痛在全身上下脉动。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_7b28bda1:


    "我已分不清这是现实还是持续的幻觉。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_143c9c10:


    "栅栏远处有阴影如巨型蜈蚣般伸缩，并未藏入树干之间。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_2ba095fd:


    "又一阵刺骨寒风吹来，却捎来熟悉的低语。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_3c10d0ac:


    "仿佛森林本身在对我说话，而非风中摇曳的食人怪物阴影。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_d53b1af1:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/09 Ne.ogg"
    Alis "别害怕，小可爱。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_9accdc15:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/10 But.ogg"
    Alis "当野兽感觉也不坏……"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_f37f4aca:


    "笼罩树冠的黑暗开始收缩凝聚，化作少女体型。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_ed3f9c8a:


    "在扭动的轮廓中，我辨认出那个相识的狐狸女人形象。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_c077a46e:


    "至少是我初遇那日记忆中的模样。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_fc97ab19:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/11 Os.ogg" 
    Alis "尤其是你不用再听着别人的笛声，跟着起舞。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_2233aeb9:


    "我的目光从手中斧刃移向破裂的山羊面具。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_609f9b43:


    "凝视着犄角巨兽僵硬的躯体，看不出来它到底是死是活。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_fa5f45b3:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/12 Unas.ogg" 
    Alis "我们没有主人了！"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_2783d31d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/13 Azna.ogg" 
    Alis "也就是说，再也没人能强迫我们欺凌……"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_0d8a1782:


    "阿狸萨有意犹豫了片刻再说出下一句，似乎将那个词放在舌尖细细品味。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_b5e90e42:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/14 Bez.ogg" 
    Alis "……弱小。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_5892de7e:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/15 poroi.ogg" 
    Alis "有时，该成为猎物的凡人会闯入我们的森林。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_d5ad9400:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/16 Chto.ogg" 
    Alis "毕竟人类中藏着太多真正的怪物。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_c1db79d6:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/Hah.ogg"
    "她顽皮地从百年松树后探身。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_88ec49e2:


    "狡黠面具的眼缝在黑暗中寻找着我。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_69df29f1:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/17 Mi.ogg" 
    Alis "兔子，你和我，我们是兽群最后的血脉。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_b5a10812:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/18 Nam.ogg"
    Alis "我们需要互相照应。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_82bef09a:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/19 Raz.ogg"
    Alis "不明白吗？"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_fa4ebbbf:


    "阿狸萨向我迈步走来。月光照亮了她的手，她手上有几道深深的口子，还在往下滴着血。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_77e6624c:


    "獠牙利爪留下的创口中汩汩涌出猩红血液。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_441f3142:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/20 Poz.ogg" 
    Alis "求你了，我需要你！"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_cd243439:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/21 Mi.ogg" 
    Alis "我们会获得自由，你想去哪儿都能去。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_2cf5efe0:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/295 a.ogg"
    Ant "那我从前的生活呢？我的家人、朋友、奥利娅……"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_1b2c8b3d:


    "我怀疑地注视着阿狸萨，仿佛终于窥见她最大的秘密，却不敢承认。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_9dea1788:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/296 k.ogg"
    Ant "……那波琳娜怎么办？"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_fd0d92f2:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/Hahaha.ogg" 
    "阿狸萨难以置信地瞪了我片刻，随即爆发出一声强忍住的大笑，接着又是一声。她捂着肚子，笑声止不住地从嘴里窜出来，整个人笑得歇斯底里，前仰后合。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_ccf98a4f:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/Haho.ogg"
    "她像个坏掉的机械玩偶，一直笑啊笑，笑到电池耗尽才停下来，僵在原地一动不动，脸上挂着凝固的笑容。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_f666bbe1:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/19 Po.ogg" 
    Alis "波琳娜？啊哈哈哈！"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_e2a08c8e:


    "面具后的脸显然在笑，但接下来的话语却冰冷刺骨："


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_07fb321b:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/Vpizdu.ogg" 
    Alis "去他的波琳娜！"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_469f4526:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/21 To.ogg" 
    Alis "只有你和我。该做决定了，宝贝。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_fb78610c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/22 Tol.ogg"
    Alis "求你别抛下我。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_95d68d75:


    "我的目光再次转向兔子面具，它此刻仿佛正咧着嘴笑。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_7cce07ce:


    "在狡黠狐狸的注视下，我像自动驾驶般握紧了斧柄。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_dcc2cd53:


    "我想起兔子的威胁，想起阿狸萨甜蜜的承诺——相信这些根本是疯狂。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_c353c642:


    "我想起奥利娅温暖的微光。"


translate chinese event_slaughter_devend_e152dc0f:


    "然后做出了选择。"


translate chinese event_final_break_1654edd1:


    "我高声宣告。"


translate chinese event_final_break_58507004:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/255.Ti.ogg"
    Ant "你不是我！"


translate chinese event_final_break_3429ab0f:


    "扬起斧头。"


translate chinese event_final_break_63437bd6:


    "山羊眼中残存最后一丝意识。"


translate chinese event_final_break_9052a329:


    "黑色长舌从口中垂落。"


translate chinese event_final_break_1c1698ac:


    "面具抽搐着乞求被我戴上。"


translate chinese event_final_break_8a5e631a:


    "而我狠狠劈下，将布满蛆虫的兔脸砸进泥土。"


translate chinese event_final_break_e6a79b17:


    "山羊发出惨叫。"


translate chinese event_final_break_25e5dfa3:


    "第二击劈开前额，腐坏的脑浆溅落雪地。"


translate chinese event_final_break_68eb7e1f:


    "斧刃卡在犄角头骨的裂缝中。"


translate chinese event_final_break_5fd4c01e:


    "狐女发出心碎的尖啸，如同爱尔兰传说预告亲人死亡的报丧女妖。"


translate chinese event_final_break_9fb0ba85:


    "她纵身跃过雪原，消失在枯树林中，哭嚎声久久回荡。"


translate chinese event_final_break_37010e0b:


    "那哭声将永远烙印在我记忆里。"


translate chinese event_final_break_cf18397c:


    "如此恐怖又令人揪心的声音永难遗忘。"


translate chinese event_final_break_6927e9b5:


    "震惊中过了许久，我才听见有人呼喊我的名字。"


translate chinese event_final_break_6a28c0c1:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/53  To.ogg"
    Oly "托沙！"


translate chinese event_final_break_5a8c302d:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/256.Yas.ogg"
    Ant "我来了。"


translate chinese event_final_break_f6188078:


    "我把她抱出车外，沿小径前行。"


translate chinese event_final_break_eda11b74:


    "奥利娅轻得像片羽毛，湿漉漉的鼻子蹭着我的脖颈。"


translate chinese event_final_break_8e875bd2:


    "我想起十字架下死去的朋友。"


translate chinese event_final_break_f4626c41:


    "一滴泪滑过脸颊，落在奥利娅发顶。"


translate chinese event_final_break_a35e5ab0:


    "两道车灯划破夜色。"


translate chinese event_final_break_392694cf:


    "我向前走去，不知等待我的是什么。"


translate chinese event_final_break_38de70e1:


    "父亲的车停在空地中央。"


translate chinese event_final_break_d1224537:


    "他踉跄着下车。"


translate chinese event_final_break_ac2e2830:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/69 Papa.ogg"
    Oly "爸爸！爸爸！"


translate chinese event_final_break_e930c03c:


    "他用大手紧紧抱住我们。"


translate chinese event_final_break_3fd41045:


    "胡茬扎得人生疼，此刻却是世间最温暖的触感。"


translate chinese event_final_break_8473a791:



    voice "voice/father/day5/18pr.ogg"
    Pap "对不起！真的对不起！"


translate chinese event_final_break_00a0ccf3:


    "他在哭泣。这是我第一次看见父亲的眼泪，不多，却滚烫灼人。"


translate chinese event_final_break_4a49bf97:



    voice "voice/father/day5/20ya.ogg"
    Pap "我不该离开的。老天，我真不该走。"


translate chinese event_final_break_f5ef4529:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/257.dom.ogg"
    Ant "他们放了把火，房子烧没了……"


translate chinese event_final_break_8428fc6d:


    "父亲沉重地点点头。"


translate chinese event_final_break_3a17fca4:


    "他接过奥利娅，稳稳放在后座。"


translate chinese event_final_break_073d4e1e:



    voice "voice/father/day5/21oni.ogg"
    Pap "他们在森林里伏击了我们。"


translate chinese event_final_break_71d9707b:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/257.Z.ogg"
    Ant "那些野兽？"


translate chinese event_final_break_8c7b82c8:


    "父亲惊讶地瞥了我一眼。"


translate chinese event_final_break_ab67dfb1:


    "我坐进车里，看他绕到车前，重重关上车门。"


translate chinese event_final_break_8adb36ea:



    voice "voice/father/day5/22Lud.ogg"
    Pap "是人类。"


translate chinese event_final_break_cca689a0:



    voice "voice/father/day5/23Lu.ogg"
    Pap "比野兽更恶劣的人类。"


translate chinese event_final_break_57be64b6:


    "他并不知道。"


translate chinese event_final_break_12768dc9:


    "他没看见黑暗中怪物眼睛的闪光。"


translate chinese event_final_break_6084c03d:



    voice "voice/father/day5/24Yadum.ogg"
    Pap "我以为警察抓到了那混蛋，但他还有同伙。"


translate chinese event_final_break_03fb678f:


    "车辆加速。"


translate chinese event_final_break_e4104b63:


    "暴风雪渐息，天空不再飘雪。"


translate chinese event_final_break_23e5b8bd:


    "我自问古老松林上空是否正泛起黎明的红霞。"


translate chinese event_final_break_7a9ecab0:


    "时间失去常态。"


translate chinese event_final_break_52a1bf9b:


    "化作逆升的雪花飘向天际。"


translate chinese event_final_break_dd0100b3:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/259.Gde.ogg"
    Ant "妈妈呢？"


translate chinese event_final_break_87140b5f:


    "父亲沉默着，苍白的手指紧握方向盘，目光沉重地注视前路。"


translate chinese event_final_break_39a8a20c:



    voice "voice/father/day5/26pl.ogg"
    Pap "坏人带走了妈妈。"


translate chinese event_final_break_79ff2b02:



    voice "voice/father/day5/27Ya.ogg"
    Pap "我会处理，会把她救回来。"


translate chinese event_final_break_4ae5fb5b:



    voice "voice/father/day5/28no.ogg"
    Pap "但现在你们更重要。你和奥利娅。"


translate chinese event_final_break_cccef49e:


    "后视镜里映出妹妹困倦的脸。"


translate chinese event_final_break_c6f057d4:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/70 Toha.ogg"
    Oly "托沙？"


translate chinese event_final_break_ac16853e:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/297 d.ogg"
    Ant "怎么了？"


translate chinese event_final_break_afc32d86:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/71 T.ogg"
    Oly "你救了我们，哥哥。"


translate chinese event_final_break_c4945851:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/72 U.ogg"
    Oly "你做到了……"


translate chinese event_final_break_2efced10:


    "她含着手指沉入睡梦，发出轻柔鼾声。"


translate chinese event_final_break_2ffc722d:


    "我做到了。"


translate chinese event_final_break_276278e4:


    "我把她带出了地狱。"


translate chinese event_final_break_44bb14bd:



    voice "voice/father/day5/29vse.ogg"
    Pap "我们会没事的。他们再也找不到我们。"


translate chinese event_final_break_c7380d29:


    "路边有什么一闪而过。"


translate chinese event_final_break_85344b03:


    "我扶正眼镜，看见抓住结冰树枝的女孩。"


translate chinese event_final_break_8c02f627:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/260.St.ogg"
    Ant "等等！"


translate chinese event_final_break_0036a3a8:


    "我的喊声没有惊醒奥利娅。"


translate chinese event_final_break_1f2963f7:


    "车速减缓时，我已跳下车冲过雪堆。"


translate chinese event_final_break_e0bff0d5:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/261.Pol.ogg"
    Ant "波琳娜！"


translate chinese event_final_break_acf2ec53:


    "她闻声瑟缩。"


translate chinese event_final_break_132f726d:


    "衣衫被树枝或利爪撕得褴褛。"


translate chinese event_final_break_4d978b66:


    "我轻轻抱住她。"


translate chinese event_final_break_96ee6609:


    "她体温高得不自然，发间混合着常青树与腐殖土的气息。"


translate chinese event_final_break_42483887:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/gde.ogg" 
    Pol "罗曼在哪？"


translate chinese event_final_break_9c8ad766:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/262.mne.ogg"
    Ant "对不起。"


translate chinese event_final_break_522d739d:


    "波琳娜悲伤地点头。"


translate chinese event_final_break_24dcce91:


    "黏连的刘海遮住脸庞，让我看不清她的眼神。"


translate chinese event_final_break_886fcbef:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/Ya.ogg" 
    Pol "我想离开……去哪儿都行。"


translate chinese event_final_break_968c9983:


    "我搀住她的胳膊。"


translate chinese event_final_break_f9cd5131:


    "父亲跑来帮我将波琳娜扶到后座，安置在打鼾的奥利娅身旁。"


translate chinese event_final_break_cd8e7980:


    "我俯身低语。"


translate chinese event_final_break_6f0df122:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/263.Vs.ogg"
    Ant "都结束了。"


translate chinese event_final_break_33e31da1:


    "车辆调转方向。"


translate chinese event_final_break_ddc59652:


    "右侧是我们燃烧的老宅。"


translate chinese event_final_break_385d1f12:


    "焦黑屋架从坍塌的正面凸出。"


translate chinese event_final_break_6ececd83:


    "屋顶闷燃着，灰烬在风中翻飞。"


translate chinese event_final_break_f3249dfb:


    "眼眶刺痛，却非因为浓烟。"


translate chinese event_final_break_664e21d0:


    "都结束了。"


translate chinese event_final_break_a58f974a:


    "一切皆成灰烬。不止是我的玩具和画作。"


translate chinese event_final_break_9616eb21:


    "整个“崭新”的人生都已焚毁。"


translate chinese event_final_break_ea29ae90:


    "而前路如何……"


translate chinese event_final_break_b4872f5b:


    "我一无所知。车灯只照亮连绵树影。"


translate chinese event_final_break_9d9a9f44:


    "燃烧的老宅挥舞着火红帷幕向我们道别。"


translate chinese event_final_break_68eccccb:


    "在驶向未知的途中，我望着镜中的自己。"


translate chinese event_final_break_60364772:


    "森林在低语呻吟，传播着主人覆灭的消息。"


translate chinese event_final_break_dfb34bba:


    "房屋在转角处消失。"


translate chinese event_final_break_417e0aa1:


    "我擦去脸上的烟灰。"


translate chinese event_final_break_b6f6f3f9:


    "前方地平线泛起粉红霞光。"


translate chinese event_final_break_3a9ac673:


    "我期盼黎明将至。"


translate chinese event_final_break_a112f77e:


    "我渴望相信曙光。"


translate chinese event_final_break_f7c18f84:


    "寒意中带着温柔的微风渗入紧闭的车窗。"


translate chinese event_final_break_2c2cb76c:


    "它拂过驾驶座父亲的下颌，钻入座椅间隙，探看熟睡的小女孩，最后蜷成温顺的一团。"


translate chinese event_final_break_4f3e49c4:


    "另一个凝望虚空的女孩发丝被风撩起，如轻纱般飘散。"


translate chinese event_final_break_b54af0f9:


    "微风吻过她干裂的嘴唇。"


translate chinese event_final_break_f0d1231d:


    "波琳娜笑了。"


translate chinese event_killerfree_devend_85bfd10b:


    "警官举枪瞄准夜色。"


translate chinese event_killerfree_devend_8086bb4e:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/71 Beg.ogg"
    Tikhonov "往村里跑，去找援兵。"


translate chinese event_killerfree_devend_e98e1130:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/207.no.ogg"
    Ant "可是……"


translate chinese event_killerfree_devend_fac0bf71:


    "普通子弹能挡住怪物吗？"


translate chinese event_killerfree_devend_6927a2c1:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/280 hot.ogg" 
    Rom "你虽然是警察，但是个好人。"


translate chinese event_killerfree_devend_5aaf8f56:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/222 Ka.ogg" 
    Pol "什么意思？我们不能就这样……"


translate chinese event_killerfree_devend_658f91fc:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/72 Be.ogg"
    Tikhonov "快跑！"


translate chinese event_killerfree_devend_90f86dfe:


    "我点了两下头。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_0e598ac4:


    "斧头哐当落地，我的手却本能地伸向面具。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_b95a4079:


    "我接纳了它，用手指梳理头发，莫名以胜利者的姿态戴上了面具。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_39212f0a:


    "我的脸。被保护起来了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_03049d2c:


    "恐惧随之消退。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_5ab4a83e:


    "它如同寄生在我脆弱胸腔内的异物，抽搐着离开了我的身体。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_0b3f768d:


    "一切即将结束。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_68b6009a:


    "安宁将至。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_d737ca30:


    "我望着仍在地板上安睡的妹妹。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_7dea849a:


    "唯一的遗憾是再也看不到她长大，看不到她实现我们去迪士尼乐园的梦想。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_6e6c6aed:


    "兽爪从木板缝隙间退去，悄然消失。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_f5330e0e:



    voice "voice/Bear/A_raz.ogg"   
    Animals "一、二，该陪你玩耍……"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_f7d9c583:



    voice "voice/Bear/A_tree.ogg" 
    Animals "三、四、五，猫头鹰将至。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_1053de6e:


    "野兽们等待着。必须喂饱它们。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_7f876990:


    "永别了，我心想。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_120f7f04:


    "永别了，拉小提琴的姑娘。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_e736c9cd:


    "永别了，朋友。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_9240d4fe:


    "我刚走到门廊，奥利娅就在睡梦中喃喃呼唤："


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_9c025a1f:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/99 Tosha.ogg"
    Oly "托沙？"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_b946a7ec:



    voice "voice/Bear/A_she.ogg" 
    Animals "Six, on end, the wolf's gray fur will stand."


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_f6427ad1:



    voice "voice/Bear/A_sem.ogg" 
    Animals "Seven, eight, stomp your hooves in wait."


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_223983a9:


    "我没有停留。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_7d00382c:


    "径直握住门把手。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_d4c04fb2:



    voice "voice/Bear/dlya.ogg" 
    Animals "为狐狸与熊，"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_895931e8:



    voice "voice/Bear/zaichik.ogg" 
    Animals "兔子备好美餐！"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_ce3e62b4:


    "我推开门，踏入暴风雪。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_a20cefa7:


    "……"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_e66dc78e:


    "当我醒来时，听见暴风雪欢欣而邪恶的呼啸。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_2d6c8e9e:


    "我走到门边，推开门，在黑暗中看见了我的哥哥。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_c4112123:


    "他静立不动。暴风雪于他仿佛不存在。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_53a537e5:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/99 Tosha2.ogg"
    Oly "托沙！"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_e707eff7:


    "一滴沉重的泪珠从睫毛坠落。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_37c32bc3:


    "黑影在安东周围窜动，随即从四面八方扑向他。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_28bd33d1:


    "出乎意料地，他没有尖叫。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_c2ab952d:


    "连我都因恐惧而哭喊，他却默默承受，仿佛咬断了舌头。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_563ad74d:


    "他大概是不想惊醒我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_d063a80c:


    "但剧痛终究胜过了意志——一声短促的哀鸣还是挤出了他的喉咙。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_13be8e78:


    "野兽们正在分食我的安东。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_76bf6ded:


    "它们扑上去，撞碎单薄的肋骨，撕开皮肤、肌肉与胸膜，将利爪楔入胸腔，掏出那双小小的肺囊——它们在风中瞬间冻结硬化。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_cee327f7:


    "随后尖叫消失了，被暴风雪扼杀。如同受伤的鸟儿坠入雪地，找到了永恒的安宁。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_a20cefa7:


    "……"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_8ffa41c5:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/175 Olga.ogg"
    Mam "奥莉娅，听见我说话了吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_74b99b3c:


    "我把自己从窗边挪开，悄悄擦干湿润的眼睛。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_73daba3e:


    "妈妈正在门厅帮安雅脱鞋。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_eecdeac1:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/101 Zah.ogg"
    Oly "我…刚才在照看炉子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_b7bed430:


    "我的大女儿迈着小碎步走向浴室。都长这么大了！几乎和我当年搬到村子时一样年纪了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_4302ee42:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/102 Amamu.ogg"
    Oly "不想给妈妈一个吻吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_86775d3a:



    voice "voice/Anechka/01 sei.ogg"
    Anya "来啦妈妈！我有惊喜给你看！"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_8b70b397:


    "妈妈走进厨房，解下银白头发的围巾。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_6d91c82d:


    "自从2010年爸爸去世后，她的头发白得很快，但连皱纹也夺不走她惯有的雍容之美。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_a9e1691e:


    "她如今常来城里，在我们明亮宽敞的三居室公寓里小住。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_46eeec71:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/176 Uh.ogg" 
    Mam "外面雪下得好大，呼！"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_c485a67a:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/103 E.ogg"
    Oly "这种天气您怎么穿过村边的森林？"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_7863c324:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/177 Priv.ogg" 
    Mam "习惯了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_c3bc8454:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/178 Vot.ogg"
    Mam "最近回家路上碰到吉洪诺夫，他帮我提了袋子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_06d04014:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/178 Pom.ogg"
    Mam "还记得他吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_81a35f47:


    "一位严肃警察的形象浮现在我脑海。那个不幸的夜晚，正是他强壮的臂膀把我抱出屋子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_06f3e949:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/104 Ka.ogg"
    Oly "他过得怎样？"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_5d9643f6:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/179 Da.ogg" 
    Mam "老糊涂啦。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_acb9c77c:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/180 Zim.ogg"
    Mam "退休后整天去冬钓。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_e4bfff7a:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/181Da.ogg" 
    Mam "还总喂那些该死的流浪狗。我可受不了它们！"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_a26d78c3:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/105 Ak.ogg"
    Oly "幼儿园怎么样？"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_883deaa3:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/182 Ut.ogg" 
    Mam "{u}晨间活动{/u}很顺利。安雅玩得很开心。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_7fff7d17:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/183 Vito.ogg"
    Mam "你怎么样？你丈夫呢？"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_b79d70ce:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/106 Ta.ogg"
    Oly "今天他值班。假期会回来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_0e1fe509:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/107 An.ogg"
    Oly "我差点哄不住安东。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_146d286f:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/184 op.ogg" 
    Mam "他睡觉还是不安稳？"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_6ee9d1c6:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/108 Me.ogg"
    Oly "总在睡梦中踢腾翻身。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_6514765b:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/109 Ko.ogg"
    Oly "大概在做噩梦吧……"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_68f2f1c2:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/185 M.ogg" 
    Mam "小婴儿不会做噩梦的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_3ad1e24d:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/186 Et.ogg" 
    Mam "只是抽筋而已。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_f4018208:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/110 Cht.ogg"
    Oly "袋子里是什么？"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_ec5929b6:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/187 Po.ogg"
    Mam "需要的都买了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_0ba2012e:


    voice "voice/karina/5day/188 Mys.ogg"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_14fac63f:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/188 Mys.ogg" 
    Mam "做肉冻的肉，拌{u}甜菜沙拉{/u}的酸黄瓜，还有糖果。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_a801ddd9:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/111 Sha.ogg"
    Oly "明天我去买香槟，就能准备过节了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_ed9446c0:


    "炉子上的水壶开始鸣叫，食物香气在厨房弥漫。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_182525bf:


    "我搅动着炖菜。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_31ff92b9:


    "这时望向门口——走廊里站着一个狐女。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_986f224a:


    "勺子从我手中滑落。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_fd88181f:



    voice "voice/Anechka/02 mam.ogg"
    Anya "看呀妈妈，我是小狐狸！"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_e031de8b:


    "我咽了口唾沫，挤出一个笑容。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_0cc64c51:


    "那孩童面具只是普通的塑料制品，画着鼻子和胡须。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_6e2ea37d:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/113 Ed.ogg"
    Oly "过来，小太阳。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_fa4e91e5:


    "安雅一言不发地走近。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_9328e43a:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/114 A.ogg"
    Oly "你戴这个我怎么亲你呢，嗯？"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_78d33076:



    voice "voice/Anechka/03 a.ogg"
    Anya "很简单呀！"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_f423e539:


    "我吻了吻冰凉的塑料面具。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_c1e3e1b6:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/116 Utir.ogg"
    "又本能地用前臂擦了擦嘴唇。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_b959728a:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/117 Lu.ogg"
    Oly "能摘下来吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_18ae9eb6:



    voice "voice/Anechka/04 no.ogg"
    Anya "可我是小狐狸呀！"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_c6c2ed8e:


    "妈妈凝视着孙女，仿佛想起了某个久远的记忆。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_1df793be:


    "她饱经风霜的脸上掠过极淡的笑意。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_230d7509:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/118 Sni.ogg"
    Oly "我说，摘下来！该吃饭了！"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_af968b6a:


    "小安东在隔壁房间哭起来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_5aa0dafb:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/119 Nu.ogg"
    Oly "看？你把弟弟吵醒了！"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_14367d6c:


    voice "voice/karina/5day/189 Ed.ogg"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_f3d6f91e:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/189 Ed.ogg" 
    Mam "去吧，我来摆餐具。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_6857240e:


    "狐狸安雅围着妈妈跳舞。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_89830e98:


    "我走进走廊，听见身后的对话："


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_aa6951e9:



    voice "voice/Anechka/05 ba.ogg"
    Anya "奶奶，我想玩捉迷藏！"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_5c7bc3d6:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/190 Kto.ogg"
    Mam "谁当'鬼'呀？"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_44b3f8b3:



    voice "voice/Anechka/06 ti.ogg"
    Anya "您！"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_1b3368f8:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/191 Be.ogg"
    Mam "我这把老骨头哟！好吧……"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_3656fe82:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/192 Ra.ogg"
    Mam "一、二，该陪你玩耍……"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_13160a96:


    "我浑身一颤。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_32dd35b4:


    "鸡皮疙瘩爬上脊背。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_70b331f2:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/193 Tri.ogg"
    Mam "三、四、五，猫头鹰将至。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_7b864537:


    "我闭眼抵抗突如其来的偏头痛。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_c538bf91:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/194 Sh.ogg"
    Mam "六、七、八。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_9b509372:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/121 Du.ogg"
    Oly "狼毛倒竖……"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_12f9221b:


    "我仿佛正透过木板缝隙窥视兽孩们恐怖的宴席。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_24391435:


    "父母总说那是安东的错。他不听话跑出去，在暴风雪中迷了路。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_53472422:


    "但我知道真相。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_616c9a6f:


    "在遥远的村庄某处，有栋房子仍在悲伤地吱呀作响。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_1da706c9:


    "即便过去这么多年，它依然如故。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_72f8f291:


    "角落的蛛网阴影，阁楼的窸窣声响，窗外永恒的针叶林栅栏。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_502b728c:


    "那里的网络信号和手机覆盖都不稳定，唯有浓雾恒久不变。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_b64f4b0d:


    "我走进儿童房。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_ccc7aa18:


    "以已故舅舅命名的小安东正在摇篮里呜咽。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_f17f136e:


    "我感到乳汁涌向乳头。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_d6aec267:


    "紧随而来的是压抑的焦虑感。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_10af9b57:


    "饥饿的野兽在我眼前围成圈跳舞。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_6a826683:


    "「我们跳舞，」它们说，「我们永远跳舞，永远饥饿！」"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_d81f09c7:


    "我走近摇篮向内看去。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_1ca1433c:


    "儿子在空中挥舞着小拳头。他胸前放着一张陈旧虫蛀的面具。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_a9291031:


    "我凝视着空洞的眼窝。"


translate chinese d5_ending_was_there_aftertitles_0ff7df0b:


    "黑暗本身回望着我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_7e7eea8b:


    "一个毛茸茸的身影耸立在门廊上，松针与硫磺的气味扑面而来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_2c35761c:


    "还没来得及反应，妈妈已从雪幕中走出。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_0b4137ac:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/01 Vo.ogg"
    "空气从紧咬的牙关间挤出哨音。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_35260189:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/264.Ti.ogg"
    Ant "你还活着！"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_08c19630:


    "妈妈惊讶地看着我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_663536b2:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/154 Ziva.ogg"
    Mam "当然活着。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_8f2594ae:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/155 Ti.ogg"
    Mam "怎么提着斧头？学{u}拉斯科尔尼科夫{/u}？"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_7fb665a3:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/157 vot.ogg"
    Mam "爸爸要是知道你终于读了陀思妥耶夫斯基，肯定高兴坏了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_6509cf81:


    "如利卡用后腿站起来，吐着舌头蹭妈妈的腿。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_6c145591:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/158 U.ogg"
    Mam "是不是有客人来过？"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_16b04090:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/265.ona.ogg"
    Ant "外面太冷了，我就……"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_9f176fa5:


    "妈妈扫视被毁的家具，又看向钉死的窗户。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_a4ff800d:


    "风将暗如坟土的雪团砸在窗玻璃上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_c6c1fef0:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/160 Et.ogg"
    Mam "说说看，你到底干了什么？"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_1508fe2c:


    "我把工具藏到背后，试图辩解。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_f2677c5e:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/266.K.ogg"
    Ant "有人在房子周围转悠。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_a4be4d48:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/266.A.ogg"
    Ant "爸爸让我保护好奥利娅。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_475f7431:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/162 Eti.ogg"
    Mam "所以你觉得旧橱柜会害你们？"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_b4cdf692:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/267.Ve.ogg"
    Ant "风太大了，窗户玻璃可能会碎。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_8c22aea8:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/267.Vot.ogg"
    Ant "我就想……"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_46b1616a:


    "现在一看，用木板钉死窗户的决定显得愚蠢透顶。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_f5870cb9:


    "妈妈咂了咂舌。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_1423aae3:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/163 Dur.ogg"
    Mam "真是场灾难。至少没剁掉自己手指。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_3bf752e3:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/164 Chto.ogg"
    Mam "别杵在那儿盯地板！自己造的孽自己收拾。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_2471112f:


    "我垂头丧气地点头，拖着脚步去拿羊角锤。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_f3672264:


    "妈妈环顾四周，仿佛在昏暗空房间中寻找什么。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_413d046b:


    "压抑的寂静让我不安，我开口打破沉默。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_cea643f4:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/269.Tam.ogg"
    Ant "路肯定全被雪封了吧？爸爸会不会被困在路上？"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_5868ea36:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/166 Ne.ogg"
    Mam "别操心你爸，他能照顾好自己。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_b9b2ea33:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/270.A.ogg"
    Ant "药买到了吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_b9032c5b:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/168 Ku.ogg"
    Mam "该买的都买了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_e761e46e:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/169 Apo.ogg"
    Mam "哎呀，奥利娅怎么睡地上？奥利娅！"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_a8a66609:


    "妹妹伸着懒腰睁开眼，随即发出欣喜的尖叫。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_1fab285e:


    "她扑向妈妈脖颈，毯子如披风般拖在身后。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_ef2764bc:


    "这情景让我不禁微笑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_d81ea0bb:


    "爸爸很快会回来，彼得罗夫一家就团聚了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_6267fd5c:


    "在这座穿戏服的人绝对攻不破的堡垒里。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_207881df:


    "妈妈紧紧搂住奥利娅。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_6ad04fd4:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/171 Vse.ogg"
    Mam "没事了，乖孩子，你会好起来的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_c9e06150:


    "她扭头瞥了我一眼。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_8727f46a:


    voice "voice/karina/5day/172 A.ogg"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_c3775119:


    Mam "愣着干什么！"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_b5989069:


    "我吸了吸鼻子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_efe40bed:


    "妈妈向我伸出手，另一只手揉着奥利娅本就乱糟糟的头发。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_e121d1ec:


    "我扔下斧头走向全世界最亲爱的人。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_1af651dd:


    "那里有我的位置。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_7a268e6c:


    "妈妈的掌心冰得灼人，但我知道很快就会暖和起来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_eb3e4000:


    "从此刻起，我们家能战胜生活抛来的一切苦难。冬天会结束，积雪会消融，土壤里将钻出雪滴花……"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_6bc80ad0:


    "风穿过房间，撩动桌布边缘。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_f206f422:


    "雪花飘进门廊。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_0041da57:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/274.m.ogg"
    Ant "妈妈，门……"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_a606d8dd:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/173 Dv.ogg"
    Mam "门永远敞开。万一有客人来呢。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_4d5f1080:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/275.go.ogg"
    Ant "客人？"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_f411b2ca:


    "灯光闪烁。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_d1774821:


    "每次熄灭又亮起，地上的影子就拉得更长，越发扭曲变形。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_9add9658:


    "房屋在甜美的期待中发出木骨呻吟。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_911eb6cd:


    "刮擦，刮擦。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_2c053352:


    "生锈铰链上的门扇自由晃荡，撞击着门框。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_01082441:


    "我抓住妈妈的毛皮大衣。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_55dbee5d:


    "抬头望向天花板。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_c58868d5:


    "黑暗。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_02066dbc:


    "光亮。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_eabbb0e3:


    "门猛然洞开撞上墙壁。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_92c7bbdf:


    "犄角的剪影立于门廊。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_4459b3e7:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/64 Ug.ogg" 
    Master "点心！"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_85b37853:


    "他庞大而无可阻挡地踏入门口。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_ab807a4b:


    "森林边缘的木盒不再假装是房屋，是庇护所。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_cd3ac5ff:


    "它成了窗棂钉死的陷阱。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_e1b23567:


    "怪物在木板缝隙间狞笑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_35297428:


    "霉斑在天花板上蔓延。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_d8609697:


    "古老针叶林吱呀作响，抖落宽厚松枝上的积雪。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_439dd406:


    "扭曲手指从裂缝中伸出。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_086226ec:


    "奥利娅尖叫起来，我却怎么也救不了她。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_6bb6dbdd:


    "此刻的拥抱令人窒息。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_b675c57a:


    "我仰起头，眨掉绝望的泪水。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_5788e734:


    "目光滑过妈妈的胸口、脖颈……凝固在那张灰色兔形面具上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_073e7b02:


    "贪婪在她眼中闪烁。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_d1ee2eca:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/277.Ya.ogg"
    "我尖叫时她的颚部张开，腐臭气息喷涌而出。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_90100727:


    "妈妈的獠牙刺入我的脸颊。"


translate chinese d5_ending_home_violence_db79bb90:


    "我们被永恒的黑暗吞噬。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_ad48f06e:


    "一声巨响。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_33c8c1d2:


    "与此同时，屋内的灯光骤然亮起。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_937d18d2:


    "门板脱离铰链迸裂，木屑四溅。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_90cddb25:


    "门扇像雪橇般滑过走廊。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_8fdb04bd:


    "它们来了！"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_e9ad7217:


    "它们闯进来要吞食波琳娜的血肉。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_3c83f67f:


    "它们闯进来要吞食罗姆卡的血肉。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_039e84b3:


    "它们闯进来要吞食奥利娅的血肉。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_9a78b265:


    "我转身直面古老森林的恐怖造物，朝着门口浮现的身影嘶吼："


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_f9f17161:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/130.Vot.ogg"
    Ant "这就是你们的盛宴，怪物们！"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_75abf2f9:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/130.Netro.ogg"
    Ant "别碰我！"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_a99ddec4:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/02 Det.ogg"
    Tikhonov "孩子，还好吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_19ee3e61:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/03 Ant.ogg"
    Tikhonov "安东，我们好不容易才赶到，你爸爸妈妈他们……"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_161c80fb:


    "警督话说到一半卡住了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_1f17d585:



    voice "voice/episod/Doronin.ogg"
    "身后那位中年警官强忍着惊呼。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_9b0a8c5f:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/04 O.ogg"
    Tikhonov "老天爷啊……"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_7e16935f:


    "我望向窗户。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_b8f2030d:


    "面具消失了。取而代之的是闪烁的警灯。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_6b94de42:


    "吉洪诺夫震惊的目光在斧头与沾黏在刃上的发丝间游移。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_e4d8d20a:


    "刚从衣柜出来的罗姆卡发出惊叫，踉跄后退。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_da4eea90:


    "刚从二楼回来的波琳娜发出惊叫，踉跄后退。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_41a61ccf:


    "刚从二楼回来的罗姆卡和波琳娜惊恐不已，踉跄后退。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_74cf4fa8:


    "厨房看起来像屠宰场。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_66dde73e:


    "吉洪诺夫发出呻吟。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_862c9b9e:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/05 Chto.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你干了什么？"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_3f743e78:


    "我扔下斧头用手抹脸，将波琳娜的血涂得满脸都是。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_660b2709:


    "我扔下斧头用手抹脸，将朋友的血涂得满脸都是。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_b8ccc8d6:


    "我扔下斧头用手抹脸，将妹妹的血涂得满脸都是。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_e9ceeede:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/131.vse.ogg"
    Ant "不是你想的那样……我……"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_ee19247d:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/131.Eto.ogg"
    Ant "都是那些野兽的错。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_40f91217:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/132.Oni.ogg"
    Ant "它们……说轮到我喂它们吃肉了……"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_e239d5d0:


    "屋外风雪翻卷，形成可怖巨人的轮廓。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_fe9a14ad:


    "警察把我带走了，我没有反抗。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_b620978a:


    "依稀记得手铐因我手腕太细而不断滑落，冰冷的金属圈套不住我的双手。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_e08b4341:


    "何必多此一举呢？"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_cbe8b301:


    "我根本不会逃进丛林，逃进那些食人怪物的利爪之中。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_ffc9e8a2:


    "他们把我塞进警车后座。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_db2d2eb5:


    "我最后瞥了一眼屋子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_dd3ea42a:


    "暴风雪如同极地的猫头鹰，展开巨大的双翅紧紧包裹着老屋。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_398d2f24:


    "波琳娜呆立在门口，泪眼朦胧地目送我离去。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_c4424fd4:


    "她怎么就不明白我救了她的命？！"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_075917aa:


    "波琳娜和罗姆卡呆立在门口，目送我离去。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_dab225ea:


    "他们怎么就不明白我救了他们的命？！"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_13688e1d:


    "罗姆卡站在门口，愤怒地目送我离去。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_7ece7aed:


    "警官抱着毯子裹着的奥利娅走出屋外。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_4768735e:


    "他们怎么就不明白我救了他们的命？！"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_b88e77bb:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/133.Gde.ogg"
    Ant "我爸爸妈妈呢？"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_f7c27643:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/06 ob.ogg"
    Tikhonov "我们正想告诉你。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_f5ebf21a:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/07 Bu.ogg"
    Tikhonov "暴风雪太大……他们出车祸去世了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_181a14d5:


    voice "voice/anton/5day/13 hnik.ogg" 


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_c92fc1d4:


    "他转身沉重地看着我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_8503e22a:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/08 Em.ogg"
    Tikhonov "他们走得幸运。不会知道你做了什么。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_e40b8a79:


    "乌阿斯警车带铁栏的窗外雪花飘浮，车顶警灯在黑暗中挣扎。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_29ed3235:


    "派出所里，台灯刺得我眯起眼睛。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_a13692c1:


    "吉洪诺夫在室内踱着大步。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_356f4bbf:


    "他的阴影反复侵吞墙上的俄罗斯地图——那片我永远无法踏足的辽阔疆域。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_79e1172b:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/09 Tak.ogg"
    Tikhonov "好了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_92988adb:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/10 Kto.ogg"
    Tikhonov "再说一遍，谁在窥探你家窗户？"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_2fa8018b:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/134.Zver.ogg"
    Ant "野兽。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_02a7aabb:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/134.Ali.ogg"
    Ant "阿狸萨……猫头鹰……小熊……小狼……"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_e16784a0:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/135.Oni.ogg"
    Ant "它们饿了，明白吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_2fa44f85:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/135.E.ogg"
    Ant "然后兔子告诉我，该给它们喂吃的了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_55ccd5e6:


    "吉洪诺夫一拳砸在桌上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_f07b6a4e:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/11 Kak.ogg"
    Tikhonov "什么小狼，什么兔子！你他妈在胡说什么？！"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_173ae374:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/12 Zoo.ogg"
    Tikhonov "是巡回马戏团吗？！"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_54546311:


    "我吓得蜷缩起来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_66081b36:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/13 Na.ogg"
    Tikhonov "看着我，小杂种！"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_56ef8af6:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/14 Sl.ogg"
    Tikhonov "听说过氟哌啶醇吗？你知不知道打了会怎么样？"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_fca62bc1:


    "我摇头。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_a4e517d6:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/15 Em.ogg"
    Tikhonov "这种药是给疯子打的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_0beceeb2:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/16 Me.ogg"
    Tikhonov "一打进去，你的肌肉会扭曲，疼得你生不如死。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_63d0d918:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/17 Ho.ogg"
    Tikhonov "想试试吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_56d77e71:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/136.net.ogg"
    Ant "不……不想。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_332243b0:


    "为什么？"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_fe342c0b:


    "他们难道不明白？"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_3b598767:


    "感觉不到森林里的存在吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_1b995f2a:


    "黑暗针叶林从地图上注视着我，就在警官头顶。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_7d5151f0:


    "那是远离文明的所在：猫头鹰啼叫，会动的尸体用结了冰的手指，刮擦冻土。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_57e24f20:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/139.Vi.ogg"
    Ant "找到脚印了吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_7347bcf5:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/139.Oni.ogg"
    Ant "田地里、前院全是它们的足迹。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_ff8612e1:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/18 Oni.ogg"
    Tikhonov "又来了！又是它们！"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_325d6ff2:


    "警督翻了个白眼。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_bb1322f0:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/19 Sn.ogg"
    Tikhonov "暴风雪早把你那破房子埋到屋顶了！"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_2ab23176:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/20 Ee.ogg"
    Tikhonov "连房子都找不到，还找什么脚印……"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_11a2fca5:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/140.SprPol.ogg"
    Ant "去问波琳娜。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_fd839b65:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/140.SprRom.ogg"
    Ant "去问罗曼。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_7dc85d48:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/298 oni.ogg"
    Ant "他们看见了……"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_519060fc:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/299 ona.ogg"
    Ant "她看见了……"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_51c7563e:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/300 on.ogg"
    Ant "他看见了……"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_5a8307d9:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/21 Ti.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你以为我不懂办案？"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_2b0dc9f3:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/22 Sp.ogg"
    Tikhonov "早问过了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_6991876a:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/23 On.ogg"
    Tikhonov "他们说看见你用木板钉死了窗户。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_70ad7504:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/06 Ona.ogg"
    Tikhonov "她说看见你用木板钉死了窗户。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_18ff980d:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/04 On.ogg"
    Tikhonov "他说看见你用木板钉死了窗户。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_2941b80c:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/24 No.ogg"
    Tikhonov "但你说的什么动物园，他半个字也没提！"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_e59da802:


    "怎么会这样？难道他们站在怪物那边？"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_ce42200e:


    "怎么会这样？难道她站在怪物那边？"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_ef337dab:


    "怎么会这样？难道他站在怪物那边？"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_9d736e35:


    "我想起如利卡体内蠕动的寄生虫。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_3280814f:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/143.Vmus.ogg"
    Ant "你们翻翻垃圾桶。里面应该有从狗身体里钻出来的东西。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_eea4f3b6:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/25 Es.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你杀的那条野狗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_e4a9c4ae:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/26 Mu.ogg"
    Tikhonov "我们在冰箱里找到了狗的尸体，但垃圾桶里没有什么怪物。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_012ce875:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/144.Na.ogg"
    Ant "估计是让野兽拿走了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_6db1abbb:


    "我如此渴望拥抱波琳娜，以致伸手环抱虚空，将那片虚无紧紧按在胸前。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_a2f8268c:


    "我如此渴望拥抱罗姆卡，以致伸手环抱虚空，将那片虚无紧紧按在胸前。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_dbefd125:


    "我如此渴望拥抱奥利娅，以致伸手环抱虚空，将那片虚无紧紧按在胸前。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_5035fe38:


    "吉洪诺夫与同事交换了意味深长的眼神。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_ea64e8c5:


    "警督语气放软，但我感觉他们有什么别的事要说。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_770a5429:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/27 Ti.ogg"
    Tikhonov "知道这是什么吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_184ba62d:


    "他将一个小药盒推到我面前。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_8a21885e:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/145.Vit.ogg"
    Ant "维生素。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_54f5bd3f:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/28 A.ogg"
    Tikhonov "那知道精神分裂症是什么吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_ff55cb0f:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/146.Ps.ogg"
    Ant "精神病？"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_e5050900:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/29 Em.ogg"
    Tikhonov "对，孩子。这是一种病。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_05ba1783:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/30 Ee.ogg"
    Tikhonov "伴随认知功能障碍、情绪管理失调、妄想……"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_0df2548f:


    "我不明白说这话是什么意思。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_68db3305:


    "这和我有什么关系？"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_c0f5a508:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/31 Est.ogg"
    Tikhonov "这种病有药吃，能缓解症状。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_fe4cf860:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/32 No.ogg"
    Tikhonov "但不是每次吃都有用。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_04bc8d63:


    "我想或许该停止拥抱空气和控制不住地舔嘴唇，但冲动压倒了我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_e7ba0b4d:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/147.Ya.ogg"
    Ant "我见过黑色车库。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_69f70fcd:


    "吉洪诺夫咔嚓点燃打火机，点了支烟。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_d7ea217a:


    "我咳嗽起来，他反而露出冷笑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_ade4c13b:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/33 Cho.ogg"
    Tikhonov "黑色车库是都市传说。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_a07c5cee:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/34 Ya.ogg"
    Tikhonov "我经常看《犯罪新闻》报纸，上面总写海外连环杀手。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_9325f59e:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/35 Pra.ogg"
    Tikhonov "事实上，二十多年前有个叫赫伯特·马林的美国人为了阻止地震杀了十几个人。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_087ebf5e:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/36 Dr.ogg"
    Tikhonov "还有个叫理查德·蔡斯的家伙喝人血，以为这能解 Nazi秘密组织给他注射的毒。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_c533dcbd:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/150.Ya.ogg"
    Ant "我不认识那些人。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_13e238cc:


    "吉洪诺夫的语气充满伪装的同情。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_4a76553b:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/37 O.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你当然不认识。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_cfb7d8d4:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/38 No.ogg"
    Tikhonov "但你知道一个男孩……一个可悲的重病男孩，他父母濒临离婚，压力加重了他的病情。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_b0846e33:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/39 On.ogg"
    Tikhonov "他幻想出一群会说话的动物，还和它们交朋友。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_65fc9aa1:


    "吉洪诺夫深吸一口烟，吐出烟圈。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_8a8b2b06:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/151.Net.ogg"
    Ant "不是的……"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_71aa886d:


    "我的思绪纠缠，视线模糊。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_ca171d8e:


    "我曾经跟阿狸萨一同跃过森林！"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_b7f32bde:


    "我到过冰雪爷爷的宫殿！"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_9049c216:


    "我……"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_c6e7be2c:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/41 Pos.ogg"
    Tikhonov "谢苗失踪后，我们就盯上了你。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_e4ae3fbd:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/42 ta.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你这种古怪孤僻的孩子……但证据不足。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_b80cb1b0:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/43 Da.ogg"
    Tikhonov "甚至卡嘉失踪时……"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_add94fb4:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/152.Vr.ogg"
    Ant "撒谎！"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_8ad55f83:


    "我扑向可憎的警官，但他的搭档迅速把我按回座位。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_3129cfca:


    "挫败感令我窒息。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_d4422e94:


    "嘴里泛起难以忍受的味道，像生人手指的滋味……"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_448cd602:


    "等等，我怎会知道人肉的滋味？"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_d51715d4:


    "我紧捂太阳穴。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_61c09540:


    "仿佛大脑正在颅骨下沸腾。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_0da187f8:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/44 Mal.ogg"
    Tikhonov "那个男孩清除了他的敌人。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_149a856c:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/45 No.ogg"
    Tikhonov "但他脑中的野兽索求更多。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_5ad296ff:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/46 Oni.ogg"
    Tikhonov "逼迫他……"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_8ca06b01:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/156.Zam.ogg"
    Ant "闭嘴！"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_503fdd3a:


    "吉洪诺夫在烟灰缸里摁灭烟头。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_1e13d3f9:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/48 Zaru.ogg"
    Tikhonov "剁碎了他唯一的朋友。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_25b999de:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/49 Zarub.ogg"
    Tikhonov "剁碎了他的女友。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_cd3335b3:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/47 Zar.ogg"
    Tikhonov "剁碎了他的妹妹。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_4f5e6244:


    "我惊恐地呜咽，用手指拉扯下唇，脸颊被扯得变形。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_5ceabbf2:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/50 Sem.ogg"
    Tikhonov "冲突之后，你在密林里追上了谢苗。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_2bfd6de7:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/53 Kat.ogg"
    Tikhonov "又借口说秘密，把卡嘉骗到偏僻处。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_7993caa7:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/51 Vov.ogg"
    Tikhonov "在森林游荡时偶然遇到了沃瓦。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_9ca4a0e6:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/52 Voz.ogg"
    Tikhonov "也许你想玩他的玩具枪，他不肯给。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_aff08a99:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/158.Per.ogg"
    Ant "别说了！"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_92583479:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/54 Sl.ogg"
    Tikhonov "谢涅奇卡的案子更棘手。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_04ed8051:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/55 ona.ogg"
    Tikhonov "她在你到来前就失踪了，让我们困惑了很久……但现在我想起来了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_7360cff6:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/56 Tv.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你祖母葬在这里，对吧？"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_221f9300:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/159.Eto.ogg"
    Ant "这不是真的！只是场梦！"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_c12a86ee:


    "吉洪诺夫朝我逼近，他的脸快跟我的贴在了一起。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_32cad7ae:


    "我闻到剃须膏和烟草的气味。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_eed4fc45:


    "他凑得很近，用冷漠无情的目光审视着我，低声说道："


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_451196ce:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/57 Ti.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你是十二月来村子的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_aeb9808f:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/58 Pro.ogg"
    Tikhonov "到墓地看望祖母。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_721eb8da:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/59 Tam.ogg"
    Tikhonov "那时你看见了森娅。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_856d6262:


    "墓园的小路上扔着几条撕碎的衣物。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_891d1506:


    "我放声大哭。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_63d207b6:


    "吉洪诺夫侧了侧身，又点了支烟说："


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_c45465a3:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/60 Ad.ogg"
    Tikhonov "回忆就是地狱。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_db77d2ba:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/61 Ya.ogg"
    Tikhonov "对你而言，最残忍的惩罚，就是让你想起自己做过的所有事。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_d4c1bff0:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/62 Uv.ogg"
    Tikhonov "带走！"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_91edd27c:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/161.Eto.ogg"
    Ant "它们骗了我！都是它们的错！"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_95c054ab:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/161.Po.ogg"
    Ant "求您相信我！"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_afterdev_a8ca38ff:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/162.Let.ogg"
    Ant "警官！"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_aftertitles_40abc550:


    "病房明亮宽敞。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_aftertitles_4dca6f57:


    "这儿只有一片纯白，冬天永远不会结束。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_aftertitles_526eeef0:


    "伙食不错，但大部分是流食，因为有很多让医护人员领到食堂去的病友，牙齿嚼不动固体食物。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_aftertitles_01f77262:


    "有的人只能用吸管吃东西，我经常在走廊里碰见。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_aftertitles_6f7a94ea:


    "他们脏乱邋遢，在长椅上打盹，或者用指甲挠墙。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_aftertitles_3d981604:


    "不守规矩的会被关进四面全是软垫子的房间，有时候甚至直接关进地下室。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_aftertitles_1568c4cc:


    "等到放出来，这些人一句话都不说了。他们变得空洞、了无生气，像个玩偶。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_aftertitles_690f0bc8:


    "但我一直很规矩。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_aftertitles_705b8856:


    "不会像犯错者那样挨橡皮棍。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_aftertitles_99703f04:


    "可同病房的人有时恶劣至极。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_aftertitles_d7f71e9f:


    "并非所有人真的患有精……精神分……我开始遗忘某些词汇……但没错，有些人只是为躲{u}兵役{/u}而来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_aftertitles_159e9c74:


    "那些装病者无故欺凌我，就像从前的同学。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_aftertitles_dc67d0fa:


    "他们可能把烟头按在我裸露的皮肤上，或逼我洗他们的衣服，全程哄笑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_aftertitles_506e5f31:


    "有天，某个村里的傻子趁我睡着时摸上来，差点侵犯了我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_aftertitles_e0400283:


    "从那时起，我几乎不敢入睡。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_aftertitles_fcbc7ec5:


    "我总想着警官的话。他太愚蠢了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_aftertitles_f06dc193:


    "面具真实存在过，车库、林间舞蹈，所有一切都是真实的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_aftertitles_2d0cbde8:


    "若并非如此，我为何要杀害那个如清泉般动人的女孩？"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_aftertitles_21cef860:


    "若并非如此，我为何要杀害我最好的朋友？"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_aftertitles_139170b3:


    "若并非如此，我为何要杀害我最爱的人？"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_aftertitles_a7874968:


    "这难道不是纯粹的疯狂吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_aftertitles_b482a8f3:


    "走廊传来尖叫。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_aftertitles_58ef3e6d:


    "但我不在乎。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_aftertitles_62ba1e67:


    "我等待着春天降临。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_aftertitles_f211bcc6:


    "凝望房间里唯一有铁栏的窗户。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_aftertitles_968e717a:


    "害怕温暖的季节永不来临。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_aftertitles_e9f3f775:


    "遥远之处，有人吹起了笛声。"


translate chinese d5_ending_mad_world_aftertitles_8c6d2328:


    "随后我看见了它们……"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_965bb1fa:


    "一滴泪，一滴眼泪沿着我的脸颊滑落，像硫酸般灼烧着我的皮肤。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_20972997:


    "同样的酸液在我体内沸腾，腐蚀着我的五脏六腑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_01b80f7f:


    "我一眨不眨地看着奥莉娅。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_9167ec39:


    "死去的奥莉娅。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_095e159e:


    "她的眼睑低垂。鲜血染红了她头发，但她的面容依然纯净而安详。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_7ed1f1f7:


    "她的头骨像巧克力蛋一样被拇指压扁了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_35b01201:


    "不过，巧克力蛋里面可没有骨头和粘连脑组织的头发。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_d3cdc692:


    "若不是她头顶的伤口，我几乎要以为她只是睡着了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_94a16171:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/301 hn.ogg"
    "我吸了吸鼻子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_7b21e1e9:


    "是我杀死了我的妹妹。是我没能救下我们的父母。是我毁掉了我们的家。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_d49bff7f:


    "我多希望有一群成年人冲进屋里来。比如，由吉洪诺夫带领着。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_994c07a6:


    "我多希望他看见我手中的斧头，当场就判处我枪决。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_c9b0e1fe:


    "刚想到这里，那个一直潜伏在我脑海里的存在便控制了我的嘴唇，拉扯出一个恶心而夸张的笑容。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_08dd6ad2:



    voice "voice/bunny/20 T.ogg"
    Bunny "你不配死，你配得上最高奖赏。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_a5f3d044:



    voice "voice/bunny/21 Ti.ogg"
    Bunny "你做得对，安东。牺牲是必要的，牺牲永远都是正当的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_c8c7fa15:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/27 ti.ogg"
    Bunny "你会复仇的，你只需要耐心等待……"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_81c67654:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/301 Kog.ogg"
    Ant "等到什么时候？"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_bc2d89ef:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/28 p.ogg"
    Bunny "再晚一点，孩子。只要再晚一点点……"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_4a0deb54:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/29 t.ogg"
    Bunny "你还太弱。你需要变得更强。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_d045b35c:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/30 e.ogg"
    Bunny "如果你现在死了，谁来喂养那些善良的野兽？"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_12fe95a5:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/22 v.ogg"
    Bunny "该喂食了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_6501d0df:


    "我丢下斧头，它沉闷地砸在地板上。但这并没有惊醒奥莉娅。死人总是睡得这么沉……"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_391365ff:


    "我穿上外套，尽管某种第六感告诉我，我要去的地方并不需要衣服。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_9eb122ee:


    "我弯下腰，双手滑到奥莉娅的颈后和膝下。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_34c2d582:


    "一缕细细的口水从我张开的嘴里滴落到她的胸前。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_533cf5ba:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/23 s.ogg"
    Bunny "我们流口水了，嗯？"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_32024df3:


    "我亲爱的奥莉娅……"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_e9bb3a8c:


    "保护她是我的责任。作为她的哥哥。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_679350fa:


    "责任只会让我们变得软弱。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_493677ba:


    "唯有自由能给予我们力量。而奥莉娅现在自由了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_f5059d19:


    "浓重的阴影填满了她的眼窝和颧骨下方。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_ce58476c:


    "一幅死者的画像……这还算肖像吗，抑或已是静物画？"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_1845de20:


    "我抱起了妹妹。她轻得几乎没有重量。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_911ee0eb:


    "她那总是散发芬芳的头发，此刻飘散着一股铜腥而甜腻的血香。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_98b9444d:


    "奥莉娅的头颅耷拉在我的手臂上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_e2435002:


    "我想起妈妈把刚出生的奥莉娅抱给我，让我抱她的情景。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_01cfcd68:


    "那时我想：‘这么小，看起来这么可口，就已经是个人了吗？’"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_26e9bf08:


    "现在她不再是人了……"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_f31432d4:


    "是我造成了这一切。我把一个活生生的生命变成了尸体——冰冷、甜美、粘腻。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_836a2405:


    "我俯身，笨拙地吻了吻她冰冷的脸颊。它依然像过去一样柔软。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_53a8a5ea:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/31 ot.ogg"
    Bunny "咬一口吧。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_6962ca5a:


    "身后的门猛地被吹开，风灌满了屋子。门廊上覆满了雪。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_dc647a1e:


    "我走向暴风雪，极其小心地捧着身前那可怕的负担。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_1fdd644b:


    "四个字母：奥莉娅。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_81f245b8:


    "四个字母：食物。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_7c78c1c6:


    "我走到门廊上。世界已经变了。在我做出这一切之后，它怎么可能保持不变？"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_c5c96464:


    "某种无定形的团块在翻腾鼓胀。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_af966151:


    "‘是森林，’我想，‘它真实的模样。’"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_9dc1b671:


    "这是我的新家。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_fa87fd22:


    "树木潜伏在黑暗中，枝条伸向猎物。粗壮的树根从冻土中隆起，在雪地上勾勒出噩梦般的线条。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_de42cf33:


    "世界饥饿了。它的子嗣们站在我和那些扭曲蠕动的松树之间。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_111dd520:


    "它们已长到不可思议的规模，却依然让人觉得如此熟悉，如此亲切……"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_dbdb653c:


    "一道黑色的痕迹通向那些可怖的身影。一条细细的条纹，在雪已融化的地方。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_3cb6bf4a:


    "坚硬的土地让我想起巨型爬行动物的鳞片。它在我的脚底下起伏。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_2d8eac31:


    "我行走其上的巨兽在呼吸。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_e58a4031:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/03 Mi.ogg" 
    Alis "欢迎，兔子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_fb60bda6:



    voice "voice/Owl/40 Uh.ogg" 
    Owl "原来你长这样啊，呼呜。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_9269f363:



    voice "voice/Wolf/125 k.ogg"
    Wolf "挺——呜噜——漂亮嘛。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_28c01768:


    "我把奥莉娅向上托了托，像是掂量她的重量。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_1e185807:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/304 eto.ogg"
    Ant "这是我妹妹。我爱过她。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_6d34d9ac:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/04 E.ogg" 
    Alis "我们也喜欢她……把她拿近些。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_2533fbef:


    "风扑面而来，带着灰烬的气息，刺激着我的黏膜。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_0f0558ef:


    "一种折磨耳膜的尖锐声响从上方某处传来。介于空袭警报和女人痛苦哀嚎之间的声音。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_9792d046:


    "我抬头看向天空，它移动着，蠕动着，仿佛由数百万条蠕虫编织而成。天空死了，就像奥莉娅一样，如今满是蛆虫。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_0d353560:


    "月亮，浑圆而昏黄，在森林上空鼓胀，如同死人凸出的眼球。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_6a0f85f7:


    "月亮看到了我所做的一切。它在尖叫。月亮因恐惧而尖啸，流淌着鲜血。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_1045b8cc:


    "我感觉自己像风中的一片羽毛。我也感觉到，没有奥莉娅的世界就应该是这个样子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_80c3258f:


    "有着尖叫的月亮，腐烂的天空，以及在墓地中爬行的针叶林。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_2a556259:


    "巨兽的影子笼罩了我和我死去的妹妹。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_af027513:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/05 Sp.ogg" 
    Alis "谢谢你，兔子。我从未怀疑过你。可以吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_65c8f9e7:


    "我的目光在那些骇人的轮廓间飞快移动。它们时而靠近，时而后退。我一眨眼，它们就换了位置。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_9548cd7c:


    "这不对。这些怪物随时能把我撕成碎片。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_b15357f2:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/24 ra.ogg"
    Bunny "朋友们会这样吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_b4c2f39e:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/25 p.ogg"
    Bunny "看看它们，它们是你的家人，你的族群……"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_d4cebdea:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/26 d.ogg"
    Bunny "相信它们，已经没有回头路了。所有的桥都已烧毁，把肉给它们吧，它们会温柔对待的，把肉给它们。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_265174f8:


    "我那麻木、沾满鲜血的手空了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_e1b2c5be:


    "那只饥饿的、形似狐狸的野兽贴上了尸体。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_93b0e405:


    "我听到了骨头碎裂的声音。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_65090373:


    "一条恶心的蜈蚣身体伸展着，它的颚部开合，锋利如镰刀。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_2a85d47d:


    "它们割开了我妹妹的腹部。同时，那可怕的下颚咬住了奥莉娅苍白的脸庞。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_b1e03161:


    "我踉跄了一下，但无法移开视线。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_c9e96ca5:


    "阿狸萨把内脏甩到一边。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_f0c3c02d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/08 Pr.ogg" 
    Alis "祝好胃口。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_4c2c4254:


    "猫头鹰扑向那些灰暗、黏滑的肠子，贪婪地吞噬着，如同流浪狗吞食腐肉。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_528b0439:


    "狐狸将尸体撕扯得四分五裂。肌腱在爪子的力量下崩断。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_448ce9e2:


    "一块块多汁的人肉扑通扑通掉在我面前。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_8b1cb495:


    "死去但不知为何仍未凝结的血液流向我的脚边。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_3607a6e9:


    "奥莉娅的头颅倒向地面，仅靠一小片皮肤与身体相连。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_6e770e0a:


    "她脖子里似乎藏着什么紫色的管子，现在露了出来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_d0804750:


    "‘她身体里有这么多东西，’——我想。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_1cf5f603:


    "不知道是妹妹被开膛破肚的时候一直睁着眼睛，还是阿狸萨干脆撕掉了她的眼皮。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_5217a850:


    "奥莉娅现在直勾勾地看着我。她的头像钟摆一样摇晃。我也随之摇晃。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_98938c51:


    "野兽们在准备食物。一场盛宴。为这麻风星球准备的深夜大餐。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_12ed03dd:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/Da.ogg"
    Bear "这肯定不够……"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_aa7644d5:


    "那头依稀还有熊形的野兽，在粉红色的雪地上拖来几个玩偶。不，那不是玩偶……"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_a4dfa4bf:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/Za.ogg"
    Bear "给爸爸的……给妈妈的……"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_1d949aca:


    "小熊把我已无生气的父母的躯体扔到了空地上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_32ad29a8:


    "我发出微弱的呻吟，双手伸向妈妈和爸爸。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_75dd97ec:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/09 Se.ogg"
    Alis "今晚我们能吃饱了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_c656842f:


    "阿狸萨舔着嘴唇，抓住爸爸，将他抛向兽群，野兽扑向尸体。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_008ea0df:


    "那个曾让我骑在他肩上，以便我能更好地看新年烟花的人……"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_a7049e07:


    "已经没有了肩膀。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_cdef01d3:


    "那个曾让我坐在他膝上的人……"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_78485961:


    "已经没有了双腿。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_d9b4d131:


    "住手，我爸爸是全世界最好的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_448e498c:


    "那个世界已不复存在，我们把它吃掉了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_037ffb3d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/11 Eto.ogg" 
    Alis "这不只是肉，兔子……"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_0b4fb35d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/12 Eto.ogg" 
    Alis "这是开启我们光明未来之门的钥匙。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_7899a4a9:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/13 V.ogg" 
    Alis "通向那个我们可以吃尽一切的土地。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_df27cf23:


    "我妈妈在被撕碎时发出噼啪和碎裂声。镰刀切割、砍剁，从白骨上剔下肉和脂肪。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_54e69e86:


    "肉块落下，和我妹妹的残骸混在一起。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_26a83494:


    "一个源于另一个，然后再次融为一体。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_d8f84104:


    "我想起来了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_602f9798:


    "你什么都没想起来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_ae06570d:


    "妈妈怎么逗着我和奥莉娅玩，在地上挖了个小洞。我们把珠子放进去，用彩色玻璃片盖上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_a3249752:


    "那是我们的宝库。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_70f3a6d9:


    "这是坟墓。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_d091ea8d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/14 Zr.ogg" 
    Alis "吃吧，兔子。照做，别想反抗。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_09225bd0:


    "我体内的野兽最先服从了命令。没等我眨眼，我已经跪倒在地，双手在冰冷黏腻的肉块中翻找。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_ede9132b:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/305 1v.ogg"
    "眼泪和口水从我身上涌出。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_8262220a:


    "我捧起一片厚肉凑到脸前。是妈妈？奥莉娅？管他呢！我好饿！"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_d0f7466c:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/305 0v.ogg"
    "我的牙齿咬进这美味的款待。里面有一小片骨头。我也把它吞了下去。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_d3c2e401:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/10 Gl.ogg"
    "妈妈。我很确定那是她。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_08bb2396:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/305 v.ogg"
    Ant "好吃！"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_c5352a59:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/15 Ne.ogg" 
    Alis "尝起来有点兔肉味，对吧？"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_ea51b454:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/16 A t.ogg" 
    Alis "你知道那个关于兔子咬不到月亮的老故事吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_380480f0:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/17 Zi.ogg" 
    Alis "从前有个男孩，他有好多好多玩具。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_35f0ef7c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/18 E.ogg" 
    Alis "当主人睡着后，它们在深夜逃离了他，来到了雪白的空地。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_0f4d389d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/19 Tam.ogg" 
    Alis "在那里，煤烟般漆黑的天空中，挂着一轮满月。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_8a59d796:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/20 Med.ogg"
    Alis "熊第一个跳起来，撕下了一大块。‘尝起来像蜂蜜，’他说。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_ce02a861:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/21 Go.ogg"
    Alis "饥饿的狼崽飞向天空，牙齿咔哒作响。‘肥美的鱼腥味，’他的吼声在田野上回荡。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_ab2f4b93:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/22 Pr.ogg" 
    Alis "再一跳——轮到狐狸在月光下舔嘴唇了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_521ae70a:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/23 Vs.ogg" 
    Alis "‘谁都知道月亮是奶酪做的，’狡猾的野兽咧嘴一笑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_d29d14c5:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/24 As.ogg" 
    Alis "而猫头鹰什么也没说。但其他人都知道，对她来说，世上的一切尝起来都像老鼠。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_4435a87a:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/25 E.ogg" 
    Alis "只有胆小的兔子才会害怕跳那么高，去吧，去够天上那块美味的月亮。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_0163bc7c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/26 tr.ogg" 
    Alis "这个受惊的女孩逃离了她的主人，筑了个巢，又缝了两只小兔子，用锯末填满肚子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_1126c3cc:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/27 E.ogg" 
    Alis "它们谁也别想再咬到月亮了，因为兔子把她的力量分给了她的孩子们。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_fed4482c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/28 No.ogg"
    Alis "但现在，兔子，你把所有的力量都吸收了……"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_f6fa50ea:


    "月亮嚎叫着表示同意。脓液从天空的破洞中流出。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_15a8dd5a:


    "而折磨我的饥饿感，让我把越来越多的肉塞进嘴里。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_683efc15:


    "我看见妈妈站在厨房里，沐浴在晨光中。她神秘地微笑着，慈爱地看着我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_66d2d10e:


    "我看见奥莉娅跑进房间扑进我的怀抱。她那明媚的笑容。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_56dc20c2:


    "我看见肉。我的胃鼓胀起来。我的妈妈和我的姐妹卡在了我的牙缝里。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_b09469be:


    "我打了个嗝，开始大笑。我舔着手指，狂笑着，用拳头捶打着残骸。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_5a6bd474:


    "兽群以同样的吠叫般笑声回应。暴风雪击打着我们，野兽们退向森林。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_f4a56e34:


    "我又抓了些肉，边走边啃着一块关节骨，四肢着地跟在它们后面爬行。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_5d32cbcc:


    "一根指甲刺穿了我的上颚。我把它吐出来，站了起来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_5adcda02:


    "那些生物仍在向森林撤退。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_701e87e2:


    "树木在恶臭的黑暗中盘旋，有时甚至互相攻击。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_f1345f41:


    "猩红的血浆在坑洼中翻腾。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_d529d6d6:


    "一簇簇眼睛在树干上生长。它们注视着我的一举一动。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_ee88e3c7:


    "我感到自己在蜕皮，那是一种美妙的感觉。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_4fed18f8:


    "往事连同少年的躯壳一起剥落。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_831b237d:


    "在我旧皮之下，某种狂野不羁的东西舒展开来。某种真实的东西。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_61f8e512:


    "在这片密林中我不感到恐惧。黑夜属于我们。我就是兽群……"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_da431363:


    Narr_color "看，这片古老的森林……还是……原来那样吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_cccee08c:


    Narr_color "我回头看了看那些现在只是普通树木的树，它们不再像受惊的虫子般骚动。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_8b4b6654:


    Narr_color "我的脚下，是普通的老土地。还有一个从松树后走出的普通女孩，正朝我走来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_81b9a4a5:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/22 Dob.ogg"
    Alis_Color "欢迎回家，兔子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_066a9a4c:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/01 eto.ogg"
    Ant_Color "这地方真美……还有喜庆的声音……"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_753fdff0:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/24 Ost.ogg"
    Alis_Color "你的转生就快完成了，只差一点点。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_7d8bb216:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/25 Den.ogg"
    Alis_Color "新兔子的生日……"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_c5c06a01:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/26 raz.ogg"
    Alis_Color "可以让我揪揪你的耳朵吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_f0269c3f:


    Narr_color "音乐和爆竹声吸引着我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_8aba7ab4:


    Narr_color "在这奇妙空地一步之遥的某处，一种令人心碎的幸福在等待着我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_1902cba9:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/27 Pot.ogg"
    Alis_Color "快点，傻瓜。我保证这是最后一次叫你‘傻瓜’了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_533ea142:


    Narr_color "我牵起她的手。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_2e5d804e:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/28 Be.ogg"
    Alis_Color "我们跑吧！"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_10858d97:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/03 no.ogg"
    Ant_Color "跑去哪儿？"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_250ca2f5:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/29 Ti.ogg"
    Alis_Color "你已经知道了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_a4ef02d0:


    Narr_color "她指向天空，那被尖叫的月亮加冕的天空。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_0c6db255:


    Narr_color "我看了看自己无力的双腿，犹豫地开口。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_a5bdd886:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/04 ona.ogg"
    Ant_Color "太高了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_df44953d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/30 Pr.ogg"
    Alis_Color "干脆忘掉他们在学校里教你的那些东西。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_4bd27b18:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/31 Zem.ogg"
    Alis_Color "重力定律是给傻瓜准备的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_c8100a7c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/32 Sd.ogg"
    Alis_Color "想一起试试吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_6c689111:


    Narr_color "我点点头。当然，我们要一起。这新的天空是为我们俩准备的。月亮也只是在为我们尖叫。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_02f15857:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/33 R.ogg"
    Alis_Color "一……"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_130c6cb1:


    Narr_color "我们跳了起来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_ac90b594:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/05 D.ogg"
    Ant_Color "二……"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_23c83544:


    Narr_color "又一次跳跃。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_ae72dac4:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/34 Tri.ogg"
    Alis_Color "三！来吧！"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_62ea6a3a:


    Narr_color "然后，它发生了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_a5b80b07:


    Narr_color "我们强健的双腿蹬离冻土，身体冲向天空，将我们黑色阴影的腐朽污秽抛在身后。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_d8c08a03:


    "刺骨的严寒包裹了我，像刑具般钻进我的脊椎，寒彻骨髓。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_947da193:


    "我的皮肤开裂，血滴变成冰晶，从伤口四散。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_25a74460:


    "我爆发出大笑。但不是从我嘴里——我的舌头已经变蓝僵硬——而是从其他地方。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_dc25e2cd:


    "大概是黑暗本身在我体内狂笑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_cb0e94e9:


    "阿狸萨向我投来一个耀眼的笑容。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_7b28b5e3:


    "我们在呼啸的飓风中旋转，在星球的脓疮间。冻肉从骨头上剥落。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_301f0333:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/35 Va.ogg"
    Alis "华尔兹！"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_a6117cd2:


    "一道裂纹划过她发青的脸庞。她脸颊的碎片像冰片般坠入深渊。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_a451fe3d:


    "风把她眼球浆液从扩大的孔洞中吹出。天空舞者的动作慢了下来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_3eefc8f3:


    "我拥抱着曾是阿狸萨的冰雕跳着华尔兹。我们融为单一的剪影。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_ac2ca439:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/30 Ya.ogg" 
    Alis "我会在地面等你。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_fdec83ec:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/306 p.ogg"
    Ant "等等！"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_f610d79f:


    "她挣脱了我，碎裂成片，在我手中瓦解，落入下方蠕动的黑暗。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_d548e741:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/31 Let.ogg"
    Alis "飞吧！"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_9a617c5b:


    "我知道该做什么。我向上冲去，冲向那些幼虫球体和在空间本身穿孔的溃疡。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_fe60cb8b:


    "冲向黄色的月亮。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_02dab0da:


    "它流着口水，和我一样。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_99f73dbf:


    "我的过去留在了下方的某处。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_8f825f08:


    "卡嘉。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_37e65e51:


    "她恨我，那个恶毒的婊子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_fd8c03a6:


    "谢苗。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_778bb2ec:


    "一个丑陋的胖子，打我欺负我，叫我懦夫。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_cd60e5a8:


    "罗姆卡。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_7042f478:


    "他从不是我真正的朋友，他烂掉了我才不在乎。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_a37f8a80:


    "他烂掉了我才不在乎。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_cef4fa07:


    "拜沙。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_b3dc514d:


    "一个马屁精和懦夫。我早该在第一时间摆脱他。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_e48b5207:


    "妈妈和爸爸。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_c49bbec2:


    "他们的尖叫，他们无休止的争吵，他们冰冷的眼神……"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_a33bb6b3:


    "那个该死的村子。那个我痛恨的、令人窒息的房子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_f0b32676:


    "奥莉娅。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_aae978c4:


    "她死了……一切都死了。死了，毁了，腐烂了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_8fca9ee6:


    "我终于自由了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_78ba46c1:


    "月亮将我向上拉。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_43b89f5f:


    "我体内某个非常重要的东西裂开、分解了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_bb1a83a2:


    "某些不必要的东西。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_fd8a710d:


    "我忘了父亲的名字。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_402a02cd:


    "我忘了母亲的名字。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_42395f02:


    "我忘了那个我曾紧紧拥抱的小女孩的名字。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_c82615cd:


    "在黄色月亮蠕动着、蔓延着的阴影中……"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_ee7b35d6:


    "……我忘记了自己的名字。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_692a8068:


    "但我也做到了……"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_9da5b839:


    "我成功咬到了月亮。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_6253a0e4:


    "我的皮肤鼓胀，从血肉上剥离。我的骨头伴随着撕裂声从中戳出。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_28009ad1:


    "饥饿。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_d4ab6502:


    "我的嘴用力张开，脸颊撕裂。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_80c88e54:


    "那不再是嘴。是血盆大口。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_9b7ffabb:


    "我所有的牙齿都掉光了，像个婴儿。锋利的骨刀从牙龈长出，刺穿我的嘴唇。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_28009ad1_1:


    "饥饿。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_271e71b1:


    "我的眼球爆裂，溅在脸上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_ddd5288b:


    "那不再是人脸，而是动物的脸。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_c967b697:


    "我的肌肉扭结成团。新的眼睛在我的眼窝里形成。它们视一切为食物。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_3c54cc0b:


    "可食用的世界。无尽的森林，无尽的猎场。可以藏身的黑暗。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_a917f027:


    "我咆哮。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_fc788f37:


    "爪子从手指中伸出，撕掉指甲。我扯掉残留的旧皮，旧脸的碎片，旧头发。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_3d700041:


    "月亮注视着我的变形，发出嚎叫。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_0d15b8a0:


    "当仪式完成，当我的新骨头在皮囊下接合，当我的头骨硬化，呈现出真实的形态，我在黏滑的天空中，星辰之间停下……"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_96b90833:


    "……然后冲回地球。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_aftertitles_4f1f2870:


    "世界在流血。行星沉入漆黑。火焰熄灭，整个城市眨眼间化为灰烬。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_aftertitles_f85bb0cb:


    "由爪子、尾巴和牙齿组成的集合体爬行着，摧毁生命本身。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_aftertitles_b059498b:


    "海洋变成深红。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_aftertitles_ec12dbb1:


    "森林大火是唯一的光源。巨大怪物的影子在火焰中穿梭。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_aftertitles_f41bc95d:


    "它们吞食河流与山脉。它们啃噬现实的骨骼。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_aftertitles_945ec078:


    "我藏在黑暗中。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_aftertitles_e7675e99:


    "我掘进地里，在啜饮完内容物后，在被挖开的坟墓中度夜。但我仍无法躲避饥饿。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_aftertitles_b4a15109:


    "它无法被满足，一刻也不能。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_aftertitles_4c5e6ebf:


    "我在挨饿。我如此饥饿，以至于啃噬自己。即使吃掉月亮，我也不会饱足。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_aftertitles_5ac75451:


    "我所能做的只有吞噬。我是饥饿，我是世界的吞噬者。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_aftertitles_b5681231:


    "我创造虚无。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_aftertitles_c2372922:


    "我留下这颗行星被啃食一半的核心。我吞食墓地。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_aftertitles_44dbc48e:


    "我的嚎叫是死亡颂歌。我的身体比任何人所能想象的还要庞大——如果我没有吃掉所有人的话。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_aftertitles_9d9df590:


    "我在黑暗中行走，张开的巨口舀起悬崖与海洋。我的眼睛在眼窝的坑洞中转动，搜寻四周的营养。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_aftertitles_e6112b58:


    "我吞食星辰。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_aftertitles_0327f1df:


    "我吞噬宇宙。"


translate chinese d5_ending_apocalypse_aftertitles_bd9f34b4:


    "我听见行星在尖叫。我听见宇宙在恐惧中哀嚎，它垂死的痉挛永无止境。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_24b69a63:


    "在经历了她所承受的疯狂之后，我不敢因此怪癖评判她。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_5f166b28:


    "我自己的脸被内心野兽拉扯出一个狞笑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_98bf043d:


    "到头来，我所有想要的一切，我所有为之奋斗的，就是这个女孩和我们的友谊。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_d41696b5:


    "或者甚至超越友谊的某种东西……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_222c0f58:


    "我拥抱波琳娜，她以有力的拥抱回应。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_a6cffed1:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/01 Ni.ogg"
    Ant "我一直不明白，为什么要把精神病院设在这么小的村子里。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_cc5d1ead:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/240 Et.ogg"
    Pol "这是地区医院。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_0533997a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/241 E.ogg" 
    Pol "而且……在这里，靠近森林的地方，人很容易疯掉。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_ff4328a3:


    "我对这一点再清楚不过了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_072df676:


    "风拂过小荒园里光秃秃的树枝。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_4f51b9e6:


    "太阳在针叶林上方落下。空气潮湿，带着松树的气味。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_ba6e02b3:


    "阴影在建筑风化的外墙上滑动，如同身着黑色病号服的疯子幽灵。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_9cf23689:


    "这个村子像一具尸体，体内凝固着防腐液。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_741a7b3f:


    "一具可怕的玩偶，由某个恋尸癖用从死人身上偷来的衣物制成。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_8f48c252:


    "在经历了不得不做的一切之后。在波琳娜和我触碰了黑暗之后……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_4420c13b:


    "我们深陷其中，直至肘部，如同浸在血里。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_f30b464f:


    "站在车旁，与我的搭档并肩，我怒视着那些有栏杆的窗户。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_5e6d53a3:


    "雪从天空落下，肃穆而焦虑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_1f3801fd:


    "我自己也可能身处此地。被绑在床上，用药物镇静。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_510419b0:


    "但我们设法逃离了上锁的病房。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_e9698ead:


    "当年紧急情况部的人发现拜沙时，他正爬行在森林的沟壑里。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_9a7dc6aa:


    "医生在他胃里找到了田鼠和松鼠的残骸。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_51bdc441:


    "他竭尽全力活了下来。警方推断这个可怜的男孩成了连环杀手的受害者，这使他精神受创。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_24076b5e:


    "波琳娜和我用我们自己的方式保持了完整。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_b238fdde:


    "但如果真正的疯子不在里面，而在外面呢？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_9d9523e7:


    "我看着手机。壁纸上的爸爸正带着温和的微笑回望着我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_e56fd699:


    "他牵着奥莉娅的手。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_bdca3966:


    "我的小妹妹大笑着，仿佛被封存在琥珀中，定格在那个遥远、永远逝去的夏日。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_8919fed2:


    "我看了看屏幕角落的时间。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_bb29541b:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/02 Pr.ogg"
    Ant "探视时间到了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_8a746ce9:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/242 Poi.ogg"
    Pol "我们走吧。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_ceead2b1:


    "穿堂风吹过这座破败建筑的入口大厅。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_8fbee3ed:


    "每两个灯泡就有一个是坏的，所以走廊几乎昏暗无光。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_936efac0:



    voice "voice/Med/01Vi.ogg"
    Doctor "需要帮忙吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_e579464c:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/243 K.ogg" 
    Pol "我们来看望伊戈尔·布达耶夫。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_c7620562:



    voice "voice/Med/02 A.ogg"
    Doctor "啊……我们的常客！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_06921d76:



    voice "voice/Med/04 Pa.ogg"
    Doctor "病人们现在都在食堂或接受常规治疗，但伊戈尔·杜尔加诺维奇已经回房间了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_3777a7c7:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/03 Ka.ogg"
    Ant "他感觉怎么样？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_150687a3:



    voice "voice/Med/05 Nad.ogg"
    Doctor "恐怕还是没有康复的希望。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_bc837448:



    voice "voice/Med/06 Bo.ogg"
    Doctor "他余生可能都需要医疗辅助。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_087ce2fa:



    voice "voice/Med/07 no.ogg"
    Doctor "但是，你知道吗，伊戈尔最近沉迷于手工艺。我们这里欢迎任何形式的艺术治疗。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_27593af4:



    voice "voice/Med/08 on.ogg"
    Doctor "他甚至成了我们儿童病房艺术俱乐部的负责人。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_91451150:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/04 Ne.ogg"
    Ant "哈，他又在搞烙画了？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_4b78d5bf:



    voice "voice/Med/09 da.ogg"
    Doctor "哦不，我们不可能让他碰电烙铁的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_724f1558:



    voice "voice/Med/10 net.ogg"
    Doctor "他在给我们业余剧团缝制服装。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_85f45293:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/244 Da.ogg"
    Pol "你们这里简直是人才工厂，不是医院。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_87ab264d:


    "医护人员没听出讽刺。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_29f2f94f:



    voice "voice/Med/11 Na.ogg"
    Doctor "是的，他们都是很棒的孩子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_78a3e29a:



    voice "voice/Med/03 Ed.ogg"
    Doctor "跟我来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_82b507c1:


    "一只蟑螂跑过油毡地板。波琳娜用鞋踩碎了它，厌恶地皱了下眉。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_8d7c84ec:


    "医护人员打开了门。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_3ec90d1a:



    voice "voice/Med/12 Eg.ogg"
    Doctor "伊戈尔·杜尔加诺维奇，你有访客。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_e651be23:


    "我为这次见面做了准备，但看到明显比常人衰老更快的拜沙，仍然让我震惊。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_b4330c0a:


    "穿着国家发的睡衣的病人将目光从窗户移开，银发苍苍的头转向我们。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_488a9883:


    "他泪汪汪的眼睛空洞无神。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_ec7537a7:


    "波琳娜意识到这是让我们独处的好时机，便开始和医护人员交谈以分散其注意力。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_90a6ec6c:


    "我听不到她们说话了。最初的震惊被决心取代。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_9237ef0b:


    "我走近我的老伙计，用我的影子笼罩了他。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_4d3504d8:


    "拜沙缩了一下，仿佛那影子灼伤了他。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_844d06ed:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/01k.ogg"
    Bya "你、你、你、你是谁，嗯？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_fe016b6f:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/05 Pr.ogg"
    Ant "假装忘记我了，是吧？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_8df23e76:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/02ne.ogg"
    Bya "别、别、别伤害我，嗯。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_981ea14b:


    "我把声音压低到令人发寒的耳语。这是一场一对一的对话。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_4a693303:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/06 Es.ogg"
    Ant "如果疼痛能让你记起来……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_5c34aed3:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/03ee.ogg"
    "我站到他面前，用后背挡住医护人员的视线，抓住了他的衣领。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_3c264bba:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/04d.ogg"
    Bya "先、先、先生，求、求、求你。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_1937606d:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/05Ya.ogg"
    Bya "我、我、我只是个孩子，嗯。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_7a282e46:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/07 Te.ogg"
    Ant "你三十七了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_dc2ff582:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/06ne.ogg"
    Bya "胡、胡说。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_5a9473c8:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/07po.ogg"
    Bya "你为、为、为什么要撒谎？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_f2b7b204:


    "我更用力地拽他的衣服。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_c3ae084c:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/09 E.ogg"
    Ant "如果可以，我现在就杀了你，明白吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_966c2932:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/09 V.ogg"
    Ant "看着我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_12ab6ce5:



    voice "voice/Med/13 Se.ogg"
    Doctor "抱歉，但你不能这样对待我们的病人。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_8b9e7234:


    "“我还没开始呢”，我松开手指时想道。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_3489f996:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/246 Vs.ogg" 
    Pol "没事，他们是老朋友。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_9156bab7:


    "拜沙的目光开始扫视房间，最后停在波琳娜身上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_f28dc922:


    "我们的老同学背抵着墙，全身发抖。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_7553063e:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/10za.ogg"
    Bya "为、为、为什么带她来这儿！？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_0deec457:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/11pr.ogg"
    Bya "赶、赶她走，嗯，走开！！！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_2a301c57:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/12uh.ogg"
    Bya "走开，你和那、那头野兽都走开！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_6115c863:


    "我也转向站在黑暗角落里一动不动的波琳娜。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_a832d9bd:


    "她脸上绽开一道可怕的笑容，如同裂开的伤口。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_669933d9:


    "我们交换了无声的信号。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_ae360a4a:


    "是时候了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_c3339476:


    "上路的时候到了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_a23a076b:


    "她把医护人员叫到一边。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_e0d8e1fa:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/247 M.ogg" 
    Pol "我们也许可以带拜沙……带布达耶夫散散步？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_aa056f35:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/248 Es.ogg" 
    Pol "当然，由我们负责。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_7c9c5287:



    voice "voice/Med/14 Chto.ogg"
    Doctor "什么？这不可能。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_9cbb0b58:



    voice "voice/Med/15 On.ogg"
    Doctor "他必须一直在专业人士的监护下。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_fa8ba1ba:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/249 Ya.ogg" 
    Pol "我就是专业人士。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_ce1197b0:


    "波琳娜从口袋里掏出什么东西递给医护人员。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_137c46b7:


    "她皱起眉头，看着波琳娜手中的信封。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_d4872e76:



    voice "voice/Med/16 U.ogg"
    Doctor "你看，小姐……你身上有这种负面的气场……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_df3fd28c:



    voice "voice/Med/17 V.ogg"
    Doctor "你们俩……看起来都超级古怪。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_267efa96:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/250 Eto.ogg"
    Pol "我能搞定这个。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_c12a362a:


    "波琳娜摆弄着钞票，增加了酬劳。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_6c66765d:



    voice "voice/Med/18 Ch.ogg"
    Doctor "嗯……好吧，医生……我想病人交给你是安全的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_4419a78a:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/13ne.ogg"
    Bya "别、别、别把我交给他们。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_ecf61296:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/14to.ogg"
    Bya "除、除了这个，什么、什么都行，嗯！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_7e9dcec7:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/10 Na.ogg"
    Ant "走。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_88b0149b:


    voice "voice/anton/Adult/08 P3.ogg"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_d853a516:


    "我捏紧他的肩膀。大概会留下相当大的印记。知道这个让我感到愉悦。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_85f1162a:


    "拜沙虚弱地试图反抗，他盯着波琳娜，仿佛她是什么活死人。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_c614f18c:


    "医护人员转向窗户。她的良心在与贪婪斗争。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_690713d9:


    "而且，正如我们村子的惯例，贪婪赢了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_20960ef9:



    voice "voice/Med/19 Eg.ogg"
    Doctor "伊戈尔·杜尔加诺维奇刚打过镇静剂。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_5f6f0d95:



    voice "voice/Med/20 On.ogg"
    Doctor "他应该反抗不了什么。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_a659df83:


    "‘我倒想看看他试试，’我咧开嘴想道。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_9f49c3ee:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/251 na.ogg" 
    Pol "那么，关于我们之前谈到的那个……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_6774d79b:



    voice "voice/Med/21 oi.ogg"
    Doctor "哦，对。我去拿袋子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_90fb7844:


    "我们走进风中。乌云翻滚过松林顶端，越来越厚。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_66bdaa47:


    "拜沙膝盖发软。他抽泣着，盯着等我们的车——我那辆黑色的‘虎’式SUV。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_daae6835:


    "他看着它，仿佛期待迎接他的是个带工业绞肉机的宽敞房间，而不是汽车内饰。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_c1ac819a:


    "这庞然大物闪耀着铬合金的光泽。一头饥饿的金属野兽。一个不祥的动物。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_4dcd2b2f:


    "我们架着拜沙的胳膊肘，把他押进后座。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_28566fa4:


    "我们脸上痉挛般的笑容扭曲着，映在车窗上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_d10a8930:


    "毫无防备的拜沙偷偷瞥向他度过大半生的医院。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_fc7b8195:


    "他的童年结束了，但笼罩着针叶林村庄的噩梦没有。人们仍然在这里失踪。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_86bb78f5:


    "古老邪恶的痕迹依然出现在警方的报告中。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_57ed8290:


    "它们存活在谣言和恐怖故事里，被今天的学生们讲述。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_3f340458:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/17ku.ogg"
    Bya "你、你、你们要带我去哪、哪儿，嗯？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_353ac3c0:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/252 T.ogg"
    Pol "你知道去哪儿。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_a9e0168b:


    "一把枪出现在我的搭档手中。她用它抵住我们的俘虏。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_e9cab3f0:


    "是一把点三八。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_cdb71c41:


    "在这里，在地狱的边缘，我不信任铅弹。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_380f4a3b:


    "这里的武器不同。战争的规则也不同。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_5f73cf90:


    voice "voice/byasha/5day/19Aaa.ogg"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_5d3fc82d:


    Bya "你、你们坏、坏透了，嗯！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_ffa7c0c4:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/21ti.ogg"
    Bya "你、你们……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_16119bb5:


    "拜沙将恳求的目光投向我。他找错了地方，也找错了人求助。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_9658d63f:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/22za.ogg"
    Bya "为、为、为什么把那个带着恶魔般笑容的野兽带到这儿来？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_bc869e78:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/253 S.ogg"
    Pol "你很快就会知道的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_e917c346:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/10 Nas.ogg"
    Ant "好好享受这趟车程吧，伙计。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_81bcbaae:


    "离开村庄后，我拐上一条不起眼的小径。松树像阴森的堡垒城墙般耸立在我们上方。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_27ec17ae:


    "它们的枝条伸向汽车，针叶的爪子拂去车顶的积雪。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_33f608c5:


    "阴影如同从沉睡中苏醒的秃鹫，悄悄靠近小径。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_70ccc4c9:


    "黑色的树干在两侧闪过。小径变窄。灌木丛中传来鸦叫和吱吱声。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_cb53f25f:


    "我在一处低洼地，靠近一个汩汩的泉水停了车。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_11cba82a:


    "拜沙在后座开始颤抖。他猜到我们的计划了吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_4696c843:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/12 Vs.ogg"
    Ant "现在想起来了？你那丑陋的脸告诉我你想起来了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_2e395f5e:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/23ch.ogg"
    Bya "布、布、布拉……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_ab2da144:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/13 N.ogg"
    Ant "说啊，你能做到的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_6de3dc8f:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/24ga.ogg"
    Bya "嘎、嘎、嘎拉……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_1106e9f2:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/14 Na.ogg"
    Ant "出来，怪胎。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_2d9726dd:


    "他不想走。我不得不把他从‘虎’里拖出来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_d0edf8b3:


    "拜沙绊了一下，跪倒在地。他的脸和他的头发、和我们周围的雪一样白。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_573ba4dd:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/26toha.ogg"
    Bya "托、托哈……嗯……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_ac57496a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/254 o.ogg" 
    Pol "哎呀！有进展了！我们的病人正在康复。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_2a6c328f:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/27pol.ogg"
    Bya "波、波琳娜……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_49ba09f8:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/28za.ogg"
    Bya "为、为、为什么要这么做，嗯？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_376a8124:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/15 Z.ogg"
    Ant "为、为什么！？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_b8bbd699:


    "我拿出手机，把屏幕凑到拜沙睁圆的眼睛前。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_ade3f856:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/16 Za.ogg"
    Ant "为什么，你问？你这个混蛋！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_1e02adce:


    "照片上一个短发少年看着拜沙。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_a9c26fc2:


    "村里的新闻聊天群里满是这样的照片。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_9acc8474:


    "失踪的精神病院病人，未成年孤儿，没人会为之哭泣的社会弃儿。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_ecdd0c0b:


    "我记得我那该死的学校布告栏上所有的‘儿童失踪！’海报。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_4573bfb2:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/17 De.ogg"
    Ant "孩子还在失踪，不是吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_85fb240d:


    "拜沙抽泣着，口水从嘴里流下。一块深色污渍在他睡衣裤上扩散开来。波琳娜厌恶地哼了一声。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_628b3daf:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/18 Kru.ogg"
    Ant "手工艺俱乐部，嗯？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_4a81c56d:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/255 mi.ogg"
    Pol "我们全都知道。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_8e4897dd:


    "波琳娜打开后备箱，把一个塑料袋扔向拜沙。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_ad9d8de5:


    "一堆动物面具从袋子里滑到雪地上，那是某个有事业心的医护人员卖给我们的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_4720a0b9:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/19 V.ogg"
    Ant "你在疯人院里做了新面具。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_dfa28b6a:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/31ya.ogg"
    Bya "我、我、我不明白，托、托沙！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_f283bd71:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/32mn.ogg"
    Bya "他、他、他们告诉我这会有帮助，嗯……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_d6a03cff:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/33cht.ogg"
    Bya "说、说、说我的脑、脑子会变、变正常。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_d7033208:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/34ya.ogg"
    Bya "我、我、我不知道这是坏的，嗯！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_785be999:


    "一个念头闪过我的脑海：‘艺术会是邪恶的吗？’"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_08dccf41:


    "难道我自己不也曾试图通过绘画逃避残酷的生活现实吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_4f72f212:


    "我提高音量以压制自己的疑虑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_a21f789c:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/20 Ti.ogg"
    Ant "你从青少年病人里召集了一伙人。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_83eda2cc:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/21 Ma.ogg"
    Ant "有自闭症和精神分裂症的男孩。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_1b253aab:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/22 Ti.ogg"
    Ant "你们以医院住民为食。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_6eb7d648:


    "拜沙垂头痛哭。他的喉咙发出低沉的、嗡嗡的声音。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_05bb9a0b:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/23 T.ogg"
    Ant "记得我奶奶吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_3cdf90db:


    "我奶奶的轮廓在我脑海中浮现，被摇曳的烛光照亮。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_19372b6f:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/36os.ogg"
    Bya "别、别、别缠着我，嗯……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_d5e20698:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/24 Ba.ogg"
    Ant "奶奶住这儿，去修道院附近一个很老的教堂。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_21d1da29:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/37ya.ogg"
    Bya "我、我、我听不见你，嗯……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_3105da58:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/25 Um.ogg"
    Ant "一个僧侣临终前告诉她，邪恶行走于世，但上帝的造物守护着人们。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_7c8191ac:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/38so.ogg"
    Bya "造、造物……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_41a80c2c:


    "他含泪的目光游移，粘附在古松林间矗立的东西上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_a0d0f7a1:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/26 Na.ogg"
    Ant "僧侣死之前给了奶奶这个。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_7272720d:


    "我把家族遗物给拜沙看。那是个挂在我家门口的简易黑色十字架。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_ec6b8ef1:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/27 N.ogg"
    Ant "波琳娜和我花了好几年研究才明白。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_f285fc51:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/28 Vn.ogg"
    Ant "里面是能让人找到它们的圣物……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_f09b661c:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/40s.ogg"
    Bya "它、它们……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_7543a685:


    "他不知道“它们”，却跟着重复了一遍我的话。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_60c1974a:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/29 S.ogg"
    Ant "天上的守护者。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_81e21ca4:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/30 U.ogg"
    Ant "每个民族都有自己召唤这些实体的咒语和仪式……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_5e157c96:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/31 Cht.ogg"
    Ant "帮助他们对抗……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_f37c5d8e:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/256 s.ogg" 
    Pol "……像你这样的生物。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_8b9ec4dc:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/257 to.ogg"
    Pol "嗯，确切地说，是像操纵木偶一样控制你的那些。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_9370ab7b:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/32 Be.ogg"
    Ant "没有波琳娜我不可能看透这一切。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_70d7fbaa:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/258 Pu.ogg"
    Pol "哎，不用谢我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_d9c9a582:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/259 Pr.ogg" 
    Pol "我只是刚好知道我爷爷那边的真相。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_94e3cc77:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/41h.ogg"
    Bya "哈、哈里通，嗯……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_b9ffa60d:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/33 Fa.ogg"
    Ant "严格来说，你已经拯救了我们的世界，波琳娜。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_8680f31b:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/42vi.ogg"
    Bya "你、你们疯了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_a109d28f:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/43d.ogg"
    Bya "医、医、医生会治好你们的，嗯。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_e62cca38:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/44eto.ogg"
    Bya "你、你们胡说八道……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_da32ea62:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/45ch.ogg"
    Bya "这、这、这全是胡扯，嗯……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_aef65d1f:


    "拜沙抓住自己的胸口，仿佛要撕开睡衣。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_f82b048f:


    "他的脸变绿了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_b12d4cc0:


    "波琳娜皱起眉头。我怀疑我们的老伙计是不是中风了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_be77f706:


    "突然，拜沙开始转圈，迅速舔着毫无血色的嘴唇。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_171872ab:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/48be.ogg"
    Bya "叭——啊——啊——啊！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_e12787a7:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/260 An.ogg" 
    Pol "安东……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_7249aa91:


    "拜沙原地僵住，然后猛地从装面具的袋子里抓出一样东西。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_6288e597:


    "我知道那是什么。我见过它太多次了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_6417b065:


    "我一直以为它是用人骨雕刻的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_206fe81c:


    "为什么我这么想？我有任何证据吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_857b995d:


    "没有，我只是盲目相信一些黑暗的传说。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_603bc920:


    "眼中带着胜利的光芒，拜沙将那恶魔般的骨笛凑到唇边……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_842e7ef9:


    "……开始吹奏。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_7f1cab66:


    "被古老旋律吸引，阴影在空地上蠕动。沉重的铅灰色云层遮蔽了太阳，黄昏降临森林。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_4ad88179:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/34 X.ogg"
    Ant "够了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_c02db012:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/50es.ogg"
    Bya "害、害怕了，嗯？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_f04b9705:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/51es.ogg"
    Bya "如果你、你、你相信这些蠢、蠢故事，你也肯、肯定害怕这音乐，嗯。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_20a84295:


    "拜沙更用力地吹着骨笛。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_a046a321:


    "波琳娜蹲在哭泣的精神病患旁边，撩开一缕秀发。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_dde4548f:


    "旋律停了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_1293e9a4:


    "拜沙喘着气看着她。看着波琳娜太阳穴上的伤疤。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_a4af4275:


    "和我身上一模一样的伤疤。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_a590e9f2:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/53ch.ogg"
    Bya "你、你、你们做了什么，嗯？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_71e709a9:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/261 Ez.ogg" 
    Pol "我们清除了寄生虫。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_6cd71217:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/262 t.ogg" 
    Pol "现在骨笛的音乐对我们没用了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_5d1d9be0:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/35 Mo.ogg"
    Ant "我内心的恶魔，那个折磨我这么多年的恶魔，现在沉默了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_594058ea:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/54v.ogg"
    Bya "你、你、你们残害自己……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_009ebe24:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/36 Kr.ogg"
    Ant "十字架帮助我们召唤了一位守护者。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_86a60ef0:


    "我忍住没有转身去看是否有人站在树后。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_8bb44953:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/263 e.ogg" 
    Pol "我爷爷以前就怕他。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_39b649c7:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/264 h.ogg" 
    Pol "守护者引导了安东的手。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_aa9cc6be:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/265 e.ogg" 
    Pol "天界存在就是这样——他们引导，但不会亲自行动。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_e511e433:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/267 A.ogg" 
    Pol "安东给我的头骨做了环钻术。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_b71d9806:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/268 Ap.ogg"
    Pol "然后我帮他摆脱了脑海里的那个声音。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_b41db0fe:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/55va.ogg"
    Bya "你、你、你们需要帮助，嗯……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_697c7830:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/56p.ogg"
    Bya "我们回、回、回去吧，嗯……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_0c831853:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/57t.ogg"
    Bya "医、医、医生有药、药、药……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_0eea4723:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/37 Ta.ogg"
    Ant "药物救不了任何人。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_334b8604:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/38 No.ogg"
    Ant "但我能给你解药。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_09afabb1:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/39 Poz.ogg"
    Ant "让天使引导我的手。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_c75d43a6:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/40 P.ogg"
    Ant "让我们除掉寄生虫。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_118080a7:


    "我用目光在拜沙额头上‘钻’了一个点，仿佛能透视他的皮肉和骨头。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_7dc9bbd6:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/58b.ogg"
    Bya "疯、疯、疯了！！！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_4cc7928e:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/41 B.ogg"
    Ant "只用了几天，我们就与守护者立下了契约。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_7895ce5c:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/42 Da.ogg"
    Ant "我们发誓要找到并消灭残余的吞噬者。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_6adf0972:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/43 T.ogg"
    Ant "你是最后一个。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_bbc50398:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/59ya.ogg"
    Bya "我、我、我只是个……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_0422df14:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/60r.ogg"
    Bya "孩、孩子……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_125f7dfe:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/44 Zn.ogg"
    Ant "那么，你就必须去那里。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_bf2c7be7:


    "我指向愈发浓重的黑暗。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_d13ff8f2:


    "黑色车库蜷伏在树林间。一个恶心的黑色棺材。一台穿越界域的绞肉机。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_27d5d072:


    "它一直盲目地在这一带游荡，寻找拜沙，那个破坏了仪式的小男孩，那个没有敲它门的男孩。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_07885443:


    "不然它怎么会出现在密林深处？难道是在那个‘狂野的九十年代’，有人把它遗弃在这里？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_4cedd191:


    "难道他们就这么忘了它的存在，无意中将它变成了一个村庄传说……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_754710d5:


    "有那么一秒，这个念头显得可怕地真实。恶毒的疑虑再次攫住了我。谢天谢地，一声尖叫分散了我的注意力。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_a6ca1069:


    "拜沙尖叫起来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_2a8c28cd:


    "我用手背扇了他一耳光，让他老实点。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_3c320a20:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/46 Pol.ogg"
    Ant "波琳娜，燃料！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_10c1ab01:


    "她从后备箱拿出一个油罐。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_42618da4:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/47 Pot.ogg"
    Ant "快点！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_bd44b951:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/269 b.ogg" 
    Pol "真的有必要这样吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_e1624288:


    "她不安地看着无助的拜沙。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_80c82bdc:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/48 M.ogg"
    Ant "我们讨论过多少次了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_e5d79d2d:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/270 Z.ogg" 
    Pol "我知道……但是……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_1533e9aa:


    "我几乎能读出她的心思：‘我们在犯错吗？’。这个问题吞噬着她。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_f5dc20d5:


    "‘我们是怀着那些胡言乱语，跑到森林里来杀一个无辜的人吗？’"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_27cbce18:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/49 Me.ogg"
    Ant "我们立过誓了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_69a64a03:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/50 Vih.ogg"
    Ant "别无他法。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_c4c553b7:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/51 Po.ogg"
    Ant "看那边。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_2090a44d:


    "我指向灌木丛。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_05c63c9c:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/52 On.ogg"
    Ant "他在看着我们。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_dcadb559:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/53 Onp.ogg"
    Ant "他既美丽又令人无法承受。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_94c56bd8:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/54 On.ogg"
    Ant "他是你见过的最不自然的东西。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_3eb119a5:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/55 Es.ogg"
    Ant "扭曲的空间，无穷遥远行星的黑暗，以及垂死恒星的光芒。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_99145aad:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/56 Pe.ogg"
    Ant "是宇宙的灰烬！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_3bdb50f4:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/57 On.ogg"
    Ant "他既是一切，也是虚无。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_72d1ebe2:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/271 V.ogg"
    Pol "一切和虚无……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_b3216024:


    "我的搭档说话时仿佛处于恍惚状态。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_4fbd69b8:


    "我继续说着，充满狂暴的喜悦，疯狂地朝吱嘎作响的树木挥舞着手臂。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_b9b871d1:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/58 Uz.ogg"
    Ant "在他宏伟而骇人的形象前颤抖吧！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_8c5578e5:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/59 Z.ogg"
    Ant "金光笼罩着他！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_74ffd3ed:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/60 Ne.ogg"
    Ant "但别看得太久，否则你会失明！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_edf35063:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/61 On.ogg"
    Ant "他有着女人的形态，但与女人或男人都毫无关系。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_a2e54f46:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/62 Ni.ogg"
    Ant "也与善恶无关。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_32071982:


    "我挥舞着十字架，在空中划出混乱的图形。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_00694a36:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/63 St.ogg"
    Ant "他对所有生命来说都如同针叶林或冰寒黑暗中的星辰一样陌生。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_7479bbaf:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/64 E.ogg"
    Ant "而这毁灭性的力量站在我们这边！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_584a1947:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/272 A.ogg"
    Pol "而汽油是……我们的圣水。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_1ad03a4e:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/65 Bl.ogg"
    Ant "由他祝福过的圣水。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_cd8316f3:


    "我擦掉下巴上的口水。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_8a75ecf8:


    "波琳娜缓缓点头，拧开了油罐盖。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_23495902:


    "我从她手中接过油罐，把里面的东西浇在拜沙头上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_1e8f4b9e:


    "他尖叫着抓挠自己的脸颊。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_be9a3cd8:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/65bee.ogg"
    Bya "叭啊啊啊……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_55e1fe63:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/66ber.ogg"
    Bya "小、小、小心黑、黑、黑车库！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_e6c2cfa3:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/67ya.ogg"
    Bya "我、我、我进去过，嗯！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_0e6efb36:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/68ta.ogg"
    Bya "里、里、里面没有恶魔！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_bd7427fc:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/69tam.ogg"
    Bya "那、那、那是连环杀手的巢穴，有死、死、死孩子，嗯！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_e573bec0:


    "我向他露出一个悲伤的微笑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_d609acae:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/66 te.ogg"
    Ant "你现在才是那个连环杀手。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_59787da7:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/66 Ti.ogg"
    Ant "你变成了你曾恐惧的东西。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_d1497ab7:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/70m.ogg"
    Bya "杀、杀、杀手？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_32210654:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/71a.ogg"
    Bya "那、那、那你们是什么？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_b74a64d3:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/72ne.ogg"
    Bya "你、你、你们不是绑架了另、另、另一个人带到森林里来吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_b8604c93:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/68 T.ogg"
    Ant "你骗不了我的，恶魔！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_2e6e5b19:


    "拜沙试图逃跑，但我抓住他，把他拖向黑色小屋。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_5756d07c:


    "门自己开了。或者说，风只是吹开了那扇生锈的铁皮门。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_51274783:


    "我无所谓。我们将完成命运的安排。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_92a980ff:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/75ma.ogg"
    Bya "妈、妈、妈妈！救、救救我！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_1746e730:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/76ya.ogg"
    Bya "我、我、我要找妈妈！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_e1f7824d:


    "波琳娜从后备箱拿出第二个油罐，紧闭双眼。她的手在发抖。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_96ce63bf:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/77v.ogg"
    Bya "带、带、带我回、回、回医院，嗯！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_ca1a9bfd:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/78ne.ogg"
    Bya "不！我、我、我要回家！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_8d224019:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/70 Ne.ogg"
    Ant "我必不惧怕邪恶！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_026e868e:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/79s.ogg"
    Bya "我害怕，妈妈！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_cca5be34:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/71 T.ogg"
    Ant "因为你与我同在；你的杖，你的竿，都安慰我！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_bf813931:


    "波琳娜看着我拖拽着那撕心裂肺般咩叫扭动的拜沙，突然哭了出来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_de44464e:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/80b.ogg"
    Bya "上、上、上帝帮帮我！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_0e3c129f:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/72 K.ogg"
    Ant "你在向哪个神祈祷，恶魔？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_59ba6332:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/121 Pol.ogg"
    Ant "看着，波琳娜！ "


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_c49ffbbc:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/122 Smotry.ogg"
    Ant "别哭，看着恶魔灭亡！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_b49d1a79:


    "她恢复了镇定。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_2a74b873:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/274 Da.ogg"
    Pol "是的。对，我与你同在。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_d782fbd0:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/74 M.ogg"
    Ant "怯懦是通往地狱之路。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_bf5dc4fc:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/275 V.ogg" 
    Pol "通往永恒的折磨。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_8443d4c7:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/75 Am.ogg"
    Ant "阿门。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_807bb854:


    "我把拜沙扔进了车库。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_840d3777:


    "骨笛和散落的面具留在雪地里——那是新一代野兽的面孔。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_8cf9170a:


    "波琳娜捡起它们，扔进黑暗的门洞。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_aa0ea41b:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/82 po.ogg"
    Bya "饶、饶了我吧，嗯！！！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_7d651c54:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/83e.ogg"
    Bya "是、是、是我，比亚、亚、亚沙！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_9d104228:



    voice "voice/byasha/5day/84ya.ogg"
    Bya "我、我、我病得很重，嗯！"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_f80792ee:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/77 E.ogg"
    Ant "主啊，救赎降临于他。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_fa157c60:


    "我从波琳娜手中接过第二个油罐，把汽油浇遍整个车库。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_0eaa1052:


    "我身体的每一个细胞，都感受到了天界存在的护佑。波琳娜也感觉到了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_62c19461:


    "我们同时将点燃的火柴扔进油泊。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_5bb77728:


    "火焰几秒钟内吞噬了车库。守护者正借助我们的手，将我们凡人的敌人化为灰烬。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_aa5359f4:


    "拜沙在火中痛苦地尖叫。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_68dc08b1:


    "波琳娜被他绝望的尖叫吓得一颤，手本能地伸向烧红的铁门。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_684582ea:


    "我抓住她的手臂，直视她的眼睛提醒她。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_97329f96:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/78 B.ogg"
    Ant "拜沙早就死了。他救不了。他自己也不想被救。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_43d59857:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/79 Ti.ogg"
    Ant "你知道那些变形的动物能做到什么。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_3253651d:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/277 Z.ogg" 
    Pol "是的，我知道。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_85d2a54a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/278 Du.ogg" 
    Pol "你真的认为拜沙……？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_0af05e2a:


    "她的声音低了下去。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_45e50e21:


    "拜沙在已成为烤箱的车库里开始咩叫。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_f3c91bba:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/80 e.ogg"
    Ant "一个魔鬼正在那里死去。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_5fde9973:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/81 Ag.ogg"
    Ant "你听到那痛苦了吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_6f527339:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/279 Da.ogg"
    Pol "是的。他在垂死挣扎。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_c6205ea0:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/82 No.ogg"
    Ant "守护者不会让他逃出来的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_0ca4d735:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/280 A.ogg" 
    Pol "我们身后的天使。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_aba10499:


    "决心回到了我的搭档身上。我也充满了碾碎恶魔的信念。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_9b07250e:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/83 Li.ogg"
    Ant "他的面容难以捉摸而骄傲。他眼中的光芒愈发强烈。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_378b3ea8:


    "我感到波琳娜的手抓住了我的手，我也用尽全力握紧手指。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_447226db:


    "我们站在巨大的火焰前，我们的影子融化了积雪。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_1592cc02:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/281 Mir.ogg"
    Pol "世界得救了。吞噬者不复存在。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_6292c63c:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/84 M.ogg"
    Ant "我们做了正确的事。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_ba4311d9:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/85 X.ogg"
    Ant "守护者许诺我们遗忘。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_bd24965e:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/282 A.ogg" 
    Pol "那么我们也会……"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_3bc56b09:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/283 M.ogg" 
    Pol "我们会忘记……一切吗？我们也会忘记彼此吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_2225a88f:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/86 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "我不会失去你。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_b0e65639:


    "车库的门洞在喷吐火焰、灰烬和越来越弱的尖叫声中变形。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_a771660f:


    "它的墙壁和屋顶在折叠。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_3156b4f5:


    "当我敢回头看时，树林间的巨大身影消失了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_4b59b99b:


    "就像受诅咒村庄里的孩子们一样。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_400bc189:


    "就像那只假扮拜沙的山羊一样。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_bb9caa40:


    "就像我们对所发生之事的记忆即将消失一样。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_cca847e6:


    "尖叫声停止了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_d8c5ff4c:


    "我望着火焰，狠狠咬住下唇直到流血。因为在死寂之中，一个问题突然出现在我脑海里。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_b293166e:


    "会不会是我疯了，然后把我的疯狂传染给了波琳娜？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_505768b8:


    "到底有没有过天使？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_547a2985:


    "还是只有一个患有可怕疾病、停止服药的男孩？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_7a581459:


    "然后他脑海里的野兽开始对他说话？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_467cd620:


    "不是森林里的野兽。而是来自他痛苦心灵深处的野兽。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_e17131b5:


    "我是精神分裂症吗？我精神有病……我的天使在哪里？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_32b97c80:


    "我们都做了些什么？"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_2e61c4da:


    "感觉像是脑袋里发生了局部爆炸之类的事情。当我睁开眼睛，我意识到自己躺在雪地上，离一个我不认识的女人几英尺远。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_007fd5b5:


    "松树高耸在我们上方，伸向蓝天。我们被灌木丛包围，但这并不可怕。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_b618e9f6:


    "我不知道自己怎么会来到这里，但这并没有让我感到困扰。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_11508d0b:


    "唯一让我担心的是那个女人是否还活着。但接着她动了动，睁开了眼睛。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_0e1a5a34:


    voice "voice/Polina/5day/07 pr1.ogg" 


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_c9268efb:


    "我从未见过如此神奇的眼睛。如此美丽的脸庞。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_37274059:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/07 pr3.ogg" 
    "她惊讶地看着我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_5d9e05a8:


    "出于一阵突如其来的冲动，我伸出了手，而那个女人，尽管犹豫了片刻，也做了同样的事。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_d8663afe:


    "我们的手指触碰。我对那传遍全身的温暖报以微笑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_genius_aftertitles_6ccc6a6d:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/07 p4.ogg" 
    "那个女人也对我回以微笑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_dfabe4aa:


    "斧头在空中划出一道弧线，猛一下砍在面具旁边的地面上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_36a15e2f:


    "这一砍砍断了我过去的脊梁。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_c42c1f00:


    "我自欺欺人太久了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_7d2daaaa:


    "一直逃避着自己的阴影。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_6d03e973:


    "我的固执差点儿害死了奥莉娅，也可能害死了爸爸妈妈。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_f9ead611:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/11 A.ogg"
    Ant_m "阿狸萨说得对——人类之中，有配得上最悲惨命运的野兽……"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_14b3fd52:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/12 U.ogg"
    Ant_m "而那命运就是在森林里遇到像我们这样的存在……"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_cbbf40e8:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/13 E.ogg"
    Ant_m "棺材里的巫婆那些愚蠢的咒语保护不了他们。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_eb3b5749:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/14 Eh.ogg"
    Ant_m "我爸爸信奉的神也救不了他们。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_ac056344:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/15 Z.ogg"
    Ant_m "这里唯一的神是兽群。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_cd01e4d8:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/16 E.ogg"
    Ant_m "而我属于其中。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_b85773ce:


    "我用麻木的手指伸向面具。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_0ac8eea9:


    "这就对了……"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_3dd006f2:


    "我的手指触碰到那无比古老的躯壳。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_abd9f451:


    "它比从世界灰烬中生长出的松树更古老。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_3ca3e569:


    "比在葬沟中蠕动的生物更古老。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_5588ee3f:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/46 ho.ogg"
    Ant_m "很好……"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_12b30aed:


    "透过长耳面孔的缝隙，我看到两个模糊的阿狸萨，而我甚至没来得及向从前的生活告别。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_be1e83c9:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/01 poc A.ogg" 
    Alis "好好感受。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_c1b57016:


    "面具触碰到我的皮肤。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_57bc45bd:


    "感觉就像我把脸浸入了沸水，但不知怎的竟有些愉悦……"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_6d310c73:


    Ant_m "土壤的气息充盈了我的整个存在。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_c7b23af7:


    Ant_m "我看见了雪野上兔子的足迹：一条通往森林的虚线。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_7995d572:


    Ant_m "我看见了不断移动、交织、从我颤抖的心脏生长出的根须。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_136119c5:


    Ant_m "我看见了黑色的枝条，让我想起通往狂怒天空中悬挂的月亮的梯子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_9545e3f8:


    Ant_m "雪花在我的皮毛上融化。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_9ecd0492:


    Ant_m "我的绒毛里满是跳蚤，我想用后腿挠痒痒。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_a0fa9aea:


    "我强迫自己去想我的妹妹。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_165f1b0d:


    Ant_m "去想风在树洞中游荡。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_ffa20d50:


    Ant_m "去想最终换毛时，旧的我将与一块块脏毛一同脱落。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_7532c8b5:


    Ant_m "去想黑暗中甜美的浆果，我可以用嘴唇从枝条上摘取。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_2c1b58eb:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/02 Ya.ogg" 
    Alis "我知道你戴它会很好看。你拖了这么久，安托沙。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_c09db700:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/18 A.ogg"
    Ant_m "安托沙……"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_4caf6cef:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/19 Ch.ogg"
    Ant_m "那是谁的名字？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_2a2ec13a:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/19 Z.ogg"
    Ant_m "名字有什么用？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_04778d8d:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/20 Z.ogg"
    Ant_m "野兽需要能在夜间奔跑的爪子，需要能龇露的牙齿，需要能软化咬不动的肉的口水。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_339b11c8:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/21 Zv.ogg"
    Ant_m "野兽需要的是敏捷，而不是人类用来区分彼此的称呼。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_29b39e84:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/22 Ya.ogg"
    Ant_m "我也一样，我将融入阴影，成为兽群的一部分……"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_0b967706:


    "我摇头。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_0c44d59b:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/01 A.ogg" 
    Alis "现在，走吧。我们要照顾好你妹妹。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_149abfac:


    "奥利娅！"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_57cf6e7f:


    "我得带她离开这里。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_4cc50ecd:


    "我转向那道飞旋雪墙后方，那里停着一辆警用乌阿斯，散发着机油和孩童恐惧的气味。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_804a21ec:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/23mo.ogg"
    Ant_m "我们可以玩个小游戏。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_bbe1fe4f:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/24 p.ogg"
    Ant_m "把面具贴到车窗上，看看奥莉娅还认不认得我们。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_c23f2dc2:


    Ant_m "在墓地里吓唬人类可真好玩。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_09b1930e:


    Ant_m "我强迫自己行动。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_9937abe6:


    Ant_m "一只爪子……一只手，当然是手，拉开了副驾驶的门。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_6b6de426:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/06 vse.ogg"
    Ant "没……"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_36613560:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/55 Tosh.ogg"
    Oly "托沙！！！"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_9b016694:


    "奥莉娅用尽全力尖叫，但随即戛然而止。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_47b6ce9b:


    "她晕了过去，瘫软下来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_7c3de312:


    "她没有看到救星，只看见试图钻进车的怪物。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_ca0af31c:


    "冬天与森林深处的造物。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_bbcbc221:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/05 Pus.ogg"
    Alis "让她休息吧。她只是还不习惯你这张新面孔。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_d1480469:


    "我小心地把妹妹抱出车外，惊讶于她是多么……"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_71665fe6:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/25 s.ogg"
    Ant_m "……可口。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_c798c755:


    "我体内有什么古老的东西转着长耳朵，发出不怀好意的笑声；那东西就像如利卡身体里的寄生虫，还有黑车库里的黑暗一样。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_b3b0a640:


    "发霉的面具紧贴着我的皮肤。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_cb3f02dd:


    "这不过是晨间化装舞会的面具罢了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_e21f9fe6:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/47 O.ogg"
    "{b}‘哦，你还相信有早晨？’{/b} 我内心的声音嘲弄道。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_fb44348d:


    "我随时可以摘下它。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_cad72ac3:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/26 no.ogg"
    Ant_m "但你不想摘，你这野兽……"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_da3660a3:


    "我的眼睛湿润了，冰冷的绒毛飞入眼中。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_8957a8db:


    "我从迷雾中捞起一个半遗忘的场景：哥哥举起他小小的妹妹，让她把一颗红宝石般的星星放在圣诞树顶。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_d3c37467:


    "我抱着奥莉娅穿过一排排墓碑，双脚被积雪拖累。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_09814891:


    "我把她抱向那条沥青路，黑暗、覆冰，就像定居在我体内的那个东西一样。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_77bb99e1:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/06 Sl.ogg" 
    Alis "听到了吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_b26a1c30:


    "除了呼啸的风和我急促的心跳，我什么也听不见，但我的鼻孔捕捉到了逐渐加强的铁和汽油的气味。一辆车正从黑暗中向我们驶来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_56a207d4:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/07 Ost.ogg" 
    Alis "把她留在这儿。她会没事的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_b840ce90:


    "我想，如果我现在放开妹妹，我就会切断连接我与过去生活的最后一根线。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_06479b22:


    "阿狸萨用鼓励的目光看着我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_83ede3fa:


    "我把奥莉娅放在路边。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_7b1319b8:


    "要不是阿丽莎的命令，我会像个无生命的物体，像块石头，像地区博物馆里积尘的毛绒兔子一样站在她身边。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_16bfd9c3:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/08 Be.ogg" 
    Alis "快跑！"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_30dd403c:


    "我身体的每一块肌肉都回应了那个呼唤。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_4da91bcb:


    "我是一个无法被阻挡的俄罗斯方块，只能被旋转，被引导着落入先前堆积的方块堆中。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_c829e7f0:


    "我们三次大跳跃，便越过了公路和那片可怕的森林。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_a34b39e8:


    "那片美好的森林。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_6778019d:


    "那片尸骸般的森林。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_0d03744f:


    "那片魔法森林。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_3c8c8a3c:


    "它将我们拥入怀中。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_1194cc08:


    "像猫头鹰眼睛般的橙色车灯，从黑暗中浮现。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_06443d6f:


    "我和阿狸萨肩并肩站在渐起的暮色中，看着爸爸的宝马车突然转向路边，在躺在沥青路上的小女孩面前尖啸着刹停。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_ca58569f:


    "看到爸爸跳下车时，喜悦与悲伤在我心中交织。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_1e67fb69:


    "他还活着，但对我来说已永远失去。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_39a44278:


    "隔着一排排细小的灌木枝，他与我们——两个俄罗斯森林的造物——永远分隔。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_6005c342:


    "我注意到爸爸拿着枪。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_85085798:


    "如果我现在走上公路，他会开枪打自己的儿子吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_0a4b2a01:


    "他会认出我，还是像奥莉娅一样，把我当成怪物？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_006eb66d:



    voice "voice/father/day5/1ya.ogg" 
    Pap "我来了！我在这儿！醒醒，宝贝！没事了，爸爸在这儿！"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_c60cdb48:


    "当爸爸抱起奥莉娅时，他焦虑的目光停在了我们这边路旁的松林墙上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_39f4d888:


    "正停在我身上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_cd9f294c:


    "我能闻到他绝望和惊愕的气息。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_175f6658:


    "我知道他看不见我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_118fc8ef:


    "我知道我再也不会见到我的父母或妹妹了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_0c9f0b7a:


    "爸爸把奥莉娅放进副驾驶座，砰地关上车门，倒车驶离。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_87106954:


    "我看着他转动方向盘离开。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_2b610b28:


    "永远地离开了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_ac05130b:


    "暴风雪吞噬了汽车，也吞噬了那个名叫安东的男孩的整个世界。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_004e0b4c:


    "阿狸萨的手摸索到我麻木的手，紧紧握住，提醒我从此我有了新的家人。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_5af3ea6a:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/09 Poi.ogg"
    Alis "我们走吧。黑暗没有尽头，外面有太多有趣的东西！"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_c1ae7d46:


    "我没有反对。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_bcab7463:


    "我们循着两个死去的孩子的足迹前行：波琳娜和罗姆卡。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_307acc78:


    "树干后方燃起了火焰。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_cf2f1f57:


    "我曾称之为家的房子被烈焰吞没。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_16864c53:


    "我们走出灌木丛，绕过了那座巨大火炬的基座。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_45c0f17a:


    "它的梁木在渗出树脂时噼啪作响，屋顶已坍塌，引发了火花的爆炸。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_743665f3:


    "火焰吞噬着过去，用它巨大的红色火舌舔舐低垂的天空。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_58db7d27:


    "我看着阿狸萨，捕捉到她专注的凝视。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_6f61bd34:


    "绯红的光芒反射在狐狸面具和她的眼睛里。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_7e42a6f6:


    "我的搭档的身影笼罩着一圈紫色的光晕。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_bed82e8d:


    "我在她身上看到了火焰，并感到体内有熔岩喷泉在上升。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_69aecfb0:


    "我从未见过比这个戴面具的女孩更美的事物。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_d6bb4e2f:


    "‘这是绝对的自由，’我想。‘整个森林只属于我们俩。其他一切已焚毁。’"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_8bfa1a95:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/07 ya.ogg"
    Ant "再站在这儿我会死的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_20fc314a:


    "我真的把这话说出口了吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_c5ae437a:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/10 Tak.ogg"
    Alis "那我们就跑吧，傻瓜。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_0b4f4f1a:


    "于是我们奔跑起来，在整个宇宙中，只有我们的影子——这个崭新却又难以想象的古老世界的先驱者——比我们更快。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_f307424d:


    "只有月亮比我们更高。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_4cd77e17:


    "主人已死，现在我们自己是主人。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_908cd881:


    "我们可以在阴影中嬉戏。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_91b2e183:


    "我们可以翻滚直到力竭倒下。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_6654a163:


    "我们可以互相啃咬。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_2237b77f:


    "我们可以吞噬。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_00e9c85d:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/08 Alis.ogg"
    Ant "阿狸萨！等等我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_a9fd67ce:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/11 Tol.ogg"
    Alis "哦，别告诉我你累了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_16ca31be:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/09 Us.ogg"
    Ant "累？我能跑上一千年！"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_88482eb2:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/12 A.ogg" 
    Alis "我能跑一百万年！"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_ae37e7c0:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/10 mne.ogg"
    Ant "我感觉好极了，但是……"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_558a115c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/13 Chto.ogg" 
    Alis "‘但是’什么？你感冒了？扁桃体发炎？还是你恋爱了？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_9d873203:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/11 Chto.ogg"
    Ant "什么？不……我不知道。我感觉很奇怪。好像有人在对我说话。在我脑子里。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_a4f5cd49:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/14 Ah.ogg" 
    Alis "哦，那个啊！你吓了我一跳！"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_17f1da2d:


    "阿狸萨的手掌落在我的肩上，我立刻除了她的声音、她仍燃烧着火焰的眼睛外，什么都不在乎了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_7e78c979:


    "仿佛我们被火焰包围，仿佛现实本身在燃烧，就像村子边缘那所愚蠢的房子一样。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_83631edd:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/15 eto.ogg" 
    Alis "那会过去的，我向你保证。那个声音会平息。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_19bb9e8c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/15 nu.ogg" 
    Alis "你只需要奔跑。你的双腿承载着真理，你没听说过吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_13cde414:


    "我想问哪个声音会平息：是我分裂的意识中那只长耳阴影的声音，还是我自己的？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_165bbc9a:


    "但提问的时刻已经过去了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_6c7ed166:


    Ant_m "是游戏时间了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_80fd2f99:


    Ant_m "暴风雪平息了，接着是沉闷的灰暗午后，像被殡仪馆工作人员涂了油的尸体。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_1697b296:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/12 Smeh.ogg"
    Ant_m "我们从树枝上跳下，在雪地里打滚。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_ccc700a3:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/14 Krik.ogg"
    Ant_m "我们发出无拘无束的欢笑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_878b8e8f:


    Ant_m "我们爬上高树，窥视走在林间小径上的孩子们。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_98b1c393:


    Ant_m "他们紧紧依偎在一起，让我想起了谁，但我记不起来了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_14df2d89:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/16 Ka.ogg" 
    Alis "真是小可爱……我们去吓吓他们吧！就一点点！"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_5d913dc0:


    Ant_m "但我们停不下来在‘一点点’上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_5e7a4170:


    Ant_m "我们太沉迷于在松树后的半明半暗中潜伏，用傻乎乎的声音呼唤那些孩子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_53a0bb9b:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/17 Ai.ogg" 
    Alis "嘿，你们！"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_4b68fb2b:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/15 kak.ogg"
    Ant_c "你们的面具真有趣！"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_2a6db268:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/18 Mas.ogg" 
    Alis "迷路小人类的面具。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_34504e81:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/16 Avd.ogg"
    Ant_c "要是森林里潜伏着饥饿的野兽呢？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_6aaeac70:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/19 Vd.ogg"
    Alis "要是它们决定吃掉你们呢？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_396af8f0:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/18 Tsap.ogg"
    Ant_m "一个女孩绊倒了。一个苍白的男孩扶起她。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_60a515dd:


    Ant_m "我的一部分想继续游戏，想追赶那些孩子，摘掉他们的面具，尽管我没看到面具，而我自己的面具正愉快地搏动着。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_9f853583:


    Ant_m "我牵起阿狸萨的手。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_4ff6c0f7:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/19 Pu.ogg"
    Ant_c "放他们走吧。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_8ffdac41:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/20 Mi.ogg"
    Alis "只是个恶作剧而已。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_51509d8c:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/20 Zn.ogg"
    Ant_c "我知道。但让我们向彼此发誓吧。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_9dedabb0:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/21 A kak.ogg"
    Alis "怎么发誓？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_14660169:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/21 Pr.ogg"
    Ant_c "你得把手放在心上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_ff10da34:


    "阿狸萨把手掌按在我的胸口。我的心将热血泵送到全身。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_7cddbf69:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/22 Mo.ogg"
    Ant "这样也行。我们发誓……跟着我念。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_7778d9ea:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/22 Mu.ogg" 
    Alis "我们发誓。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_13bc2a79:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/24 Ne.ogg"
    Ant "永不伤害无力自卫者。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_74cdde79:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/23 Ni.ogg" 
    Alis "在任何情况下都不。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_314ae20a:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/25 Kl.ogg"
    Ant "我们发誓只猎杀怪物。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_d94a6d86:


    "阿狸萨眯起眼睛，抬起她的狐狸鼻子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_8a313ca8:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/26 Ti.ogg"
    Ant "怎么了？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_f37e9630:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/25 Ks.ogg" 
    Alis "说到怪物……你能感觉到吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_ac1ac552:


    "我四处嗅闻，用我增强的嗅觉在短暂的冬日黑暗里分辨出上千种不同的事物："


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_a165d356:


    "灌木下醒来的刺猬；沟壑里僵硬的死山雀；一个矮壮的男子，正从一栋建筑跑向另一栋。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_c4c2a0d2:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/27 Eto.ogg"
    Ant "是他！那个兔唇男！"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_23439027:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/26 Pr.ogg" 
    Alis "我提议玩个新游戏！"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_dca1c635:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/28 Oh.ogg"
    Ant "猎杀怪物？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_605b6440:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/27 Lo.ogg"
    Alis "你学得真快！"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_c242b434:


    "我们的猎物很敏捷，但这样只会让它显得更加美味。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_60530dc7:


    "当太阳沉入地平线时，我们四肢着地，交换眼神，舔了舔牙齿，然后同时将目光转向林中空地。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_6d2b4d4f:


    "那杀手不知怎么设法逃出了牢房。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_ff4d75b6:


    "他坐在树桩上，一只手揉着剃光的额头，另一只手抓着一部手机，看起来像穆勒用来打电话给史高丽，告诉她又一桩超自然罪案的那种。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_6232cf5a:


    "我脑海里的声音说，在这片被施了魔法的森林里也发生着超自然的事情。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_46773d82:


    "我体内的兔子兴奋地跺着脚。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_de2fe147:


    "我的胃在翻腾。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_917cca95:


    "兔唇男用一只靴子踩着一个运动包。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_c3200b7a:


    "他的目光扫视着灌木丛，但看不见我们。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_55de8aec:



    voice "voice/killer/01Al.ogg"
    Killer "喂！伯爵！听得到吗？对，我挺好，从局子里出来了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_86e11bbf:



    voice "voice/killer/01Vi.ogg"
    Killer "没什么能阻止我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_d46d77cf:



    voice "voice/killer/01K.ogg"
    Killer "切。我像他妈的终结者一样干掉了那些条子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_19e7f88e:



    voice "voice/killer/02 Da.ogg"
    Killer "得了吧，我开玩笑呢，别生气。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_31f2a99e:



    voice "voice/killer/02 Tam.ogg"
    Killer "局子里一团糟。你打点过的那个条子放我走了。听得到吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_1c465b31:



    voice "voice/killer/02Da .ogg"
    Killer "嗯。我的家伙事儿拿回来了。但有什么用？那记账的溜了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_3149fa1e:


    "记账的？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_06b90dc0:


    "突然，我想起来了：他是在说我爸爸！"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_a41a7aab:


    "我爸爸，我善良聪明的爸爸，会和这种怪物打交道吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_b3233e0f:


    "仿佛为了证实我的预感，杀手用嘶哑的耳语说道："


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_8397c3d6:



    voice "voice/killer/03 Do.ogg"
    Killer "彼得罗夫的房子烧了。暴露的还不止这一点。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_3a5af66c:



    voice "voice/killer/03 ne.ogg"
    Killer "不，不是我。我猜我们的记账的惹到别人了。信号不好，听得到吗？这他妈鬼地方……"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_cd142758:



    voice "voice/killer/04 Ya.ogg"
    Killer "我本想追他，可我被关着的时候，当地人把我的车拆了卖零件。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_9a4d356a:



    voice "voice/killer/04 Daz.ogg"
    Killer "连我的圣像都顺走了，那些恶魔。他们心里一点神圣都没有。我在森林里。喂？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_3320f723:



    voice "voice/killer/05 Bu.ogg"
    Killer "我在森林里，伯爵。我往南走。直觉告诉我条子在追我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_2ab1e01c:



    voice "voice/killer/05 Sb.ogg"
    Killer "我会甩掉他们，然后去找那该死的记账的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_e9813306:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/48 ne.ogg"
    "{b}‘哦，你哪儿也去不了，’{/b} 我脑海里的声音反驳道。我忍不住表示同意。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_f5412ca5:


    "我看着阿狸萨。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_7c5283aa:


    "她点点头，脸上带着微笑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_6def4984:


    "我将腹部贴在结壳的雪上，向前爬行，穿过灌木丛。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_fde38751:


    "是时候喂饱野兽了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_73d5618d:



    voice "voice/killer/06 Nu.ogg"
    Killer "嗯，你说别碰彼得罗夫家的小崽子，是吧？不是吗，伯爵？那个混蛋的儿子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_be91a712:



    voice "voice/killer/06 No.ogg"
    Killer "我本该拔掉他一片指甲或一颗牙，我们立马就能知道他老子去哪儿了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_2a733302:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/49 se.ogg"
    "{b}‘哦，你马上就会知道了，’{/b} 我心想，兴奋地拱起了背。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_e451aca7:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/50 bu.ogg"
    "你会得到我的指甲。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_02d331c5:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/51 bu.ogg"
    "还有我的牙齿。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_ddd60c5b:


    "我的思绪飘过雪丘之上，就像电视报道中越过墓地的摄像机镜头。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_c2a61db9:


    "我将我那特别的脸颊贴紧多节的树皮。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_70f37ba3:


    "我侧目而视，以免失去杀手的侧影。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_4a4b54b7:


    "他说话时，太阳穴上短短的毛发微微颤动。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_aa1d5edb:


    "他的喉结上下滚动。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_f84ec65d:


    "我抹了抹下巴，意识到口水正从那里滴落。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_7e6cf931:



    voice "voice/killer/08 Sh.ogg"
    Killer "我跟踪过他，伯爵，跟踪了好几次，从学校跟到家里，但他的踪迹总是会消失。好像被什么野兽掩盖了。你听到我说话了吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_22a3c076:


    "我听到了……"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_1c7f458b:



    voice "voice/killer/09 T.ogg"
    Killer "你在听吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_137d89a8:


    "我在这儿，我的美味，我的猎物，我的肉丸子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_178e3761:


    "你的心脏在狂跳，将血液泵入你的动脉。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_c08f2a80:


    "我想象着那颗球体在他胸膛里搏动，我想将嘴唇贴在那心室、心房，以及那颗红色心脏的其他组成部分上，就像生物课本里画的那样。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_8c1d1845:


    "就像写给怪物的烹饪书里那样。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_c179ff76:


    "兔唇男近在咫尺。我一跃而起，就能撕开他的衣服。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_c7dbc10e:


    "他的皮肤。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_14e9853e:


    "他的肌肉。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_f94e05b3:


    "但我克制住情绪，慢慢走进林中空地。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_df9f3b8d:


    "黑暗已完全笼罩我们，但他借着洒在空地上的月光看见了我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_aac64b79:


    "怪物都有锐利的眼睛，而他也是个怪物——并非因为他的兔唇。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_fab78b4f:



    voice "voice/killer/10 Po.ogg"
    Killer "等一下，伯爵。有点事。我待会儿打给你。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_59aa45cc:


    "他惊讶的目光粘在我身上，将手机滑进口袋。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_c66cd1a2:


    "然后慢慢弯下腰，在背包里摸索着。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_bf5247be:


    "他表现得好像我是某种他不想吓跑的森林小兽。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_b492240d:



    voice "voice/killer/11 Nu.ogg"
    Killer "嘿，你好啊。这化装舞会是搞什么名堂，嗯？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_df6ca9b3:


    "他的手从背包里抽出，迅速藏到背后。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_6f61e9f3:


    "那个高大愚蠢的人类以为他的武器能吓住我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_35b64420:


    "我只是站在那里，垂着眼，一脸无辜，在他走近时抬眼望向他。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_d3bc80c6:



    voice "voice/killer/12 Ch.ogg"
    Killer "这么晚你在森林里干什么？就你一个人？我认识你吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_7192d9b9:


    "一道红色尾巴在他魁梧的身影后的灌木丛中闪过。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_808eb978:


    "我咬着腮帮子内侧，以免笑出声来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_a94cd036:


    "杀手的声音里透出一丝忧虑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_d7fb2772:



    voice "voice/killer/13 Za.ogg"
    Killer "你戴这面具做什么？你是彼得罗夫的儿子，对吧？不是吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_d04f385a:


    "他空着的那只手伸向我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_aa2dc2c7:


    "停在半空。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_73c07467:


    "又继续伸向我那咯吱作响的下颚。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_f60e6491:


    "我让他的手指触碰到我真实的面孔。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_b63b1dac:


    "我不再害怕了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_3a74759b:



    voice "voice/killer/14Ya.ogg"
    Killer "让我看看……"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_9d0f16db:


    "‘看’字淹没在他骨头碎裂的声音里。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_cc83b311:


    "杀手猛地抽回手，举到眼前。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_9de66cc6:


    "他的手腕染上了猩红，鲜血迅速浸透了他的袖子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_8593e971:


    "兔唇男目瞪口呆地盯着原本长着手指的地方留下的残桩。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_59a0be1b:


    "我匆忙咀嚼着，享受着这从未品尝过的美味。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_662ab957:


    "怪物肉……尽管并不嫩滑，但我强健的白齿迅速处理了皮肤、骨头和软骨。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_dc8c855e:



    voice "voice/killer/17 Su.ogg"
    Killer "操——————！！！"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_6022519f:


    "我很惊讶，他这么个恶心的家伙，尝起来居然还不错。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_18540635:


    "我甚至没注意到他用完好的那只手将枪对准了我的额头。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_8254b299:


    "阿狸萨从阴影中跃出，扑在了尖叫的男人身上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_c329c1f0:


    "他的腿软了下去。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_d3e7e640:


    "我站在一旁，看着两个戴面具的生物，两只美丽饥饿的野兽冲向那具踉跄的身体，开始用它们雪白的尖牙将它撕碎。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_4c743f97:


    "像食人鱼一样，它们从他骨头上剥下肌肉，啃咬他的肌腱。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_4e4d492b:


    "杀手用他完好的拳头击打它们，但它们感觉不到疼痛。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_dd2102d5:


    "他试图逃跑，但一只脚上未系带的靴子留在了空地。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_a0fe64b9:


    "皮肤组织从脚部连接到他的腿上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_08f3f6bc:


    "杀手脸朝下栽进血肉模糊的泥泞中，翻过身，用疯狂的眼神盯着掠食者们猩红的面具。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_718cdb9a:


    "他咕哝着什么，但我花了一会儿才听清字句。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_31934797:



    voice "voice/killer/21 Go.ogg"
    Killer "主啊，救我脱离恶人的手。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_8a339b87:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/28 kak.ogg" 
    Alis "他会救他吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_dbe4763a:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/30 Se.ogg"
    Ant "我们马上就会知道了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_9e56dc91:


    "我们仰面朝向天空，仿佛在等待一道雷电作为对我们罪行的神圣惩罚降临，但天空中并无神明，只有一轮恶毒的异教月亮。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_eb412f18:


    "杀手哭泣着，用残存的手腕护住自己。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_777f19ae:



    voice "voice/killer/22 Si.ogg"
    Killer "凭你恩典的大能，驱逐并消、消、消除魔鬼教唆下的一切邪恶。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_0da5aa0f:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/29 Ant.ogg" 
    Alis "安东，你是在魔鬼教唆下行动吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_8b0d22b7:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/31Vr.ogg"
    Ant "我觉得不是。你呢？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_ed8180ae:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/30 Ne.ogg" 
    Alis "也不是。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_4534dbd3:



    voice "voice/killer/23 Go.ogg"
    Killer "神啊，请垂听我的祷告……"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_c495cb55:


    "我俯身靠近，将他毁容脸上恐惧的扭曲表情刻入脑海。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_501920e6:


    "这比迪士尼乐园酷多了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_8c542927:


    "这是我们自己的痛苦迪士尼乐园，就在这饥饿的黑暗中。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_353646a0:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/307 Nikto.ogg"
    Ant "没人会听到你。但你要听我的。我才是这里的神。这是我们的森林，我们是它的管理者。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_d0ecfe88:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/308 Teo.ogg"
    Ant "你现在可以停止祈祷了。只管继续尖叫吧。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_e1f93379:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/Rik.ogg"
    "他确实尖叫了，直到失去了声带。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_c1e0e132:


    "雪花因大量滚烫的‘琼浆’而融化。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_36ba114c:


    "戴面具的野兽吞食人肉，掏出内脏，在将多汁的肉块塞进大张的嘴前玩弄着它们的食物。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_a306d257:


    "然后，我完全与其中一只宴飨的生物融为一体。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_74fd91ce:


    "是的，正是我从断裂的肋骨堆中扯出那颗肌肉发达的心脏，并以兽群之名、以黑暗之名、以令人陶醉的自由之名，品尝了它的甘美。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_aa9da346:


    "阿丽莎快乐地尖叫，我们在血泊中、在皮肉的碎片中、在满如饱食肉腹的月亮下起舞。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_2f1fe2af:


    "我们在白骨上跳舞，向天空跃起。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_2c6fd955:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/34 Alis.ogg"
    Ant "阿狸萨……"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_c8c405cd:


    "她停下来，用她深邃无底的眼睛看着我——我如此爱沉溺于其中。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_989d08d2:


    "我想画下她——狂野的、不可阻挡的、完美的她，但我记不起如何握笔了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_5abf2789:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/Kash.ogg"
    "我的发声器官也不听使唤。我得先咳出一个毛球，把注意力转向身体一侧，咬上几口，赶走恼人的跳蚤。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_53c318ab:


    "我的意识如同外太空，名字在其中不时闪烁。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_ba4df2c2:


    "我仍记得奥莉娅，但沃瓦、谢涅奇卡、卡嘉、罗曼是谁？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_d745fa72:


    "我曾有个叫谢苗的朋友吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_7affe669:


    "还是那是我爸爸的名字？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_a467d2cf:


    "我用爪子抚过自己兽类的脸庞。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_5e159e4c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/32 Chto.ogg" 
    Alis "有什么事在啃噬你吗，亲爱的？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_d0861d3a:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/35 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "我害怕我会忘记……"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_be4e7b6d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/33 Zab.ogg" 
    Alis "忘记什么？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_32870fa3:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/36 Yab.ogg"
    Ant "我害怕春天来临，我会变成野兽，不再是我自己。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_a3e8bf52:


    "她伸手抚摸我的脸颊。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_e94ac3e2:


    "她的动作充满如此多的怜爱，我忍不住用我的手盖住她的手腕，将它更用力地压向我灼热的脸庞。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_7e1e21ad:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/34 Ra.ogg" 
    Alis "那些真能被忘记吗？我们怎能忘记发生在我们之间的事？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_08dc4d13:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/37 Zv.ogg"
    Ant "动物记得吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_2913e35f:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/35 Wes.ogg" 
    Alis "无论春天还是酷暑。无论秋天还是严冬。在巢穴里，在捕猎中。饮水时，换毛时。我都会和你在一起。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_e1954b1d:


    "我渴望她的触摸和凝视永驻。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_6f17e7dc:


    "但她抽回了手。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_1d0cb8f2:


    "我知道该怎么做。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_ba498972:


    "这种认知活在我体内，而那些外来的声音，另一方面，已经消失。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_42b734b2:


    "要么是我内心的兔子进入了休眠，要么我们终究合而为一了，从内到外。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_ac39ebf8:


    Narr_color "许多个月亮过去，空气中才充满了春天的气息。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_8eee68c5:


    Narr_color "一个恐怖的夏天正在逼近，我们改变了的身体将更难熬过它。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_487ce10e:


    Narr_color "我们需要变形，蜕去旧皮，在古老森林的荫蔽下等待酷热过去。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_ff32acd0:


    Narr_color "我和阿狸萨背对背靠着。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_d869fba4:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/36 Ver.ogg"
    Alis_Color "你需要相信。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_e2197341:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/38 Yave.ogg"
    Bunny_Color "我相信。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_6b9c6a70:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/37 Edi.ogg" 
    Alis_Color "去吧，做你自己。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_d317dd91:


    Narr_color "我们同时向后退了一步，远离彼此，走向未知白昼初现的光明。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_147d77cd:


    Narr_color "我们的脚滑出鞋子，袜子滑落——我们赤裸的脚跟踏在雪上，但这是一种愉悦的感觉，摆脱文明的枷锁。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_93c85e7d:


    Narr_color "一道野兽的影子落在我面前的地上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_9a8a07c7:


    Narr_color "在它惊人的轮廓中，我看到了黑色的间隙和嫩绿的草，从土壤伸向太阳。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_12083adc:


    Narr_color "影子动了动耳朵，我听到雨滴的轻响和鸟儿归来的歌唱。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_83a6b08d:


    Narr_color "影子四处嗅闻，我的鼻孔充满了远处空地上新鲜浆果的芳香，雪莲花和松针的气味。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_fdb67e42:


    Narr_color "我知道阿狸萨在我身后研究着她自己的影子，她的影子或许正兴奋地甩动毛茸茸的尾巴。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_acc9a9fb:


    Narr_color "再一步，我便滑出了衣服，像蜕去旧皮一样褪下它。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_41d591f7:


    Narr_color "我四肢着地。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_bab0f5c9:


    Narr_color "我奔向召唤我的光明，但在空地边缘停下，转过身。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_60a033f3:


    Narr_color "阿狸萨也回头望向我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_43cd0f27:


    Narr_color "我们的目光在永恒变幻的天空下、在无边的森林中相遇。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_a3cabe49:


    Narr_color "在跑进灌木丛前，我在心中问她。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_7868d68b:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/Smogu.ogg"
    Narr_color "‘如果再见到你，我还能认出是你吗？’"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_48574272:


    Narr_color "然后我意识到，世上没有任何力量能使我们忘记彼此。"


translate chinese d5_ending_recipe_8b46dcef:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/38 E.ogg" 
    Alis_Color "记住：只要和我在一起，你就是安全的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_30cbf838:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/309 m.ogg"
    Ant "尘归尘，土归土！"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_d17072eb:


    "一阵死寂降临在我们周围。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_b3bdca93:


    "我看着麻木手指间的十字架。金属似乎变得更黑了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_aa5b4d0d:


    "黑色如浓烟般从中流出。它包裹了我的手腕，以冰冷灼烧它，并沿着我的手臂向上蔓延。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_a9927c05:


    "黑暗入侵了我。或者相反，我被传送到了宇宙深渊。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_5615f159:


    "接着，打破绝对的黑暗，星辰开始在我周围闪烁。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_1a0bb70b:


    "感觉它们让我漂浮起来，在现实的边缘失重。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_19fd7bc9:


    "这些发光体聚集在一起，以非人世的恐惧压抑并慢慢侵蚀我的理智和意志力。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_f43f7f31:


    "我随即意识到那些是眼睛。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_a6bcdebf:


    "宇宙的创造者透过世界间的薄纱注视着我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_ddfee57f:


    "它是如此巨大，我的大脑拒绝记录它的大小。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_255bf620:


    "孤独与绝望的化身，在永夜中以神秘方式运作的存在。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_7c508b6e:


    "我喘着气回到自己的身体，回到森林，回到惊恐的波琳娜身边。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_34eb30de:


    "我的心在狂跳。绝望感让我血液冰冷。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_f0264f94:


    "我将目光转向松树顶端。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_44b90f25:


    "然后，某种巨大的东西从天而降，折断树木，在森林中央形成一个冒烟的陨坑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_1d799bf5:


    "雪、冻土、树枝和冰块四处飞溅，将我们覆盖。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_ac8533ca:


    "顶上的树枝在燃烧。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_c5413234:


    "它们将灰烬洒在满是倒木的坑洞上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_5f3bdacd:


    "波琳娜艰难地从雪中挣脱，爬向我。我们的手指交缠。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_eb88cc92:


    "热量从开始在坑洞中扭动的生物身上散发出来。伴随着刺目的光。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_8dc246c4:


    "这个非人世的生物难以形容，不可名状。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_c1053451:


    "千年之前，它或许曾使赤足的使徒和在沙漠中游荡的狂热分子同样疯狂。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_f3d51ff6:


    "看着它，我忍不住颤抖。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_4d8e78e3:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/207 ch.ogg" 
    Pol "这……到底是怎么回事？"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_432716e7:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/310 t.ogg"
    Ant "你也看到了？说啊，我没疯，对吧？"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_06cf6a08:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/208 Eto.ogg"
    Pol "这太不对劲了……"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_3031071d:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/209 tak.ogg" 
    Pol "这不可能！"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_cd2cf3b7:


    "那生物伸直身体，形态不断变化，由硫磺和沸腾的物质构成，同时是固体、液体和气体。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_bc5ec226:


    "它嗡嗡作响，用一种未知的语言对我们说话。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_12a75e39:


    "在旋转的圆环、白色翅膀和凸出的眼睛组成的集合体中，嘴巴像伤口一样张开。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_781af3d6:


    "它们单调地吟诵着类似祈祷的言辞。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_10c11abe:


    "火焰从深红色的孔洞中喷出，如同熔炉，在嘶嘶作响的物质表面滑动，却不伤害那生物。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_70dcffab:


    "它是如此不自然和错误，如此可怕和难以理解，以至于我宁愿失明，好不再看见这宇宙诞生的东西。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_a5d474d2:


    "不再听见那火焰与翅膀、眼睛与圆环之物的喃喃低语。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_1ca322b5:


    "当我的身体石化时，我甚至没有因追逐者的声响而回头。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_6ea1f39d:


    "那个巨人是谁？它为何回应我的呼唤？我们会怎样？"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_49226c2b:


    "问题从我脑中一扫而空。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_b0c59bd5:


    "天界来客从坑洞上升，发出隆隆的嗡鸣，使我们周围的整个区域震颤。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_c297b068:


    "翅膀摩擦着旋转的圆环。那生物滑向兽群。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_5171cbaa:


    "巨大翅膀触碰到的树木像火柴一样爆燃。火焰将黑暗染红。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_4637cdcc:


    "黑色土壤在那荒谬的身影后显露，仿佛有人在纯白纸张上用记号笔画线。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_fa40921b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/210 Ch.ogg" 
    Pol "那——那是什么东西？"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_81bbd4ad:


    "烟雾中有人尖叫。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_f540ad90:


    "一声充满异世痛苦的嚎叫响彻针叶林。兽群与天界恐怖面对面相遇。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_c61a9b9a:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/311 z.ogg"
    Ant "我奶奶知道……"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_afe87178:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/211 oc.ogg" 
    Pol "知道什么？"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_41930bd9:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/312o.ogg"
    Ant "关于十字架。它能召唤……"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_0858427a:


    "我不知道该给那从天而降的东西起什么名字。它一点也不像天使。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_41493570:


    "由于承受的震惊，我甚至没注意到一直紧握的十字架变得滚烫。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_1147254e:


    "我痛得叫了一声，松开了它。十字架消失在雪堆里。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_2a2f5f75:


    "它在雪中溶解，仿佛完成了使命，只留下一缕白烟和蛇般的嘶嘶声。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_26244c02:


    "谁能想到，一段古老的咒语，加上一件不起眼的家族遗物十字架，会导致这一切？"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_1345c4aa:


    "意识到奶奶可能与这位宇宙来客有某种联系，我哑口无言。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_f9d8d8ea:


    "那几乎不能称之为天使的东西，和追逐我们的恶魔一样可怕。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_d2a46a71:


    "松树倒下，用撕心裂肺的尖啸充斥夜晚。我们的追逐者声嘶力竭地尖叫。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_1c1b1922:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/313 b.ogg"
    Ant "跑！"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_c2566613:


    "我们向反方向冲去。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_a049fdec:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/212 beg.ogg"
    "一个火球在我们背后膨胀。大火肆虐，火焰舔舐树干，吞噬针叶。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_e82d8fde:


    "树脂沸腾嘶嘶作响。松树倒下，激起成束的火花。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_1a494981:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/213 tam.ogg" 
    Pol "看，有辆车！"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_6da42468:


    "我也能看到一辆车的近光灯，正缓缓向我们驶来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_aa039b0d:


    "我们跳到路上，开始挥手。车转向路边。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_1a34c736:


    "看到父亲时，我几乎因喜悦和解脱而窒息。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_7ec23283:



    voice "voice/father/day5/31 Gd.ogg"
    Pap "你们去哪儿了？发生什么事了？"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_32c37418:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/315 v.ogg"
    Ant "森林着火了！我们的房子没了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_b969c70d:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/316 p.ogg"
    Ant "我们快离开这儿，求你了！"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_8bf59961:



    voice "voice/father/day5/32 Gde.ogg"
    Pap "你妹妹呢？"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_ade4cd18:


    "波琳娜不停地瞥向被火焰吞噬的森林。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_6bce33ac:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/317 Y.ogg"
    Ant "我和她走散了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_a00cfc95:


    "父亲在原地跳脚，为我们撑着车门。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_3ca9aa3d:



    voice "voice/father/day5/33 Oh.ogg"
    Pap "哦，安东……"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_e98a78f0:



    voice "voice/father/day5/34 Ya.ogg"
    Pap "我才刚学会信任你……"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_cf3da3c8:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/318 T.ogg"
    Ant "好了，但妈妈在哪儿？"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_7b7b43ce:


    "父亲用愤怒的皱眉作为回应。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_34b2e853:



    voice "voice/father/day5/36 Mi.ogg"
    Pap "我们错过了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_b4a231e5:



    voice "voice/father/day5/37 On.ogg"
    Pap "但她一定在附近……"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_fe73e844:



    voice "voice/father/day5/38 Se.ogg"
    Pap "我们会找到她的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_8e3b2710:


    "他怒视着森林，愤怒地啐了一口。波琳娜和我坐进后座。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_15a15903:


    "父亲坐上驾驶座，车疾驰而去。火焰在挡风玻璃上闪烁。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_c5331739:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/214 Cht.ogg" 
    Pol "安东，那是什么生物？"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_8bf86160:



    voice "voice/father/day5/40 Ka.ogg"
    Pap "什么生物？"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_3ed540f5:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/319 N.ogg"
    Ant "算了，爸爸。我们只是在森林里产生了幻觉。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_6dd745cb:


    "车灯划破黑暗。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_f3886d57:


    "我幻想着那只由眼睛、翅膀、圆环和光芒组成的生物。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_ece98317:


    "想象它如何消灭那些恶心的野兽，将它们的肉化为灰烬，轻易碾碎它们的骨头，伴随着它们无尽的嚎叫和难以形容的恐怖。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_c88a122a:


    "想象它如何摧毁那些恶心的面具。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_65a54af7:


    "我如此清晰地看到它，仿佛就是现实。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_0f205457:


    "几张闷烧的面具。一只兔子和一只狐狸。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_eae06175:


    "它们的皮毛被火烧黑，裂缝扩大直到变成一个洞。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_04d3c2ef:


    "我松了口气，但同时又因恐惧而颤抖。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_4cf68e41:


    "在半明半暗中，覆盖着积雪的‘墓地’公交站旁，站着另一个孤独的身影。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_30c0c1f1:


    "又一个怪物伸出它利爪般的爪子向我们抓来！"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_645bd12d:


    "但接着，模糊的身影摸了摸脸，仿佛摘下了什么东西，我瘫倒在座位上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_9c2c50a9:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/215 tam.ogg" 
    Pol "是个女人！"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_ba482505:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/321 M.ogg"
    Ant "妈妈！"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_cb40d882:



    voice "voice/father/day5/41 Go.ogg"
    Pap "我说吧！"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_82b3d65f:


    "车停了。妈妈滑进车里，对我们露出快乐的微笑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_401c8d4b:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/17 Zi.ogg"
    Mam "你们还活着！我们的奥莉娅在哪儿？"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_f4942df2:



    voice "voice/father/day5/mi.ogg"
    Pap "我们正打算去找她。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_693301d0:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/18 Ka.ogg"
    Mam "什么意思？你们把她弄丢了？！"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_6054ec74:


    "我们活下来了，但代价是什么？奥莉娅不见了。都是我的错。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_41038330:



    voice "voice/father/day5/43 Ti.ogg"
    Pap "你疯了吗？我一直和你在一起。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_1fc9256f:



    voice "voice/father/day5/44 Ant.ogg"
    Pap "安东，你们到底发生了什么事？"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_3145e64a:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/19 Ya.ogg"
    Mam "我告诉过你，这地方要把我逼疯了……我说过！"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_1ba1940e:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/20 Oni.ogg" 
    Mam "先是他们找到了我们，现在奥莉娅又失踪了！"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_4f6b8f01:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/21 Ne.ogg" 
    Mam "我恨你！"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_f5996ebc:


    "我意识到一切都完了。自从我们的指路明灯熄灭，爸爸妈妈再也无法在黑暗中看到光亮了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_430db15d:



    voice "voice/father/day5/45 Za.ogg"
    Pap "闭嘴！闭嘴！闭嘴！"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_1a86604b:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/21 Nen.ogg"
    Mam "我恨你……"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_51706151:


    "吓坏的波琳娜把背紧贴在座位上，转向车窗，大概是希望能透过乌云瞥见一丝晨光。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_43e60129:


    "我不想去一个父母会互相残杀或离婚的地方。我不想走向那个黯淡的未来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_36ed8016:


    "我应该逃走。就现在。深入森林，深入天空巨人袭击那些疯狂食人者的地方。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_0394d4bb:


    "我需要了结他们。我需要救我的奥莉娅……"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_f32a48c0:


    "我内心的声音在脑海中疾驰，它低语着，被恐惧扼住喉咙："


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_8be65b38:


    "{b}'我们需要沿着雪径奔跑，露出真面目，拯救族群……拯救我的妹妹。'{/b}"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_18fb0022:


    "不知不觉中，我开始拉扯锁住的车门把手，试图回到几分钟前我还拼命想逃离的森林。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_e1d700a9:


    "但在我成功跳车之前，一声非人生物的咆哮响彻森林……"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_cc99c40e:


    "我的思绪变得像{u}水果冻{/u}一样浓稠，世界失去了棱角，一切都像一场我即将醒来的噩梦。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_19a7f2f8:


    "下一刻，我已记不起那个以我头脑为家的声音向我低语的噩梦了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_c2e1c079:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/22 St.ogg" 
    Noname "奇怪……我不知道我为什么在这里。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_913d6de3:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/23 Egde.ogg"
    Noname "等等，'这里'是哪儿？我们在哪儿？"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_75030ca9:



    voice "voice/father/day5/46 Ch.ogg"
    Noname "发生了什么？我……"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_f28ff16c:



    voice "voice/father/day5/47 Yani.ogg"    
    Noname "我什么都记不起来了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_c3241ca4:


    "一团迷雾笼罩了我的记忆。又过了一会儿，我完全忘记了那天界恐怖的存在。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_5f6ba387:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/218 chto.ogg" 
    Noname "发生了什么？"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_964e7b43:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/219 k.ogg" 
    Noname "你们是谁？"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_ce351387:


    "我试图整理思绪，但疯狂的是，我自己也不知道答案。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_03b06278:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/326 Ya.ogg"
    Noname "我……"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_55611710:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/327 Ya.ogg"
    Noname "我不……"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_358a89cf:


    "没等任何陌生人回答，方向盘前的男人失去了对车的控制。或者只是忘记了如何开车。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_a5167f21:


    "一棵黑色的树猛地出现在我们面前，撞击让我的意识闪过一片白光，随即与残留的记忆一同消失在黑暗中。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_b91ec723:


    "天使以女性的形态，手持利剑，将一群在她脚边盘旋的恶魔斩杀。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_e0c56ad8:


    "状如风帆的白色翅膀装饰在天界存在的背后。闪耀的光环照亮她完美的脸庞。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_28bffc6f:


    "评论家指出了安东·彼得罗夫对光线运用的精妙："


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_d81f6725:


    "'画作几乎浸透了光线，作者娴熟的笔触使他区别于其他东正教画家'。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_82a5002a:


    "'将他提升到安德烈·鲁布廖夫或瓦西里·波列诺夫等伟大前辈的高度'。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_a29c8f11:


    "《圣经》教导我们：'不可骄傲'。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_d1e6214e:


    "我俯视着那些逃离金色利刃的邪恶。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_d63789f7:


    "那些兽形怪物的创意是从哪儿来的？我的梦境？我不确定，因为我不记得自己的梦。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_2cec8ebb:


    "天使更容易把握，因为我曾与一位天使共同生活，尽管她没有翅膀。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_de9c537e:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/284 L.ogg" 
    Pol "亲爱的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_457217c3:


    "我眨了眨眼。妻子的声音从一个遥远的地方传来，穿透了我思绪的迷雾。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_4e53151e:


    "尽管仅仅一分钟后，我就说不出我刚才在想什么了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_1e1a57b4:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/285 Lu.ogg"
    Pol "亲爱的，你在听吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_a752a2ef:


    "我转过身。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_2ecfeecb:


    "忍不住再次惊叹——在这过去的九年里，不知是第多少次——惊叹于那个同意与我携手步入婚姻殿堂的女人是多么美丽。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_09e24b21:


    "波琳娜穿着一件绿色的曳地长裙。它闪闪发光。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_b738cd1f:


    "丝滑的头发垂落在她裸露的肩膀上。她通常穿着更朴素的衣服，并用头巾包住头。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_29728ff6:


    "我们的牧师要是看到他的一位教众穿着如此不寻常的装束，下巴一定会掉下来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_8d3a1a17:


    "爸爸在厨房里嘟囔着什么。妈妈大笑起来，把我拉回现实。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_e8c6029e:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/88 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "我在这儿。谢天谢地，我在这儿。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_6186f9ce:


    "波琳娜对我微笑。那微笑不正是评论家们如此推崇的光线的灵感来源吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_e147be5f:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/286 Ne.ogg" 
    Pol "别那样看着我。你都让我害羞了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_0b8434ef:


    "她穿过宽敞的客厅。每次我父母来访，他们都对我们房子的大小和内部装修惊叹不已。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_c9e3e3aa:


    "但对我来说，这里最重要的是每一个小细节都象征着彼此的爱与关怀。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_d488dcdd:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/287 Ho.ogg" 
    Pol "好消息。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_ba358a11:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/89 Pa.ogg"
    Ant "爸爸终于学会用智能家居系统了？"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_208808f7:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/288 Ne.ogg" 
    Pol "没这么好。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_e371f82b:


    "我拥抱了妻子，把手放在她的小腹上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_5f9a7f89:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/289 Ya.ogg" 
    Pol "我取消了巡演。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_186c58b2:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/90 No.ogg"
    Ant "但你那么想去北京演出！"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_fff6efb8:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/290 Pe.ogg" 
    Pol "北京又不会跑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_dd3133b6:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/01 Su.ogg" 
    Pol "它存在了几千年，可以等到我休完产假。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_fc4f9ec6:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/02 tolk.ogg" 
    "小腹之下，仿佛赞同妈妈的话，我们未来的宝宝踢了一下。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_99c2bf80:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/291 Bu.ogg" 
    Pol "我会为你演奏。也为上帝演奏。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_09a73bae:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/91 Am.ogg"
    Ant "阿门。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_d208e927:


    "上帝看顾着我们的婚姻。他赐予我们才华，帮助我们取得成功。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_2bec8ee4:


    "而我们最感恩的，是我们仁慈的主用遗忘之雾覆盖了我们的记忆。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_d2488682:


    "波琳娜的和我的都是。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_861ac214:


    "包括一个名叫奥莉娅的女孩的形象。那个我已没有任何记忆的小妹妹。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_7c776c51:


    "我只知道她死了。我曾试着问父母，但每次看到他们那么痛苦，我就作罢了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_f09b9438:


    "我们都记不起在世界尽头的村庄、在那片黑色森林里发生了什么。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_686dc153:


    "遗忘是幸福的。我的父母和我的牧师都这么说。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_569ca76a:


    "谁知道童年记忆的小径上徘徊着什么。在黑暗中。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_1bd8094a:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/53 Pa.ogg" 
    Mam "你爸切沙拉的时候喝了两杯白兰地。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_a051ad4b:


    "妈妈端来了蛋糕。她穿的羊毛开衫和戴的金项链为她的外表增添了一种简单而温暖的优雅。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_88d6456c:


    "不过，她说她保持年轻最大的秘诀是儿子的幸福。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_6a63faf9:



    voice "voice/father/day5/48 Ne.ogg"
    Pap "不是两杯，是三杯。而且都是为好事喝的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_647c8a58:


    "爸爸紧跟着妈妈走进房间，摸了摸她日渐隆起的肚子，顽皮地向我眨了眨眼。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_ba9032ad:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/54 Po.ogg"
    Mam "看看这漂亮蛋糕！上面还有樱桃！"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_7682a21e:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/02 Da.ogg"  
    Mam "我们赶紧切了吧。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_a48ab3ab:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/292 mo.ogg" 
    Pol "要不，我们还是先看看礼物吧？"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_b92d6f5b:



    voice "voice/father/day5/49 Es.ogg"
    Pap "说得好，儿媳妇。把礼物拿出来吧！"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_0368a8c1:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/92 Uz.ogg"
    Ant "它们已经在这儿了。等着我们呢。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_b1a82eeb:


    "我们坐在蓬松的地毯上，靠近一棵装饰着天使和银色小球的圣诞树。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_e9c3e6a3:


    "爸爸一把抓过写着他名字的包裹。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_2284394e:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/93 Da.ogg"
    Ant "我们先祈祷。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_4e2b6d54:


    "波琳娜用闪亮的眼睛看着我。我的父母等待着。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_7f26658a:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/94 Go.ogg"
    Ant "感谢主赐予我们食物，这个家，以及我周围美好的人们。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_5c5486df:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/293 A.ogg"
    Pol "阿门。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_4781b1f4:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/55 Ot.ogg"
    Mam "说得好！"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_2fcca37f:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/95 Nu.ogg"
    Ant "好了，我们开始吧！"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_4b10ea20:


    "妈妈递给我一个扁平的盒子。我咧嘴笑着撕开包装纸。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_f231e0ff:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/96 Ch.ogg"
    Ant "里面是什么，爸爸？我打赌是条领带。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_4ad102a4:



    voice "voice/father/day5/50 A.ogg"
    Pap "哦，那个不是我送的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_8ad6fe09:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/97 Kto.ogg"
    Ant "除了你，还有谁会这么包礼物？"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_79500ce4:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/294 Za.ogg" 
    Pol "哦，我忘了告诉你。邮差今早送来的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_53cd3af3:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/295 S.ogg" 
    Pol "说起来好笑，上面还附了张纸条。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_0d830197:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/98 E.ogg"
    Ant "纸条上写什么了？"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_99f612df:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/296 tr.ogg" 
    Pol "就四个字：‘来自一位老朋友’。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_5f1ba3fc:


    "波琳娜被妈妈的问题分了心。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_4fd61108:


    "我打开了礼物。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_1ea006bd:


    "一张旧的兔子面具从盒子里看着我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_ce39af45:


    "我的喉咙突然发紧，脉搏加快，微笑变成了皱眉。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_490a388d:


    "房间变得难以忍受地闷热，随后又被刺骨的寒冷侵袭。我窥视着潘多拉的魔盒。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_47808622:


    "朝那扇通往地狱的门后瞥了一眼，多年来我一直躲在教堂里逃避它，用祈祷和幸福的遗忘拯救自己。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_6b756d0b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/16 Razgov.ogg" 
    "那面具像跳动的心脏一样搏动着。妈妈正和波琳娜热烈地聊着天，爸爸在试他的新毛衣。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_f8f582e3:



    voice "voiceR/bunny/01 Z.ogg"  
    Noname "{b}哎呀，你好啊，兔子。{/b}"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_52c8e2a3:


    "我咬紧了牙关。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_143cd9c6:


    "黑暗从面具中淹没了我。记忆的碎片在其中漂浮。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_5e941b62:


    "我看到了冰冻的地狱，死寂天空下的无尽荒漠。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_75edacd0:


    "我看到了渗出鲜血、淹没在垂死尖叫中的黑色车库。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_a28ef673:


    "我看到了恶魔围着篝火跳舞，扭动跳跃着。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_ad549235:


    "我被遗忘的生活。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_d020340b:


    "我的现在。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_d019a289:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/297 Ch.ogg" 
    Pol "什么……"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_6ae3d600:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/56 Ti.ogg" 
    Mam "你还好吗，亲爱的？"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_d900e2a7:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/298 D.ogg" 
    Pol "嗯……我只是感觉有点奇怪。好像在做白日梦。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_9cf124b6:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/299 V.ogg" 
    Pol "一定是荷尔蒙在作祟。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_7ae9a62b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/300 Oc.ogg" 
    Pol "真是个奇怪的东西呢，亲爱的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_d5155a83:



    voice "voice/bunny/02 Pr.ogg" 
    Noname "{b}戴上我试试。{/b}"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_af4b3c8d:


    "那声音钻透了我的灰质，在我大脑的沟回间蠕动。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_1ecea0ac:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/301 P.ogg" 
    Pol "戴上试试。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_05e76242:


    "我妻子红色的嘴唇张开，珍珠般的牙齿在她口中闪光。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_fad50ae9:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/100 S.ogg"
    Ant "吃个苹果。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_78e3f850:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/302 Ch.ogg" 
    Pol "什么？"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_dbacaf95:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/101 Tak.ogg"
    Ant "夏娃被蛇诱惑后，就是这样试图引诱亚当误入歧途的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_8803d883:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/102 Bib.ogg"
    Ant "这是在重演那个圣经故事吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_b43cd129:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/303 Ya.ogg" 
    Pol "我不是夏娃，我们也不在伊甸园。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_201cada3:


    "我的妻子靠向我，我用肩膀感受到她的心在怦怦跳。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_d7906f51:


    "但是主呢？我们相信的一切呢？"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_c42b697e:


    "我困惑地盯着那幅画着女性天使的画，仿佛在祈求帮助。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_6d3351c5:



    voice "voice/bunny/03 Ya.ogg" 
    Noname "{b}我即是神！{/b}"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_35c1cf65:


    "我的父母也将注意力转向了面具。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_0ceaa711:



    voice "voice/father/day5/51 Ch.ogg"
    Pap "这旧破烂儿是怎么回事？谁会送这种东西？"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_23b3dc63:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/57 Na.ogg"
    Mam "他们大概只是想处理掉它。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_0fa3469e:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/304 Ne.ogg"
    Pol "别听他们的。戴上吧，亲爱的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_fe0951a9:


    "我的父母只是耸耸肩作为回应，把决定权交给我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_cc85437a:


    "波琳娜的笑容如此温柔，我无法拒绝她。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_6a54ff17:


    "我闭上眼睛。用皮肤感受面具的表面。不知为何，它是温暖而潮湿的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_c111f822:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/03 ha.ogg" 
    "我看着我的家人。波琳娜如释重负地大笑起来。妈妈移开了目光。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_b2b41307:



    voice "voice/bunny/04 Ti.ogg"
    Noname "{b}你回来了，小小的流放者。{/b}"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_3df8dd6c:


    "爸爸用悲伤的眼神看着我，但他的声音很欢快。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_890a2972:



    voice "voice/father/day5/52 Ta.ogg"
    Pap "那我们的蛋糕呢？来吧，一家之主。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_2cabde5f:



    voice "voice/bunny/05 Ho.ogg" 
    "{b}‘一家之主……’{/b} 只有我能听到的声音回荡着。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_9e1afddb:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/305 On.ogg"
    Pol "他今天真沉思。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_f9d0d998:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/59 Vse.ogg"
    Mam "他一直都是这样。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_b1e8ecea:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/60 Si.ogg" 
    Mam "儿子，离新年只有几个小时了，我们想吃甜点了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_e14a4a77:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/103 Ko.ogg"
    Ant "对……"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_562eb96f:


    "我们走向餐桌。爸爸大笑着给我们斟酒。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_4bbf428d:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/61 Nu.ogg" 
    Mam "你干嘛？他们不喝酒。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_96f57b8f:



    voice "voice/father/day5/54 Ta.ogg"
    Pap "好吧，我替他们喝……毕竟是节日嘛……"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_704aa06c:


    "我拿起餐刀，悬在美味的蛋糕上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_8fed7728:


    "{b}一个节日。{/b}"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_869712a7:


    "{b}‘尖叫肉块之日’。{/b}"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_8470cb94:


    "{b}‘为了狐狸，也为了熊……’{/b}"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_7b5e3eff:


    "低语在我额骨后方诞生。我的脸在面具下发麻。我的手在颤抖。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_09466545:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/62 Po.ogg" 
    Mam "波琳娜，能为我们演奏一小段吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_957aa6c6:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/306 Es.ogg" 
    Pol "如果你们想听的话……"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_6863bfdc:



    voice "voice/father/day5/55 Vs.ogg"
    Pap "比那些{u}‘蓝色小灯’{/u}节目好多了……"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_83113d5f:


    "唾液充满了我的嘴。我转动餐刀，以便在刀刃上看到我的父母和怀孕的波琳娜的倒影。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_bf3925dc:


    "{b}献给古老森林的款待。献给古老饥饿的兔子。{/b}"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_d156ae73:


    "{b}牧师是怎么说的来着？面包即是血肉？{/b}"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_71e470a7:


    "我咽了口唾沫。"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_60637164:


    "{b}感谢您，主啊，赐予我的食物和我的巢穴，以及我周围所有这些可口的人类。{/b}"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_c9e8ba61:


    "{b}是时候再次召集族群了。{/b}"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_d1370818:


    "{b}以寒冷、黑暗和森林之名。{/b}"


translate chinese d5_ending_still_water_4e2b113f:


    "{b}阿门。{/b}"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_de3dbd46:


    "护身符曾救过我一命。我希望它能再次显灵。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_dff838a0:


    "我扯下那只爪子，灰色的雪片开始从笼罩在漆黑中的树顶落下。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_c4db67ff:


    "一线生机从我麻木的手中传递到奥莉娅的脖颈上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_bc256d25:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/27 Ya.ogg"
    Oly "我要找妈妈！"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_d44a40c5:


    "这样做是对的。作为哥哥，我必须保护她……"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_cd9d70c2:


    "说到底，我们两人中只有她仍保留着纯真的光芒。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_9674f759:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/328 B.ogg"
    Ant "快跑，奥莉娅！"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_20b84b4c:


    "我们冲过那片憎恶我们的森林。一切鲜活温血的生灵都与它格格不入。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_b844acf9:


    "森林想让我们变得像它的宝藏一样——冰冷，顺从地躺在冰壳之下。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_2924a32d:


    "那轮像发黄蠕虫团的月亮，偶尔从光秃秃的树梢间窥视。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_8184fbfe:


    "月亮和我都知道。没人会帮助我们。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_1cb94f90:


    "大人们不相信我们，吉洪诺夫敷衍了事，因为我无法证实我的话。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_af33fe50:


    "一切都结束了。灌木丛将成为我们的坟墓。它最擅长埋葬孩子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_faecfeb5:


    "身后传来嚎叫与呼啸。波琳娜的外套在我眼前一闪。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_6bf3dc27:


    "接着那个亮点突然消失了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_884749be:


    "我猛地停住脚步，奥莉娅撞进我怀里，紧紧抱住我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_d47fe997:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/28 gde.ogg"
    Oly "波琳娜呢？"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_e36eeac8:


    "我们面前出现一道沟壑，布满黑色血管般的树根。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_75614b4e:


    "波琳娜躺在沟底扭动着。她没注意到边缘，径直掉了下去。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_4187c7c4:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/329 P.ogg"
    Ant "波琳娜！"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_37a6fb2b:


    "沟壑回应了一声呻吟。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_644eac24:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/330 Y.ogg"
    Ant "奥莉娅，待在这儿。我马上回来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_8c40f37e:


    "妹妹不情愿地向后退了几步。我紧盯灌木丛，确认没有东西后，开始往沟壑下爬。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_71d94003:


    "它们毫无预警地从黑暗中现身，符合夜行生物的习性。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_613469f6:


    "一道带翼的阴影拍打翅膀，猫头鹰的轮廓出现在月轮上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_a1675bbc:


    "奥莉娅看到这可怕的鸟，尖叫着跑向森林深处。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_074eab71:


    "那只带翼的生物俯冲而下，但猎物从它利爪中滑脱。我妹妹侥幸逃脱了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_8737e674:


    "野兽升上天空，发出失望的啼叫。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_c4121009:


    "护身符真的起作用了吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_ea99e099:


    "我得去追她。我必须追上奥莉娅，安抚她，告诉她这一切只是一场噩梦……"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_9eb2ff06:


    "我试图爬出沟壑，但双脚在斜坡上打滑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_e817c35a:


    "我用靴子刮蹭冻土，还是滚落下去。掉到一个新的恐怖正等待着我的地方。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_ced9afb1:


    "小熊摇晃着他那令人毛骨悚然的脑袋，在沟底爬行。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_9ba055b7:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/13 Vs_wood.ogg" 
    "跪在地上的波琳娜看到他蛆虫遍布的眼睛，发出尖叫。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_f9e78f4b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/232 Dih.ogg" 
    "那野兽更像一具腐烂的动物标本而非真熊，用它丑陋的爪子锁住她，将她拖向自己。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_931eec69:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/Se.ogg"
    Bear "叛徒是什么下场，你很快就能亲身体验到了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_0bdc98c7:


    "我和波琳娜都吓坏了，身体僵得跟石头一样，一动不动。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_ed692f22:


    "我痛恨自己的视力没有和四肢一样失效。相反，它反而更加锐利。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_0747c0fa:


    "小狼也从阴影中走出来，像坏掉的玩具一样扭曲着身子。他的血盆大口往下滴着口水，吐出零碎的词句。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_e7815ae6:



    voice "voice/Wolf/126 Z.ogg"
    Wolf "吃——！撕——碎！杀——了你！"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_a42d66c9:


    "波琳娜在昏迷边缘挣扎，在小熊的爪中完全瘫软。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_dd5e9a8a:


    "猫头鹰落在雪堆上，咔哒着喙。它的羽毛浸透了鲜血。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_f890d14f:



    voice "voice/Owl/41 Dev.ogg"
    Owl "答应给我的女孩呢！"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_83cc05fc:



    voice "voice/Owl/42 Ga.ogg" 
    Owl "那个讨厌的小鬼害我挨饿，呼呜！"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_f4c4b5a4:


    "猫头鹰仍在挫败中颤抖，展开巨大的翅膀，寄生虫在翅内蠕动。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_5a463a8e:


    "然后朝我逼近，显然怒气冲冲。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_20badb86:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/279 N.ogg"
    Ant "不要！"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_cf25022d:


    "阴影愈发浓重，仿佛在凑近倾听我为了小命求饶的声音。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_747d3310:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/335 N.ogg"
    Ant "别杀我们……我……"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_e816d2ec:


    "这时，我灵光一现。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_bc51cfa4:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/336 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "我是兔子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_b979d4cb:



    voice "voice/Owl/43 Kto.ogg" 
    Owl "谁——谁——呼呜？"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_50a1f796:


    "小狼被从獠牙滴下的口水呛到。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_8ace7ae1:


    "那几乎不像熊的标本沉重地喘息，随后爆发出笑声。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_dc1a9436:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/09 ti.ogg"
    Bear "你？！开什么玩笑！"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_8b545128:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/10 na.ogg"
    Bear "真正的兔子已经找到，很快就会到来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_dc89c1dc:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/11 e.ogg"
    Bear "哦，我们要好好玩玩……"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_891a1c0b:


    "小狼朝我迈出一步。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_5f8be93f:


    "我这是在抓救命稻草……或者说在抓住生命的最后几秒。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_278182e6:


    "如此卑微，只为乞求多活片刻……"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_920814f7:


    "有一瞬间我甚至后悔把护身符给了奥莉娅。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_7178ff6b:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/337 H.ogg"
    Ant "住手！你们需要我们做什么？"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_7fe02ec3:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/338 T.ogg"
    Ant "你们救过我……你们说我会没事的，记得吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_b2ba1fbd:


    "小狼竖起耳朵。他的目光空洞得令人心悸。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_9a343358:


    "他微弱的低语形成了词语。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_8b47c6ec:



    voice "voice/Wolf/127 Da.ogg"
    Wolf "是……是……你……会……没事……"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_437e2475:



    voice "voice/Wolf/128 No.ogg"
    Wolf "但我的……老……朋友……"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_12d3c2f6:


    "骨笛的声音传入耳中，神秘而尖锐。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_9a3b7dc5:


    "皱眉的小狼朝我走来，却在半途停住，仿佛有人关掉了他的开关。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_246ca13d:


    "风停了，乐声更加响亮。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_2969592d:


    "那野兽颤抖着，就像暂停的录像带画面。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_2b1e10d5:


    "接着明亮的裂纹贯穿他的轮廓。那些奇异疤痕的边缘闷烧着。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_bd75a927:


    "我惊讶得张大了嘴。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_d4a842f4:


    "狼的外形冒起烟，碎片开始剥落。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_7fcc9109:


    "它们化作无重量的灰烬，如薄片般在沟壑中盘旋。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_165fbf92:


    "狼面具脱落，像愈合伤口上的结痂。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_a4180300:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/229 R.ogg"
    Pol "罗姆！！！"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_5558c3ac:


    "罗姆卡苍白的脸因愤怒而扭曲。他嘴唇干裂，额头青筋暴起。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_11f19bd3:


    "他像野兽般掀起上唇，眼中闪烁着疯狂的光芒，直勾勾盯着我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_0e78f02f:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/52 T.ogg"
    Rom "你去过她家，对吧？你去过我的波琳娜家，对吧？"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_8f93ff96:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/53 Ri.ogg"
    Rom "你给她画画了吗？你碰她了吗？！"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_2d455681:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/230 Ro.ogg"
    Pol "罗莫奇卡……"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_959f3f54:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/54 Za.ogg"
    Rom "闭嘴，婊子！"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_f4dc25c6:


    "波琳娜在变形的折磨者手中瘫软，开始嚎啕大哭。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_5acb042f:


    "我因震惊而麻木。罗姆卡重复着我们在波琳娜家附近相遇时说过的话。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_560bfecb:


    "‘原来是这样，’我想。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_7d8f226b:


    "一直以来，面具封存着罗姆卡的心智，但现在我那完全疯了的同学自由了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_3bacf6f0:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/339 R.ogg"
    Ant "罗姆卡，看看周围。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_8bc52291:


    "我恳求他看看周围，看看这骇人的沟壑和尖锐的树枝。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_6a753eff:


    "但罗姆卡只是用一眨不眨的目光刺穿我，伸出了手……他手中紧握着一把熟悉的蝴蝶刀。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_39f65137:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/55 Ra.ogg"
    Rom "我没警告过你吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_160801d0:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/56 R.ogg"
    Rom "我不是说过我会杀了……杀了……杀了你……"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_d03f717d:


    "我视此为逃跑的信号。罗姆卡跃过沟壑，推了我一把。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_50587292:


    voice "voice/Anton/5day/280 v.ogg"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_c993c1d4:


    "感觉像有闪电击中我的肩胛骨之间。我倒下，忘记了如何呼吸。我用尽全力转过身。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_ec351ee1:


    "刀刃上沾染了我的血。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_257340d6:


    "我张着嘴。氧气就是无法进入肺部。取而代之的是寒冷正填满我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_dc5f5212:



    voice "voice/romka/5day/57 Ti.ogg"
    Rom "你从背后捅了我一刀。现在我们扯平了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_d3d93107:


    "波琳娜哭得撕心裂肺。但比她的哭声更响的，是那如沼泽雾气般弥漫在森林中的乐声。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_8df4dab4:


    "笛声笼罩了一切。罗姆卡面容扭曲地僵在原地。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_1f2247fb:


    "我的右眼突然失明，但左眼仍透过交错的树枝看到那邪恶的月亮。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_9650c83d:


    "无法忍受它的光芒，我看向冻住的疯子……"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_095c2769:


    "……以及那个在罗姆卡身后巍然耸立的宏伟身影——森林之主。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_cad48d54:


    "山羊慈父般地拍了拍他的肩膀。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_324cbb32:


    "罗姆卡流下白色的、泡沫状的口水，炽热的眼睛茫然凝视。刀从他苍白的手指间滑落。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_96d3af17:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/65 be.ogg" 
    Master "我可怜的咩——咩——咩——玩具，彻底坏掉了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_e2029afd:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/66 ni.ogg" 
    Master "没关系，我会修好你，就像修好其他所有人一样。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_ac8ec9ec:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/67 ka.ogg" 
    Master "每一个……"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_cbcb12b0:


    "两个较矮的身影从黑暗中显现。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_7d151ccf:


    "皱眉的胡蒂用紫色的舌头舔了舔喙。小熊拖着哭泣的波琳娜。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_0b116849:


    "山羊弯下腰，从灰烬中拾起狼面具。他将面具覆在罗姆卡脸上，从袖中取出一根巨大的针。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_568e0f99:


    "他手法娴熟、稳稳地，将面具缝在狼脸上。针扎得如此之深，我以为会刮到罗姆卡的头骨。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_32cbf7cc:


    "主人缝完最后一针，小狼的眼睛睁开了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_0f29bbdb:



    voice "voice/Wolf/129 vs.ogg"
    Wolf "如果我那天早、早上抓住你，一、一切早就结、结束了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_2226a280:



    voice "voice/Wolf/130 po.ogg"
    Wolf "还记、记得你怎么找到沃瓦的手套吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_423ee718:



    voice "voice/Owl/44 Eto.ogg" 
    Owl "是我们特意把它放在你家附近的树枝上的……"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_99370b1b:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/Ti.ogg"
    Bear "你当时就该死了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_47c8008f:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/Vs.ogg"
    Bear "但那只蠢狐狸……我们的兔子，我们的兔子……呸！"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_d788067f:


    "我无法反驳，也无法动弹。波琳娜泪如泉涌。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_14a83807:


    "小狼向前一步，张开了满是利齿的嘴。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_e5f3532e:


    "我感到他的尖牙锁住我的脖子，扯出我的喉结，将猩红的血条抛向天空。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_36cbf93b:


    "片刻之后，那个浑身是血的狼人男孩形象，变成了一只可怕的针叶林狼。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_27dc9f56:


    "所有其他怪物也都变成了动物。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_fceec073:


    "森林之主的高大身影先变成手持笛子的浓须老人，随即又拉伸回森林巨人的形态。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_83993125:


    "我病态的头脑在恐怖的万花筒中轰鸣，扭曲的镜子将现实与妄想混合。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_b972d724:


    "垂死之际，我无法分辨所见究竟为何。"


translate chinese d5_ending_bloody_claw_ae366bcc:


    "最后记得的，是狼从我身上又撕下一块肉时，鲜血喷向月亮的景象。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_2cbc0157:


    "护身符不过是愚蠢的迷信。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_d465a386:


    "一个黑暗时代的荒诞传说，那时嗜血的部落用亲生子女献祭。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_75b0d22d:


    "这可笑的历史遗物怎么能帮到我和奥莉娅？"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_753a430e:


    "它早该被扯下，扔进饥饿的黑暗。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_8e7a7632:


    "但，不知为何……我决定留着它。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_285ec359:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/328 Be.ogg"
    Ant "快跑，奥莉娅！"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_20b84b4c:


    "我们冲过那片憎恶我们的森林。一切鲜活温血的生灵都与它格格不入。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_4e8e1136:


    "森林想让我们变得像它的宝藏一样——冰冷，顺从地躺在冰壳之下。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_2924a32d:


    "那轮像发黄蠕虫团的月亮，偶尔从光秃秃的树梢间窥视。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_8184fbfe:


    "月亮和我都知道。没人会帮助我们。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_1cb94f90:


    "大人们不相信我们，吉洪诺夫敷衍了事，因为我无法证实我的话。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_af33fe50:


    "一切都结束了。灌木丛将成为我们的坟墓。它最擅长埋葬孩子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_faecfeb5:


    "身后传来嚎叫与呼啸。波琳娜的外套在我眼前一闪。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_6bf3dc27:


    "接着那个亮点突然消失了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_884749be:


    "我猛地停住脚步，奥莉娅撞进我怀里，紧紧抱住我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_b7397738:


    Oly "她去哪了，托沙？"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_6c3b493a:


    "我们面前出现一道沟壑，布满黑色血管般的树根。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_9256a114:


    "波琳娜躺在沟底扭动着。她没注意到边缘，径直掉了下去。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_68fdc5b9:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/329 Po.ogg"
    Ant "波琳娜！"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_2ff37d6b:


    "沟壑回应了一声呻吟。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_e3b41659:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/330 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "奥莉娅，待在这儿。我马上回来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_8c40f37e:


    "妹妹不情愿地向后退了几步。我紧盯灌木丛，确认没有东西后，开始往沟壑下爬。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_dad57df9:


    "它们毫无预警地从黑暗中现身，符合夜行生物的习性。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_fcba71c4:


    "一道带翼的阴影拍打翅膀，猫头鹰的轮廓出现在月轮上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_7b6b2ed9:


    "那生物抓住奥莉娅，将她从地面拽起，带入繁星点点的夜空。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_c7d0eccc:


    "一声短促的惊叫尾音渐弱，被沙沙作响的森林吞没。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_8a97d17d:


    "我所能做的，只是无助地朝着妹妹片刻前站立的地方伸出手去。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_29ad251f:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/340 net.ogg"
    Ant "不！"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_70cde57e:


    "绝望的尖叫让我五脏翻腾。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_9eb2ff06:


    "我试图爬出沟壑，但双脚在斜坡上打滑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_20f1113c:


    "我用指甲抓挠土壤，还是滚落下去，掉到下面，而那里有新的恐怖在等着我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_ced9afb1:


    "小熊摇晃着他那令人毛骨悚然的脑袋，在沟底爬行。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_72bef96c:


    "跪在地上的波琳娜看到他蛆虫遍布的眼睛，发出尖叫。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_f9e78f4b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/232 Dih.ogg" 
    "那野兽更像一具腐烂的动物标本而非真熊，用它丑陋的爪子锁住她，将她拖向自己。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_931eec69:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/Se.ogg"
    Bear "叛徒是什么下场，你很快就能亲身体验到了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_0bdc98c7:


    "我和波琳娜都吓坏了，身体僵得跟石头一样，一动不动。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_ed692f22:


    "我痛恨自己的视力没有和四肢一样失效。相反，它反而更加锐利。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_0747c0fa:


    "小狼也从阴影中走出来，像坏掉的玩具一样扭曲着身子。他的血盆大口往下滴着口水，吐出零碎的词句。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_e7815ae6:



    voice "voice/Wolf/126 Z.ogg"
    Wolf "吃——！撕——碎！杀——了你！"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_a42d66c9:


    "波琳娜在昏迷边缘挣扎，在小熊的爪中完全瘫软。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_37db0296:


    "猫头鹰落在雪堆上，鸟嘴一张一合，发出咔哒咔哒的响声；身上的羽毛浸满了鲜血。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_3266f287:


    "一想到奥莉娅已经死了，悲痛压垮了我的胸膛，我不由得弯下腰去。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_6410b84f:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/332 Ne.ogg"
    Ant "不要！"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_cf25022d:


    "阴影愈发浓重，仿佛在凑近倾听我为了小命求饶的声音。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_6a4f892a:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/335 Neu.ogg"
    Ant "别杀我们……我……"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_0ce9d256:


    "小狼朝我迈出一步。我慌忙扫视四周，希望能找到什么东西，拖住这怪物。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_e74a1f56:


    "有个念头忽然从脑子里蹦出来，我整个人仿佛触电一般。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_33b4003d:


    "我摸索到领口后的粗绳，猛力一拽，将手伸向逼近的敌人。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_6bd38930:


    "一枚爪形护身符在绳上晃荡。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_edb78136:



    voice "voice/Wolf/132 a.ogg"
    Wolf "嗷，嗷，好烫！"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_98b644fe:


    "小狼跳着后退，捂住胸口，随即爆发出嚎叫般的大笑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_ce2aca0b:



    voice "voice/Wolf/133 t.ogg"
    Wolf "这是你的乳牙吗？你以为我是谁，牙、牙仙吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_b8f1e919:



    voice "voice/Wolf/134 oi.ogg"
    Wolf "真是傻瓜！"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_8c613d20:


    "护身符毫无作用，挂在绳子上像钟摆一样旋转。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_fc78a8ef:


    "小熊抓着波琳娜，用锐利的目光盯着他那戴狼面具的兄弟。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_76ba2a85:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/Ne.ogg"
    Bear "不好笑。而且嘲笑别人的不幸一点也不厉害。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_26f04357:


    "他张开爪子，动了动四根可怖的指头，原本应该长着无名指的地方，只剩下一小坨流脓的肉块。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_87faf5d0:



    voice "voice/Wolf/136 A.ogg"
    Wolf "你不该、该惹怒主人。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_74ce9404:



    voice "voice/Owl/45 Tog.ogg" 
    Owl "呼呜——呼呜！他就不会剁掉你那根手指了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_dab75f4c:


    "小狼再次向我逼近。我后背撞上沟壑的斜坡，头上下起了一场小小的雪。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_d8e7b1c8:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/333 Ne.ogg"
    Ant "别过来！波琳娜说护身符会保护我！"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_e25082cc:



    voice "voice/Wolf/137 S.ogg"
    Wolf "她是说过……她是说过……"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_3935084d:



    voice "voice/Wolf/138 z.ogg"
    Wolf "我知道你们所有的谎、谎言。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_da940d93:


    "顽皮的火苗在他面具的缝隙中闷烧。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_2bf4a686:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/on.ogg"
    Bear "他受到主人的庇护……"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_07fe7105:



    voice "voice/Owl/46 Zn.ogg" 
    Owl "我们知道，呼呜——呼呜，你以为我们都像你一样迟钝吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_178b6dc1:



    voice "voice/Bear/5day/Le.ogg"
    Bear "懒得跟你吵。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_3a92475e:



    voice "voice/Wolf/139 mi.ogg"
    Wolf "我们不会动你一根手、手指。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_573cc64b:



    voice "voice/Wolf/140 no.ogg"
    Wolf "如果你想让领、领、领头的来了结你……"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_51184939:



    voice "voice/Wolf/141 me.ogg"
    Wolf "我不拦着。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_8625b19c:


    "狼笨拙地鞠了一躬后，退到一旁，为那只在沟壑中显形的长角阴影让路。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_c704fb34:


    "或者说，它其实一直就在那儿，欣赏着这场表演？"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_a8364fbb:


    "骇人的巨兽踏入光亮时，浑身一颤。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_341f68d5:


    "他修长的手指一收一放，指关节咔咔作响。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_1bb975f0:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/68 k.ogg" 
    Master "违逆主人者，当受惩罚。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_696e4496:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/69 a.ogg" 
    Master "而背叛族群者，当死！"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_5c986a6c:


    "我尖叫着，用那无用的护身符挡在身前。山羊的影子升向天空，遮蔽了整个世界。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_7770786e:


    "野兽们龇着牙，期待地尖叫起来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_a3e79a83:


    "一支笛子从山羊袖中滑出，落入他手中。他向我展示它，就像魔术师向观众展示道具。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_090193b4:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/70 po.ogg" 
    Master "是时候把本属于真正兔子的东西还回来了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_b6525cd8:


    "山羊将脸贴近笛子，像饿狗对待骨头一般。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_bb013210:


    "乐声击碎了我先前因恐惧而冻结的心智，如同冰锥。我因地狱般的剧痛弯下腰。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_86a8d887:


    "我感觉血管和肌肉即将爆裂，接着眼珠会掉出，悬在神经的鞭毛上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_039539f3:


    "山羊贪婪地注视着我，继续吹奏。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_f341ab65:


    "旋律吞噬了我的意识，一股怪物般的压力从内部挤压我的头骨。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_5a3bad03:


    "血从鼻孔流出。什么东西在我体内踢打，要求我……"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_71496f17:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/35 v.ogg"
    Noname "放我出去，放我出去，放我出去。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_10ca889d:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/36 ne.ogg"
    Noname "停止抵抗。否则会更疼。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_d49c3ac2:


    "我跪倒在地，不确定自己是否在尖叫。波琳娜惊恐地看着。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_4053c1d3:


    "透过笛声，我听到某种开裂声。血从我额头涌出。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_81a25c8b:


    "我的头骨炸开，将碎骨和皮块抛向空中。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_d2caa54e:


    "在意识消失前，我感到某种恶心的东西从我脑袋里迸发出来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_among_us_9f761229:


    "一只畸形的蝴蝶扑腾着飞向天空，划破冰冷的空气。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_48422e6a:


    "我们扔掉了所有无用的破烂，冲向森林。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_a00488df:


    "我们冲向森林。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_25fe9867:


    "但怪物们更快。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_8f2c581e:


    "它们从暴风雪中扑向我们。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_59536a7c:


    "猫头鹰落在奥莉娅肩上，将她从我手中夺走。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_48b99a09:


    "我只来得及注意到妹妹因恐惧而睁圆的双眼。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_02e01348:


    "那只鸟将她扔进雪地，落在她身上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_4304d0f3:


    "暴风雪用粗糙的舌头卷走了波琳娜。只在她刚才站立的地方留下一抹红色污迹。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_a0fff66e:


    "有东西击中了结了层冰壳的雪地，翻滚着。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_89a3d969:


    "罗曼耸了耸肩。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_e22ab773:


    "然后举起了手……举到了他原本放着头颅的位置。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_64afba1a:


    "一道血泉从他脖颈的断口喷出。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_7b5e941e:


    "一团白色的软骨从血肉模糊中探出。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_b570bed2:


    "他双目凸出的头颅滑过冰面，停在我的靴子旁。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_81ffbe07:


    "我哀嚎起来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_3ca700aa:


    "爪子从雪堆中伸出，像钳子一样抓住我的小腿。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_6a3c0231:


    "我无法冲去救援，只能惊恐地看着血腥的屠杀。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_3828b244:


    "猫头鹰圆睁着眼睛。对准奥莉娅的脸啄了下去。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_980e3a5e:


    "她一口啄掉了奥利娅的鼻子，血泉从形成的空洞中涌出。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_8e307025:


    "我尖叫着，抓挠着雪地。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_140b42f7:


    "猫头鹰第二次啄下，撕掉了奥莉娅的嘴唇。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_c8478353:


    "她的上唇，她的下唇，连带着皮肉还挂在奥莉娅的下巴上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_0920dc35:


    "喙撞击着奥莉娅的乳牙，将它们敲落。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_2d3ce4b1:


    "妹妹的小脸现在像绞碎的肉泥。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_96e8e5b1:


    "但猫头鹰只是继续啄食，从骨头上剥离皮肉。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_86438218:


    "接着，牙齿从四面八方刺入我，撕扯下一块块血肉。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_450d8384:


    "雪地被染红。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_3692e08a:


    "可怜的奥莉娅还活着，她在暴风雪中无声地呜咽。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_f6800775:


    "我用尽全力挥动斧头，但斧刃只划过了空气。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_0eb6be05:


    "爪子撕扯着我的头皮，活活剥下我的皮。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_a661b351:


    "在最后的时刻，一张狞笑的狐狸脸覆盖了世界，赐予我甜蜜的永恒黑暗。"


translate chinese d5_ending_pack_of_afterdev_3ac06108:


    "我最后看到的，是一张覆盖了世界的、狞笑的熊脸，它赐予了我永恒的黑暗。"


translate chinese d5_ending_rage_48422e6a:


    "我们扔掉了所有无用的破烂，冲向森林。"


translate chinese d5_ending_rage_a00488df:


    "我们冲向森林。"


translate chinese d5_ending_rage_25fe9867:


    "但怪物们更快。"


translate chinese d5_ending_rage_aff76bbe:


    "它们将尖叫的波琳娜抛到雪地上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_rage_a0fff66e:


    "有东西击中了结了层冰壳的雪地，翻滚着。"


translate chinese d5_ending_rage_044b552c:


    "罗曼耸了耸肩。"


translate chinese d5_ending_rage_930c00bd:


    "然后举起了手……举到了他原本放着头颅的位置。"


translate chinese d5_ending_rage_64afba1a:


    "一道血泉从他脖颈的断口喷出。"


translate chinese d5_ending_rage_7b5e941e:


    "一团白色的软骨从血肉模糊中探出。"


translate chinese d5_ending_rage_b570bed2:


    "他双目凸出的头颅滑过冰面，停在我的靴子旁。"


translate chinese d5_ending_rage_81ffbe07:


    "我哀嚎起来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_rage_3ca700aa:


    "爪子从雪堆中伸出，像钳子一样抓住我的小腿。"


translate chinese d5_ending_rage_6a3c0231:


    "我无法冲去救援，只能惊恐地看着血腥的屠杀。"


translate chinese d5_ending_rage_b9b9981b:


    "野兽们正在给波琳娜开膛破肚。"


translate chinese d5_ending_rage_8080220e:


    "它们折断她的骨头，从肉里剔出骨渣。"


translate chinese d5_ending_rage_77d807d7:


    "肌肉崩裂，红色的纤维卡在它们的牙缝里。"


translate chinese d5_ending_rage_e718c320:


    "波琳娜的下巴伴随着碎裂声从头骨上脱离，仅剩一些皮肉相连。"


translate chinese d5_ending_rage_324b4320:


    "波琳娜的舌头掉进了由此形成的孔洞。"


translate chinese d5_ending_rage_fd3456bc:


    "我看着她在爪子的撕扯下死去，而我的脸也被活活剥皮。"


translate chinese d5_ending_rage_c30327ec:


    "斧头在我手中颤抖，恐惧让我无法挥动它。"


translate chinese d5_ending_rage_eb8f74d1:


    "我竭力想着奥莉娅，好让我在离开这尘世时，眼前能浮现她美丽的面容。"


translate chinese d5_ending_rage_2ed53767:


    "我想着那个头上有阳光般光晕的女孩。"


translate chinese d5_ending_rage_3ac06108:


    "我最后看到的，是一张覆盖了世界的、狞笑的熊脸，它赐予了我永恒的黑暗。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_aa4dbf21:


    "选择是个谎言。一切早已注定。我的命运已封存。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_d5d2af34:


    "面具触碰到我的脸，如同野兽粗糙的舌头，导致我颅内的线路短路。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_30decc94:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/Vdoh.ogg"
    "我的肺部扩张。我吸入的空气混合着血腥味和车内肮脏的气息。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_0aa75416:


    "副驾驶的门猛地打开，快得几乎铰链脱落。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_eaa5cc27:


    "外面暴风雪肆虐，一个纤细的女性轮廓从白茫中凸显。我看不清她的头在哪里。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_73a35181:


    "苍白的手摸索着金属部件，像某种白化蜘蛛，爬进我和奥莉娅的避难所。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_6041bbf0:


    "那女人俯身探入，缓慢地弯下腰，像生锈的机械装置。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_b2abf5bc:


    "一个长着粗乱毛发的下巴出现了……然后是嘴……眼睛的缝隙。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_3b8f5625:


    "她的面具几乎和曾经盖在我脸上的那个一模一样。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_67acf55b:


    "只是更加骇人，更加扭曲，仿佛在哈哈镜中映照过一般。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_8599beb7:


    "瞳孔在孔洞中闪烁。指甲刮擦着金属。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_d9eb002c:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/013 Da.ogg"
    Lady_Bunny "你竟敢这么做，你这个杂种！"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_a1724048:


    "我在这个陌生女人的怒视下僵住了。力气尽失。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_d002b316:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/191 krya.ogg"
    "女人咆哮着爬进车里。她伸出手，长长的指甲划向我的脖子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_7bc871b1:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/253 pomer.ogg"
    "血涌了出来，温暖了我的腹部和大腿。风在外面呼啸。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_18273a99:


    "我立刻忘记了如何呼吸。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_75af7772:


    "戴面具的女人，饥饿的兔子，迫使我仰起头，将她的嘴贴上了我的喉咙。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_4e871604:


    "她贪婪地啜饮，咂嘴作响。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_adb84fe7:


    "有什么东西在我大脑里移动，冲向在伤口中蠕动的舌头。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_3e73de3e:


    "仿佛那东西一直潜伏在我体内，只为等待某天被吞食。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_bdf867e5:


    "就在黑暗完全吞噬我之前……"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_e27f50a8:


    "……我意识到了正在舔舐我脖颈伤口鲜血的是谁的舌头……"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_ca3f2055:


    "我的儿子……我可口的儿子……如此鲜嫩的肉……只有我女儿的肉能与之媲美……"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_b4b3545b:


    "我走出血迹斑斑的车，擦去猩红的嘴唇。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_1645d36e:


    "奥莉娅，我在冰窟边吃了她……现在又是安东……"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_66c89ab1:


    "我将他们送回了他们最初来的地方。我的身体。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_193a7c87:


    "他们将与我同在，直到风带走他们的名字和我对他们的记忆。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_28f2c5cc:


    "直到胃酸溶解我的孩子们。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_ec38d8b7:


    "我站直身体。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_c0110509:


    "恶魔般的力量注入我的身体，但我的意识却蒙上了一层红膜。那是一团雾。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_8a4c51b9:


    "我撕开自己孩子的喉咙是对的吗？吃下女儿温热的心脏？我是个好母亲吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_3171a48c:


    "我的思绪缠结不清。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_e77480b5:


    "我游移的目光落在森林之主身上。他背靠着一棵松树坐着。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_f6d081f5:


    "肠子从他撕裂的腹部耷拉出来，他的面具沾满了红色。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_9d47d220:


    "我想吃掉他，但主人抬起了手。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_76c481d7:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/71 be.ogg" 
    Master "完美无瑕！"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_ec0e107c:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/72 ti.ogg" 
    Master "你是完美的，我的女孩。一个完整的兔子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_155d6b9d:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/73 na.ogg"
    Master "终于，你能跳跃并触及它了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_e038141c:


    "他的食指向上指去。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_96d1b51e:


    "尽管墓园积雪覆盖，天空完全被云层遮蔽，我却看到了那轮月亮，它那令人疯狂的美丽。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_6985ed6b:


    "饥饿再次折磨我的腹部。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_c231cea2:


    "我舔去唇上儿子的血，缓缓点头。野兽的轮廓出现在车灯光束中。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_6b334dbf:


    "族群的残存者从树后走出，蹒跚地向我聚拢，围成一个圈。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_f24b34f4:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/74 td.ogg" 
    Master "去吧。去咬那月亮，兔子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_d9bc14f7:


    "我不再看族群，也不再看向森林之主。我的眼睛紧盯着月亮。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_687849be:


    "随后，我绷紧肌肉，纵身一跃。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_14b70874:


    "双脚脱离地面，我向上飞升，张开我的血盆大口。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_f4dce51d:


    "月亮越来越近。"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_1a1e7a78:


    "野兽们留在我下方：渺小的身影，等待着我的归来……"


translate chinese d5_ending_nightmare_be168cc7:


    "……去完成那个仪式。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_dd3da380:


    "我们三人沿着蜿蜒的墓地小径，在白色雾霭中快速奔跑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_4278f651:


    "仿佛那些饥饿的怪物随时都会从任何角落向我们扑来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_f1e1f8f3:


    "十字架的阴影在小径上重叠交错。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_6dbce6b9:


    "一声震耳欲聋的嚎叫从我们身后响起。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_472a57f1:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/229 ro.ogg" 
    Pol "罗姆！"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_0272f77b:


    "我转过身。波琳娜独自一人。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_ce58bf0e:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/210.Gde.ogg"
    Ant "他在哪儿？"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_16e8de65:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/224 to.ogg"
    Pol "他刚才还抓着我的手！罗姆！"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_1cb4ab10:


    "我的目光落在一件挂在十字架上的皮夹克上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_e8cf35f3:


    "是罗姆卡的外套。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_b7de8d0e:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/211.Poshle.ogg"
    Ant "走吧，波琳娜。尽量跟上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_8d3fbac3:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/225 ar.ogg"
    Pol "那罗姆怎么办？"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_60dd18a9:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/212.on.ogg"
    Ant "他会赶上来的。把手给我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_f8651883:


    "我们继续前行，只剩下我们两个人。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_35d787ca:


    "暴风雪呼啸，我们奔跑着，呼吸粗重。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_2c1b8b5f:


    "枪声在墓地上空回响。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_9f5b6474:


    "波琳娜摔倒了，我扶她起来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_7ca76651:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/226 g.ogg" 
    Pol "他在哪儿？"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_58ef80e5:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/213.On.ogg" 
    Ant "他会希望我们自救。这才是最重要的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_53831a63:


    "步枪在夜色中哒哒作响，喷射着铅弹。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_d67f7f45:


    "随后，枪声突然沉寂，呼啸的暴风雪也同时减弱。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_90a9bb84:


    "雪毯缓缓覆盖了坟墓，露出灰暗的天空和明亮的月亮。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_3357e447:


    "月光照亮了墓碑、椭圆形照片上的逝者，以及波琳娜和我的脸。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_397e0a8a:


    "是吉洪诺夫子弹用尽了吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_faf743ae:


    "还是他的生命已经终结？在那暴风雪中，被撕成碎片……"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_c4f3ecdc:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/214.Scor.ogg"
    Ant "来，我们走。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_303f26f6:


    "我们像两个迷路的孩子一样走着。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_26919279:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/227 sl.ogg" 
    Pol "听到了吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_63c9f07c:


    "我屏息倾听。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_3489fe03:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/214.no.ogg"
    Ant "不……不想。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_a47929cc:


    "她用手势示意我停下，专注地倾听着我们周围坟墓般的寂静。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_5e8307b1:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/01 ab.ogg"
    Pol "一片死寂。我听不到任何音乐了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_4dd42a87:


    "接着，她哭了起来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_c50e0939:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/03 me.ogg"
    Pol "奥莉娅的旋律……吉洪诺夫……罗姆卡……"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_d8f967cc:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/04 eh.ogg"
    Pol "他们都消失了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_f707d14c:


    "她的话让我心急如焚。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_9beb885c:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/215.Poz.ogg"
    Ant "求你了，波琳娜，你看到了那些怪物能做什么！"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_a4b5759f:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/215.Pro.ogg"
    Ant "快，我们必须离开！"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_beea634e:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/05 be.ogg"
    Pol "没有奥莉娅？没有罗姆卡？"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_72bd01cb:


    "她放声大哭，苦涩的泪水也涌上我的眼角。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_5f91a0e9:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/216.Slez.ogg"
    Ant "眼泪无法让他们回来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_cef5fc7a:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/216.no.ogg"
    Ant "但我保证会救你。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_c021449d:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/217.E.ogg"
    Ant "我们一定会去莫斯科，去维也纳，然后我……"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_b8a9c891:


    "她抽泣着，凝视着我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_9d6f2516:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/218.Ya.ogg"
    Ant "……我会出版那本关于你的漫画，波琳娜。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_1f16d7c9:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/219.Ver.ogg"
    Ant "相信我！"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_3c9e40c6:


    "波琳娜抱住我，低声说："


translate chinese d5_ending_past_d4128fa7:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/06 ti.ogg"
    Pol "你是对的。你是我仅剩的一切了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_bf0836e3:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/07 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "我相信你。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_a1bf20fb:


    "我越过她的肩膀望去。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_d7bd46c4:


    "墓地尽头的那个黑色长方形洞口吸引了我的目光。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_a0f6ebf9:


    "十字架上的花圈垂下哀悼的丝带，仿佛在呼唤我向内窥探。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_267b9bd9:


    "我拖着僵硬的腿，一瘸一拐地走向冻土上那个饥饿的洞口。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_b5ba076d:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/08 Ant.ogg"
    Pol "安东？"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_bdb39e2d:


    "洞口在呼唤我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_c47e00be:


    "我跨过矮围栏。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_34dc542b:


    "雪花在空中盘旋，像舞厅里的皇室成员。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_dcf77145:


    "地下六英尺，覆盖着一层薄雪的地方，躺着我的父母。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_de3fd621:


    "他们像在床上一样互相拥抱，却是在冰冷的地上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_1a0e5f21:


    "他们的头转向彼此，仿佛在模仿亲密的时刻，而太阳穴上装饰着完美圆润的弹孔。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_e1e1b135:


    "铅弹让妈妈和爸爸在死亡中和解，它扼杀了无谓争吵的火焰。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_48f4d99c:


    "我跪倒在地，失去了最后一丝理智和力气。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_a3610189:


    Ant "不！这不可能是真的！这都是谎言！"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_dc3502c7:


    "波琳娜走近了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_0a0132f2:


    "她的瞳孔在黑暗中闪烁。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_f8cb181a:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/09 mi.ogg"
    Pol "我们会没事的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_96e76224:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/222.Etot.ogg"
    Ant "这场噩梦……"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_330765da:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/222.On.ogg"
    Ant "它不会放过我们的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_e78eb2b3:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/10 ti.ogg"
    Pol "你忘了吗，傻瓜？"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_74c56822:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/11 poka.ogg" 
    Pol "只要你和我在一起，你就是安全的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_47b387ed:


    "她的右眼迸裂开来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_a88ff4ee:


    "脑浆和骨髓碎片从眼窝喷出，溅在我惊恐扭曲的脸上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_ef31e970:


    "波琳娜倒在一座倾斜的墓碑旁。我冲到她身边。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_eb7dbb0b:


    "我抚摸着她曾经美丽如今却毁容的脸庞。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_0b41520e:


    "灰色的烟雾从她的眼窝升起。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_ea024fd2:


    "我感到音乐正离开她迅速失温的身体。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_3d5e048e:


    "我的鼻孔捕捉到她头发的芳香，针叶和爆竹的气味。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_5ec3e1e1:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/224.Poli.ogg"
    Ant "求求你，别丢下我，波琳娜！"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_d6c7ebd6:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/224.Polina.ogg"
    Ant "波琳娜————！"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_4b152f50:


    "一把乌黑的枪管抵住了我的额头。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_265b2191:


    "咔哒。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_265b2191_1:


    "咔哒。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_1ceca1b4:


    "兔唇男人摆弄着手里的枪。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_f906c4d8:



    voice "voice/killer/01Nado.ogg"
    Killer "该死。没子弹了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_aadb8b21:


    "他看起来几乎像是在等我同情他。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_ad3b4f89:



    voice "voice/killer/02Vot.ogg"
    Killer "操蛋的人生……"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_4f67b963:


    "杀手把枪插回腰带。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_0a0504df:


    "他抬起头，望着闪烁的星辰。然后慢慢地画了个十字。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_3d6f8d0e:



    voice "voice/killer/04 Gospa.ogg"
    Killer "上帝怜悯我……"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_4304829c:


    "他无情的手将我按进雪堆，扼住了我的脖子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_fae21c90:


    "兔唇男人面露凶相。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_aea79266:


    "然后收紧手指。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_3d7133e6:



    voice "voice/killer/08prosty.ogg"
    Killer "‘求你按你的慈爱怜恤我，按你丰盛的慈悲涂抹我的过犯。’"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_12420536:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/225.Udu.ogg"
    "他的手指紧紧陷进了我的脖子，深得指甲都刺破了我的皮肤，让我无法呼吸。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_32185cd4:


    "我双脚乱蹬，周围的世界开始跳起死亡之舞。我看到两个，不对，是三个十字架。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_b1677bed:


    "裤子变得又湿又热。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_7ea05686:


    "蓝色光环，像汽油在水坑里留下的彩虹污渍，在我眼前扩散。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_3c3566aa:


    voice "voice/killer/10e.ogg"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_76ab455b:


    Killer "并将你的恩典赐予逝去幼童的灵魂……"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_0b1ead32:


    "我试图回忆波琳娜。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_d32dcfd7:


    "回忆她的高贵与美丽。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_711c197c:


    "我想象她在舞台上为成千上万的人演奏，而我坐在第一排，目光从未离开她。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_6f7a5872:


    "我试图回忆奥莉娅。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_e7a71c26:


    "我想象抱着她，沐浴在阳光中，我们融化在清晨第一缕光芒的洁白里。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_d84cdddc:


    "一种前所未有的幸福与平静感攫住了我的灵魂。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_3b7f49b1:


    "我感到安宁，仿佛我刚从一场噩梦中醒来，就在漆黑的深夜，在我自己的房间里。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_6d945515:


    "是的。这一切只是一场梦。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_b1cf25dc:


    "只是想象跟我开的玩笑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_e1cff15a:


    "然后，我再次坠入愉快的沉睡，庆幸这一切其实没有真的发生在我身上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_58969e2e:


    "等到清晨来临，我会看到妹妹、爸爸妈妈、波琳娜，还有我的好朋友……"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_29bc4a6b:


    "但我不管怎么努力……"


translate chinese d5_ending_past_7f92df59:


    "……都醒不过来了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_8c909c11:


    "我不得不把妹妹拖出车外。她抽泣着，在我怀里抖得像纸娃娃。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_914480ed:


    "我们四人沿着蜿蜒的墓地小径，在白色雾霭中疾奔。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_4278f651:


    "仿佛那些饥饿的怪物随时都会从任何角落向我们扑来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_f1e1f8f3:


    "十字架的阴影在小径上重叠交错。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_6dbce6b9:


    "一声震耳欲聋的嚎叫从我们身后响起。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_4d6c9e27:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/223 R.ogg" 
    Pol "罗姆！"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_0272f77b:


    "我转过身。波琳娜独自一人。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_ce58bf0e:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/210.Gde.ogg"
    Ant "他在哪儿？"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_9f14459b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/224 to.ogg" 
    Pol "他刚才还抓着我的手！罗姆！"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_1cb4ab10:


    "我的目光落在一件挂在十字架上的皮夹克上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_e8cf35f3:


    "是罗姆卡的外套。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_b7de8d0e:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/211.Poshle.ogg"
    Ant "走吧，波琳娜。尽量跟上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_ad58cae7:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/225 a.ogg" 
    Pol "那罗姆怎么办？"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_60dd18a9:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/212.on.ogg"
    Ant "他会赶上来的。把手给我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_103402d1:


    "但波琳娜没有听。她向后退了一步，又一步，朝毫无回应的黑暗呼喊罗姆卡的名字。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_651088f1:


    "她嘶哑颤抖的声音，像一道失败的咒语，消融在暴风雪中。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_48d11fc6:


    "唯一的回应是一声低沉的、喉音般的嚎叫，紧接着是短促的枪声。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_2c7d1ecd:


    "一阵突如其来的风雪吞噬了女孩的身影。波琳娜消失在其中，无影无踪。没有尖叫，没有影子。只是一片空无。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_a727c216:


    "我帮不了她。我需要保护妹妹。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_a7342467:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/226.S.ogg"
    Ant "来，我们走。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_4aec438f:


    "我们像两个寻找永无乡的逃亡孩子，迷失方向，最终来到了冰雪女王的冻原。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_fc1627ff:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/123 Ti.ogg"
    Oly "你会一直陪着我吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_6d074693:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/227.Ni.ogg"
    Ant "当然。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_997f65bf:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/228.No.ogg"
    Ant "但是，奥莉娅……"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_d9a5218d:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/229.Es.ogg"
    Ant "如果我出了什么事，你就跑，好吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_df7c416a:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/229.Eshi.ogg"
    Ant "去找大人，找爸爸妈妈……"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_29cb9a43:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/230.Ko.ogg"
    Ant "找没戴面具的人。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_df9768a8:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/124 Dav.ogg"
    Oly "我们做点什么吧，让坏事不要发生。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_cc457aeb:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/231.ko.ogg"
    Ant "当然，但是……"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_71e13897:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/231.po.ogg"
    Ant "答应我，如果……"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_b7e583b9:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/232.Es.ogg"
    Ant "如果我不能走了，你要跑去求救。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_91bd382b:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/125 Kl.ogg"
    Oly "我以妈妈的心发誓！"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_4d4f6686:


    "绝望让我想和风一同嚎叫。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_d7bd46c4:


    "墓地尽头的那个黑色长方形洞口吸引了我的目光。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_a0f6ebf9:


    "十字架上的花圈垂下哀悼的丝带，仿佛在呼唤我向内窥探。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_267b9bd9:


    "我拖着僵硬的腿，一瘸一拐地走向冻土上那个饥饿的洞口。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_e4008983:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/126 To.ogg"
    Oly "你去哪儿，托沙？"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_bdb39e2d:


    "洞口在呼唤我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_c47e00be:


    "我跨过矮围栏。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_34dc542b:


    "雪花在空中盘旋，像舞厅里的皇室成员。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_dcf77145:


    "地下六英尺，覆盖着一层薄雪的地方，躺着我的父母。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_de3fd621:


    "他们像在床上一样互相拥抱，却是在冰冷的地上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_1a0e5f21:


    "他们的头转向彼此，仿佛在模仿亲密的时刻，而太阳穴上装饰着完美圆润的弹孔。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_e1e1b135:


    "铅弹让妈妈和爸爸在死亡中和解，它扼杀了无谓争吵的火焰。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_48f4d99c:


    "我跪倒在地，失去了最后一丝理智和力气。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_1ac2f205:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/127 Chto.ogg"
    Oly "那里有什么？"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_3ac53925:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/233.Ne.ogg"
    Ant "别过来！"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_939c1ba4:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/128 T.ogg"
    Oly "你吓到我了！"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_d064c054:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/234.Sto.ogg"
    Ant "待在原地！"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_2c655d1e:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/129 To.ogg"
    Oly "那个先生吓到我了……"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_108738ac:


    "先生？"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_5217a38c:


    "子弹擦过我的耳际，留下令人疯狂的嗡鸣。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_0da2ecd6:


    "兔唇男人从花岗岩墓碑后走了出来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_0f3e0500:


    "在我反应过来之前，哭泣的奥莉娅已经冲过来，用身体护住我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_7871252e:


    "她害怕极了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_2d7b6d4c:


    "但她害怕失去我的恐惧更甚。而我亦然，我的恐惧或许比她的还要巨大。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_e8e52ff1:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/131 Cht.ogg"
    Oly "你想干什么！？走开！"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_3cb1e5fc:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/131 mi.ogg"
    Oly "我们是好人！别伤害我们！"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_0032675a:


    "魁梧的男人出奇地平静，仿佛不是第一次有孩子在他面前哭泣、恳求和尖叫。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_0277e9e0:


    "他拉近了我们之间的距离，枪口直指我的额头。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_9a8abced:


    "我在绝望中等待枪声响起。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_c7235f8c:


    "等待我的身体与雪花一同在空中飘摇，随即坠入我身后的墓穴。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_5dbe35ec:


    "坠入我已故父母的怀抱。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_265b2191:


    "咔哒。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_265b2191_1:


    "咔哒。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_1ceca1b4:


    "兔唇男人摆弄着手里的枪。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_f906c4d8:



    voice "voice/killer/01Nado.ogg"
    Killer "该死。没子弹了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_aadb8b21:


    "他看起来几乎像是在等我同情他。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_b3d738dc:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/132 Os.ogg"
    Oly "离我们远点！求你了，走开！"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_c30a2512:



    voice "voice/killer/02Vot.ogg"
    Killer "操蛋的人生……"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_4f67b963:


    "杀手把枪插回腰带。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_0a0504df:


    "他抬起头，望着闪烁的星辰。然后慢慢地画了个十字。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_3d6f8d0e:



    voice "voice/killer/04 Gospa.ogg"
    Killer "上帝怜悯我……"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_5d76932d:


    "他无情的手将我按进雪堆，扼住了我的脖子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_fae21c90:


    "兔唇男人面露凶相。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_aea79266:


    "然后收紧手指。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_f9e8af79:


    "奥莉娅挥拳打他，试图拯救我直到最后一刻。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_1dc752cd:


    "她没有遵守诺言。她没有逃跑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_461360c2:


    "她做不到，就像我也做不到一样。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_fed4f715:


    "杀手一脚将她——一个毫无防御能力、脆弱的女孩——踢进了最近的一个敞开的墓穴。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_7344b05d:


    "片刻之后，一声撕心裂肺的尖叫从那里传出，立刻变成了歇斯底里的哭嚎。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_7b27a60d:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/134 Mam.ogg"
    Oly "妈妈！妈妈！"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_5d2cf269:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/134 Mam2.ogg"
    Oly "妈妈————！！！"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_25667c85:


    "杀手开始大声嘟囔，试图盖过奥莉娅的哭声。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_3d7133e6:



    voice "voice/killer/08prosty.ogg"
    Killer "‘求你按你的慈爱怜恤我，按你丰盛的慈悲涂抹我的过犯。’"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_35668412:


    "他的手指紧紧陷进了我的脖子，深得指甲都刺破了我的皮肤，让我无法呼吸。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_32185cd4:


    "我双脚乱蹬，周围的世界开始跳起死亡之舞。我看到两个，不对，是三个十字架。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_b1677bed:


    "裤子变得又湿又热。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_7ea05686:


    "蓝色光环，像汽油在水坑里留下的彩虹污渍，在我眼前扩散。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_b6ba89d6:



    voice "voice/killer/10e.ogg"
    Killer "并将你的恩典赐予逝去幼童的灵魂……"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_68d059c0:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/136 Rud2.ogg"
    "奥利娅躺在刚挖好的墓穴里尖叫。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_fb0ca14e:


    "而随着圣经的每一句新词，我变得越来越虚弱。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_bdc5ec14:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/Begi.ogg"
    "我内心的声音低语：快跑！赶紧跑！"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_13076743:


    "于是我尝试最后一次逃跑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_543e7e50:


    "逃向我梦想的世界。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_35fa3968:


    "我想象着自己跑去救奥莉娅。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_0778b339:


    "我想象抱着她，沐浴在阳光中，我们融化在清晨第一缕光芒的洁白里。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_28e05773:


    "一种前所未有的幸福与平静感攫住了我的灵魂。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_c2ba2c8d:


    "我感到一阵平静与安宁，仿佛刚从一场噩梦中醒来——此时正是漆黑的深夜，我还躺在自己房间的床上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_1340b01e:


    "是的。这一切只是一场梦。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_b1cf25dc:


    "只是想象跟我开的玩笑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_e1cff15a:


    "然后，我再次坠入愉快的沉睡，庆幸这一切其实没有真的发生在我身上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_58969e2e:


    "当早晨来临，我会看到我的妹妹，我的父母，波琳娜，我的朋友们……"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_29bc4a6b:


    "但我不管怎么努力……"


translate chinese d5_ending_hunt_7f92df59:


    "……都醒不过来了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_7b1c038d:


    "我感到有人碰了碰我的肩膀。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_678044ef:


    "波琳娜从黑暗中跳出，呼吸沉重，头发凌乱。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_bd75c83b:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/12 be.ogg"
    Pol "快跑！"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_4ad05603:


    "我刚想问她关于罗姆卡的事，但雪地墓地里传来了小狼的嚎叫，打断了我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_4e5cc8c8:


    "我们从怪物身边逃跑，撞上紧密排列的墓碑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_bf9d7b57:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/105 mi.ogg"
    Master "我们会找到你们的！"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_e854bb08:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/106 v.ogg"
    Master "在沟壑里，在坑洞里，在树根下！哦，我们一定会找到你们的！"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_2199010b:


    "雪花向上飘飞，轻抚我的皮肤。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_1774bad5:


    "一片巨大的铅灰色云朵在我们头顶膨胀，吞噬了月亮。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_f50e1f49:


    "我看到了守夜人的废弃小屋，面孔损毁的花岗岩墓碑，只有编号没有名字的坟墓，以及上个世纪的地下墓穴。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_8d11f69a:


    "我看到了地上张开的洞口，花瓶里的人造花，黑暗中饥饿的眼睛。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_41890c80:


    "然后，我只能看到栅栏外蔓延的森林。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_f75ad509:


    "我们从栏杆间挤了过去。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_712c88a6:


    "如果波琳娜是一把小提琴，此刻她正拉奏到极限。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_2f9c97d9:


    "但我也感觉她像一枚在冬日天空炸开的爆竹。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_bc6c0825:


    "身后追赶的人的呼啸声离我们越来越近。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_d01deefe:


    "它们饥饿难耐，无法忘怀我们的骨头和甜美的血肉。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_5862bb65:


    "我们成了猎物。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_7ffaf512:


    "不，我们一直是猎物——是那些永不疲倦、永不停歇的猎人的猎物。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_9a557374:


    "道路到了尽头。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_99e10d2b:


    "前方只有针叶林——阴影的王国，在雪堆中蠕动。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_1893e9ed:


    "我在古老的松树旁停下。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_edd08438:


    "我想起了我所失去的一切，森林从我这里夺走的一切：我父亲，带着他睿智、平静的微笑；我美丽的母亲；我长着绒毛头发、顶着日晕般光环的小妹妹。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_72c813bb:


    "我所有的家人都葬身于这片针叶林。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_3f31f0b1:


    "但还不止他们……"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_ad6830b1:


    "森林夺走了遥远迪士尼乐园里棉花糖的滋味，我所有的玩具，我未出版的漫画书，我的初吻，我的未来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_a2780765:


    "取代学校、友谊、爱情的——只有针叶地狱中交错缠绕的枝桠。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_2ebc2c87:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/247.Kakoi.ogg"
    Ant "跑到那里又有什么意义？"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_a1104b14:


    "令我惊讶的是，波琳娜回以一个悲伤的微笑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_365aa329:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/13 pom.ogg"
    Pol "还记得吗，我答应过不再叫你傻瓜？"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_9c1e082f:


    "我困惑地看着她。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_e36b47c7:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/14 m.ogg"
    Pol "我们生来就是为了逃跑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_2e6b355e:



    voice "voice/Polina/5day/15 tak.ogg"
    Pol "所以……"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_55ab51a9:


    "她伸出手。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_ad686cb5:


    "我抓住了她冰冷的手指。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_ac775f00:


    "肩并肩，我们走进了那座无人能生还的森林。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_20633c4e:


    "阴影从巢穴中爬出。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_99bcf6db:


    "而我们奔跑着。"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_a275ae50:


    "在这笼罩我们的永恒黑暗中……"


translate chinese d5_ending_call_d8d5fc79:


    "……太阳永远不会升起。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_95a1e25d:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/32 be.ogg"
    "{b}‘快跑！’{/b} 我脑海里的声音对我低语。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_8c909c11:


    "我不得不把妹妹拖出车外。她抽泣着，在我怀里抖得像纸娃娃。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_47f0bea7:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/104 da.ogg"
    Master "对！把她带给我们！"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_4e5cc8c8:


    "我们从怪物身边逃跑，撞上紧密排列的墓碑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_bf9d7b57:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/105 mi.ogg"
    Master "我们会找到你们的！"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_e3530b22:



    voice "voice/tihonov/5day/106 v.ogg"
    Master "在沟壑里，在坑洞里，在树根下！哦，我们一定会找到你们的！"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_2199010b:


    "雪花向上飘飞，轻抚我的皮肤。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_5b97059f:


    "一片巨大的铅灰色云朵在我们头顶膨胀，吞噬了月亮。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_f50e1f49:


    "我看到了守夜人的废弃小屋，面孔损毁的花岗岩墓碑，只有编号没有名字的坟墓，以及上个世纪的地下墓穴。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_8d11f69a:


    "我看到了地上张开的洞口，花瓶里的人造花，黑暗中饥饿的眼睛。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_41890c80:


    "然后，我只能看到栅栏外蔓延的森林。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_f75ad509:


    "我们从栏杆间挤了过去。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_73ed1260:


    "唉……要是奥莉娅真的能发光照亮我们的路就好了！"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_ac91ba40:


    "我向她挤出一个鼓励的微笑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_bc6c0825:


    "身后追赶的人的呼啸声离我们越来越近。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_d01deefe:


    "它们饥饿难耐，无法忘怀我们的骨头和甜美的血肉。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_5862bb65:


    "我们成了猎物。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_7ffaf512:


    "不，我们一直是猎物——是那些永不疲倦、永不停歇的猎人的猎物。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_9a557374:


    "道路到了尽头。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_99e10d2b:


    "前方只有针叶林——阴影的王国，在雪堆中蠕动。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_1893e9ed:


    "我在古老的松树旁停下。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_4e1774d7:


    "我想起了我所失去的一切，森林从我这里夺走的一切：我的爸爸，带着他睿智平静的微笑；还有我美丽的妈妈。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_5388c526:


    "他们一定已经遇难了，被困在那片恶心的树林里，试图为奥莉娅弄到药。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_95a16139:


    "森林夺走了我那美丽、拉着小提琴欢笑的波琳娜。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_272b14b2:


    "所有我珍视的人都葬身于这片针叶林。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_3f31f0b1:


    "但还不止他们……"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_ad6830b1:


    "森林夺走了遥远迪士尼乐园里棉花糖的滋味，我所有的玩具，我未出版的漫画书，我的初吻，我的未来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_d4bd4d06:



    voice "voice/olya/5day/82 Mi.ogg"
    Oly "我们会没事吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_af2d3417:


    "我拍拍妹妹的头，撒谎道。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_b80d8533:



    voice "voice/anton/5day/248.kon.ogg"
    Ant "当、当然。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_55ab51a9:


    "她伸出手。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_b6933a25:


    "我抓住了她细小冰冷的手指。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_07954faa:


    "如果我紧闭双眼，我可以想象奥莉娅真的在发光。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_fe682858:


    "我可爱的小妹妹……"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_8f32508c:


    "我们走进了那座无人能生还的森林。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_20633c4e:


    "阴影从巢穴中爬出。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_99bcf6db:


    "而我们奔跑着。"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_a275ae50:


    "在这笼罩我们的永恒黑暗中……"


translate chinese d5_ending_traces_8290afa0:


    "……太阳永远不会升起。"


translate chinese d5_ending_in_dark_f0ceda7c:


    "我尖叫起来。奥莉娅惊醒，浑身颤抖。"


translate chinese d5_ending_in_dark_4bd0bc13:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/09 y.ogg"
    Ant "我来当你们的点心，放过我妹妹！"


translate chinese d5_ending_in_dark_21166aab:


    "巨大的爪子像拍碎火柴盒一样砸穿木板，探进屋内。"


translate chinese d5_ending_in_dark_0b9828d0:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/01 Ti.ogg" 
    Alis "你不过是塞牙缝的，哥哥。看来我们得{u}‘彻底清扫粮仓’{/u}了……"


translate chinese d5_ending_in_dark_eeb1d785:


    "它们的手指在厨房里摸索。"


translate chinese d5_ending_in_dark_ced077a0:


    "一只毛茸茸的爪子抓住尖叫的奥莉娅的腿，将她拖进了暴风雪。"


translate chinese d5_ending_in_dark_e7b0f701:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/02 St.ogg"
    Ant "等等！你们不能这样……把我带走吧！"


translate chinese d5_ending_in_dark_832ff363:



    voice "voice/Alisa/5day/02 St.ogg"
    Alis "{u}唉，我年纪大了耳朵背……来，坐到我鼻子上，把你的歌唱得再响亮些。{/u}"


translate chinese d5_ending_in_dark_d5ca5fe4:


    "接着，屠刀般大小的爪子抓住我，把我拖到屋外，高高举向天空。"


translate chinese d5_ending_in_dark_5fba8b35:


    "如刀锋般锐利的牙齿和爪子，深深咬进我的皮肉，将我一寸寸撕碎。"


translate chinese d5_ending_runaway_aftertitles_92db42cf:


    "无尽森林，位于所有世界的尽头。"


translate chinese d5_ending_runaway_aftertitles_06c6803b:


    "风，对着黑暗的子嗣，吟唱着永恒饥饿的歌谣。"


translate chinese d5_ending_runaway_aftertitles_3b4a3631:


    "族群正期待它的盛宴。我们即将开宴。血肉与骨骼的庆典即将开始。"


translate chinese d5_ending_runaway_aftertitles_393792d2:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/75 kak.ogg"
    Master "你可让我们好等啊，小兔子，终于把‘点心’带来了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_runaway_aftertitles_ba2d94ac:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/76 Do.ogg" 
    Master "欢迎回来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_runaway_aftertitles_2a85de3f:



    voice "voice/kozel/5day/77 mi.ogg" 
    Master "见到你……我们真高兴。"


translate chinese d5_ending_runaway_aftertitles_69885241:


    "我手中的斧头和渗着红浆的麻袋。我终于到家了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_908f8e6b:


    "波琳娜那疯狂的笑容让我害怕。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_20de9c27:


    "她仿佛乐在其中。对我们已经遭遇或即将遭遇的一切。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_3be76222:


    "自我认识她以来，她一直如此。像是被什么东西附了身。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_f0825b1e:



    voice "voice/Anton/5day/kak.ogg"
    Ant_m "就像我一样。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_a20cefa7:


    "……"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_b9a3520d:


    "想到自己体内那个恶魔般的同伴，同样令人恐惧。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_3c551914:


    "所以，我最不想做的就是与一个像我一样疯癫的人纠缠不清。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_90f30518:


    "我挪向窗边，远离波琳娜，并在整个行程中紧盯着她，生怕自己睡着了，再次坠入谵妄。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_c931bdf3:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/105 Sv.ogg"
    Ant "光。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_a6063105:



    voice "voice/Al/01 V.ogg"
    Smart "您没说‘要有光’，主人。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_80a6a522:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/106 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "我或许是个创作型的人，但我的世界挺暗的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_5fd2d35f:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/107 Pr.ogg"
    Ant "把灯打开就行，自作聪明的家伙。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_6d4d0ee9:



    voice "voice/Al/02 E.ogg"
    Smart "于是有了光。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_6d03c7f5:


    "我眯起眼睛，像每天一样，内心做好了准备，以为会看到别的东西，取代这富丽堂皇的宅邸内部……"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_f1d1c229:


    "那栋我过去住过的、由阴影织就的木屋，在严寒的夜晚毁于大火。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_a13772e6:


    "但和往常一样，明亮的灯光照亮了白色塑料，以及画架上未完成的画作。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_3d095496:


    "一座远离我奶奶庄园新建的豪宅。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_a890210c:


    "我的独居之所。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_1d9c3664:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/108 K.ogg"
    Ant "咖啡。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_ad50ddad:



    voice "voice/Al/03 Uze.ogg"
    Smart "已经在准备了，主人。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_12fc1775:


    "要不是有那边那位勤勉的朋友——用导线和传感器创造出来的——我在这森林里就完全孤身一人了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_2b3bc846:


    "我的经纪人至今仍难以置信，我竟能在这种鬼地方保持理智。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_6d99fa09:


    "我会如此短视，以至于没能察觉这片土地的冥界气息吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_843a5848:


    "实际上，只有这样的地方，让我想起我曾居住的黑暗老屋，才能帮助我创作。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_b2e171f8:


    "我喝了口咖啡。索然无味。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_f48726c6:


    "雪花在宽阔的防弹玻璃窗外飘荡。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_afe79ca2:


    "昨晚我刚开始创作新项目，雪就开始下了。这场雪得连着下好几个礼拜。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_2e07fada:


    "不，这个世界从来就不美好。至少对我而言是这样。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_c6b35707:


    "我凝视着茂密的森林。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_b58a24cf:


    "它环绕着这座按我要求、在我严格指导下建造的堡垒。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_ddc284f2:


    "具有伺机捕食者习性的阴影，盘踞在树木之间。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_67d626c0:


    "我几乎能听到孩子的声音，呼唤我在满月下起舞。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_116a5ab2:


    "一座积雪覆盖的墓地浮现在我眼前。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_352ff415:


    "我在脑海中预演着。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_023b2db4:


    "站在原处，我伸出手。一把点三八手枪藏在壁架下。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_575c6d28:


    "我的行动都经过排练，每一个细节都深思熟虑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_c4950100:


    "无数房间在概念上分隔开来。向右三步，我就够不到枪了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_45425a2b:


    "那里开始是我另一位好朋友的领地——一把藏在咖啡桌下暗格里的直剃刀。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_effdfeef:


    "我有大约四十种结束生命的方式：刀、绳索、士的宁、硫酸，等等等等。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_1f806b96:


    "我获得了梦寐以求的名声。但我的版税都花在哪儿了？"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_26b38bdf:


    "花在了一座单人监狱上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_b60a3519:


    "还有那些极其稀有、剧毒的蛇，我按个按钮就能让它们从饲养箱里出来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_faf3683d:


    "这种悲哀孤独的结局，仍比我内心的声音向我承诺的恐怖要好。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_a178bc5f:


    "我瞥了一眼画架。那幅画就像在现代客厅中央，打开了一扇通往另一个世界的窗。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_de2de461:


    "事实上，画中确实是一扇结霜的窗户。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_56a46ea1:


    "窗外所见，几乎与我现实中的宽窗外景致相同。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_3f125e60:


    "那么，现实又是什么呢？"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_55cde3ba:


    "我只在夜晚作画，清晨筋疲力尽地睡去。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_b1731245:


    "把安全问题留给精密的安保系统。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_ce9549a3:


    "画中还有一双男孩的手，正触碰着玻璃。冰霜在他的指尖下融化。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_b9ecc535:


    "显露出屋前的空地，以及那些在诡异月光下雀跃的微小生物。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_82cae3e2:


    "或者那些只是小旋风，暴风雪制造的幽灵？"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_ae25e442:


    "我站在画架前。如果眯起眼睛，我能分辨出窗上的倒影。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_c014a779:


    "那个向森林古老奥秘伸出小手的那个人的脸。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_4957d7ce:


    "不，不是他的脸。是一张长耳朵的旧面具。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_96ed9db9:


    "我的经纪人曾问我，为什么非要画这些令人压抑的东西。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_85cc1b2d:


    "为什么要在其中倾注如此多的绝望和原始恐惧。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_ee6d570e:


    "我摇着威士忌杯中的冰块，反驳道：‘你对我们的收入不满意吗？’"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_9a3ce2bc:


    "黑暗能卖钱。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_008161c3:


    "它一直与我们同在，即使我们用灯泡塞满房子的每个角落。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_dee2ee3a:


    "我的童年是一片散发毒雾的沼泽，而我在沼泽上建造了我的房子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_4f3797a3:


    "当我开始沉溺时，我有几十种方式避免在此世逗留过久。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_6c753ff9:


    "我环顾墙上挂着的画作。动物面具是我午夜艺术的基调。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_eb276a71:


    "双重性，双重思想，巨大天真的眼睛，无尽森林中蛇行的小径。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_f8355567:


    "阴影中的母亲。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_1bf29890:


    "防风林后的血肉盛宴。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_63389845:


    "很久以前，夜里的声音呼唤着那个受惊的男孩。如今他长大了，正用自己的画作召唤黑暗。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_78831694:


    "来吧。从森林中来，或从病态心灵最黑暗的角落中来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_3cccf518:


    "我有东西给你。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_760e57fb:


    "那些伤害的方式，如你所爱。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_6b8a5548:


    "但我没有恐惧可给。我不在乎自己的皮囊，我的家人也远在天边。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_b4ef4ac3:


    "我的父亲还活着，但我不得不将我们的互动减少到每年几个电话，以确保他的安全。也许……"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_9103708e:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/109 Mo.ogg"
    Ant "也许它今天会来。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_e1d72d61:



    voice "voice/Al/04 V.ogg"
    Smart "您每天都这么说，主人。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_540a3e1f:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/110 Ti.ogg"
    Ant "你在这儿就是为了听我说话。有什么新闻吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_184242af:



    voice "voice/Al/05 S.ogg"
    Smart "有一篇文章您可能感兴趣。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_cf35e7c3:



    voice "voice/Al/06 G.ogg"
    Smart "‘死亡空间的天才。安东·彼得罗夫的莫斯科艺术装置。’"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_cfc34c3c:



    voice "voice/Al/07 H.ogg"
    Smart "要听听吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_485214c6:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/111 Va.ogg"
    Ant "随便。把结尾部分念给我就行。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_8d2dcc82:



    voice "voice/Al/08 Te.ogg"
    Smart "‘……那些希望亲眼见到艺术家的人，迎来的却是失望。’"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_4660b7b3:



    voice "voice/Al/09 ot.ogg"
    Smart "‘这位隐士艺术家名符其实，留在了他的针叶林庇护所……’"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_6d3e45a3:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/112 X.ogg"
    Ant "行了。犯罪报告呢？"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_bbbf2b7c:



    voice "voice/Al/10 kak.ogg"
    Smart "还是跟以前一样，只限于您所在的地区吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_7a084a36:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/113 T.ogg"
    Ant "老样子……"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_5726989d:



    voice "voice/Al/11 te.ogg"
    Smart "标签：酒后斗殴，家庭暴力，抢劫。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_9642d6d0:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/114 H.ogg"
    Ant "好……"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_4b107efa:


    "剖析我画作的评论家们，总是礼貌地略过最重要的一点……"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_0f043a84:


    "……但那个定论可以从字里行间读出。他们认为作者疯了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_f07880fe:


    "哦，他们漏掉了最关键的部分。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_45875b60:


    "‘冰冷空洞的母亲’和‘黑色车库的摇篮’的创作者，有一个装满TNT炸药的地下室。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_5cf96642:


    "系统设定为自动上锁。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_eb512621:


    "如果我下楼并开始失控，我只需说出密码，炸药就会爆炸。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_65c3f6b9:


    "砰！我所有的涂鸦都化为灰烬。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_1db70662:


    "它的唯一目的，就是帮助我购买更精巧的方式，来暴力终结我的存在。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_c5273634:


    "你想接近我妹妹，对吧，我脑袋里你这肮脏的东西？"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_c943c35b:


    "我会用她的肖像喂饱你。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_29dc3e6f:


    "‘作为彼得罗夫画作中反复出现的形象，那个小女孩是……"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_ec2c4ed8:


    "他通常漆黑如煤的作品中唯一一抹完全明亮的色彩……’——评论家们如是说。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_c8aa7e6f:


    "‘但出现在‘积雪’系列中拉小提琴的美丽女孩……很可能象征着对逝去幸福的苦涩追忆。’"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_91d33d27:


    "很可能象征着对逝去幸福的苦涩追忆。’"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_465b06da:


    "这次，评论家们说对了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_19d3c14f:


    "但他们同样没提隐藏在我的女主角们背后的东西。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_ee2ac862:


    "在画布之后，在那栋我永远不可能与波琳娜共享的房子里……"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_1aed29dc:


    "是为艺术家准备的可上锁的、存放致命武器的保险库。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_9e74c83a:


    "我再次走到窗前，凝视着飘浮的雪花和其后永恒的暮色。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_0438ee1d:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/115 Mo.ogg"
    Ant "会不会我仍然漏掉了一两种可能？"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_a1afc4d0:



    voice "voice/Al/12 a.ogg"
    Smart "分析中……"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_269a7c0a:



    voice "voice/Al/13 te.ogg"
    Smart "标签：隐士，自杀意念，枪支。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_f5f3b2d3:



    voice "voice/Al/14 s.ogg"
    Smart "根据网络信息，您的行为可能是一种非常严重精神疾病的症状。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_4320c2df:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/116 Eto.ogg"
    Ant "这一切都是真的！"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_fafcf3cd:


    "我用手指戳了戳画布。画中的狼用它那双夜行猎手的炽黄眼睛盯着我。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_b5db1d9a:



    voice "voice/Al/15 ho.ogg"
    Smart "需要我为您拨打自杀预防热线吗？"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_a71a288a:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/117 H.ogg"
    Ant "我要你闭嘴，再给我弄杯咖啡。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_07b8a87a:



    voice "voice/Al/16 me.ogg"
    Smart "研磨咖啡豆中……"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_96f36837:


    "我望着森林，手指紧张地攥紧又松开，舔着嘴唇，一眨不眨。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_aca2b782:


    "然后我的目光转向雪花。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_80f9f74b:


    "接着拉近，落到窗户上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_2349117e:


    "落在映在窗中的那个人身上。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_dcc3cf0a:


    "我告诉自己，这个干瘦、邪恶的男人是正常的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_e4ae6fdd:


    "我服用了所有这些心理医生给我开的药。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_314c1cf8:


    "我擦净过本地某位弗洛伊德医生办公室里许多张沙发。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_29f1456a:


    "我知道多年前发生了什么。我能分辨什么是真实，什么不是。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_5feb49f8:


    "我有一本日记，记录我所有的想法。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_781a3b93:


    "这一切都是真实的。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_e390c4c7:



    voice "voice/Al/17 Po.ogg"
    Smart "您收到一条新消息。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_e73c6c99:


    "尽管我预见到死亡，我也一直在等待私家侦探的消息。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_75042235:


    "我不仅监控着本地发生的事件，还雇佣了专业人士去寻找我的老朋友。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_47ab92e4:


    "我的目光扫过那些用油彩绘制的动物面具。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_fccd7bf6:


    "我曾与博主、不明飞行物研究者、神秘动物学家……"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_4d431e05:


    "所有专注于超自然活动的怪人合作。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_660497f7:


    "迄今为止，我只得到了一些疯狂的都市传说。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_c34259d8:


    "还有AI生成的图片和视频。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_d7fa89df:


    "我打开平板电脑。这是一封来自遥远地方的邮件，来自网络的阴暗面。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_74d2fedf:


    "发件人是匿名的。我会把他画成一条在暗网腐肉中蠕动的蛆虫。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_3dc6ccf2:


    "邮件写道："


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_df5c971c:


    "‘我想这就是你一直在找的东西。’"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_d0958231:


    "‘小心。’"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_06904a54:


    "视频由一群在针叶林中失踪的游客拍摄。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_740c4b27:


    "请将报酬支付到常用加密钱包。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_7eace3c4:


    "这个匿名者知道他的雇主会付给他丰厚报酬。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_bccb63f8:


    "但现在庆祝还为时过早。我的猎物已多次从我设下的陷阱中溜走。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_861d8b51:


    "来看看我这次撒向海里的网捞到了什么。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_a93266cd:


    "我点开视频。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_f2bca59f:


    "画面中是古老的针叶林。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_da2b749f:


    "我紧盯着松树间的黑暗，喉咙发干。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_9c808b5b:


    "看着帐篷周围那些人注视的方向。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_e87e9d66:


    "是什么让他们在半夜爬出睡袋？"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_3f24192b:


    "我调大了声音。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_2fd72619:



    voice "voice/episod/Tourists/03 Govo.ogg"
    Girl "我真的听到了有小孩在笑。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_94322087:


    "风声从扬声器呼啸而出，让我的皮肤泛起阵阵寒意。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_2d2a5d09:


    "手电筒的光束交错，惊恐地刺探着黑暗。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_efc2dbea:


    "光线照亮了树木，照亮了那些环绕着游客的巨大树干。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_26b017d4:


    "夜晚在嚎叫，防风林发出嘎吱声，仿佛有什么东西正在靠近营地……"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_eb2ec82c:



    voice "voice/episod/Tourists/07 Tam.ogg"
    Tourist "那儿站着个人！"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_b5aa2db0:



    voice "voice/episod/Tourists/08 Gde.ogg"
    Tourist "哪儿？"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_3fcb03a3:


    "拍视频的人将镜头转向灌木丛。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_9435cb23:



    voice "voice/episod/Tourists/09 Ktoto.ogg"
    Tourist "有个好大的东西！"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_1be19402:


    "雪花飘落在镜头和逼近的阴影之间。这一停，好像就是永远。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_bc323633:


    "在呼啸的风声中，在受惊人群的喘息里，还混杂着某种别的——一种轻柔、讨好的声音。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_02d2a416:



    voice "voice/episod/Tourists/10 Dava.ogg"
    "我咬着嘴唇吸了口气。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_5f1c007c:


    "笛声在我脑海中勾勒出血腥的画面。饥饿月亮下的阴影狂欢。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_e46cbc80:


    "画面剧烈晃动。树木一闪而过。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_44bd9bcc:


    "我不想听到游客的尖叫和野兽折断树枝时的嚎叫。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_19a68687:


    "我将平板电脑猛地往墙上一砸，它啪一下碎成了无数块塑料碎片。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_0f0b13ae:


    "我需要冷静。我得把那片古老森林的音乐从脑海中驱散。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_6ac4550c:


    "我刚才看到了什么？什么都没有。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_f22f524e:


    "那是一场表演。一部为一个观众拍摄的学生电影，一个足够富有、天真到会为如此明显的赝品付费的观众。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_3e8ba2d0:


    "他们甚至在视觉特效上花了大价钱。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_84422145:


    "得放松……别慌……忘记……"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_a4119518:


    "我走到画架前，拿起画笔。蘸上颜料，集中精神在画布上寻找最完美的一笔位置。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_3f9fa582:


    "然后我画了一笔，望向窗户。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_dcc26c12:


    "我在倒影中看到了房间和画架……"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_0d4cf159:


    "以及站在它旁边的那个生物。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_2b32036a:


    "红色的颜料从它手中的画笔滴落。它正替我完成那幅画。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_18d35dcf:


    "那生物有些像一只长耳兔子。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_0c7c1c48:


    "它来了。它来找我了！"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_656ad98a:


    "我踉跄后退，准备去拿枪，但房间里空无一物。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_933f2b98:


    "熟悉的头痛又回来了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_7fc0fdf6:


    "我知道我是谁。我知道是谁在画我的作品。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_f57992e8:


    "我知道我为什么需要那些武器。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_008c6ce9:


    "我……"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_bca46c31:



    voice "voice/anton/Adult/121 Uni.ogg"
    Ant "炸掉这房子！！！"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_1a9b9b64:



    voice "voice/Al/20 u.ogg"
    Smart "请明确指令。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_dfa3999d:



    voice "voice/Al/21 na.ogg"
    Smart "请说出密码。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_ec409a2d:


    "我的心跳到了极限。惊恐发作完全把我逼到了角落。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_b630cd6d:


    "我必须冷静下来！"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_38b6032a:



    voice "voice/Al/22 na.ogg"
    Smart "请说出密码。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_7836dfcd:


    "我用双手捂住耳朵。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_1b245734:


    "雪花在外面打着旋，我觉得我的房子就像装在一个塞满泡沫塑料的玻璃球里。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_492c4c52:


    "摇一摇，就会下雪。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_84227d53:


    "我没疯。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_27d0f761:


    "我需要选择正确的道路。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_533c83d7:


    "但什么才是正确的？"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_4f9baca9:



    voice "voice/Al/22 n.ogg"
    Smart "请说出密码。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_c84ed15d:


    "我抬起头，张开了嘴。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_f30e71e6:


    "但现在既然我确信它们已经回来了，我的自杀计划就得等等了。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_aae42f4b:


    "我要倾尽所有财富，出版一本书，一部伪装成小说的传记体漫画，它的印刷量会高得惊人，能载入史册。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_d3213e59:


    "它将翻译成所有已知语言，如果需要，作者还会出资拍摄电影改编。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_96a5de7e:


    "我并非孤身一人。还有其他这种黑暗的受害者存在。他们需要支持。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_84835386:


    "这部漫画将帮助像我这样沉迷的人对抗针叶林的瘟疫。它将引导猎手们追寻那些戴着动物面具的、难以捉摸的恶魔的踪迹。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_0acf7ebd:


    "我不会因恐惧而沉默。我终于有了目标。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_61d58263:


    "我很少用我的专业绘图板，但当涉及到传播森林之主那些恶魔面具时，这个工具比油画颜料可靠得多。把画笔留给纯粹主义者吧。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_1eba6b11:


    "手写笔在屏幕上滑动。矩形和正方形被填满剪影，气泡框里填上文字。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_823fbd9c:


    "这是我的故事。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_23a8261d:


    "风整夜都在抓挠着窗户。它在田野上徘徊，像一头饥饿的野兽般嚎叫。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_5fd73e48:


    "午夜钟声敲响，男孩从床上起身，走到窗边。"


translate chinese d5_ending_contract_aftertitles_d23629f8:


    "森林、雪，以及那些舞动的生物，都沐浴在诡异的月光下。它们一察觉到有其他人在注视，便瞬间僵住，齐齐转向了房子。"

